L["your own buffs: held back -- the game will not say your name."] = "自身增益：暫不提供——遊戲無法告知你的名字。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are on your never-offer list."] = "自身增益：暫不提供——你已在你的永不提供名單上。"
L["%s: %s is running low -- a top-up is due."] = "%s：%s快到期了——該補加了。"
L["%s: none up -- %s is the one to use."] = "%s：都沒有生效——要使用的是%s。"
L["%s: none up -- %s is the one to cast."] = "%s：都沒有生效——要施放的是%s。"
L["%s: switched off (Don't remind me)."] = "%s：已關閉（不要提醒我）。"
L["%s: a stone is in your bags or on your weapon already."] = "%s：背包裡或武器上已經有一塊石頭。"
L["%s: a healthstone is in your bags already."] = "%s：背包裡已經有一塊治療石。"
L["%s: %s needs a Soul Shard, and your bags hold none."] = "%s：%s需要一個靈魂碎片，而背包裡沒有。"
L["%s: the weapon already carries a temporary enchant."] = "%s：武器上已有暫時性附魔。"
L["%s: your off hand already carries a temporary enchant."] = "%s：你的副手已有暫時性附魔。"
L["%s: your main hand already carries a temporary enchant."] = "%s：你的主手已有暫時性附魔。"
L["%s: a pet is out."] = "%s：已有寵物在外。"
L["%s: %s is up."] = "%s：%s已生效。"
L["%s: you have no %s in your bags."] = "%s：背包裡沒有%s。"
L["%s: %s needs level %d."] = "%s：%s需要%d級。"
L["%s: %s needs Fishing %d."] = "%s：%s需要釣魚%d。"
L["%s: there is no weapon in that hand."] = "%s：那隻手沒有武器。"
L["%s: there is no weapon in your main hand."] = "%s：你的主手沒有武器。"
L["%s: %s does not fit the weapon in that hand."] = "%s：%s不適用於那隻手的武器。"
L["%s: %s does not fit the weapon in your main hand."] = "%s：%s不適用於你主手的武器。"
L["%s: Automatic, and your group role is not tank, so it is not offered."] = "%s：設為「自動」，而你的隊伍職責不是坦克，所以不會提供。"
L["%s: %s was pressed or skipped a moment ago."] = "%s：剛剛才按過或略過%s。"
L["%s: the game says %s cannot be used right now."] = "%s：遊戲表示現在無法使用%s。"
L["%s: %s waits until you dismount."] = "%s：%s會等你下坐騎後再提示。"
L["%s: Automatic has nothing it would pick."] = "%s：「自動」沒有可選的法術。"
L["%s: oils, stones, flasks, elixirs and scrolls are only offered in a dungeon or a raid."] = "%s：油、磨刀石、精煉藥劑、藥劑和卷軸只在地城或團隊副本中提供。"
L["%s: oils, stones, food, flasks, elixirs and scrolls are only offered in a dungeon or a raid."] = "%s：油、磨刀石、食物、精煉藥劑、藥劑和卷軸只在地城或團隊副本中提供。"
L["%s: you are at the level cap, with no experience left to gain."] = "%s：你已達到等級上限，沒有經驗可以獲得。"
L["%s: you are resting in the bag, or it is cooling down."] = "%s：你正在睡袋裡休息，或它還在冷卻中。"
L["%s: %s is ticked under Never remind me about."] = "%s：%s 已在「永不提醒的法術」中勾選。"
L["%s: you are in another form, so it is not offered."] = "%s：你處於其他形態，因此不提供。"
L["%s: %s goes on a shield, and there is none in your off hand."] = "%s：%s要用在盾牌上，而你的副手沒有盾牌。"
L["%s: %s is only offered when you are alone, and you are in a group."] = "%s：%s 只在你獨自一人時提示，而你在隊伍中。"
L["%s: tracking is not offered in a battleground or an arena."] = "%s：在戰場或競技場中不提示追蹤。"
L["%s: you are not swimming, so it is not offered."] = "%s：你沒有在游泳，因此不提供。"
L["%s: %s waits until you stand still."] = "%s：%s會等你停下來再提示。"
L["%s: none out -- Manners brings one out of your pet journal itself."] = "%s：沒有寵物在外——Manners 會自己從你的寵物日誌中召喚一隻。"
L["%s: you put your pet away, so none comes out until you bring one out yourself."] = "%s：你解散了寵物，所以在你自己召喚之前不會再召喚。"
L["%s: not in a dungeon, a raid, a battleground or an arena."] = "%s：不在地城、團隊副本、戰場或競技場中進行。"
L["%s: waits until you are not dead, flying, stealthed or casting."] = "%s：等到你不處於死亡、飛行、潛行或施法狀態時。"
L["%s: waits until your pet battle is over."] = "%s：等到你的寵物對戰結束時。"
L["%s: the game would not let Manners bring a pet out of your journal, so that is left to you."] = "%s：遊戲不允許 Manners 從你的日誌中召喚寵物，因此需要你自己來。"
L["%s: the game will not say whether it is up, so it is not offered."] = "%s：遊戲無法告知是否已生效，所以不會提供。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are in a city or an inn, and %s is off."] = "自身增益：暫不提供——你在主城或旅店中，而%s已關閉。"
L["Also in cities and inns"] = "在主城和旅店也提供"
L["your own %s comes first -- the buffs below wait until it has been cast."] = "你自己的%s優先——下方的增益要等它施放後才會提供。"
L["%s: switched off -- no scroll is offered."] = "%s：已關閉——不提供任何卷軸。"
L["Scrolls"] = "卷軸"
L["%s: no timer -- never topped up."] = "%s：沒有計時——不會補加。"
L["%s: length unknown -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon."] = "%s：持續時間未知——剩餘%s時補加，團隊或地城中為%s。"
L["(%s as a group cast)"] = "（群體版為%s）"
L["%s: lasts %s -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon, %s outside your group."] = "%s：持續%s——剩餘%s時補加，團隊或地城中為%s，隊伍之外為%s。"
L["%s: lasts %s -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon."] = "%s：持續%s——剩餘%s時補加，團隊或地城中為%s。"
L["When a top-up is due"] = "補加時機"
L["When a top-up is due (top-ups are off)"] = "補加時機（補加已關閉）"
L["this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "這個職業沒有可以對其他玩家施放的增益。"
L["|cffff8080not during a fight|r -- the prompt cannot be put on screen while one is on. Try again when it ends."] = "|cffff8080戰鬥中無法進行|r——戰鬥期間無法把提示框顯示在畫面上。戰鬥結束後再試一次。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed. It starts once you learn |cffffd100%s|r from your class trainer, and says hello properly then."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 已安裝。等你從職業訓練師那裡學會|cffffd100%s|r後就會開始運作，到時再正式向你問好。"
L["You have learned |cffffd100%s|r, so Manners can start returning buffs."] = "你已學會|cffffd100%s|r，Manners 現在可以開始回贈增益了。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 已安裝，但這個職業沒有可以對其他玩家施放的增益。"
L["It is still worth keeping for an alt that does -- it will say hello again there."] = "不過還是值得為有增益的分身留著——到了那個角色上，它會再打一次招呼。"
L["With %s on, the prompt comes up when somebody could give you a buff you are missing, and a press asks them for it."] = "開啟%s後，當有人能給你缺少的增益時提示框會出現，按一下即可向對方請求。"
L["It can also ask other players for a buff you are missing, one polite line at a press: tick %s in the options (|cffffd100/manners|r)."] = "它還可以向其他玩家請求你缺少的增益，每按一次說一句客氣話：在選項（|cffffd100/manners|r）中勾選%s。"
L["Ask people for a buff I'm missing"] = "向別人請求我缺少的增益"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but nothing will be offered to anybody: %s."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 已安裝，但不會為任何人提供增益：%s。"
L["|cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings the rest of this back once that changes."] = "情況改變後，輸入 |cffffd100/manners welcome|r 可以再看到其餘的說明。"
L["Nothing to do: your own buffs are switched off under %s."] = "無事可做：你自己的增益都在「%s」下關閉了。"
L["Myself"] = "我自己"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up -- your class has none for other players. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會在你自己的增益都沒有生效時，把它放到一個小提示框上——你的職業沒有給其他玩家的增益。點擊提示框就會對你施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up; nothing is offered to anybody else: %s. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會在你自己的增益都沒有生效時，把它放到一個小提示框上；不會為其他任何人提供增益：%s。點擊提示框就會對你施放。"
L["Only one person can have %s at a time, so it goes to one member of your group who is not of your class, and only while none of yours is on anybody in it."] = "同一時間只有一人能擁有%s，因此會給隊伍中一位不同職業的成員，而且只在你自己的都不在隊伍任何人身上時才提供。"
L["Only one person can have %s at a time, so it goes to a tank of your group (the tank role, or main tank in a raid), and only while none of yours is on anybody in it."] = "同一時間只有一人能擁有%s，因此會給隊伍中的坦克（坦克角色，團隊中則為主坦克），而且只在你自己的都不在隊伍任何人身上時才提供。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100%s|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把缺少你的|cffffd100%s|r、或剛為你加了增益的隊友放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100buff|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把缺少你的|cffffd100增益|r、或剛為你加了增益的隊友放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody who buffs you -- and any stranger nearby who is missing one of yours -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt buffs them."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r 會把為你加增益的人，以及附近缺少你某個增益的路人，放到一個小提示框上。點擊提示框就會為對方加增益。"
L["|cffff8080Friendly nameplates are off|r, so Manners cannot tell who a stranger is: a passer-by who buffs you, or who is missing your buff, never comes up on the prompt. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "|cffff8080友方名條已關閉|r，Manners 無法認出陌生人：為你加增益的路人，或缺少你增益的路人，都不會出現在提示框上。點擊%s（在「%s」，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可開啟。"
L["The one thing that is not automatic: |cffffd100/manners macro|r or |cffffd100Put Manners on an action bar|r in the options puts a macro on your cursor for your bars, or bind a key under Options > Keybindings > Manners."] = "唯一需要你動手的事：輸入 |cffffd100/manners macro|r，或點擊選項中的|cffffd100把 Manners 放到快捷列上|r，就能把巨集放到游標上再放進快捷列；也可以在「選項 > 按鍵設定 > Manners」中設定按鍵。"
L["|cffff8080It is switched off on this profile|r, so no prompt will appear -- |cffffd100/manners on|r when you want it."] = "|cffff8080此設定檔已將它關閉|r，所以不會出現提示框——需要時請輸入 |cffffd100/manners on|r。"
L["The prompt is on screen now, with somebody real on it already. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "提示框現在就在畫面上，上面已經有真實的人選。輸入 |cffffd100/manners welcome|r 可以再看一次這段說明。"
L["That is the prompt, with a pretend name on it. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "這就是提示框，上面是假的名字。輸入 |cffffd100/manners welcome|r 可以再看一次這段說明。"
L["does not exist (or its existence is withheld)"] = "不存在（或其存在被隱藏）"
L["withheld: %s"] = "被隱藏：%s"
L["this buff is not readable here"] = "此處無法讀取這個增益"
L["%s has no unit token right now, so {unit} cannot be filled"] = "%s目前沒有單位標記，所以無法填入{unit}"
L["until you log out"] = "直到你登出"
L["until %s"] = "至%s"
L["1 minute"] = "1分鐘"
L["%d minutes"] = "%d分鐘"
L["snoozed until you log out -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "暫停至你登出——不過 Manners 已關閉，所以無論如何都不會出現提示。"
L["snoozed until you log out. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "暫停至你登出。戰鬥中提示維持戰鬥開始時的樣子，暫停結束後再跟隨。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可結束暫停。"
L["snoozed until you log out. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "暫停至你登出。提示已解鎖，會一直顯示以便拖曳，不會施放任何法術；鎖定後它就不再出現。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可結束暫停。"
L["snoozed until you log out or reload -- no prompt until then. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "暫停至你登出或重新載入介面——在此之前不會出現提示。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可結束暫停。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "已暫停%s（%s）——不過 Manners 已關閉，所以無論如何都不會出現提示框。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已暫停%s（%s）。戰鬥中提示框會維持戰鬥開始時的樣子，這場戰鬥結束後才會跟著暫停。輸入 |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可提前結束。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away until the snooze ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已暫停%s（%s）。提示框目前已解鎖，所以會留在畫面上供你拖曳，但不會施放任何東西；鎖定後，在暫停結束前都不會出現。輸入 |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可提前結束。"
L["snoozed for %s -- no prompt %s. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已暫停%s——%s期間不會出現提示框。輸入 |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可提前結束。"
L["the snooze is over, but Manners is switched off -- |cffffd100/manners on|r to see the prompt again."] = "暫停已結束，但 Manners 已關閉——輸入 |cffffd100/manners on|r 才會再看到提示框。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again once this fight ends."] = "暫停已結束——這場戰鬥結束後，提示框就能再次出現。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again."] = "暫停已結束——提示框可以再次出現。"
L["not snoozed -- the prompt is free to appear."] = "目前沒有暫停——提示框可以正常出現。"
L["there is nothing to import -- paste a settings string that starts with MNR1:."] = "沒有可匯入的內容——請貼上以 MNR1: 開頭的設定字串。"
L["that is not a Manners settings string -- one starts with MNR1:."] = "這不是 Manners 的設定字串——設定字串以 MNR1: 開頭。"
L["that is far longer than any Manners settings string, so it was not read."] = "這比任何 Manners 設定字串都長得多，因此沒有讀取。"
L["that string was made by a newer version of Manners -- update the addon to read it."] = "這個字串是由較新版本的 Manners 產生的——請更新插件後再讀取。"
L["that string is incomplete or has been changed -- copy it again in one piece, and paste a long one into the box under Share as text (%s)."] = "這個字串不完整或已被修改——請完整地重新複製一次；較長的字串請貼到「以文字分享」下方的輸入框（%s）。"
L["that string is damaged -- part of it is not a setting Manners can read. Copy it again in one piece."] = "這個字串已損壞——其中有部分不是 Manners 能讀取的設定。請完整地重新複製一次。"
L["that string gives %s a value it cannot have, so nothing was changed."] = "這個字串給了 %s 一個不可能的值，因此沒有做任何變更。"
L["settings imported -- every one of them is the default."] = "設定已匯入——全部都是預設值。"
L["settings imported -- 1 differs from the defaults."] = "設定已匯入——有1項與預設值不同。"
L["settings imported -- %d differ from the defaults."] = "設定已匯入——有%d項與預設值不同。"
L["1 setting from a newer version of Manners was left out."] = "有1項來自較新版本 Manners 的設定被略過。"
L["%d settings from a newer version of Manners were left out."] = "有%d項來自較新版本 Manners 的設定被略過。"
L["The string had speaking a line when you buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "該字串開啟了加增益時說話的功能。這項功能會對其他玩家說話，所以仍保持關閉：如果需要，請在「我說的話」分頁中開啟。"
L["The string had /thank people who buff me switched on. That is left off, because everybody near you sees it: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "該字串開啟了「對為我加增益的人使用 /thank」。附近的每個人都看得到，所以仍保持關閉：如果需要，請在「我說的話」分頁中開啟。"
L["The string had whispering a thank-you to people you can't buff back switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "該字串開啟了向無法回贈增益的人密語道謝。這項功能會對其他玩家說話，所以仍保持關閉：如果需要，請在「我說的話」分頁中開啟。"
L["The string had thanking people even when you can't see who it was switched on. That is left off, because everybody near you sees it: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "該字串開啟了「看不到是誰也道謝」。附近的每個人都看得到，所以仍保持關閉：如果需要，請在「我說的話」分頁中開啟。"
L["The string had asking people for a buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under Who to buff if you want it."] = "該字串開啟了向別人請求增益的功能。這項功能會對其他玩家說話，所以仍保持關閉：如果需要，請在「增益對象」分頁中開啟。"
L["What you say when you buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have speaking switched on."] = "加增益時說的話和說話的頻道都維持你原本的設定，因為你已開啟說話功能。"
L["How you ask for a buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have asking switched on."] = "請求增益時說的話和說話的地方都維持你原本的設定，因為你已開啟向別人請求增益。"
L["The prompt's look changes when this fight ends."] = "提示框的外觀會在這場戰鬥結束後改變。"
L["|cffffd100/manners import undo|r puts your old settings back."] = "輸入 |cffffd100/manners import undo|r 可恢復你原本的設定。"
L["nothing to undo -- no settings have been imported on this profile this session."] = "沒有可復原的內容——本次登入中，此設定檔沒有匯入過設定。"
