L["|cffffd100first name only|r -- a line says only the first word of a name"] = "|cffffd100只叫名字|r -- 台詞只說名字的第一個詞"
L["|cffffd100lines left out|r -- In character never says %d of its lines"] = "|cffffd100已排除的台詞|r -- 入戲永遠不會說其中 %d 句台詞"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- in a raid, only groups %s are offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100團隊小隊|r——在團隊中，只會主動提供給小隊%s"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- every group is unticked, so in a raid nobody is offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100團隊小隊|r——所有小隊都未勾選，所以在團隊中不會主動為任何人提供增益"
L["|cffff8080/manners try is armed:|r %s -- clear it with a bare /manners try"] = "|cffff8080/manners try 已就緒：|r%s——輸入不帶內容的 /manners try 可清除"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners help|r lists them all."] = "沒有 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 這個指令——你是指 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 嗎？輸入 |cffffd100/manners help|r 可列出所有指令。"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners dev|r lists the testing tools."] = "沒有 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 這個指令——你是指 |cffffd100/manners %s|r 嗎？輸入 |cffffd100/manners dev|r 可列出測試工具。"
L["Your own buffs wait while you rest in a city or an inn, and come up when you leave. To be reminded in town too, tick %s on %s."] = "在城市或旅店休息時，你自己的增益提醒會等待，離開後才出現。想在城裡也收到提醒，請勾選%s（位於%s）。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who. The prompt offers to thank them with your emote, but Manners cannot buff them back: %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "剛才有人為你加了增益，但友方名條已關閉，遊戲不會告訴你是誰。提示框會提議用你的表情動作道謝，但 Manners 無法回報對方：點擊%s（在「%s」，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可開啟。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who. Manners thanks them with your emote where it may, but cannot buff them back: %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "剛才有人為你加了增益，但友方名條已關閉，遊戲不會告訴你是誰。Manners 會在允許的地方用你的表情動作道謝，但無法回報對方：點擊%s（在「%s」，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可開啟。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who, so Manners cannot buff them back or thank them. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on, or %s on %s thanks them with your emote all the same."] = "剛才有人為你加了增益，但友方名條已關閉，遊戲不會告訴你是誰，所以 Manners 既無法回報也無法道謝。點擊%s（在「%s」，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可開啟，或者開啟%s（在「%s」）照樣用你的表情動作道謝。"
L["Thank them even when I can't see who it was"] = "看不到是誰也道謝"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who, so Manners cannot buff them back. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "剛才有人為你加了增益，但友方名條已關閉，遊戲不會告訴你是誰，所以 Manners 無法回報對方。點擊%s（在「%s」，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可開啟。"
L["Manners could not tell who buffed you, so there is nobody to return it to."] = "Manners 無法確定是誰給你加了增益，所以沒有可以回贈的人。"
L["Thank ye kindly, {name}! First round's on me when we're back at the forge."] = "多謝啦，{name}！回熔爐頭一杯我請！"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Ye've a friend in the mountain now."] = "夠意思，{name}！山裡從此有你這朋友！"
L["Thank ye, {name}! I'd have been fine without it, mind. But thank ye."] = "謝啦，{name}！沒這個我也行，真的！但還是謝啦。"
L["Bless ye, {name}! I'd hug ye, but ye'd be needin' a healer after."] = "好人哪，{name}！想抱你一下，但抱完你得找補師。"
L["Paid back already, {name}. Quicker than I've ever settled a bar tab."] = "這就還你了，{name}。我酒帳都沒還這麼快！"
L["I'll tell this at the Thunderbrew like ye saved me life, {name}. Thank ye!"] = "謝啦，{name}！回雷酒釀酒廠我就說你救了我的命！"
L["Grand, {name}! I'd carve ye a statue, but this is quicker."] = "好樣的，{name}！想給你雕像，這個比較快。"
L["The Titans made us of stone, {name}, but that still touched me. Thank ye."] = "泰坦造的鐵石心腸，{name}，也被你融了。謝啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Back at ye, before me pride notices I needed it."] = "謝啦，{name}！趁我的自尊心還沒醒，快還你。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Muradin said a debt left unpaid rusts. Here, before it does."] = "穆拉丁說過人情放著會生鏽，{name}。趁沒鏽，還你！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Even me ram looked impressed, and he hates everybody."] = "謝啦，{name}！連我的山羊都服了，牠可是誰都討厭。"
L["The Explorers' League'll ask where ye dug up such manners, {name}. Thanks!"] = "謝啦，{name}！出土級的禮數，探險者協會會來搶。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Warmed me right down to me boots, that did."] = "謝啦，{name}！一路暖到我的靴子底。"
L["Mined half o' Khaz Modan, {name}. Never struck a vein that rich. Yer cut."] = "挖遍卡茲莫丹，{name}，沒見過這麼富的礦。分你！"
L["Like a Kharanos hearth in a Dun Morogh blizzard, that, {name}. Thank ye."] = "像丹莫洛雪夜裡卡拉諾斯的爐火，{name}。謝啦！"
L["Came back to ye like a Wildhammer's stormhammer, {name}. Less painful, mind."] = "像蠻錘的風暴之錘飛回來，{name}。放心，不會暈。"
L["Come to Ironforge, {name}. Me mam'll feed ye till ye can't stand. Thank ye!"] = "謝啦！來鐵爐堡，{name}，我娘會餵到你站不起來。"
L["Checked it fer gunpowder out o' habit, {name}. Clean as a whistle. Here's yers!"] = "職業病，先查過有沒有火藥，{name}。乾淨！還你！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Ye'll be the talk o' the Great Forge tonight."] = "謝啦，{name}！今晚大熔爐那邊，大家都會聊你。"
L["Not even Magni could've done that kinder, {name}. Louder, aye. Thank ye."] = "麥格尼都沒你這麼貼心，{name}。嗓門比你大倒是真的。謝啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. I'd offer me beard as surety, but I'm terrible fond of it."] = "謝啦，{name}。本想拿鬍子當抵押，但我實在捨不得。"
L["Back at ye, {name}, quick as a ram goin' downhill. Stoppin' is the hard part."] = "還你，{name}，快得像山羊下坡。難的是停下來。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Ye'd make a fine honorary dwarf. We'll work on yer singin'."] = "謝了，{name}。你能當個像樣的榮譽矮人。唱歌嘛，再練練。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. If ye ever need a tunnel dug, I'm yer dwarf."] = "謝啦，{name}。哪天要挖隧道，找我就對了。"
L["Keep yer powder dry and yer friends closer, me da said. Here, {name}."] = "我爹說過：火藥要乾，朋友要近。給，{name}。"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now, like a good anvil."] = "好咧，{name}，開口就成！站穩，像塊好鐵砧。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Stone and steel, here it comes."] = "不用多說，{name}！岩石與鋼鐵，接著！"
L["Ask a dwarf fer help, {name}, and ye'll get it. Loudly."] = "矮人有求必應，{name}。很大聲地應。"
L["Right, {name}. Brace yerself; I do everything like I'm swingin' a hammer."] = "好，{name}，站穩了！我做什麼都像在掄大錘。"
L["Aye, {name}, and a story about it ye didn't ask fer. Where to begin..."] = "好咧，{name}，還附個你沒問的故事。話說當年……"
L["One {buff}, pulled fresh like a proper pint, {name}."] = "現打{buff}一杯，{name}，新鮮如生啤！"
L["Done, {name}. Dwarven work: over-built, under-priced and guaranteed."] = "好了，{name}！矮人出品，料多價廉還保固！"
L["Easy, {name}. Last time I helped a gnome, it cost me both eyebrows."] = "小事，{name}。上回幫地精的忙，賠上我兩道眉毛。"
L["Aye, {name}. Mountain kings never refuse. I'm more a foothill, but same rule."] = "{name}，山丘之王從不說不。我是小土丘，照辦！"
L["Tempered and quenched, {name}. Mind, it's still hot."] = "千錘百鍊，剛淬好，{name}。小心燙！"
L["Done afore ye finished, {name}. Dwarves hear 'please' through solid rock."] = "「請」字還沒說完就好了，{name}。矮人隔岩有耳！"
L["Aye, {name}. In Dun Morogh ye help quick, or ye both freeze standin' there."] = "好咧，{name}！丹莫洛幫人要快，不然倆都凍成冰。"
L["Aye, {name}. Ye'll feel it in yer boots first. That's how ye know it's dwarven."] = "好咧，{name}！腳底先發麻，這才是矮人出品。"
L["Aye, {name}. Say no, and ye'd ask a gnome, and then I'd feel responsible."] = "行，{name}！我不幫，你就找地精了。罪過罪過。"
L["Course, {name}. A dwarf who won't help is no dwarf. Just a short, grumpy rock."] = "當然，{name}。不幫忙的矮人哪算矮人？只是顆又矮又倔的石頭。"
L["Mountaineer's promise, {name}: done right, done once. Mostly."] = "登山老手的承諾，{name}：一次做對，一次做完。大致上啦。"
L["Fer you, {name}? Easy as findin' ale in Ironforge."] = "幫你？{name}，比在鐵爐堡找麥酒還簡單。"
L["Ask a Bronzebeard, {name}, and ye get it with both hands. Here."] = "找我們銅鬚家族幫忙，{name}，都是雙手奉上。給。"
L["Aye, {name}. Stand on that rock while I see to ye. Good rock, that. Granite."] = "好嘞，{name}。站那塊石頭上，我幫你弄好。好石頭，花崗岩。"
L["Aye, {name}. In the mines, ye shout and somebody comes runnin'. Here I am."] = "好，{name}。在礦坑裡一喊就有人跑來。我這不就來了。"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet. Wee, like me."] = "來，{name}，小小心意讓你站穩腳。小，跟我一樣！"
L["Off ye go, {name}, with a wee blessin' from me. Steady as the mountain."] = "帶上我一點小祝福，{name}，去吧，穩如磐石！"
L["Here, {name}. Ale's for after; this is for before."] = "開打前用這個，{name}。麥酒打完再喝！"
L["Magni'd melt down his crown fer a friend, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "麥格尼願意為朋友熔掉王冠，{name}，這是平價版。"
L["A dwarf's got yer back, {name}. Well, yer knees. Close enough."] = "有矮人給你撐腰，{name}。呃，撐膝蓋。差不多啦！"
L["Take this, {name}. If a trogg bothers ye, tell it a dwarf sent ye. Then run."] = "拿著，{name}。要是穴居人找你麻煩，就說是矮人派你來的。然後快跑。"
L["If it wears off, {name}, give it a good thump. That's how we fix everything."] = "{name}，失效了就猛敲一下，我們什麼都這麼修！"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give ye some stubbornness too, but I'm usin' all mine."] = "拿著，{name}。倔脾氣不分你，我自己都不夠用！"
L["That'll warm ye, {name}. Mind the wendigos: big, hairy and grumpy. Like me."] = "這能讓你暖和點，{name}。小心雪怪：又大又毛又暴躁。跟我一樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Me grandad fought three wars with a pickaxe and this."] = "拿著，{name}。我爺爺憑礦鎬和這個打過三場仗。"
L["Dwarven make, {name}. Drop it off Thandol Span and it'd still work. Don't."] = "矮人出品，{name}，薩多爾大橋丟下去也行。別試。"
L["Stonewrought Dam holds back a whole loch, {name}. This'll hold ye together."] = "大壩擋得住整座湖，{name}。這個保你不散架。"
L["Won't keep yer boots dry in the Wetlands, {name}. Nothin' does. The rest, aye."] = "濕地裡靴子必濕，{name}，誰都沒轍。其他交給我！"
L["Old miner's rule, {name}: never go down a hole without a lamp, a mate and this."] = "礦工規矩，{name}：下洞要帶燈、帶兄弟、帶這個。"
L["Brann Bronzebeard went explorin' with less, {name}, and wrote three books."] = "布萊恩·銅鬚帶得更少，{name}，照樣寫了三本書。"
L["Mountaineers swear by it, {name}. Ye'll climb no better, but land softer."] = "登山老手都掛保證，{name}。爬不更快，摔得更軟。"
L["Ironforge's gates have never fallen, {name}. Neither should ye. Take this."] = "鐵爐堡的大門從沒倒過，{name}，你也別倒。拿著！"
L["Me cousins down Blackrock way would've set it alight first, {name}. Fer luck."] = "黑石山的表親會先點把火再給，{name}。圖個吉利！"
L["Off to Uldaman, {name}? Take this, and touch nothin' with runes on it."] = "去奧達曼，{name}？拿著這個，帶符文的東西一概別碰。"
L["Fer the road, {name}. It's no keg o' Thunderbrew, but it travels better."] = "路上用，{name}。比不上一桶雷酒，但好帶多了。"
L["A gift from under the mountain, {name}. Mind yer head on the way out."] = "山底下來的禮物，{name}。出去時小心頭。"
L["A rifleman needs dry powder and a good mate, {name}. I'm the mate. Here."] = "火槍手要兩樣：乾火藥和好夥伴，{name}。我就是夥伴。給。"
L["If yer road passes Grim Batol, {name}, keep walkin'. And take this."] = "路過格瑞姆巴托，{name}，別停下。帶上這個。"
L["From one explorer to another, {name}. The League'll want yer notes after."] = "探險家對探險家，{name}。之後協會會要你的筆記。"
L["If ye ride a gryphon, {name}, hold on with yer knees and yer prayers. Here."] = "騎獅鷲的話，{name}，膝蓋夾緊，嘴裡唸禱告。給。"
L["A dwarf never lets a friend walk into the dark unready, {name}. Take this."] = "矮人不會讓朋友沒準備就走進黑暗，{name}。拿著。"
L["Stone and hammer keep ye, cousin {name}!"] = "岩石與鐵錘保佑你，{name}兄弟！"
L["Three Hammers, one round, and this one's on me, cousin {name}!"] = "三錘之會，乾一輪，這份算我請的，{name}老表！"
L["Yer cousin's cousin wed mine, {name}, I'd wager. Family gets the good stuff."] = "你表哥的表哥娶了我家的，{name}，我敢打賭。自家人，給好的。"
L["Two dwarves, and one of us freshly blessed, {name}. Pity whatever's in our way."] = "兩個矮人，其中一個剛受了祝福，{name}。擋路的可要倒楣了。"
L["Bronzebeard, Wildhammer, Dark Iron, Earthen, {name}: one family. Here, cousin."] = "銅鬚、蠻錘、黑鐵、土靈，{name}：一家人。拿著，老表。"
L["Here, {name}. Between the pair of us now, we could out-stubborn a mountain."] = "拿著，{name}。這下咱倆能比大山還倔。"
L["Me grandmother'd climb out of her tomb if I did any less fer kin, {name}."] = "對族人小氣，{name}，我奶奶會從墳裡爬出來！"
L["The Titans carved us from the same rock, {name}, so here's a chip off mine."] = "泰坦用同一塊石頭雕出了咱倆，{name}，這塊是我那邊掰下來的。"
L["Kin's kin, {name}, far from the mountain or under it. This is how we mind ours."] = "自家人就是自家人，{name}，山外山下都一樣。我們就這麼照應自己人。"
L["There, {name}, that'll see ye through. Stand behind me. Aye, I know. Crouch."] = "好了，{name}，這能撐住你。站我後面。對，我知道。蹲低點。"
L["Right, {name}: ye get this, I take the front, and we argue about loot after."] = "好，{name}：這個給你，我打頭陣，戰利品回頭再吵。"
L["Here, {name}. If I sing after this, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "拿著，{name}。要是之後我唱起歌，說明仗打得好。要麼就是糟透了。"
L["Dwarves never leave a mate behind, {name}, nor without a blessin'. Nor a keg."] = "矮人從不丟下夥伴，{name}，也不讓夥伴沒祝福就上。酒桶也不丟。"
L["There, {name}. Beards out! Them without beards, look fierce. This helps."] = "好了，{name}。鬍子亮出來！沒鬍子的，擺個兇相。這個能幫上忙。"
L["Knocked on the nearest rock fer luck, {name}, and put the luck on ye. Solid."] = "敲了敲最近的石頭討個彩頭，{name}，彩頭都給你了。結實。"
L["Here, {name}, from me pack. It's mostly gunpowder in there. And a sandwich."] = "拿著，{name}，從我背包裡掏的。裡頭大多是火藥。還有塊三明治。"
L["That'll hold ye, {name}. Dwarves don't retreat. Our legs aren't built fer it."] = "這能撐住你，{name}。矮人不後退。咱的腿不是幹那個的。"
L["Take this, stay close, {name}. If it goes dark, follow the cursin'. That's me."] = "拿著，跟緊，{name}。要是黑了，就跟著罵聲走。那就是我。"
L["Ye're sorted, {name}. Dwarves always know which way is down. Up's yer problem."] = "你這邊妥了，{name}。矮人總知道哪邊是下。上頭歸你管。"
L["Here, {name}. Anythin' o' stone, let me talk to it first. Might be a cousin."] = "拿著，{name}。凡是石頭做的，讓我先跟它聊聊。說不定是親戚。"
L["There, {name}, that'll take a knock. If the ceilin' creaks, I'll tell ye."] = "好了，{name}，挨一下沒問題。天花板要是吱呀響，我會告訴你。"
L["There, {name}, some mountain fer ye. I'll hold the line. Mountains don't move."] = "好了，{name}，分你一點大山的勁兒。我來守線。大山不挪窩。"
L["That'll stiffen yer ankles, {name}. Troggs go fer ankles. Mine, mostly."] = "這能讓你腳踝硬氣點，{name}。穴居人專咬腳踝。多半是我的。"
L["There, {name}, fer the low beams. Says the only one here who never needs it."] = "好了，{name}，防矮房樑用的。說這話的是唯一用不著的那個。"
L["A hammer, a grudge, a good breakfast, and this fer ye, {name}. We'll be fine."] = "一把錘子，一肚子怨氣，一頓好早飯，再加上給你的這個，{name}。穩了。"
L["Ironforge's carvers never quit halfway, {name}. Nor does a dwarf's blessin'."] = "鐵爐堡的石匠從不半途而廢，{name}，矮人的祝福也一樣。"
L["Keep up, {name}! There's a spring in yer step now. Short legs; we never stop."] = "跟上，{name}！現在你腳下帶勁了。腿短，可咱從不停。"
L["Mornin', {name}! Too early for ale. Almost. Have this first."] = "早，{name}！喝麥酒還太早。大概吧。先來這個！"
L["Up with the forge fires, {name}! A dwarf's day starts with a hammer and this."] = "{name}，爐火已旺！矮人一天從掄錘和這個開始。"
L["Early, {name}? Nonsense. The mine's been open two hours. Here."] = "早？胡說，{name}，礦坑都開工兩小時了。拿去！"
L["Mornin', {name}. Me eyes are still abed, but me hands knew to give ye this."] = "早啊，{name}。眼睛還賴在床上，手倒知道把這個給你。"
L["Mornin', {name}. Porridge, a pipe and this. The other two are mine."] = "早，{name}。燕麥粥、菸斗、這個。前兩樣是我的。"
L["The rams had me up at dawn, {name}. Headbutted the door till I came out. Here."] = "山羊一早撞門，{name}，撞到我出來為止。拿去！"
L["Mornin', {name}. Ears still ringin' from last night's singin'. Here."] = "早，{name}。昨晚唱太嗨，耳朵還在嗡嗡響。拿去！"
L["Steady, {name}. Ye've a better nose than any dwarf in Ironforge."] = "穩住，{name}。你的鼻子比鐵爐堡哪個矮人都靈。"
L["That's the spot, {name}. Ye've earned a scratch, and a share o' me jerky."] = "就是這兒，{name}。撓撓你，再分你點肉乾。"
L["Easy now, {name}. The road's long, but we've stout hearts between us."] = "慢點，{name}。路還長，可咱倆膽子都大。"
L["Well fought, {name}! Ye've the heart of a mountain, so ye have."] = "打得好，{name}！你有一顆大山般的心。"
L["Ha! Grand work, {name}. I'll tell it at the Thunderbrew with ye in it."] = "哈！幹得漂亮，{name}。我要在酒館裡講你的故事。"
L["That's me partner! Fine work, {name}. Not a trogg could've stood it."] = "這才是我的搭檔！幹得好，{name}。穴居人可扛不住。"
L["Easy, {name}, easy. I've got ye. Rest a while."] = "別急，{name}，別急。有我在。歇一會兒。"
L["There now, {name}. Ye're tougher than granite, but rest anyway."] = "好了，{name}。你比花崗岩還結實，可還是歇歇吧。"
L["Shh, {name}. Nothin' gets past me while ye catch yer breath."] = "噓，{name}。你喘口氣，什麼都過不了我這關。"
L["My thanks, {name}. Let me return the kindness before a bard gets it wrong."] = "多謝，{name}。趁吟遊詩人還沒唱錯，先還你人情。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. Let no one say we forget a friend."] = "有心了，{name}。我們從不忘記朋友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd knight you, but apparently I 'need permission'."] = "謝了，{name}。想封你當騎士，據說我「沒權限」。"
L["Repaid on the spot, {name}. In Stormwind that'd take three forms and a stamp."] = "當場還你，{name}。在暴風城得填三張表再蓋章。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Prompter than Stormwind ever paid its stonemasons."] = "謝了，{name}。比暴風城付石匠工錢快多了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Mother said always return a kindness. And the dish."] = "感激不盡，{name}。我媽說人情要還，碗也要還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In Elwynn, no kindness goes home unanswered."] = "謝謝，{name}。在艾爾文森林，好意從不空手而歸。"
L["You shame me, {name}; I should have thought of it first. Allow me."] = "慚愧，{name}，該我先想到的。容我回敬。"
L["Heartier than Westfall Stew, {name}, and I've wept over that stew. Thank you."] = "暖過西部荒野燉肉，{name}，那燉肉我吃到哭過。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell Marshal Dughan. He won't care, but I'll tell him."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會跟杜漢元帥說，他不在乎也說。"
L["Job's done, {name}! My grandad built half of Stormwind saying that. Thanks."] = "工作完成，{name}！我爺爺喊這句蓋了半座暴風城。"
L["Lakeshire will finish its bridge before I forget this, {name}. So, never."] = "湖畔鎮的橋蓋好前，{name}，我忘不了。等於永遠。"
L["Kul Tirans say a kindness goes back on the next tide, {name}. There it goes."] = "庫爾提拉斯人說人情隨潮還，{name}。潮來了！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Northshire's brothers would call that the Light at work."] = "謝謝，{name}。北郡修士會說，這是聖光的作為。"
L["Not since Mum packed my lunches, {name}, have I felt so looked after. Thanks."] = "自從媽媽幫我帶便當，{name}，就沒人這樣照顧我了。謝謝。"
L["Into my memoirs, {name}. Chapter nine: 'Everyone Was Lovely'. Thank you."] = "寫進回憶錄第九章，{name}：「大家人都很好」。"
L["I'll toast you at the Pig and Whistle, {name}. Then the pig. Then the whistle."] = "豬與哨子酒館裡敬你，{name}。然後敬豬、敬哨子。"
L["Thanks, {name}. My next horse gets your name. He'll be a very good horse."] = "謝了，{name}。我下一匹馬就取你的名字。牠會是匹好馬。"
L["I owe you a pint at the Lion's Pride, {name}. This will tide you over."] = "欠你一杯，{name}，獅王之傲旅店見。先拿這個墊著。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. In Elwynn that's neighbourly. Out here, it's heroic."] = "多謝，{name}。在艾爾文森林這叫敦親睦鄰，在這裡叫英雄。"
L["Thanks, {name}. We humans don't live long enough to leave a kindness waiting."] = "謝了，{name}。我們人類活不了那麼久，好意不能拖。"
L["Thanks, {name}. If the Stockade held folk for kindness, you'd be in for life."] = "謝了，{name}。暴風城監獄要是抓好心人，你得關一輩子。"
L["By the Light, {name}, that was good of you. Uther would have liked you."] = "聖光在上，{name}，你真好心。烏瑟會喜歡你的。"
L["Darkshire could use folk like you, {name}. Your kindness, returned."] = "夜色鎮正缺你這樣的人，{name}。你的好意，我回敬了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still and look heroic; it helps the bards."] = "當然，{name}。擺個英雄姿勢，吟遊詩人好寫歌。"
L["Right away, {name}. Keep your shield high."] = "馬上來，{name}。盾牌舉高！"
L["More work? Gladly, {name}. It beats the lumber mill."] = "又有工作？樂意，{name}。總比伐木場強。"
L["Of course, {name}. Humans excel at helping and overpromising. This is helping."] = "當然，{name}。人類擅長幫忙和開支票，這是幫忙。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Westfall farm manners: you help first and ask why later."] = "當然，{name}。西部荒野農家規矩：先幫忙，再問為什麼。"
L["Hold still, {name}, like a statue in the Valley of Heroes. You'd fit right in."] = "別動，{name}，像英雄谷的雕像。你擺那兒剛好！"
L["Right away, {name}. The Light helps those who ask. So do I, and I'm quicker."] = "馬上，{name}。聖光有求必應，我也是，還更快。"
L["Sailors' rule, {name}: somebody calls for help, you row. Here."] = "水手守則，{name}：有人喊救命，就划過去。給你！"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand up straight; my old sergeant is watching, somewhere."] = "當然，{name}。站直！我的老士官長不知在哪盯著。"
L["Of course, {name}. A polite request is rarer than a quiet night in Duskwood."] = "當然，{name}。客氣的人比暮色森林的靜夜還稀有。"
L["Right away, {name}. I'll play the Archbishop; you pretend to be impressed."] = "馬上，{name}。我來扮大主教，你負責假裝很佩服。"
L["Stormwind rose from rubble, {name}. I can manage one {buff}."] = "暴風城都能從廢墟重建，{name}，區區{buff}算什麼。"
L["Of course, {name}. Last one I did was a Westfall scarecrow. Long story."] = "當然，{name}。上個是西部荒野稻草人。說來話長。"
L["Aye, {name}. Kul Tiran terms: a handshake, and I spare you the shanty."] = "行，{name}。庫爾提拉斯規矩：握個手，船歌免了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Bolvar says the realm runs on small kindnesses."] = "馬上，{name}。伯瓦爾說，王國靠點滴善意運轉。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Elwynn folk never turn away a neighbour, armour and all."] = "樂意，{name}。艾爾文鄉親從不拒絕鄰居，穿盔甲也一樣。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Light provides. Today it's using me as the courier."] = "當然，{name}。聖光自會供應，今天派我當信差。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stormwind raised me on the Light, porridge and saying yes."] = "當然，{name}。暴風城用聖光、燕麥粥和「好」把我養大。"
L["Right away, {name}. At Northshire we answered before the second bell."] = "馬上，{name}。在北郡，第二聲鐘響前就得回應。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. This won't shorten it, but it'll help."] = "前路漫漫，{name}。路不會變短，但會好走點。"
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}, and this to carry you along."] = "一路順風順水，{name}，帶上這個送你一程。"
L["Take this, {name}. Elves have centuries to be generous; I've got fifty years."] = "{name}，精靈有幾百年慢慢大方，我只有五十年。"
L["A little something, {name}. Don't tell the guards; they'll all want one."] = "小意思，{name}。別跟衛兵說，他們都會想要。"
L["Here, {name}. If a kobold asks, you don't have a candle."] = "狗頭人問起，{name}，就說你沒拿蠟燭。"
L["For you, {name}. A human gift: well meant, hastily made, surprisingly sturdy."] = "給你，{name}。人類出品：好心、趕工、意外耐用。"
L["Mind the murlocs, {name}. Take this; I've seen what they do to a picnic."] = "小心魚人，{name}。拿著，我見過牠們掃蕩野餐。"
L["Every road needs a hero, {name}. Today it's me, apparently. Take this."] = "每條路都要有英雄，{name}。今天好像是我。拿著！"
L["Stay out of Duskwood after dark, {name}. It's always dark. Take this."] = "天黑別進暮色森林，{name}。那裡永遠天黑。拿著。"
L["Redridge gnolls take anything not nailed down, {name}. This is nailed down."] = "赤脊山豺狼人沒釘牢的都搶，{name}。這個釘牢了。"
L["If you meet Hogger, {name}, take this and a friend. Mostly the friend."] = "遇到霍格，{name}，帶上這個和朋友。主要是朋友。"
L["The Light and a good pair of boots, {name}. Now you've got one of them."] = "出門靠聖光和好靴子，{name}。這下你有一樣了。"
L["Every hero in Stormwind began with a kindness and a borrowed sword, {name}."] = "暴風城英雄都起於善意和借來的劍，{name}。"
L["Here, {name}. The Defias can't steal this one. They've tried everything else."] = "給你，{name}。迪菲亞偷不走這個。其他全偷過了。"
L["Uther blessed strangers on the road, {name}. I've less hammer, same idea."] = "烏瑟常為路人祝福，{name}。我錘子小，心意一樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Goldshire custom: no traveller leaves empty-handed."] = "拿著，{name}。閃金鎮的規矩：旅人不空手離開。"
L["The wolves in Elwynn look friendly, {name}. They are not. Take this."] = "艾爾文森林的狼看著友善，{name}。才怪。拿著！"
L["Lothar held the line with less, {name}. Granted, he had a very big sword."] = "洛薩靠更少就守住防線，{name}。好吧，他有把超大的劍。"
L["Westfall farmers share even in a bad year, {name}. So here's my share."] = "西部荒野的農夫荒年也肯分享，{name}。這份是我的。"
L["Redridge, Duskwood, Westfall, {name}: worse roads every mile. Take this."] = "赤脊山、暮色森林、西部荒野，{name}：出了艾爾文路路更難走。拿著這個。"
L["Take this, {name}. The guards can't be everywhere. Out here, they're nowhere."] = "拿著，{name}。衛兵不可能無所不在。在這裡，他們根本不在。"
L["Bound for Hillsbrad, {name}? Southshore's still ours. Barely. Take this."] = "要去希爾斯布萊德，{name}？南海鎮還是我們的。勉強啦。拿著。"
L["Stromgarde still stands, {name}, mostly out of stubbornness. So will you. Here."] = "激流堡還屹立著，{name}，多半靠固執。你也會的。給。"
L["A Stormwind welcome, {name}: a smile, a blessing and the way to the inn."] = "暴風城式歡迎，{name}：一個微笑、一份祝福，外加旅店怎麼走。"
L["The Argent Dawn says the Light is for all who'll carry it, {name}. Carry some."] = "銀色黎明說，聖光屬於願意承載它的人，{name}。你也帶點。"
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}, and share what strength they have."] = "阿拉索的子民同進退，{name}，有力量就一起分享。"
L["A fellow human, {name}! Take this. Then let's found a kingdom before lunch."] = "同為人類，{name}！拿著。然後咱們午飯前建個王國。"
L["Stormwind or Boralus, {name}, we'll both moan about the weather. This helps."] = "暴風城也好伯拉勒斯也罷，{name}，咱倆都得抱怨天氣。這個能頂點用。"
L["Human to human, {name}: everything happens to us, so here's a little help."] = "人類對人類，{name}：倒楣事總找上咱們，所以給你幫點小忙。"
L["Short lives, long to-do lists, {name}. We humans must help each other along."] = "人生苦短，待辦超長，{name}。人類得互相幫忙。"
L["Stormwind stone or Kul Tiran oak, {name}, this will help you outlast them all."] = "暴風城的石頭也好，庫爾提拉斯的橡木也好，{name}，有了這個你比誰都撐得久。"
L["Humans stick together, {name}, so take this. The rest are taller or furrier."] = "人類得抱團，{name}，所以拿著。別的種族不是更高就是毛更多。"
L["We built half the world on bread, stubbornness and favours like this, {name}."] = "咱們人類靠麵包、倔勁和這樣的好意建起了半個世界，{name}。"
L["Don't tell the dwarves, {name}: humans invented the tavern. And this round."] = "別告訴矮人，{name}，酒館是咱們人類發明的。這一輪也算我的。"
L["There, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things, and by sharing."] = "好了，{name}。人類向來靠人多取勝，也靠互相幫襯。"
L["You're ready, {name}. Stay in formation. We haven't got one, but stay in it."] = "你準備好了，{name}。保持隊形。咱們沒隊形，但也得保持。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll draw up a plan too, and we can all ignore it together."] = "拿著，{name}。我再定個計畫，然後大家一起無視它。"
L["Every hero in the songs had friends who did this, {name}. I'll be yours."] = "歌謠裡的英雄都有朋友這樣照應，{name}。我來當你的那個朋友。"
L["There, {name}. Stormwind taught me to march and to mind who marches with me."] = "好了，{name}。暴風城教會我行軍，也教會我照顧並肩行軍的人。"
L["That should keep us safe, {name}. If not, we regroup at the nearest inn."] = "這下應該不會出岔子，{name}。真出了，就到最近的旅店集合。"
L["I made us a flag, {name}, and you a blessing. The flag's a hankie on a stick."] = "我給咱們做了面旗，{name}，給你加了個祝福。旗嘛，就是根棍上掛塊手帕。"
L["A light of your own, {name}. Humans can't see in the dark, and we hate it."] = "拿著，{name}，給你一點自己的光。人類在黑暗裡看不見，我們最討厭那樣。"
L["That's for your back, {name}; I'll watch it too. The Light has the rest."] = "這是護你後背的，{name}；我也替你盯著。剩下的交給聖光。"
L["There, {name}. Humans rise to the occasion, and this should stop the tripping."] = "好了，{name}。人類總能臨危而起，有了這個，起來時就不會再絆倒了。"
L["Your share, {name}. Do this well; some elf will tell the story for an age."] = "這份是你的，{name}。好好幹；總有個精靈會把這事講上一千年。"
L["Farmers, sailors, bakers, {name}: every army Stormwind raised got one of these."] = "農夫、水手、麵包師，{name}：暴風城召集的每支軍隊都領過這麼一份。"
L["Form up, {name}, and take this. One steady line beats a crowd of brave fools."] = "列隊，{name}，拿上這個。一道穩固的陣線勝過一群莽夫。"
L["We'll make Stormwind proud, {name}. This should keep the town criers kind."] = "咱們要讓暴風城驕傲，{name}。有了這個，傳令官嘴下也會留情。"
L["The Light keeps us, {name}. Here's some for you. I've packed bandages too."] = "聖光護佑我們，{name}，這一份是給你的。我也帶了繃帶。"
L["Take this, {name}. Everyone goes home; I promised somebody's mother. Yours."] = "誰都得平安回家，{name}，所以拿著。我答應過某人的母親。多半是你媽。"
L["We look like a proper Stormwind patrol now, {name}. Shinier, even."] = "現在像支正規的暴風城巡邏隊了，{name}。還更閃亮。"
L["Stay sharp, {name}, this'll help. Lordaeron learned: never trust the bread."] = "打起精神，{name}，這個能幫上忙。洛丹倫吃過大虧才明白：千萬別信麵包。"
L["Easy there, {name}. Stormwind's finest couldn't ask for better company."] = "放輕鬆，{name}。暴風城的精英也找不到更好的夥伴。"
L["Good to have you at my side, {name}. Truly."] = "有你在身邊真好，{name}。真的。"
L["Who's the best hunting partner in the Eastern Kingdoms? You are, {name}."] = "東部王國最好的狩獵夥伴是誰？是你，{name}。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Light itself couldn't have timed that better."] = "幹得好，{name}！聖光都沒法把時機抓得更準。"
L["That's how it's done, {name}. I'd put you up against any knight."] = "就該這樣，{name}。哪個騎士我都敢讓你上。"
L["Brilliant, {name}. You turned that fight before I'd drawn twice."] = "漂亮，{name}。我還沒拉兩次弓，你就扭轉了戰局。"
L["Easy, {name}. I'm here. Lie still and let me look at you."] = "別動，{name}。我在這兒。躺好，讓我看看你。"
L["You're all right, {name}. I've got you. Breathe."] = "沒事了，{name}。有我在。呼吸。"
L["Steady, {name}. Rest now; I'll keep watch for both of us."] = "穩住，{name}。歇著吧，我替咱倆守著。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Returned the same day, which for a kaldorei is rushing."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。當天就還，對卡多雷來說已經很趕了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Elune smiles on the generous."] = "謝謝，{name}。伊露恩眷顧慷慨之人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the wisps glow brighter, and they're hard to impress."] = "謝謝，{name}。連眼光很高的小精靈都亮了起來。"
L["Elune saw that, {name}. She sees everything, so I had best return it."] = "伊露恩看見了，{name}。她無所不見，我得趕快還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness planted, kindness grown. Here."] = "謝謝，{name}。種下善意，長出善意。給你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Ancients will hear of this. They're dreadful gossips."] = "謝謝，{name}。這事古樹們都會知道，它們超八卦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell the Sentinels to stop aiming at you."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會叫哨兵別再瞄準你了。"
L["My people never hurry, {name}. For you, an exception."] = "我族從不趕時間，{name}。為你破例一次。"
L["Ande'thoras-ethil, {name}. May your troubles be diminished, as mine just were."] = "Ande'thoras-ethil，{name}。願你煩惱漸消，如我剛剛。"
L["We gave up immortality at Hyjal, {name}. Kindness has been worth double since."] = "海加爾一戰捨了永生，{name}，善意從此加倍珍貴。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My ears went a shade darker. Kaldorei blush there first."] = "謝謝你，{name}。我的耳朵顏色深了一層。卡多雷先紅的就是耳朵。"
L["Azshara's court never gave a thing away, {name}. You've outdone a queen."] = "艾薩拉的宮廷一毛不拔，{name}。你比女王還大方。"
L["The owls turned their heads for that, {name}. All the way round. High praise."] = "貓頭鷹都轉過頭來，{name}。360度的讚賞！"
L["I outlived the Sundering, {name}. I'll not outlive a debt to you. Here."] = "熬過大分裂，{name}，卻熬不住欠你人情。還你。"
L["All those centuries of memories, {name}, and this one goes near the front."] = "這麼多世紀的回憶裡，{name}，這段排前面。"
L["I'll tell the moon about you tonight, {name}. She likes a good story."] = "今晚我會跟月亮說起你，{name}。她愛聽好故事。"
L["In Darnassus they'd sing of that, {name}. Quietly, for about a century."] = "在達納蘇斯，這會被傳唱，{name}。輕聲地，唱個一百年。"
L["Thank you, {name}. A Sentinel settles a debt of honour by moonset. So do I."] = "謝謝，{name}。哨兵的榮譽之債，月落前必還。我也是。"
L["Shan'do Stormrage would approve, {name}. He'll tell you himself, when he wakes."] = "瑪法里恩導師會讚許的，{name}。等他醒來，會親口告訴你。"
L["The Cenarion Circle preaches balance, {name}. You've just tipped it my way."] = "塞納里奧議會講究平衡，{name}。你剛把天秤往我這邊傾了。"
L["Better than a moonwell, {name}. Don't tell the priestesses I said so."] = "比月井還好，{name}。別跟女祭司說是我講的。"
L["Even Fandral would smile at that, {name}, and his face has forgotten how."] = "連范達爾都會笑，{name}，雖然他的臉早忘了怎麼笑。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd send a hippogryph with my thanks, but they bite."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想派角鷹獸送謝意，但牠們會咬人。"
L["That warms me like moonlight, {name}. Not very warm, I admit. Still, thank you."] = "像月光般溫暖，{name}。我承認月光不太暖。還是謝謝你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Be still, and let the moonlight find you."] = "樂意之至，{name}。靜靜沐浴月光吧。"
L["Of course, {name}. Elune's blessings are meant to be shared."] = "當然，{name}。伊露恩的祝福本該分享。"
L["At last, {name}! I've waited ten thousand years for someone to ask."] = "終於，{name}！我等人開口等了一萬年。"
L["No riddle, no omen from Elune, {name}. Just a plain yes, for once."] = "不打啞謎也不問伊露恩，{name}。難得直接說好。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask in Darnassian next time and I'll add a bow."] = "當然，{name}。下次用達納蘇斯語說，附贈鞠躬。"
L["Elune already said yes, {name}. I'm merely catching up."] = "伊露恩早就答應了，{name}。我只是跟上而已。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still and pretend you're a tree. It helps."] = "當然，{name}。站好，假裝自己是棵樹，真的有用。"
L["Step into the light, {name}. The last kaldorei I did this for Shadowmelded."] = "站到亮處，{name}。上次那位卡多雷，直接影遁了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Ask a kaldorei anything, except how old we are."] = "當然，{name}。卡多雷什麼都能問，除了芳齡。"
L["In Darnassus, {name}, this takes a moonwell and a priestess. Out here, just me."] = "達納蘇斯要月井和女祭司，{name}。野外只有我。"
L["The last army to ask me for help was fighting demons, {name}. You're politer."] = "上個求我幫忙的是抗魔軍隊，{name}。你禮貌多了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Consider it on loan from Elune. She's never once collected."] = "樂意，{name}。算向伊露恩借的，她從沒討過。"
L["Of course, {name}. One moment; my hair is older than kingdoms, and it tangles."] = "當然，{name}。稍等，我的頭髮比好些王國還老，老打結。"
L["Darnassian has nine words for 'yes', {name}. I'll spare you eight of them."] = "達納蘇斯語「好」有九種，{name}。省你八種：好。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Sentinels would want a password. I'll accept 'please'."] = "當然，{name}。哨兵要口令，我只要一聲「請」。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll be swift. Swift for a kaldorei, that is. Do sit down."] = "當然，{name}。我會很快，以卡多雷來說。先坐吧。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The Sentinels taught me to answer a call before it echoes."] = "樂意，{name}。哨兵教我：呼喚還沒回音，就要回應。"
L["Be still, {name}. What's done in haste is undone by nightfall, the druids say."] = "別動，{name}。德魯伊說，倉促做成的事，入夜就散。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Elune asks little of us: kindness, patience and good aim."] = "樂意，{name}。伊露恩要求不多：善良、耐心、準頭。"
L["Of course, {name}. The forest gave me plenty. It would sulk if I didn't share."] = "當然，{name}。森林給我很多，不分享它會鬧脾氣。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Her light goes with you. Walk softly; trees sleep lightly."] = "艾露恩-阿多爾，{name}。她的光與你同行。腳步輕些，樹木睡得淺。"
L["May the forest shelter you, {name}, wherever you roam."] = "無論你去哪，願森林庇護你，{name}。"
L["A gift from the shadows, {name}. No, don't look. You won't find me."] = "來自暗影的禮物，{name}。別找了，你找不到我的。"
L["Elune lights your path, {name}. I'm merely holding the lantern."] = "伊露恩照亮你的路，{name}。我只是提燈的。"
L["The owls pointed you out, {name}. They have strong opinions. Here."] = "貓頭鷹指名要給你，{name}。牠們很有主見。拿著。"
L["Tyrande would insist, {name}, and nobody argues with Tyrande."] = "泰蘭妲會堅持的，{name}。沒人敢跟泰蘭妲吵。"
L["Take this, {name}. The last one went to a hippogryph. It was less grateful."] = "拿著，{name}。上次給角鷹獸，牠可沒這麼領情。"
L["Take this, {name}. Half the wildlife's a druid, and all of it is watching."] = "拿著，{name}。這兒的野獸一半是德魯伊，全都在看著。"
L["Walk with Elune, {name}. If she's busy, walk with this."] = "願伊露恩與你同行，{name}。她沒空就換這個陪你。"
L["A ward against satyrs, {name}. Once Highborne; you can tell by the sneer."] = "防薩特的護佑，{name}。它們曾是上層精靈。看那冷笑就知道。"
L["The trees spoke well of you, {name}. I thought I'd add my blessing."] = "樹木們對你讚不絕口，{name}。我想在它們的話上再添一份祝福。"
L["Most furbolgs are friendly, {name}. This is for the other ones."] = "熊怪大多很友善，{name}。這個是防另外那些的。"
L["Moonwell water would be better, {name}, but it travels badly. This doesn't."] = "月井水更好，{name}，但不好帶。這個好帶。"
L["A gift from Teldrassil, {name}. It's a long way down; I nearly dropped it."] = "泰達希爾帶下來的，{name}。好高，差點失手。"
L["I'd stay to chat, {name}, but kaldorei chats run to the next full moon. Here."] = "想多聊，{name}，但卡多雷一聊就到滿月。拿著。"
L["Bandu thoribas, {name}: prepare to fight. There. Now you're prepared."] = "Bandu thoribas，{name}：準備戰鬥。喏，準備好了。"
L["From the kaldorei, the moon and a very old tree, {name}. Mostly from me."] = "卡多雷、月亮和一棵老樹合送，{name}。主要是我。"
L["Ashenvale remembers every axe, {name}. Carry this, and leave yours sheathed."] = "梣谷記得每一把斧頭，{name}。帶上這個，你的就收著吧。"
L["With this, {name}, the Sentinels will know you're a friend. Probably. Wave."] = "帶著這個，{name}，哨兵就知道你是朋友了。大概吧。多揮揮手。"
L["May the moon guide you, {name}, and this keep you until it rises."] = "願月光指引你，{name}。月亮升起前，就讓這個護著你。"
L["Moonglade welcomes all who come in peace, {name}. So does this."] = "月光林地歡迎所有和平來客，{name}。這個也是。"
L["Darkshore is beautiful, {name}, and full of things that bite. Take this."] = "黑海岸很美，{name}，也到處是會咬人的東西。拿著。"
L["My people learned the hard way not to hoard magic, {name}. So, here."] = "我的族人吃過大虧才學會不囤魔法，{name}。所以，給你。"
L["Felwood was a forest once, {name}. Take this; stay well where it didn't."] = "費伍德森林曾經也是尋常森林，{name}。拿著這個，它沒能保全，願你平安。"
L["Bound for Stonetalon, {name}? Take this. Mind the goblins' saws; the trees do."] = "要去石爪山脈嗎，{name}？拿著這個。當心哥布林的鋸子，樹木都提防著。"
L["Take this, {name}. If you meet an Ancient, bow. They notice, and never forget."] = "拿著，{name}。遇到古樹要鞠躬。它們會注意到，而且永遠記得。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close, and so do I."] = "伊什努-阿拉，{name}。艾露恩護佑她的孩子，我也一樣。"
L["Of course I saw you, {name}. It takes a kaldorei to spot one in need of this."] = "我當然看見你了，{name}。只有卡多雷才看得出同族需要這個。"
L["Kaldorei to kaldorei, {name}: we gave up eternity, not each other. Take this."] = "卡多雷對卡多雷，{name}：我們放棄了永生，沒放棄彼此。拿著。"
L["A kaldorei never leaves kin in the dark, {name}. Unless it's for cover."] = "卡多雷不讓族人摸黑，{name}。要躲起來除外。"
L["Two kaldorei, {name}, and no helmet fits either pair of ears. This does."] = "兩個卡多雷，{name}，哪頂頭盔都套不上咱們的耳朵。這個倒合適。"
L["Sentinel, druid or simply stubborn, {name}? This suits all three."] = "哨兵、德魯伊，還是單純倔，{name}？這個三樣都合適。"
L["Twenty thousand years of 'we tried that', {name}. This, though, always works."] = "兩萬年來都是「那個試過了」，{name}。不過這個向來管用。"
L["There, {name}. Now let's Shadowmeld together sometime and see who notices."] = "好了，{name}。哪天咱倆一起用影遁，看誰能發現。"
L["Our shan'do sleeps in the Dream, {name}. I'll mind you for him until he wakes."] = "我們的導師在夢境中沉睡，{name}。他醒來之前，我替他照看你。"
L["Our people are few, {name}, so each of us gets looked after. Here."] = "我們族人稀少，{name}，所以每一個都得照應。給你。"
L["Quick one, {name}? Take this now. By kaldorei reckoning we're already done."] = "速戰速決，{name}？那先拿著這個。按卡多雷的算法，咱們已經結束了。"
L["That's from the one you can't see, {name}. Not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "這是看不見的那個人給你的，{name}。不是失誤，是計畫。"
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I just pass her light along."] = "艾露恩看顧著整支隊伍，{name}。我只是把她的光傳下去。"
L["Ten thousand years of companions, {name}. You lot rank high enough for this."] = "一萬年的旅伴，{name}。你們這夥人夠格拿這個。"
L["Here, {name}. We misplaced half a continent once. I'm not misplacing you."] = "拿著，{name}。我們弄丟過半塊大陸。可不會弄丟你。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, I'll float about as a wisp, looking wise."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我倒了，就變成小精靈飄來飄去，一臉睿智。"
L["I fought beside Neltharion once, {name}. He never got this from me. You do."] = "我曾與奈薩里奧並肩作戰，{name}。他從沒從我這得到過這個。你得到了。"
L["Take this and follow me, {name}. I know these paths. They were a forest, mind."] = "拿著，跟我來，{name}。這些路我熟。不過上次還是片森林。"
L["Here, {name}. With this, we shan't fail. If we do, I'll remember you for ages."] = "拿著，{name}。有了這個就不會失敗。真敗了，我會記你幾千年。"
L["Heroes charge in blind for millennia, {name}. Take this; let's try eyes open."] = "幾千年來英雄們都閉眼衝鋒，{name}。拿著，咱們睜著眼試試。"
L["That'll keep you till dawn, {name}. I'll take first watch. And second."] = "這能撐你到天亮，{name}。頭一班崗我來站。第二班也是。"
L["Here, quietly, {name}. Keep your voices low; the forest listens, and remembers."] = "悄悄地，拿著，{name}。說話小聲點，森林在聽，也記著。"
L["We held the Legion with fewer, {name}, and less help than this. We'll be fine."] = "我們曾以更少的人、更少的援助擋住燃燒軍團，{name}。沒事的。"
L["A Sentinel never looses an arrow she'd want back, {name}, nor a blessing."] = "哨兵從不射出會後悔的箭，{name}，祝福也一樣。"
L["Dark in there, {name}? Take this and follow me. The night is where we live."] = "裡面黑嗎，{name}？拿著，跟我走。黑夜是我們的家。"
L["Moving out, {name}, blessed and silent as owls. Or as dwarves, if we can't."] = "出發，{name}，帶著祝福，像貓頭鷹一樣安靜。做不到就像矮人那樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. I watch the shadows; nothing moves in them without my say."] = "拿著，{name}。陰影我來盯，沒我點頭，裡頭什麼都動不了。"
L["The moon's up, {name}; here's her blessing. For a kaldorei, it's mid-morning."] = "月亮升起來了，{name}，給你她的祝福。對卡多雷來說，現在才上午。"
L["Everyone sensible is asleep, {name}, so Elune's light is all yours tonight."] = "明理的人都睡了，{name}，今晚艾露恩的光全歸你。"
L["Elune's light is on you, {name}. Here's a second layer."] = "伊露恩的光照著你，{name}。這個再加一層。"
L["Dark at last, {name}. Now I see perfectly, and you get this before I see more."] = "總算黑了，{name}。現在我看得一清二楚，先把這個給你。"
L["Same stars as ten thousand years ago, {name}. Same blessing. Both aged well."] = "還是一萬年前那些星星，{name}。這祝福也沒變。都老得挺好。"
L["Moonrise, {name}. Every kaldorei just woke up a little. Here's my share of it."] = "月出了，{name}。每個卡多雷都醒了幾分。這份是我的，分給你。"
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these; this will help us both adapt."] = "早，{name}。我的族人向來睡過這時候；這個能幫咱倆適應。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Elune's gone to bed, so I'm covering for her."] = "天亮了，{name}。伊露恩去睡了，我來代班。"
L["The sun's up, {name}, and so, reluctantly, am I. Have this while I wake."] = "太陽出來了，{name}，我也不情不願地起來了。我醒醒神，你先拿著這個。"
L["Too bright, {name}. I'll squint through this one; Elune forgives squinting."] = "太亮了，{name}。我瞇著眼施吧，伊露恩准許瞇眼。"
L["Daybreak, {name}: the one hour a night elf is easy to spot. Quick, take this."] = "天亮了，{name}：夜精靈就這時最好找。快拿著！"
L["Up early, {name}? I'm up late. Let's meet in the middle, with this."] = "你早起，{name}？我晚睡。各退一步，拿著這個。"
L["Elune walks with us, {name}. Breathe the forest in while it is quiet."] = "伊露恩與我們同行，{name}。趁森林安靜，深呼吸吧。"
L["The wild remembers us both, {name}. Stay close a while."] = "荒野記得我們倆，{name}。在我身邊待一會兒。"
L["Ten thousand years of hunters, {name}, and none had a truer friend."] = "萬年來的獵人裡，{name}，沒人有比你更忠實的朋友。"
L["Swift and true, {name}. Cenarius himself would be proud of you."] = "迅捷又精準，{name}。塞納留斯也會為你驕傲。"
L["Well hunted, {name}. The forest sings of that one tonight."] = "獵得好，{name}。今晚森林會為此歌唱。"
L["That was the wild at its finest, {name}. Well done."] = "這才是荒野最美的樣子，{name}。幹得好。"
L["Be still, {name}. Elune's light is on you; let it mend you."] = "別動，{name}。伊露恩的光照著你，讓它治癒你。"
L["Hush, {name}. I am here, and the night is gentle."] = "噓，{name}。我在這兒，夜色很溫柔。"
L["Rest, {name}. The Emerald Dream can wait a while longer for you."] = "歇著吧，{name}。翡翠夢境還能再等你一會兒。"
L["The shadows remember kindness, {name}. So do I."] = "暗影記得善意，{name}。我也是。"
L["My thanks, {name}. The ren'dorei do not forget a kindness."] = "感謝，{name}。虛無精靈不忘恩情。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The voices approve of you, which is frankly alarming."] = "謝謝，{name}。低語們挺喜歡你，這點有點嚇人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Few give gifts to someone who glows this ominously."] = "謝謝，{name}。我都閃著不祥的光了，你還敢送。"
L["Kindness is rare in the Void, {name}. I'll return yours before it notices."] = "虛無裡善意很稀有，{name}。趁它沒發現，快還你。"
L["Silvermoon threw us out, {name}. Kindness like yours deserves returning."] = "銀月城把我們趕了出來，{name}。你這樣的好意值得回報。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. It may be slightly purple. That's normal."] = "如數奉還，{name}。可能有點紫，這很正常。"
L["The Void only takes, {name}. I, however, give back."] = "虛無只會索取，{name}。我呢，懂得回報。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The whispers went quiet. That's how I know it was sincere."] = "謝謝，{name}。低語安靜下來了，可見你是真心的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd smile, but people say it's unsettling. So: imagine one."] = "謝謝，{name}。聽說我笑起來嚇人，請自行想像。"
L["Returned, {name}: cold hands, warm intentions. That's us in a sentence."] = "還你，{name}：手冷心熱，虛無精靈一言以蔽之。"
L["Returned, {name}. You may hear it twice; my spells echo now."] = "還你，{name}……還你……我的法術現在有回音。"
L["The Void offered me forbidden knowledge, {name}. Yours was the nicer gift."] = "虛無給過我禁忌知識，{name}。你送的比較好。"
L["Alleria says the Void can be mastered, {name}. Kindness, I find, is easier."] = "艾蕾莉亞說虛無能駕馭，{name}。善意倒簡單多了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Most people give us a wide berth. You gave me this."] = "感謝，{name}。別人只給我們距離，你給了這個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My shadow bowed as well. It never does. You've impressed it."] = "謝謝，{name}。我的影子也鞠躬了，它從不低頭。"
L["As you wish, {name}. The shadows answer kindly today."] = "如你所願，{name}。今天暗影很好說話。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. The Void obeys us, not the other way round."] = "交給我，{name}。虛無聽我們的，不是反過來。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The whispers said no, so it's an easy yes."] = "當然，{name}。低語叫我別給，那肯定要給。"
L["Of course, {name}. One {buff}, lightly seasoned with the Void."] = "當然，{name}。{buff}一份，撒了點虛無調味。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still; the shadows are shy with strangers."] = "當然，{name}。別動，暗影怕生。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ren'dorei manners: the Void waits its turn."] = "樂意，{name}。虛無精靈的禮數：虛無也得排隊。"
L["Asked so nicely, {name}? Then you'll have my best."] = "這麼客氣，{name}？那就給你我最好的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand in the light, please; the Void gets ideas in corners."] = "當然，{name}。站到亮處吧，虛無在角落會動歪念。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Void asked why. I said 'manners'. It's still puzzled."] = "虛無問為什麼，{name}，我說「禮貌」。它還在想。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Nobody asks us for anything but 'please stop whispering'."] = "樂意，{name}。別人只求我們：「拜託別再低語」。"
L["Happy to, {name}. Just let me finish arguing with myself. There. I won."] = "樂意，{name}。等我跟自己吵完。好了，我贏了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I could rift over there first, but that feels showy."] = "當然，{name}。可以先開裂隙閃過去，但太愛現。"
L["Asking questions got us exiled, {name}. Answering one is quite safe, I'm told."] = "我們是問太多被流放的，{name}。聽說回答挺安全。"
L["Of course, {name}. A slight chill and a faint chorus are both perfectly normal."] = "當然，{name}。微微發冷、隱約有合唱，都很正常。"
L["A touch of shadow for you, {name}. Quite safe. Mostly."] = "送你一抹暗影，{name}。很安全……大概。"
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}. This will light a little of them."] = "在黑暗之地要小心行走，{name}。這個能照亮一點。"
L["A little something from the Telogrus Rift, {name}. It's cleaner than it sounds."] = "來自泰洛古斯裂隙，{name}。比聽起來乾淨。"
L["Take this, {name}. Any tentacles you see are purely decorative."] = "拿著，{name}。看到觸手的話，純屬裝飾。"
L["The shadows asked after you, {name}. Take this; they can mind their manners."] = "陰影們打聽你呢，{name}。我把這個給了你，叫它們放規矩點。"
L["Here, {name}. We walked into the Void so you wouldn't have to."] = "給你，{name}。我們走進虛無，你就不必了。"
L["I checked your shadow, {name}. Nothing lurking. Take this anyway."] = "你的影子我查過了，{name}，很乾淨。還是拿著吧。"
L["Umbric sends his regards, {name}, and this. He doesn't, but he would."] = "安布里克向你問好，{name}，還送了這個。其實沒有，但他會的。"
L["Take this, {name}. It may whisper a compliment. Pretend you didn't hear."] = "拿著，{name}。它可能會低聲誇你，裝沒聽到就好。"
L["Here, {name}. Looks sinister, works beautifully. Rather like me."] = "給你，{name}。看著邪門，效果一流。跟我挺像的。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Void had worse in mind for you. I intercepted."] = "拿著，{name}。虛無原本想給你更糟的，我攔截了。"
L["If the dark whispers at you today, {name}, pay it no mind. Take this."] = "今天若黑暗對你低語，{name}，別理它。拿著。"
L["Here, {name}. We ren'dorei don't often get to be the nice surprise."] = "給你，{name}。虛無精靈難得是驚喜，不是驚嚇。"
L["I left Quel'Thalas with only a knack for the dark, {name}. Here's the knack."] = "我從奎爾薩拉斯只帶出暗影手藝，{name}。獻醜了。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't thank the shadows; they'll only want something. Thank me."] = "給你，{name}。別謝暗影，它們會得寸進尺。謝我。"
L["I owe a kindness for every ominous look I've given, {name}. I'm badly behind."] = "每個陰森眼神都欠一份善意，{name}。我負債累累。"
L["We ren'dorei look after our own, {name}."] = "虛無精靈照顧自己人，{name}。"
L["Silvermoon's loss, {name}. Here: we look after our own splendidly without it."] = "是銀月城的損失，{name}。拿著：沒了它，我們照樣把自己人照顧得好好的。"
L["Your whispers and mine should meet sometime, {name}. Here's a start."] = "你的低語和我的低語該見個面了，{name}。這算個開頭。"
L["Two ren'dorei, {name}. Take this; then look brooding. It's expected."] = "兩個虛無精靈湊一塊了，{name}。拿著，然後擺個憂鬱臉。大家都這麼期待。"
L["Nobody else understands the hair, {name}. Here, from one of the few who do."] = "沒人懂這頭髮，{name}。拿著，這是少數懂的人給你的。"
L["Telogrus felt like home in the end, {name}. Draughty, dark. This will warm you."] = "特羅古斯最後也算個家了，{name}。漏風又黑。這個能讓你暖和點。"
L["Ren'dorei to ren'dorei, {name}: mine whispered to give you this. Yours?"] = "虛無精靈對虛無精靈，{name}：我的低語叫我把這個給你。你的呢？"
L["Stay close, {name}, and take this. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "待近點，{name}，拿著這個。有人作伴，低語就安靜多了。"
L["There, {name}. If the shadows start giving orders, ignore them. I usually do."] = "好了，{name}。要是陰影開始發號施令，別理它們。我一般都不理。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep an eye on my shadow. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "拿著，{name}。幫我盯著我的影子。一打架它就亂跑。"
L["That glow is my gift to you, {name}. If I start glowing purple too, I'm keen."] = "那道光是我送你的，{name}。要是我也開始發紫光，說明我來勁了。"
L["Ren'dorei make fine companions, {name}. We bring our own dark, and gifts."] = "虛無精靈是好旅伴，{name}。自帶黑暗，也帶這樣的禮物。"
L["Here, {name}. If I talk to nobody, I'm fine. If nobody talks back, worry."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我好像在跟空氣說話，沒事。要是空氣不回話，那才要擔心。"
L["Yours, {name}. If it goes wrong I'll open a rift. Only for me, but I'll wave."] = "這是你的，{name}。要是出岔子，我就開個裂隙。只夠我一人，不過我會揮手。"
L["Enjoy this little gift, {name}. Ren'dorei rarely get invited anywhere twice."] = "享受這份小禮物吧，{name}。虛無精靈很少被邀請第二次。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep the lanterns lit; not for me, but the shadows behave."] = "拿著，{name}。燈籠別滅；我用不著，可陰影會老實點。"
L["Here, {name}. Watch the corners; I'll keep an eye on what's in them."] = "拿著，{name}。你盯角落，角落裡的東西我來盯。"
L["The Void gave me power, {name}. It never said I'd have friends to share it."] = "虛空給了我力量，{name}。可沒說我會遇到值得分享的同伴。"
L["For you, {name}. If you hear whispers mid-fight, they're cheering. For us."] = "這是給你的，{name}。打著打著聽見低語，那是在喝彩。給咱們的。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything eldritch turns up, I'll talk. I speak a little."] = "拿著，{name}。要是冒出什麼不可名狀的東西，讓我來說話。我會一點。"
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor. Here's a little of it."] = "夜色襯虛無精靈，{name}。我們和這布景很搭。分你一點。"
L["The shadows are longest now, {name}, and in a very generous mood."] = "此刻暗影最長，{name}，心情也最大方。"
L["Late, {name}? The whispers love a late hour, and asked me to give you this."] = "晚了吧，{name}？低語最愛深夜，它們讓我把這個給你。"
L["Midnight, {name}. My shadow and I agree on one thing tonight: you get this."] = "午夜了，{name}。今晚我和我的影子達成一致：這個給你。"
L["Stars out, {name}. I've seen what's between them. This keeps that away."] = "星星出來了，{name}。我見過星星之間是什麼。拿著，它能擋住那些。"
L["The Void whispers, {name}, but you're the only voice I listen to."] = "虛無在低語，{name}，可我只聽你的聲音。"
L["Stay near, {name}. Out here, you're the steadiest thing I have."] = "靠近點，{name}。在外頭，你是我最可靠的依靠。"
L["You never flinch at the shadows, {name}. I could learn from you."] = "你從不懼怕陰影，{name}。我該向你學學。"
L["Well done, {name}. Even the Void took a step back from that."] = "幹得好，{name}。連虛無都退了一步。"
L["Perfect, {name}. Alleria herself would want you at her side."] = "完美，{name}。奧蕾莉亞本人都會想讓你陪在身邊。"
L["That's it, {name}! Darkness on our side, and you in front."] = "就是這樣，{name}！黑暗站在我們這邊，而你衝在前面。"
L["Easy, {name}. I'll keep the whispers away while you rest."] = "別急，{name}。你休息時，我替你擋住低語。"
L["Breathe, {name}. The dark lets go of us both in time."] = "呼吸，{name}。黑暗終會放過我們倆。"
L["Stay with me, {name}. Rest now; the shadows are mine to watch."] = "陪著我，{name}。歇吧，陰影由我來盯。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness received, catalogued and returned!"] = "謝啦，{name}！好意已接收、歸檔並回傳！"
L["Reciprocity engaged! Much obliged, {name}."] = "互惠機制啟動！感激不盡，{name}。"
L["By my calculations, {name}, you're owed exactly one {buff}."] = "根據我的計算，{name}，你應得{buff}，恰好一份。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd build you a thank-you machine, but it'd explode."] = "謝啦，{name}！本想做台感謝機給你，但它會爆炸。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Gnomeregan's finest couldn't have timed that better."] = "謝謝，{name}！諾姆瑞根的頂尖專家也算不了這麼準。"
L["You're too kind, {name}! Returning the favour took only four schematics."] = "你太好了，{name}！還這份人情只用了四張設計圖。"
L["Drat, {name}! I was going to invent gratitude, but you beat me to it."] = "可惡，{name}！我正要發明「感恩」，被你搶先了。"
L["Oh, {name}, how kind! My heart's doing that whirring thing again."] = "哎呀，{name}，你真好！我的心臟齒輪又嗡嗡轉了。"
L["Noted in my lab journal, {name}, page four hundred: 'people are lovely'."] = "記進實驗日誌，{name}，第400頁：「大家人真好」。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Returning it at once, before I'm tempted to improve it."] = "太棒了，{name}！馬上還你，免得我手癢改良它。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness is a reversible reaction. I checked. Here's yours."] = "謝啦，{name}！善意是可逆反應，驗證過了。還你！"
L["My mechanostrider would salute you, {name}, but it only knows falling over."] = "機械陸行鳥想向你敬禮，{name}，但它只會跌倒。"
L["My transporter would've sent this to Gadgetzan, {name}. Hand-delivered instead!"] = "我的傳送器會把它送去加基森，{name}。改親手送！"
L["Oh, thank you, {name}! I haven't felt this good since before the troggs."] = "謝謝，{name}！自從穴居人來了，就沒這麼開心過。"
L["I'll name my next invention after you, {name}! It's a very small cannon."] = "下個發明用你命名，{name}！是門很小的大砲。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Ironforge has been good to us gnomes, and so have you."] = "謝啦，{name}！鐵爐堡待我們地精不薄，你也是。"
L["Thanks, {name}! You're on my list of favourites. It's short. Mostly clockwork."] = "謝謝你，{name}！你上了我的最愛名單。名單很短，大多是發條裝置。"
L["Thanks, {name}! A gift with no gears in it. I didn't know they made those."] = "謝啦，{name}！沒有齒輪的禮物。原來還有這種東西！"
L["Thank you, {name}! I'd pay you back with interest, but my abacus is in pieces."] = "謝謝，{name}！本想連本帶利還你，可我的算盤散了。"
L["Paid back, {name}! In Gnomeregan, you'll get a window seat. We'll add windows."] = "還你了，{name}！等我們奪回諾姆瑞根，給你留個靠窗座。窗戶再加。"
L["Exactly what I needed, {name}, and I didn't even have to build it. Thanks!"] = "正是我需要的，{name}，還不用我自己造。謝啦！"
L["The tall folk rarely notice us gnomes, {name}. You did. Thank you!"] = "高個子很少注意到我們地精，{name}。你注意到了。謝謝！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Tinker Town will hear all about it. Loudly, over the machinery."] = "謝啦，{name}！地精區會聽我講個夠。在機器轟鳴聲裡大聲講。"
L["It worked first time, {name}! Nothing I make works first time. Marvellous!"] = "一次就成功，{name}！我做的東西從沒一次成功過。太妙了！"
L["Request received, {name}! Processing... done!"] = "收到請求，{name}！處理中……完成！"
L["One upgrade, coming right up, {name}! Stand still for calibration."] = "升級一份馬上來，{name}！別動，校準中。"
L["Of course, {name}! I built a machine for this. It's in pieces, so: by hand."] = "當然，{name}！專用機器散架中，改手動。"
L["Certainly, {name}! Stand on the X. There's no X. Stand anywhere."] = "沒問題，{name}！站到X上。沒有X。隨便站。"
L["Right away, {name}! Goggles on. Not for you, I just like them."] = "馬上，{name}！戴上護目鏡。不是為你，我就愛戴。"
L["{buff}, {name}? Simple in theory and practice. Suspicious!"] = "{buff}？{name}，理論和實作都簡單？可疑！"
L["Happy to, {name}! Keep hands, feet and eyebrows well clear."] = "樂意，{name}！手、腳和眉毛請遠離。"
L["Right away, {name}! Stand back three paces. Four. Five. There, perfect."] = "馬上，{name}！退後三步。四步。五步。好，完美！"
L["Happy to, {name}! It beats sorting springs by size. Though that's fun too."] = "樂意，{name}！比按大小排彈簧好玩。那個也好玩啦。"
L["Excellent request, {name}! No moving parts. I'll try to add some next time."] = "絕佳的請求，{name}！零活動零件。下次盡量加幾個。"
L["Standard model or deluxe, {name}? They're the same. Deluxe sounds nicer."] = "標準版還是豪華版，{name}？都一樣，豪華版比較好聽。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Fresh off the workbench, still warm, only slightly smoking."] = "來了，{name}！剛出爐，還熱著，只冒一點點煙。"
L["Approved, {name}! Stamped, signed and filed under 'obviously'."] = "核准，{name}！已蓋章、簽名，歸檔在「那還用說」。"
L["Of course, {name}! A twist of the gyromatic micro-adjustor... there!"] = "當然，{name}！轉一下陀螺微調器……好了！"
L["Gnomes never refuse a problem, {name}. Occasionally we cause them. Here!"] = "地精從不拒絕問題，{name}，偶爾還親手製造。拿去！"
L["Right away, {name}! Tested on three volunteers and one very brave squirrel."] = "馬上，{name}！已在三位志願者和一隻超勇敢的松鼠身上測試過。"
L["Happy to, {name}! Measure twice, zap once. Gnome proverb. Well, my proverb."] = "樂意，{name}！量兩次，電一次。地精諺語。好吧，我的諺語。"
L["Of course, {name}! The High Tinker says help where you can. I can, so here!"] = "當然，{name}！大技師說能幫就幫。我能，所以給你！"
L["On it, {name}! I'll need a ladder. No? Just this, then."] = "這就來，{name}！我需要梯子。不用？那就這個吧。"
L["Delighted, {name}! It's nice to fix something that doesn't fight back."] = "樂意之至，{name}！修個不會還手的東西真好。"
L["Hold still, {name}, this is perfectly safe. Probably!"] = "別動，{name}，這完全安全。應該吧！"
L["Science says you need this, {name}. Who am I to argue?"] = "科學說你需要這個，{name}。我哪敢反駁？"
L["A small upgrade for you, {name}. No cogs required."] = "給你個小升級，{name}。免裝齒輪！"
L["Take it, {name}, I've a spare. I've three spares of everything."] = "拿去，{name}，我有備用的，什麼都備了三份。"
L["Try this, {name}! Version one had legs. Version two is much better."] = "試試這個，{name}！第一版長了腿，第二版好多了。"
L["The High Tinker says share our genius, {name}. Here's a sample!"] = "大技師說要分享天才，{name}。來，試用品！"
L["Gnomeregan Forever, {name}! This lasts rather less, but it's free."] = "諾姆瑞根萬歲，{name}！這個不到萬歲，但免費！"
L["I'm small, {name}, but my gifts come full-sized. Here!"] = "我個子小，{name}，送的禮可是全尺寸。拿去！"
L["Don't worry, {name}! It worked on the chicken, and the chicken's thrilled."] = "別擔心，{name}！雞試過了，雞超開心的。"
L["Field notes say it works on everyone, {name}. Let's make it unanimous!"] = "田野筆記說對誰都有效，{name}。來個全票通過！"
L["One size fits all, {name}, gnome to tauren. I measured. The tauren was patient."] = "地精到牛頭人都合身，{name}。我量過，牛頭人超有耐心。"
L["Take this, {name}! Unlike my Net-o-Matic, it never lands on me."] = "拿著，{name}！不像我的撒網機，這個不會罩到我自己。"
L["The Gnomish Army Knife does twelve things badly, {name}. This does one well."] = "地精軍刀十二種功能樣樣不精，{name}。這個只精一樣。"
L["Guarantee void if exposed to troggs, dragonfire or enthusiasm, {name}. Enjoy!"] = "遇到穴居人、龍焰或熱情即不保固，{name}。使用愉快！"
L["Nothing up my sleeves, {name}! Well, a spanner and two fuses. Nothing sinister."] = "袖裡沒藏東西，{name}！只有扳手和兩條引信。不可疑。"
L["Here, {name}! It's small, but so is a keystone, and look what those hold up."] = "給你，{name}！是很小，但拱心石也小，照樣撐起整座拱門。"
L["I'd explain how it works, {name}, but that takes three days and a chalkboard."] = "原理我很想解釋，{name}，但得花三天加一塊黑板。"
L["That hum's my gift settling, {name}. If you hear ticking, it's my pocket watch."] = "那嗡嗡聲是我的禮物在生效，{name}。要是聽見滴答聲，那是我的懷錶。"
L["A dash of arcane, a pinch of science, {name}, and no troggs involved. Here!"] = "一點奧術，一撮科學，{name}，全程沒有穴居人。給你！"
L["Ironforge took us gnomes in when we needed it, {name}. I'm passing it along."] = "我們地精落難時，鐵爐堡收留了我們，{name}。我把這份情傳下去。"
L["Here, {name}! It doesn't whistle, spin or catch fire. I'm working on all three."] = "給你，{name}！它不會吹哨、不會轉、也不會著火。三樣我都在改。"
L["Here, {name}! Unwrapped, sorry. The wrapping machine wrapped itself again."] = "給你，{name}！沒包裝，抱歉。包裝機又把自己包起來了。"
L["My mechanostrider wanted to give you something, {name}. It lacks the hands."] = "我的機械陸行鳥也想送你東西，{name}。可惜它沒有手。"
L["Off on an adventure, {name}? Take this, and bring me back anything that ticks."] = "要去冒險，{name}？拿著，看到會滴答響的都帶回來給我。"
L["Reliable as the Deeprun Tram, {name}. That's a compliment, I promise. Here!"] = "跟礦道地鐵一樣可靠，{name}。我保證這是稱讚。給你！"
L["For you, {name}! One part magic to two parts confidence. Mostly confidence."] = "給你，{name}！一份魔法配兩份自信。主要是自信。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Here, eye to eye. Always nice to give at eye level."] = "為了諾姆瑞根，{name}！來，平視著給。能平視著送禮真好。"
L["Fellow gnome, {name}! A boost for you. I'll hold the schematic, you the bucket."] = "地精老鄉，{name}！給你加把勁。圖紙我拿，水桶你拿。"
L["Flesh or cogs, {name}, we're all gnomes. Some need oiling. This is oil."] = "血肉也好齒輪也罷，{name}，咱都是地精，有的得上點油。這就是油。"
L["Gnome to gnome, {name}: here's a boost. You did turn the reactor off, yes?"] = "地精對地精，{name}：給你加把勁。反應爐你關了吧？"
L["Two gnomes, {name}! With this boost and you on my shoulders, we're a night elf."] = "兩個地精，{name}！加上這股勁，你再騎我肩上，咱倆差不多就是個夜精靈了。"
L["I checked my sums on this, {name}. You check yours; we're both offended."] = "這個我把帳算過了，{name}。你也算算，然後咱倆一起不服氣。"
L["That one's free, {name}. You still owe me a sprocket. Every gnome does."] = "這個免費，{name}。你還欠我個鏈輪。每個地精都欠我一個鏈輪。"
L["Here, {name}. One day we'll walk back into Gnomeregan together, lights on."] = "拿著，{name}。總有一天咱們一起走回諾姆瑞根，燈火通明。"
L["Between gnomes, {name}: this one won't explode. I checked. Twice. Mostly."] = "地精之間說句實話，{name}：這個不會炸。我檢查過。兩遍。差不多吧。"
L["A start, {name}. Shall we build something huge, to see the tall folk's faces?"] = "先給你這個，{name}。咱們造個巨無霸，看看大個子們的表情？"
L["Party-wide calibration complete, {name}! Nobody touch anything shiny."] = "全隊校準完成，{name}！誰都別碰亮晶晶的東西。"
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with this on you, we win. I rounded up."] = "我算過了，{name}：你身上有了這個，咱們贏。我四捨五入了。"
L["There, {name}. If I shout 'duck', don't look for a duck. Last time went badly."] = "好了，{name}。我要是喊「趴下」，別低頭找東西。上回就這麼砸了。"
L["There, {name}. Formation: tall folk at the front, me somewhere safe and clever."] = "好了，{name}。陣型：大個子在前，我躲在安全又聰明的地方。"
L["Everyone gets one, {name}! Standardised parts are the secret of a good machine."] = "人人有份，{name}！標準化零件是好機器的祕訣。"
L["My plan, {name}: step one, give you this. Step two is still in development."] = "我的計畫，{name}：第一步，把這個給你。第二步還在研發中。"
L["Don't panic, {name}. That's my gadget for any mishap. Version two next week."] = "別慌，{name}。這就是我應對各種意外的小玩意兒。二代下週出。"
L["Here, {name}. If I vanish, check under the nearest boot. Politely, please."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我不見了，去最近的靴子底下找找。客氣點。"
L["Yours, {name}. When this is over, I want samples. Of everything. Big one first."] = "這是你的，{name}。完事後我要樣本。每樣都要。先要大傢伙的。"
L["On purpose, {name}. Like every explosion today. I'll decide which ones later."] = "這股勁是故意給的，{name}。今天每次爆炸也都是故意的。哪些是，回頭再定。"
L["Clipboard ready, {name}! First entry: gave you this. Then everyone's heroics."] = "記錄板就緒，{name}！第一條：給了你這個。接著記大家的英勇事蹟。"
L["There, {name}. If we get separated, follow the smoke. It'll be me."] = "好了，{name}。要是走散了，跟著煙走。那就是我。"
L["Here, {name}. Everyone keep their fingers. I've counted. I'll recount after."] = "拿著，{name}。大家都保住手指頭。我數過了。完事再數一遍。"
L["Ready, {name}? Spare gears, spare fuses, and now a spare boost for you."] = "準備好了嗎，{name}？備用齒輪、備用保險絲，現在再給你備一股勁。"
L["Take this, {name}, and leave the traps to me. I built most of them. Not these."] = "拿著，{name}，陷阱交給我。大部分是我造的。這幾個不是。"
L["Here, {name}, before we go in. Anyone seen my wrench? It's mildly important."] = "進去前先拿著，{name}。有人看見我的扳手嗎？有那麼一點重要。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! And for you, here. And for everywhere else, too."] = "為了諾姆瑞根，{name}！也為了你，拿著。順便為了別的所有地方。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I'm carried off, retrieve my notes first. Then me."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我被叼走了，先把我的筆記搶回來。再救我。"
L["An experiment, {name}. Hypothesis: with this on you, we win. Let's test it."] = "這是個實驗，{name}。假設：你身上有了這個，咱們就贏。試試看。"
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed an engine; you needed this."] = "早安，{name}！三點就起了。烤麵包機要換引擎，你要這個。"
L["Good morning, {name}! The coffee brews itself now, so I had time for this."] = "早安，{name}！咖啡現在自己會煮了，所以我有空弄這個。"
L["Early start, {name}! Best ideas come before breakfast. This was one of them."] = "起得早，{name}！好點子都在早飯前冒出來。這就是其中一個。"
L["Morning, {name}! Tinker Town's been clanking since dawn, and so have I. Here!"] = "早，{name}！地精區天一亮就叮噹響，我也是。給你！"
L["Up early, {name}? I dreamt of a better sprocket and couldn't wait. Here!"] = "這麼早，{name}？我夢到更好的齒輪，等不及了。給你！"
L["Morning, {name}! The sun's a bit dim today, so I made you a brighter one."] = "早，{name}！今天太陽有點暗，我給你造了個更亮的。"
L["By my calculations, {name}, you are ninety percent wonderful."] = "根據我的計算，{name}，你有百分之九十棒。"
L["Who needs a mechanostrider with you around, {name}? Not me!"] = "有你在，誰還要機械陸行鳥啊，{name}？我不要！"
L["Remind me to build you a little hat, {name}. A sensible hat."] = "提醒我給你做頂小帽子，{name}。要正經的那種。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Efficiency rating: off the charts!"] = "漂亮，{name}！效率評分：爆表！"
L["Marvellous, {name}! I couldn't have engineered a better bite."] = "太妙了，{name}！我都設計不出更好的一口。"
L["Ha! Textbook, {name}. I'm writing that one down for Mekkatorque."] = "哈！教科書級別，{name}。我得記下來給大機械師看。"
L["Easy, {name}. Diagnostics say you need rest. Lots of rest."] = "別急，{name}。診斷結果：需要休息。大量休息。"
L["There, there, {name}. Nothing a little patching won't fix."] = "好啦好啦，{name}。補一補就沒事了。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Bandages first, inventions later."] = "別動，{name}。先包紮，再搞發明。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}. I'm simply its fastest courier."] = "聖光會回報善意，{name}。我只是它最快的信差。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}. Your gift is returned."] = "Archenon poros，{name}。回贈你的禮物。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd offer a lift in the Exodar, but you've seen how it lands."] = "謝了，{name}。艾克索達不載你了，它是用摔的。"
L["A gift freely given, {name}. The naaru hum a little louder. Returned."] = "無私相贈，{name}，那魯都嗡得更響了。回贈你。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. On Argus we'd have carved that in crystal. Here."] = "好心人，{name}。在阿古斯，這得刻進水晶。給你。"
L["Across a dozen worlds, {name}, kindness is the one tongue I never had to learn."] = "走過十幾個世界，{name}，只有善意這語言不用學。"
L["What a kindness, {name}. It almost makes up for the Legion. Almost."] = "多好心，{name}。差點就抵銷燃燒軍團了。差點。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd say it in Draenei, but that takes eleven minutes."] = "謝謝，{name}。用德萊尼語說的話，要講十一分鐘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My people call that a debt of honour. Here."] = "謝謝，{name}。我族稱之為榮譽之債。給你。"
L["Sargeras once offered my people gifts, {name}. We ran. Yours, I'll keep."] = "薩格拉斯也送過我族禮物，{name}。我們跑了。你的我收下。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've fled demons across the stars, but never from a debt."] = "謝謝，{name}。我在星海間逃離惡魔，卻從不逃債。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll add you to my prayers. The list goes back to Argus."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會為你祈禱。這份名單從阿古斯排到現在。"
L["The Legion took a world from us, {name}. Folk like you keep giving bits back."] = "軍團奪走一個世界，{name}，好心人正一點一點還給我們。"
L["You gave first, {name}. A prophet would call it an omen. I call it manners."] = "你先給了，{name}。先知會說是預兆，我說是禮貌。"
L["With the Light's compliments, {name}. It asked me to add 'nicely done'."] = "聖光向你致意，{name}。它要我補一句「做得好」。"
L["Of course, {name}. The naaru guide your steps; this puts a spring in them."] = "當然，{name}。那魯指引腳步，這個讓你步步生風。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The Light answers those who ask."] = "很樂意，{name}。聖光必回應祈求者。"
L["Velen foresaw you asking, {name}. I foresaw saying yes."] = "維倫預見了你會問，{name}。我預見我會答應。"
L["The Light is not rationed, {name}. Take as much as you like."] = "聖光不限量供應，{name}。要多少拿多少。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've outrun the Burning Legion; I can manage this."] = "當然，{name}。燃燒軍團我都跑贏了，這算什麼。"
L["At once, {name}. Hooves planted, crystals humming, here it comes."] = "馬上，{name}。蹄子站穩，水晶嗡鳴，來了！"
L["Gladly, {name}. I followed a talking crystal across the stars. This is easy."] = "{name}，我跟過會說話的水晶橫越星海，這很簡單。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Velen taught us patience. Luckily, this takes none."] = "當然，{name}。維倫教我們耐心。幸好這個不用。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The naaru never say no. They say 'hmmm', but it means yes."] = "樂意，{name}。那魯從不說不，只會「嗡……」，那就是好。"
L["On the Exodar this took three crystals and a prayer, {name}. Here: the prayer."] = "在艾克索達，這要三顆水晶加一段禱告，{name}。這是禱告。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only refuse demons, and they so rarely say please."] = "當然，{name}。我只拒絕惡魔，而它們很少說「請」。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We were refugees long enough to know what asking costs."] = "樂意，{name}。當了太久難民，知道開口有多難。"
L["Of course, {name}. My people crossed the stars looking for friends. Found one."] = "當然，{name}。我族橫越星海來找朋友。找到一個了。"
L["Ask a draenei, {name}: one yes, one blessing, possibly a history lesson."] = "問德萊尼吧，{name}：一聲好、一份祝福，可能附贈歷史課。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace, or at least go prepared."] = "聖光與你同在，{name}。平安去吧，至少有備而去。"
L["Walk in the Light, {name}. May it shelter you always."] = "行於聖光中，{name}。願它時時護你。"
L["Take this, {name}. My people always travel Light."] = "{name}，我族出門向來光帶聖光。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Legion is always coming. I'd know."] = "拿著，{name}。燃燒軍團總會來的，我最清楚。"
L["I'm out of miracles today, {name}. Will {buff} do?"] = "今天奇蹟用完了，{name}。{buff}將就一下？"
L["For the road, {name}. Mine has been twenty-five thousand years long."] = "路上用，{name}。我這條路走了兩萬五千年。"
L["Blessed by a naaru, {name}. Well, I stood near one. It still counts."] = "那魯開過光的，{name}。其實只是站它旁邊。也算！"
L["Take this, {name}. It glows a bit. Everything we own does."] = "拿著，{name}。它會發點光，我們的東西都會。"
L["Here, {name}. We draenei pack for the end of the world. We've had the practice."] = "給你，{name}。德萊尼行李都照末日標準打包，練過了。"
L["Take this, {name}. The crystals only hum like that for friends."] = "拿著，{name}。水晶只為朋友這樣嗡鳴。"
L["The naaru shine on all, {name}. Here is your share."] = "那魯普照眾生，{name}。這是你的那份。"
L["A stranger shared bread with me on Azuremyst, {name}. I'm still paying it back."] = "在藍謎島受過一飯之恩，{name}，我到今天還在報。"
L["Velen sees a thousand futures, {name}. I see one: you, better prepared. Here."] = "維倫預見千種未來，{name}。我只見一種：萬全準備的你。"
L["Don't drink from the streams on Bloodmyst, {name}. Do take this."] = "別喝血謎島的溪水，{name}。這個倒是可以拿。"
L["Eredar magic from before the fall, {name}. We only kept the good kind. Here."] = "阿古斯墮落前的魔法，{name}。我們只帶走好的那種。給你。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}! The children of Argus look after one another."] = "Archenon poros，{name}！阿古斯的子民彼此照應。"
L["Home is where two draenei meet, {name}. Today it's here; this is my welcome."] = "兩個德萊尼相聚之處便是家，{name}。今天就在這兒；這是我的歡迎。"
L["We crossed the stars together, {name}. Sharing the Light still means something."] = "我們一同穿越群星，{name}。分享聖光依然意義非凡。"
L["Tails up, {name}; take this. Argus would be proud of what we made of exile."] = "尾巴翹起來，{name}，拿著這個。阿古斯會為我們在流亡中的作為而驕傲。"
L["Two draenei, {name}: fifty thousand years of worry. This should ease yours."] = "兩個德萊尼，{name}：五萬年的憂慮。這個能讓你少操點心。"
L["Horns, hooves, hope, {name}, and this. The Legion found no cure for any of it."] = "角、蹄、希望，{name}，再加上這個。燃燒軍團對哪樣都束手無策。"
L["Children of Velen, {name}: exiled, hopeful and dreadfully polite. Hence this."] = "維倫的子民，{name}：流亡、懷抱希望、還客氣得要命。所以給你這個。"
L["Third world's the charm, {name}. Take this; we're owed one that stays put."] = "第三個世界該轉運了，{name}。拿著；我們早該有個安穩的家園。"
L["There, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "好了，{name}。我曾失去過一個世界；這支隊伍我會牢牢守住。"
L["Millennia on the run, {name}. Sharing the Light with friends is nicer."] = "逃亡了幾千年，{name}。和朋友分享聖光要好得多。"
L["The naaru would call sharing Light a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "那魯會把分享聖光稱作情誼，{name}。我管它叫好運。"
L["I've watched worlds end, {name}. With this on you, nothing ahead worries me."] = "我見過世界終結，{name}。你身上有了這個，前路再險我也不擔心。"
L["Stay together, {name}. The Light finds us easier that way; I just proved it."] = "待在一起，{name}。這樣聖光更容易找到我們；我剛證明了。"
L["Take this; stay close, {name}. We draenei are very good at leaving in a hurry."] = "拿著，待近點，{name}。我們德萊尼最擅長匆忙撤離。"
L["Draenei take the long view, {name}. This fight's a footnote. This gift isn't."] = "德萊尼看得長遠，{name}。這場仗只是個註腳。這份禮物可不是。"
L["Here, {name}. Now I go first; anything watching sees a very tall optimist."] = "拿著，{name}。現在我打頭；誰在看，都會看到一個個子很高的樂天派。"
L["We draenei follow prophets, {name}. Today I'll follow you, blessed as you are."] = "德萊尼追隨先知，{name}。今天我就追隨你，你已受了祝福。"
L["The Exodar carried thousands, {name}. I'd rather carry this little party. Here."] = "艾克索達載過成千上萬的人，{name}。我更願意扶持這支小隊。給你。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, blessed, {name}. Mine's higher, but the principle holds."] = "並肩而立，帶著祝福，{name}。我的肩高些，道理一樣。"
L["A short prayer for the party, {name}. The long one would take an age."] = "為隊伍念段短禱文，{name}。長版要念一個紀元。"
L["The Naaru smile on us, {name}. Rest a moment with me."] = "那魯在對我們微笑，{name}。陪我歇一會兒。"
L["You are a good friend, {name}. Argus never gave me better."] = "你是個好朋友，{name}。阿古斯從沒給過我更好的。"
L["Walk with me, {name}. The road is kinder with two."] = "陪我走吧，{name}。兩個人的路更溫柔。"
L["Light be praised, {name}! You fought with a true heart."] = "讚美聖光，{name}！你戰鬥時心懷真誠。"
L["Well done, {name}. Velen himself would bless you for that."] = "幹得好，{name}。維倫本人都會為此祝福你。"
L["Magnificent, {name}. The crystals of the Exodar shine for you."] = "了不起，{name}。艾克索達的水晶為你閃耀。"
L["Be at peace, {name}. The Light is with you, and so am I."] = "安心吧，{name}。聖光與你同在，我也是。"
L["Hush, {name}. Rest now. I will not leave your side."] = "噓，{name}。歇吧。我不會離開你身邊。"
L["Breathe, {name}. We have outlasted worse than this together."] = "呼吸，{name}。比這更糟的我們都一起熬過來了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness, and nor does my nose."] = "多謝，{name}。吉爾尼斯不忘恩，我的鼻子也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have my gratitude, and my best howl."] = "謝謝，{name}。獻上謝意和我最拿手的狼嚎！"
L["Thank you, {name}. If worgen had tails, mine would be wagging."] = "謝謝，{name}。狼人若有尾巴，我早搖起來了。"
L["You've made a friend for life, {name}. Loyalty is rather our thing."] = "從此是終生好友，{name}。忠誠可是我們的專長。"
L["The beast in me wants to growl, {name}. The Gilnean in me insists on thanks."] = "野獸的我想低吼，{name}，吉爾尼斯的我堅持道謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer a hand, but mine have claws now."] = "謝謝，{name}。想跟你握手，但我的手現在有爪子。"
L["We walled ourselves off for years, {name}. You make that look silly."] = "有你這樣的鄰居，{name}，葛雷邁恩之牆算白蓋了。"
L["Obliged, {name}. You've earned a spot by the fire. The good spot."] = "謝了，{name}。爐火邊給你留個位，最好的那個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Gilneas had a word for folk like you: neighbour."] = "謝謝，{name}。吉爾尼斯管你這種人叫：鄰居。"
L["Returned, {name}, with a stiff upper lip. The lower one shows teeth; ignore it."] = "回禮，{name}。上唇很紳士，下唇在露牙，別理它。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd tip my hat, but it doesn't fit over the ears these days."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想脫帽致意，但帽子已經塞不下耳朵了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk just scratch my ears and hope for the best."] = "謝謝，{name}。多數人只會搔搔我的耳朵，然後祈禱沒事。"
L["Returned, {name}. A Gilnean pays debts; a worgen pays them at a sprint."] = "回禮，{name}。吉爾尼斯人有債必還，狼人還得飛快。"
L["My mother would have had you round for tea, {name}. Thank you."] = "我母親一定會請你來喝茶，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still, I don't bite. Much."] = "當然，{name}。別動，我不怎麼咬人。"
L["Right you are, {name}. Stand steady now."] = "好的，{name}，站穩了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stay, now. I've always wanted to say that."] = "馬上，{name}。坐好，別動！這句我老早想說了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Rain or shine, and in Gilneas it's rain."] = "樂意，{name}。風雨無阻，吉爾尼斯只有雨。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Mind the claws."] = "當然，{name}。小心爪子。"
L["Say no more, {name}. These ears heard you before you'd decided to ask."] = "不必說，{name}。你還沒決定要問，我就聽見了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You asked nicer than the last fellow who threw me a stick."] = "當然，{name}。你比上次丟樹枝給我的傢伙客氣。"
L["Glad to, {name}. Few people ask a seven-foot wolf for favours. I love it."] = "樂意，{name}。很少人找兩米高的狼幫忙，我好喜歡。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll stay in this form. The other one causes a scene."] = "當然，{name}。我就維持這個形態，另一個會引起騷動。"
L["Straight to business without tea, {name}? How un-Gilnean."] = "不喝茶就直接辦正事，{name}？真不吉爾尼斯。"
L["Of course, {name}. In Gilneas, nobody had to ask twice."] = "當然，{name}。在吉爾尼斯，沒人需要問第二次。"
L["Of course, {name}. It would be rude to keep you waiting."] = "當然，{name}。讓你久等太失禮了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Anything but a bath."] = "當然，{name}。洗澡以外都行。"
L["Stay off the moors after dark, {name}. Take this."] = "天黑後別去荒野，{name}。拿著這個。"
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}, and this too. Something is always hunting."] = "保持警覺，{name}，也帶上這個。總有東西在狩獵。"
L["I'd have brought this sooner, {name}, but I stopped to chase something."] = "本該早點送來，{name}，半路去追了個東西。"
L["For you, {name}. No, I don't want a treat. Well. Perhaps a small one."] = "給你，{name}。不用給我零食。嗯……一小塊就好。"
L["Gilneans always offer, {name}. The claws are just part of the outfit."] = "吉爾尼斯人很熱心的，{name}。爪子只是配件。"
L["An old Gilnean remedy, {name}. Good for colds, gloom and most curses. Not mine."] = "吉爾尼斯偏方，{name}，百咒皆治。我的除外。"
L["Run with this, {name}. Trust me, I know about running."] = "帶著跑吧，{name}。信我，跑步我最在行。"
L["Brought you this, {name}. Don't make a fuss over it."] = "幫你帶來的，{name}。別大驚小怪。"
L["Here, {name}. Gilnean roads were never safe alone, and nor are these."] = "給你，{name}。吉爾尼斯的路從不適合獨行，這裡也一樣。"
L["For you, {name}. Not everything that prowls was as well raised as I was."] = "給你，{name}。夜裡潛行的東西，可不是都像我這麼有教養。"
L["From a Gilnean of good family, {name}. The fur is new; the manners are old."] = "來自吉爾尼斯名門，{name}。毛是新長的，教養是祖傳的。"
L["Someone did this for me in Duskhaven once, {name}. I never forgot."] = "以前在吉爾尼斯，有人這樣幫過我，{name}。我從沒忘記。"
L["Liam would have cried 'For Gilneas!', {name}. I'll just say: for you."] = "王子會高喊「為了吉爾尼斯！」，{name}。我只說：為了你。"
L["Tal'doren's druids taught me to leash the beast, {name}. It lets me do this."] = "德魯伊教我拴住心中的野獸，{name}。我才能做這個。"
L["Take this, {name}, and be careful out there. Advice from someone bitten once."] = "拿著，{name}，在外面小心點。這是被咬過一回的人給的忠告。"
L["Here, {name}. In Gilneas we'd have sent it with a jar of preserves."] = "給你，{name}。在吉爾尼斯，還會附上一罐果醬。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd offer my coat, but it's attached."] = "拿著，{name}。本想把外套借你，可惜它長在我身上。"
L["Here, {name}. Chin up, hackles down. Words to live by."] = "給你，{name}。下巴抬高，頸毛放平。人生格言。"
L["The curse binds us, {name}; Gilneas binds us tighter. Here, from one of yours."] = "詛咒把我們綁在一起，{name}；吉爾尼斯綁得更緊。拿著，自家人給的。"
L["No need to explain the ears to you, {name}, nor to thank me for this."] = "耳朵的事不用跟你解釋，{name}，這個也不用謝我。"
L["Fur, fog, rain, {name}. Only a Gilnean knows all three. This helps with them."] = "皮毛、霧、雨，{name}。三樣全懂的只有吉爾尼斯人。這個能幫上忙。"
L["Pack looks after pack, {name}. Always has."] = "狼群照顧狼群，{name}。向來如此。"
L["Shed this badly too, {name}? Take this; I'll knit a third worgen with the rest."] = "你也掉毛這麼兇嗎，{name}？拿著；剩下的毛夠我織個狼人了。"
L["Two worgen, {name}, one blessing. Somewhere, a cat's having a very bad day."] = "兩個狼人，{name}，一份祝福。某處有隻貓要倒大楣了。"
L["Here, {name}. Works in either form; I forget which one I left home in."] = "拿著，{name}。兩種形態都管用；我老忘了自己是以哪種出門的。"
L["Gilnean to Gilnean, {name}: the best-mannered wolves in Azeroth share. Here."] = "吉爾尼斯人對吉爾尼斯人，{name}：艾澤拉斯最有禮數的狼懂得分享。拿著。"
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, everyone gets one, no talk of fleas."] = "狼群規矩，{name}：誰也別走散，人人有份，不許提跳蚤。"
L["A pack again, {name}, someone to look after. I hadn't known how I'd missed it."] = "又有狼群了，{name}，有人可照顧了。我竟不知自己有多想念這個。"
L["Take this, {name}. I smell trouble first; it's the curse's one perk."] = "拿著，{name}。麻煩我總是先聞到；這是詛咒唯一的好處。"
L["There, {name}. If I howl, it's a battle cry. Howl back if you like."] = "好了，{name}。我要是嚎，那是戰吼。想的話你也嚎回來。"
L["That'll keep you up, {name}. Lead on. I'll trot. Undignified, but quick."] = "這能讓你撐住，{name}。你帶路。我小跑跟著。不體面，但快。"
L["Here, {name}. If I stare at a wall, something's behind it. Or it's a wall."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是盯著牆看，那後頭有東西。要麼就只是牆。"
L["Years on the Greymane Wall, {name}. A line held with you, blessed? A holiday."] = "在葛雷邁恩之牆守了好幾年，{name}。和受了祝福的你一起守線？那是度假。"
L["Take this for the mauling, {name}. After, a proper cup of tea."] = "拿著，撕咬時用得上，{name}。完事後來杯好茶。"
L["Here, {name}, so you mend as quickly as I do. Worgen mend quickly."] = "拿著，{name}，讓你跟我一樣好得快。狼人恢復得快。"
L["That sees you to the rest, {name}. I'll take first watch; I hear everything."] = "這能撐你到歇腳，{name}。頭班崗我來，我什麼都聽得見。"
L["Take this, {name}, and stay together. Being a lone wolf is overrated."] = "拿著，{name}，大家待在一起。當孤狼被高估了。"
L["Night again, {name}: my best and my worst. Giving you this is the best part."] = "又入夜了，{name}：我最好也最糟的時候。把這個給你是最好的部分。"
L["Look at that moon, {name}. Gilneas taught us not to trust it. Trust this."] = "看那月亮，{name}。吉爾尼斯教會我們別信它。信這個吧。"
L["Gilneas at night was fog and footsteps, {name}. Now the footsteps bring this."] = "夜裡的吉爾尼斯只有霧和腳步聲，{name}。如今腳步聲給你帶來這個。"
L["Curfew in Gilneas was sundown, {name}. Take this; there's a reason it was."] = "吉爾尼斯的宵禁從日落開始，{name}。拿著；那是有原因的。"
L["Something's rustling out there, {name}. Take this; stay close. I'll look."] = "外頭有東西窸窸窣窣，{name}。拿著，待近點。我去看看。"
L["Past dark, {name}: ears up, nose working, manners on. Manners means this."] = "天黑了，{name}：耳朵豎起，鼻子開工，禮數到位。禮數就是這個。"
L["Morning, {name}. The rug by the fire was warm, but I got up to give you this."] = "早，{name}。爐邊的毯子暖和得很，可我還是起來把這個給你。"
L["Smells like rain this morning, {name}. Here's something to keep you dry inside."] = "今早聞著要下雨，{name}。給你點東西，讓你裡頭乾爽。"
L["Up already, {name}? I've prowled since first light, waiting to give you this."] = "已經起了，{name}？我天一亮就在轉悠，等著把這個給你。"
L["Morning, {name}. Tea, toast, a shave, and this. The shave takes longer now."] = "早，{name}。茶、吐司、刮鬍子，再加這個。現在刮鬍子費時多了。"
L["Morning, {name}. The birds woke me, so I woke the birds. You just get this."] = "早，{name}。鳥把我吵醒了，我就把鳥也吵醒了。你嘛，只給這個。"
L["Morning, {name}. The fog's lifting, as it never did in Gilneas. Take this."] = "早，{name}。霧散了，在吉爾尼斯可從沒散過。帶上這個。"
L["We both know the wild, {name}. Stay close to me."] = "我們都懂得荒野，{name}。待在我身邊。"
L["Gilneas lost much, {name}. It never gave me a better friend."] = "吉爾尼斯失去了很多，{name}。但它從沒給過我更好的朋友。"
L["Steady, {name}. You and I don't need a wall to feel at home."] = "穩住，{name}。你我不需要城牆也能找到家。"
L["Ha! Well hunted, {name}! That's the Gilnean spirit."] = "哈！獵得好，{name}！這就是吉爾尼斯精神。"
L["That's it, {name}. Not one step back. Gilneas would be proud."] = "就是這樣，{name}。一步不退。吉爾尼斯會驕傲的。"
L["Brilliant, {name}. The Greymane Wall never held so well."] = "漂亮，{name}。葛雷邁恩之牆都沒守得這麼好。"
L["Easy, {name}. The beast in me knows hurt. Rest now."] = "別急，{name}。我體內的野獸懂得痛。歇吧。"
L["Shh, {name}. I'm here. Let the fog roll by while you rest."] = "噓，{name}。我在。你歇著，讓霧慢慢散去。"
L["Stay down, {name}. I'll stand watch until you're ready."] = "躺著別動，{name}。我守著，直到你緩過來。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! Honour is repaid."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！榮譽已償。"
L["You give freely, {name}. I return the favour."] = "你夠大方，{name}。這人情我還。"
L["Orcs keep their thanks short, {name}. Thanks."] = "獸人道謝很簡短，{name}。謝了。"
L["Orcs return every blow twice, {name}. The kind ones too."] = "獸人挨一拳還兩拳，{name}。受恩也一樣。"
L["You helped me, I help you, {name}. That is the old way."] = "你幫我，我幫你，{name}。這是古老的規矩。"
L["In the old days I'd have repaid you with a boar, {name}. This keeps better."] = "以前我會拿頭野豬還你，{name}。這個比較放得久。"
L["Owing somebody itches worse than Durotar sand, {name}. There. Itch gone."] = "欠人情比杜洛塔的沙還癢，{name}。好了，不癢了。"
L["Strong stuff, {name}. I could wrestle a kodo now. So can you."] = "夠勁，{name}。我能摔倒科多獸了，你也能。"
L["Ambushed by kindness, {name}. No orc trains for that. Returned in full."] = "被善意伏擊了，{name}。獸人沒練過這招。如數奉還。"
L["Honour is a debt, {name}, and orcs pay on the spot."] = "榮譽是債，{name}，獸人當場就還。"
L["An orc remembers a kindness like a scar, {name}: fondly, and for good."] = "獸人記恩像記傷疤，{name}：帶著懷念，一輩子。"
L["I'd give you my axe, {name}, but we're not that close yet. Take this."] = "想把斧頭給你，{name}，但我們還沒那麼熟。拿這個。"
L["Thanks, {name}. My wolf growled at you. That's how he says it."] = "謝了，{name}。我的狼對你低吼，那是牠在道謝。"
L["I've had gifts from shamans and chieftains, {name}. None came so freely."] = "薩滿和酋長都送過我禮，{name}。沒一份給得這麼爽快。"
L["We once took strength from demons, {name}. Yours comes on far better terms."] = "我們曾向惡魔借力，{name}。你給的條件好太多了。"
L["The spirits saw that, {name}. They'll remember it, and so will I."] = "眾靈看見了，{name}。祂們會記住，我也會。"
L["I'll carve that on my axe handle, {name}. Next to the notches. Thank you."] = "我會刻在斧柄上，{name}，就在那排刻痕旁邊。謝了。"
L["Kindness unasked is rare as rain in Durotar, {name}. Returned."] = "不請自來的善意，比杜洛塔的雨還稀有，{name}。還你。"
L["In my clan, {name}, a gift is answered with a bigger one. Here."] = "在我的氏族，{name}，收禮要回更大的。給你。"
L["A Frostwolf never counts what a friend gives, {name}. Only what he gives back."] = "霜狼從不計較朋友給多少，{name}，只算自己還多少。"
L["The camps taught us who our friends are, {name}. You're one. Here."] = "收容所讓我們看清誰是朋友，{name}。你是其中之一。給。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Thrall says the Horde's strength is its friends. You count."] = "謝了，{name}。索爾說部落的力量在於朋友。你算一個。"
L["Good. Strong. Kind. Three things I respect, {name}. Have this."] = "好。強。善。我敬重的三樣，{name}。拿去。"
L["Grom would have roared his thanks, {name}. I'll spare your ears and send this."] = "格羅姆會用吼的道謝，{name}。我放過你的耳朵，送這個就好。"
L["Dabu, {name}. It is done."] = "Dabu，{name}。完成。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Strength for the fight ahead."] = "站好，{name}。為戰鬥添點力量。"
L["Ask an orc for help and you get it, {name}. Ask for subtlety and you wait."] = "要獸人幫忙，{name}，行。要獸人委婉，等著吧。"
L["Help, yes. Hugging, no. Hold still, {name}."] = "幫忙行，抱抱不行。站好，{name}。"
L["You want {buff}? You have {buff}, {name}. Next."] = "要{buff}？給你{buff}，{name}。下一個。"
L["Don't flinch, {name}. My helping face looks exactly like my fighting face."] = "別縮，{name}。我幫忙的臉跟打架的臉一模一樣。"
L["Short question, short answer, {name}: yes."] = "問得短，答得也短，{name}：行。"
L["Done, {name}. I was a peon once; I never refuse honest work."] = "完成，{name}。我當過苦工，正經活從不推辭。"
L["A challenge, {name}? Ah, a request. I accept either way."] = "挑戰嗎，{name}？啊，是請求。我都接。"
L["Yes, {name}. I was sharpening my axe, but it'll keep. It always keeps."] = "行，{name}。正在磨斧頭，晚點再磨，它又不會跑。"
L["In the Valley of Honor this would cost you a duel, {name}. For you, a nod."] = "在榮譽谷，這得跟你決鬥，{name}。對你，點個頭就好。"
L["Now, {name}? Now. Orcs never learned the word 'later'."] = "現在？{name}，現在。獸人沒學過「晚點」這個詞。"
L["One {buff}, {name}. Orc style: fast, direct, a bit too hard."] = "{buff}一份，{name}。獸人風格：快、直接，有點太用力。"
L["Stand still, {name}. I aim this like a throwing axe, and I rarely miss."] = "站好，{name}。我瞄這個跟丟飛斧一樣，很少失手。"
L["Lok'tar, {name}. It means 'victory'. Today it also means 'yes'."] = "Lok'tar，{name}。意思是「勝利」，今天也是「好」。"
L["Done, {name}. If you need anything carried, hit or shouted at, ask again."] = "好了，{name}。要搬、要揍、要吼，再找我。"
L["You ask straight, {name}. I answer straight. Here."] = "你問得直，{name}，我答得也直。給。"
L["The shamans say the spirits help those who stand still, {name}. Stand still."] = "薩滿說，靈魂只幫站著不動的人，{name}。別動。"
L["A good request, {name}: clear, brave and short. Like a good battle plan."] = "好請求，{name}：清楚、果敢、簡短。就像好的作戰計畫。"
L["Done, {name}. Thrall says help freely. I say help quickly. Both right."] = "好了，{name}。索爾說幫人要大方，我說要快。都對。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle. A tavern brawl also counts."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！帶上戰場。酒館打架也算。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Take my strength and go earn your glory."] = "鮮血與雷霆，{name}！拿走我的力量，去贏得你的榮耀。"
L["Among orcs, {name}, making you stronger is how we say we like you."] = "獸人表達好感的方式，{name}：讓你變強。"
L["An orc giving gifts unasked? Tell no one, {name}. It ruins the image."] = "獸人主動送禮？別說出去，{name}。有損形象。"
L["The Warchief wants us diplomatic, {name}. This is my diplomacy."] = "大酋長要我們講外交，{name}。這就是我的外交。"
L["Take this strength, {name}, and hit something for me. Or set it on fire."] = "拿著這股力量，{name}，替我揍點什麼。或者燒了它。"
L["Don't thank me, {name}. Just win, and do it loudly."] = "別謝我，{name}。贏就對了，贏得大聲點。"
L["I'd make a speech, {name}, but it's mostly shouting. Just take it."] = "本想致詞，{name}，但大部分是吼叫。拿去就是。"
L["An orc at your back, {name}, even when I'm not there. Take this."] = "就算我不在，{name}，也有獸人在背後挺你。拿著。"
L["'Strike first,' Grom always said, {name}. So: here, before you could ask."] = "格羅姆說「先下手為強」，{name}。所以不等你開口，拿去。"
L["Take it, {name}. A grunt who walks past a comrade gets a talking-to. From me."] = "拿去，{name}。對同袍視而不見的步兵，要被我訓話。"
L["Frostwolves share the hunt, {name}. I caught nothing today, so share this."] = "霜狼氏族分享獵物，{name}。今天沒抓到，分你這個。"
L["Walk the Durotar way, {name}: head up, sun on your neck, my strength in you."] = "走杜洛塔的路子，{name}：抬頭，太陽曬後頸，身上帶著我的力量。"
L["Here, {name}. The spirits favour the generous."] = "給你，{name}。眾靈眷顧慷慨之人。"
L["Orcs give two things freely, {name}: advice and this. Skip the advice."] = "獸人免費送兩樣東西，{name}：建議和這個。建議就免了。"
L["The Barrens don't end, {name}. They just get more zhevra. Take this."] = "貧瘠之地沒有盡頭，{name}，只有越來越多斑馬。拿著。"
L["Strength for your arm, {name}. The honour, I see, you brought yourself."] = "力量給你的手臂，{name}。榮譽嘛，你自己帶來了。"
L["My wolf wanted you to have his bone, {name}. I talked him down to this."] = "我的狼想把骨頭送你，{name}。我說服牠換成這個。"
L["Any grunt in Razor Hill would do the same, {name}. Most would shout first."] = "剃刀嶺的步兵都會這麼做，{name}。多半會先吼一聲。"
L["For the fight ahead, {name}. There's always one. Orcs plan for it."] = "為了前面的戰鬥，{name}。總會有一場，獸人早有準備。"
L["We were slaves once, {name}. Now we choose whom we help. Today, it's you."] = "我們曾是奴隸，{name}。現在幫誰由我們選。今天，選你。"
L["Go with this, {name}. Let them hear you coming. Or don't. Surprise works too."] = "帶著這個去吧，{name}。讓他們聽見你來。或者別讓他們聽見。偷襲也行。"
L["A gift from Durotar, {name}. Like the land: rough, warm and short on shade."] = "杜洛塔的禮物，{name}。跟那片土地一樣：粗獷、溫熱、樹蔭少。"
L["The elements are fickle, {name}. I am not. Take this."] = "元素反覆無常，{name}。我不會。拿去。"
L["Strength, {name}. Not the kind you lift. The kind you keep."] = "力量，{name}。不是舉得起的那種，是撐得住的那種。"
L["Nobody crosses the Barrens alone if an orc can help it, {name}. Here."] = "有獸人在，就沒人得獨自穿越貧瘠之地，{name}。給。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you. Stronger now."] = "索姆-卡，{name}！氏族之血在你體內奔湧。現在更猛了。"
L["An orc, {name}! Here: somebody who shouts at my volume deserves this."] = "是獸人啊，{name}！拿著：嗓門跟我一樣大的，配得上這個。"
L["Frostwolf, Warsong, Blackrock, {name}: we argue like family, and share like it."] = "霜狼、戰歌、黑石，{name}：我們像一家人那樣吵，也像一家人那樣分享。"
L["Between orcs no words are needed, {name}. Good; I'm out of them. Take this."] = "獸人之間不需要言語，{name}。正好，我也沒詞了。拿著。"
L["Grunt or shaman, {name}, the same stubborn blood. Here's more strength for it."] = "步兵也好薩滿也罷，{name}，都是一樣倔的血。再給它添點力量。"
L["Two orcs, {name}, and nobody's shouted yet. This the shamans will call an omen."] = "兩個獸人，{name}，居然還沒人吼。這個薩滿們會說是個徵兆。"
L["Our clans probably feuded once, {name}. Everybody's did. Let this settle it."] = "咱們的氏族八成結過仇，{name}。誰家都結過。就用這個了結吧。"
L["Between orcs, {name}, 'victory or death'. This should tilt it towards victory."] = "獸人之間，{name}：「不勝則死」。這個能讓天平偏向勝利。"
L["Your tusks and mine have seen worse days, {name}. With this, today's better."] = "你我的獠牙都見過更糟的日子，{name}。有了這個，今天好多了。"
L["The plan, {name}: you take this, we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "計畫是，{name}：你拿著這個，我們揍它。有問題嗎？沒有？好計畫。"
L["A true warband, {name}: loud, angry, blessed, and on the same side for once."] = "真正的戰團，{name}：吵鬧、暴躁、受了祝福，難得全站一邊。"
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers, in axes, and in this."] = "跟緊戰團，{name}。力量在於人多、在於斧頭，也在於這個。"
L["Take this so I needn't carry you out, {name}. I would. Complaining all the way."] = "拿著，免得我把你扛出去，{name}。我會扛的。一路抱怨著扛。"
L["Fight well with this, {name}, and tonight you share our fire. And our boasting."] = "帶著這個好好打，{name}，今晚就來分享我們的篝火。還有吹牛。"
L["That's courage, {name}. Nobody runs now. Walking briskly away is allowed."] = "這是勇氣，{name}。現在誰也不許跑。快步走開倒是可以。"
L["Here, {name}. Now I go first. I have the thickest skull here, and I'm proud."] = "拿著，{name}。現在我打頭。這裡我的腦殼最硬，我很自豪。"
L["When the drums start, {name}, charge with this in you. No drums? I'll hum."] = "戰鼓一響，{name}，帶著這個衝鋒。沒鼓？我來哼。"
L["That's for your front, {name}. Watch my back; the front's what I hit."] = "這是護你前面的，{name}。你看著我後背；前面是我揍的地方。"
L["One clan today, {name}: Whoever Showed Up. Its members get one of these."] = "今天就一個氏族，{name}：來者氏族。成員每人一份。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything big through that door is mine. Bigger, ours."] = "拿著，{name}。從那門進來的大傢伙歸我。更大的歸咱們。"
L["Scars are stories, {name}. With this, let's all come out with short ones."] = "傷疤就是故事，{name}。有了這個，咱們都只帶短故事出來。"
L["Old chieftains had war councils, {name}. We have me pointing, and this."] = "老酋長們有作戰會議，{name}。我們有我指指點點，還有這個。"
L["Take this before I charge, {name}. If I charge early, it's tradition."] = "我衝鋒前先拿著，{name}。我要是衝早了，那是傳統。"
L["Form up, {name}, and take this! Shamans in the middle, fools at the front. Me."] = "列隊，{name}，拿上這個！薩滿在中間，傻子在前面。就是我。"
L["Tonight we feast, {name}. First we earn it, and this will help."] = "今晚大吃一頓，{name}。先得掙到手，這個能幫忙。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, sing about it loudly in Orgrimmar. Lie a little."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我倒了，就在奧格瑪大聲唱出來。吹一點。"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. The honour's yours; the strength I just gave you."] = "力量與榮譽，{name}。榮譽是你的；力量我剛給了你。"
L["Strong and loyal, {name}. A true companion of the Horde."] = "強壯又忠誠，{name}。部落真正的夥伴。"
L["Rest a while, {name}. Even a warrior needs a moment of peace."] = "歇一會兒，{name}。戰士也需要片刻安寧。"
L["The spirits chose well when they sent you to me, {name}."] = "先祖之靈把你送到我身邊，選得好，{name}。"
L["Lok'tar, {name}! You fought with honor!"] = "洛克塔，{name}！你戰鬥得光榮！"
L["Well fought, {name}! You'd shame half the warriors in Orgrimmar."] = "打得好，{name}！奧格瑪一半的戰士都得慚愧。"
L["Strength and honor, {name}. That kill was yours."] = "力量與榮耀，{name}。那一擊是你的。"
L["Easy, {name}. You bled for us both. Rest now."] = "別急，{name}。你為我們倆流了血。歇吧。"
L["Breathe, {name}. A true warrior rises again. Take your time."] = "呼吸，{name}。真正的戰士會再站起來。慢慢來。"
L["Stay down, {name}. I'll guard you; no blade gets past me."] = "躺著，{name}。我護著你，刀刃過不了我。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It would warm my heart, if it still beat."] = "謝了，{name}。心要是還跳得動，肯定暖和。"
L["Such warmth, for one so cold? Returned in full, {name}."] = "對冰冷的我這麼溫暖？如數奉還，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd blush, but the blood stopped reaching my face."] = "謝謝，{name}。我很想臉紅，但血早就上不來了。"
L["My undying gratitude, {name}. For once, the phrase is accurate."] = "獻上不死的謝意，{name}。這次是字面意思。"
L["Most kind, {name}. You've lifted me from 'deceased' to 'mildly deceased'."] = "好心人，{name}。我從「死透」變成「半死」了。"
L["The last gift I got was the plague, {name}. Yours is a big improvement."] = "我上次收到的禮是瘟疫，{name}。你的好多了。"
L["Sylvanas says we repay every debt, {name}. She rarely means the nice ones."] = "希瓦娜斯說有債必還，{name}。她指的通常是血債。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}. We Forsaken never carry debts. They rot."] = "立刻還你，{name}。被遺忘者從不欠債，放久會爛。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll keep this somewhere safe. My ribcage has room."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會收好，肋骨裡還有空位。"
L["Kindness returned, {name}. Even the flies around me look impressed."] = "禮尚往來，{name}。連我身邊的蒼蠅都很佩服。"
L["I'll drink to you tonight, {name}. It all leaks out, but it's the thought."] = "今晚我敬你一杯，{name}。雖然會全漏光，心意到就好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've made my list of reasons to keep going. It's short."] = "謝謝，{name}。你列入我「撐下去的理由」了。清單很短。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No contract, no fine print. Varimathras should take notes."] = "謝謝，{name}。沒契約，沒附註小字。瓦里瑪薩斯該學學。"
L["Grave dirt and gratitude, {name}: all I own. You'll prefer the gratitude."] = "墳土和謝意，{name}：我的全部家當。你會比較想要謝意。"
L["I'd have Lordaeron's bells rung for you, {name}, but they only do funerals now."] = "想為你敲響羅德隆的鐘，{name}，但它們現在只敲喪鐘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Next time I'm in Brill, I'll name a pumpkin after you."] = "謝了，{name}。回布瑞爾就給南瓜取你的名字。"
L["Most of the living wouldn't have bothered, {name}. I'll resent them, not you."] = "大多數活人才懶得理，{name}。我恨他們，不恨你。"
L["Better than anything I've pulled out of Undercity's sewers, {name}. Thanks."] = "比我從幽暗城下水道撈出來的任何東西都好，{name}。謝了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. One tip in return: never drink what an apothecary hands you."] = "謝謝，{name}。回送一句忠告：藥劑師遞的東西，千萬別喝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd shake your hand, but I'd like to keep mine attached."] = "謝了，{name}。不握手了，我想留著我的手。"
L["You've done what the apothecaries never could, {name}: made me feel something."] = "藥劑師做不到的，{name}，你做到了：讓我有感覺了。"
L["A gift for the dead, {name}? Most people bring flowers. Then they run."] = "送禮給死人啊，{name}？別人都是放下花就落跑。"
L["Gratitude, {name}. Freshly exhumed, barely used."] = "獻上謝意，{name}。剛挖出土，幾乎沒用過。"
L["That tingled, {name}. Either that was you, or something's nesting in me again."] = "麻麻的，{name}。不是你，就是又有東西在我身上築巢。"
L["Bless you too, {name}. Not literally, please; the Light stings. Thank you."] = "也祝福你，{name}。別當真，聖光會燙人。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If anything of mine drops off, keep it. A little souvenir."] = "謝謝，{name}。我身上要是掉了什麼，你留著。當個小紀念。"
L["Nicest spell cast on me since Arthas, {name}. Low bar, but you cleared it."] = "比阿薩斯那道法術好多了，{name}。門檻很低，你過關了。"
L["I'll have the apothecaries name a plague after you, {name}. A small one."] = "改天請藥劑師用你的名字命名瘟疫，{name}。小型的。"
L["I'll rest easier now, {name}. Not in peace, mind. Just easier."] = "這下我能安心多了，{name}。不是安息喔，只是安心。"
L["Please don't tell the Dark Lady I was nice to somebody, {name}."] = "拜託別跟黑暗女士說我對人好過，{name}。"
L["Here's {buff}, {name}. Fresh, unlike everything else about me."] = "{buff}給你，{name}。新鮮貨，跟我本人不一樣。"
L["Kindness, {name}? I checked it for poison out of habit. It's clean. So is this."] = "善意嗎，{name}？我習慣先驗毒，很乾淨。這個也是。"
L["You've put a spring in my step, {name}. Possibly literally. Something's loose."] = "你讓我走路有彈性了，{name}。真的有，某個零件鬆了。"
L["Death took my pulse, my looks and my sense of smell, {name}. Not my manners."] = "死亡帶走我的脈搏、長相和嗅覺，{name}。禮貌沒帶走。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Somewhere in Brill, a ghoul is jealous of me right now."] = "謝啦，{name}。布瑞爾某隻食屍鬼現在一定很羨慕我。"
L["I'd put you in my will, {name}, but it was read years ago."] = "想把你寫進遺囑，{name}，但它早在幾年前就宣讀了。"
L["That's going on my headstone, {name}. Under the bit that's already there."] = "這件事要刻進我的墓碑，{name}。刻在原本那行字底下。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Don't mind the smell. It's not personal, it's posthumous."] = "謝謝，{name}。這味道別在意，不是針對你，是死後現象。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most people only cast on me to make me lie back down."] = "謝啦，{name}。別人對我施法，通常是要我躺回去。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll have Mordo stitch that in, so it can't fall out."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會請莫爾多把它縫牢，免得掉出來。"
L["Faranell will want to know how you did that, {name}. Don't tell him. Thank you."] = "法拉尼爾會想知道你怎麼辦到的，{name}。別告訴他。謝謝。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. I'd offer you a seat, but mine came with a lid."] = "有心了，{name}。本想請你坐，可我的座位附蓋子。"
L["Steadier hands than the man who sewed my arm on, {name}. Thank you."] = "手比幫我縫手臂的那位穩多了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["First time in years I've been improved without a needle, {name}. Thanks."] = "好幾年沒有不靠針線就變好了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If I twitch, don't be alarmed. It means I'm pleased."] = "謝謝，{name}。我要是抽一下，別慌。說明我高興。"
L["Gratitude, {name}, from what remains of me. Most of it. The important parts."] = "謝意，{name}，來自我剩下的部分。大部分。重要的那些。"
L["You'd make a fine apothecary, {name}. That's the worst I'll ever say of you."] = "你會是個好藥劑師，{name}。這是我對你說過最壞的話。"
L["Tell nobody in Brill about this, {name}. I've a reputation for being dreadful."] = "別在布瑞爾聲張，{name}。我可是出了名的嚇人。"
L["Last one to look after me was a necromancer, {name}. You're much better at it."] = "上一個照顧我的是個死靈法師，{name}。你比他強多了。"
L["People rarely put anything into a Forsaken, {name}. Usually it's a sword."] = "很少有人往被遺忘者身上放東西，{name}。通常是把劍。"
L["For that, {name}, I'll stop scowling a while. No promises; the face is set."] = "為這個，{name}，我暫時不板著臉了。不保證；這張臉定型了。"
L["I'd write you a note, {name}, but my writing hand's at the stitcher's."] = "想給你寫張字條，{name}，可我寫字的手還在裁縫那裡。"
L["Deathknell gave me a shovel and a grudge, {name}. You gave me something better."] = "喪鐘鎮給了我一把鏟子和一肚子怨氣，{name}。你給的更好。"
L["A credit to the living, {name}, thanked by the dead. Not fierce competition."] = "你是活人的驕傲，{name}，死人向你道謝。競爭不算激烈就是了。"
L["Into the ledger it goes, {name}. In ink this time, not the other stuff."] = "記進帳本，{name}。這次用墨水，不用那種液體。"
L["The Dark Lady says nothing is free, {name}. She hasn't met you."] = "黑暗女士說天下沒有白吃的午餐，{name}。她沒見過你。"
L["I feel that in my bones, {name}. Mostly because they show."] = "我骨子裡都感覺到了，{name}。主要是骨頭露在外面。"
L["Mother said always repay a kindness, {name}. She's in Brill now. Under it."] = "母親說受人恩惠必當回報，{name}。她現在在布瑞爾。地底下。"
L["Shadow I shrug off, {name}. Kindness gets right through. Thank you."] = "暗影從我身上滑開，{name}。善意卻直透進來。謝謝。"
L["I can't feel much these days, {name}, so I'll take your word it was lovely."] = "如今我沒什麼感覺了，{name}，所以你說美妙，我就信。"
L["Nobody's wished me a long life in years, {name}. I've got one anyway. Thanks."] = "好幾年沒人祝我長壽了，{name}。反正我也死不了。謝謝。"
L["Cannibalize is for enemies, {name}. Friends get {buff}."] = "食屍是留給敵人的，{name}。朋友拿到的是{buff}。"
L["The will of the Forsaken shrugs off every charm, {name}. Not yours, it seems."] = "不死意志能擺脫一切魅惑，{name}。看來你的除外。"
L["My jaw's wired on, {name}, so this thank-you smile is a feat of engineering."] = "我的下巴是鐵絲綁著的，{name}，所以這道謝的笑可是工程奇蹟。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Most of my old life went with the Plague. There's room for you."] = "謝謝，{name}。我從前的日子大半隨瘟疫去了。給你留得出位置。"
L["That's put colour in my cheeks, {name}. Grey, mostly, but it's a start."] = "這讓我臉上有了血色，{name}。主要是灰色，但總算有了。"
L["I'd send you flowers, {name}, but they wilt when I pick them up."] = "想送你花，{name}，可花一到我手裡就枯了。"
L["The Scourge never once said thank you, {name}. So let me say it properly."] = "天譴軍從沒說過一聲謝謝，{name}。那就讓我好好說一次。"
L["Kindness to the dead, {name}? The priests in Brill used to charge for that."] = "善待死者，{name}？布瑞爾的牧師以前可是要收錢的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Try not to die. It's overrated."] = "當然，{name}。別死，死亡被高估了。"
L["You need only ask, {name}. The dead are patient."] = "開口就是了，{name}。死者很有耐心。"
L["Ask the dead for a favour, {name}. We rarely have other plans."] = "找死人幫忙準沒錯，{name}。我們行程很空。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear; I'd hate to drop anything on you."] = "當然，{name}。站開點，免得我掉什麼到你身上。"
L["A moment, {name}. Rigor mortis is hard on the casting hand."] = "稍等，{name}。屍僵對施法的手很不友善。"
L["Nice to be asked for something, {name}, besides the way to the graveyard."] = "難得有人問我事，{name}，不是問墓地怎麼走。"
L["Gladly, {name}. It takes my mind off the smell. Mine, I mean."] = "樂意，{name}。能讓我忘了那股味道。我身上的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim drifts when my eye does."] = "好，{name}。別動，我眼珠一飄，準頭也跟著飄。"
L["In Undercity nobody says please, {name}. Mostly they gurgle. Here you are."] = "幽暗城沒人說「請」，{name}，只會咕嚕。給你。"
L["Just {buff}, {name}? The apothecaries always want a sample too."] = "只要{buff}嗎，{name}？藥劑師通常還會順便要個樣本。"
L["I always rise when called, {name}. Unfortunate history. Here you are."] = "隨叫隨起，{name}。當年被喚醒的後遺症。給你。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Within reason, and what's left of mine."] = "什麼都行，{name}。以我僅剩的理智為限。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'd say 'over my dead body', but that's been tried."] = "當然，{name}。本想說「除非我死了」，但死過了。"
L["Right away, {name}. The dead don't dawdle. We shamble with purpose."] = "馬上，{name}。死人做事不拖拉，只拖著腳走。"
L["Of course, {name}. Free will is a gift. I spend mine on things like this."] = "當然，{name}。自由意志難得，我就花在這上面。"
L["At once, {name}. I've had far worse requests from the Apothecarium."] = "馬上，{name}。藥劑師協會提過糟得多的要求。"
L["Of course, {name}. After a winter in the Plaguelands, this counts as a holiday."] = "當然，{name}。熬過瘟疫之地的冬天，這算度假。"
L["{buff}, {name}? With the Dark Lady's compliments."] = "{buff}？{name}，黑暗女士向你致意。"
L["Of course, {name}. I don't sleep or eat, so I may as well be useful."] = "當然，{name}。我不睡也不吃，不如做點有用的事。"
L["Glad to, {name}. The Scourge used my hands for worse."] = "樂意，{name}。天譴軍拿我這雙手做過更糟的事。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The apothecaries taught me a steady hand. Mostly on rats."] = "當然，{name}。藥劑師教我手要穩。大多拿老鼠練。"
L["The Dark Lady said serve the Horde, {name}. She never said sulk about it."] = "黑暗女士說要為部落效力，{name}。可沒說要擺臭臉。"
L["Right away, {name}. In Deathknell they woke me with far ruder requests."] = "馬上，{name}。在喪鐘鎮叫醒我的請求，可沒禮貌多了。"
L["Silverpine's worgen never ask this nicely, {name}. You're a pleasant change."] = "銀松森林的狼人從不這麼客氣，{name}。你真讓人耳目一新。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've nothing on until the end of the world."] = "當然，{name}。世界末日之前我都沒安排。"
L["Done, {name}. Quicker than the bat to the Sepulcher, and you keep your lunch."] = "好了，{name}。比飛往瑟伯切爾的蝙蝠還快，而且你不會吐。"
L["You had me at please, {name}. Or at 'oi, corpse'. Either works."] = "一句「請」就打動我了，{name}。或者一句「喂，死屍」。都行。"
L["Why not, {name}? It's that or stand here decomposing."] = "為什麼不呢，{name}？要嘛幫你，要嘛站在這裡腐爛。"
L["Right away, {name}. I've stood here so long the moss had started to hope."] = "馬上，{name}。我在這裡站太久，青苔都開始抱希望了。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. Well. With what passes for it now."] = "樂意之至，{name}。嗯，用如今還算是樂意的那點東西。"
L["Here, {name}. I won't ask what it's for. The dead are discreet."] = "給，{name}。我不問用途。死人嘴緊。"
L["Ask away, {name}. Death made me patient, and Undercity made me bored."] = "儘管開口，{name}。死亡讓我有耐心，幽暗城讓我很無聊。"
L["Done, {name}. Come back when it fades. I'm not going anywhere. Ever."] = "好了，{name}。消失了再來。我哪裡也不去。永遠。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Better work than hauling ichor for Faranell."] = "當然，{name}。總比替法拉尼爾搬膿液強。"
L["Easiest thing I've done all week, {name}, and I dug myself out of a grave."] = "這是我這週做過最輕鬆的事，{name}，我可是自己從墳裡挖出來的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Eternity's long; I can spare a moment of it."] = "當然，{name}。永恆很長，分你一刻不算什麼。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Beats standing in the Ruins of Lordaeron looking haunted."] = "樂意，{name}。總比在羅德隆廢墟裡陰森森地站著強。"
L["Ask a Forsaken, get an answer, {name}. Ask an apothecary, get a waiver."] = "問被遺忘者，得到答案，{name}。問藥劑師，得到一份切結書。"
L["At your service, {name}. The Lich King never said please. You did."] = "為你效勞，{name}。巫妖王從不說請。你說了。"
L["Stay among the living a little longer, {name}."] = "在活人堆裡多待一會吧，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. The grave can wait."] = "拿著，{name}。墳墓等得起。"
L["I was a physician in Lordaeron, {name}. Old habits die harder than I did."] = "我在羅德隆當過醫生，{name}。老習慣比我還難死。"
L["No charge, {name}. The apothecaries would have made you sign something."] = "免費，{name}。換成藥劑師，會先叫你簽點東西。"
L["A gift from the grave, {name}. Don't worry, I washed it."] = "來自墳墓的禮物，{name}。放心，我洗過了。"
L["I've seen where heroes end up, {name}. I live there. Take this."] = "我見過英雄的歸宿，{name}。我就住那。拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}. I learned the hard way you can't take it with you."] = "拿著，{name}。生不帶來死不帶去，我親身證實過。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own that isn't slightly damp."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我身上唯一不潮的東西。"
L["Hold on to yourself, {name}; this helps. The pieces are hard to find later."] = "把自己看牢，{name}；這個有幫助。零件掉了事後很難找。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Plaguelands are full of people who didn't."] = "拿著，{name}。瘟疫之地到處都是沒拿的人。"
L["A small kindness, {name}. Tirisfal could use more of them."] = "一點心意，{name}。提里斯法正缺這個。"
L["Tirisfal fog gets into everything, {name}. So does this, but pleasantly."] = "提里斯法的霧無孔不入，{name}。這也是，舒服版。"
L["Here, {name}. Kept cool for you, like everything I carry."] = "給你，{name}。冰過了，我帶的東西都是冰的。"
L["I've outlived everyone I knew, {name}. I'd rather not outlive you. Take this."] = "熟人我都送走了，{name}，不想再送走你。拿著。"
L["Pardon me, {name}. I'm told I lurk. I'm trying to lurk helpfully."] = "打擾，{name}。都說我鬼鬼祟祟，就鬼祟地幫個忙。"
L["Out of my own pocket, {name}. The dead don't need much."] = "自掏腰包，{name}。死人需要的不多。"
L["I've already had the worst day there is, {name}. Let's spare you yours."] = "最糟的那天我已經過完了，{name}。你的就免了吧。"
L["Wind's off the Plaguelands, {name}. Take this, and breathe through your mouth."] = "風從瘟疫之地吹來，{name}。拿著，改用嘴巴呼吸。"
L["The crows have been watching you, {name}. Let's disappoint them."] = "烏鴉一直盯著你，{name}。讓牠們失望吧。"
L["Here, {name}. Tirisfal grows nothing but pumpkins and grudges. This is neither."] = "{name}，提里斯法只長南瓜跟怨恨。這兩樣都不是。"
L["Take this, {name}. The only thing in Undercity that needn't be boiled first."] = "拿著，{name}。幽暗城唯一不必先煮沸的東西。"
L["Eternity is long, {name}, and I've spent a fair bit of it practising this."] = "永恆很長，{name}，我花了不少時間練這個。"
L["For the road, {name}. Undercity-made, so do keep it away from open flame."] = "路上用，{name}。幽暗城製造，請遠離火源。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's odourless, which I'm told makes it my best feature."] = "拿著，{name}。無臭無味，據說是我最大的優點。"
L["Forsaken are famously patient, {name}. I just couldn't wait to give you this."] = "被遺忘者最有耐心，{name}，但這個我等不及了。"
L["No strings attached, {name}. I cut mine when the Lich King lost his grip."] = "不附條件也不附線，{name}。巫妖王鬆手時就剪了。"
L["Fresh from Tirisfal, {name}. Well, fresh for Tirisfal."] = "提里斯法新鮮直送，{name}。以提里斯法的標準啦。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Bulwark taught me to look out for the living."] = "拿著，{name}。壁壘教會我照顧活人。"
L["Passing Pyrewood, {name}? Take this. The village has a bad habit after dark."] = "路過焚木村，{name}？拿著。那村子天黑後有個壞習慣。"
L["The Scarlets would call this unholy, {name}. From me, they'd say it of bread."] = "血色十字軍會說這是邪物，{name}。我遞的，連麵包都算邪物。"
L["Don't flinch, {name}. It's a spell, not a bite."] = "別躲，{name}。這是法術，不是咬你。"
L["Here, {name}. The Royal Apothecary Society had no hand in this one. Promise."] = "給，{name}。這次皇家藥劑師協會沒插手。保證。"
L["You look tired, {name}; from me, that's a professional opinion. So: this."] = "你看著累了，{name}；我說的可是專業意見。所以，給你這個。"
L["You looked a bit peaky, {name}. Then again, I'm a poor judge of colour."] = "你氣色有點差，{name}。不過我看顏色不太準。"
L["On the house, {name}. The house is a crypt, but it's paid off."] = "免費的，{name}。我家是座墓穴，但沒欠債。"
L["Take this, {name}. Agamand Mills is full of folk who also had places to be."] = "拿著，{name}。阿加曼德磨坊裡全是也曾有事要辦的人。"
L["Bound for Tarren Mill, {name}? Take this. The Southshore lot throw things."] = "去塔倫米爾嗎，{name}？拿著。南海鎮那幫人愛丟東西。"
L["Living's a fragile hobby, {name}. Let's keep you at it."] = "活著是個脆弱的嗜好，{name}。我們讓你繼續下去。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd hate for us to end up neighbours."] = "拿著，{name}。我可不想我們當鄰居。"
L["Every life I keep is one the Lich King doesn't get, {name}."] = "我保住的每條命，巫妖王都拿不到，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's what we do instead of sleeping."] = "拿著，{name}。我們不睡覺，就做這個。"
L["Mind yourself, {name}, and take this. Not all Tirisfal's dead have my manners."] = "當心點，{name}，拿著這個。提里斯法的死人不全像我這麼有禮。"
L["Stay warm, {name}. One of us ought to, and this should help."] = "暖和著點，{name}。咱倆總得有一個暖和，這個能幫忙。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Deathguard can't watch every road."] = "拿著，{name}。亡靈衛兵守不住每條路。"
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just a passing corpse doing a good turn."] = "別在意我，{name}。路過的屍體做件好事而已。"
L["It's free, {name}. The embalming afterwards is not, so do be careful."] = "這個免費，{name}。之後的防腐可不免費，所以小心點。"
L["A Forsaken's gift, {name}: cold, a little grim, and good for you."] = "被遺忘者的禮物，{name}：冰涼，有點陰森，對你有好處。"
L["Off to the Scarlet Monastery, {name}? Take this. They'll take the rest."] = "去血色修道院嗎，{name}？拿著。剩下的他們會全拿走。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give you advice, but mine is mostly about digging."] = "拿著，{name}。想給你點建議，可我的建議大多是關於挖坑的。"
L["Don't mind the hand that gave you this, {name}. It's mine. Usually."] = "別在意給你這個的那隻手，{name}。是我的。一般是。"
L["We Forsaken must look after each other, {name}."] = "我們被遺忘者得互相照應，{name}。"
L["Between us corpses, {name}, you're well preserved. This should keep you so."] = "咱們屍體之間說，{name}，你保存得挺好。這個讓你保持下去。"
L["Lose a finger, {name}, and I've a spare. Forsaken share. Today, it's this."] = "丟了手指，{name}，我這兒有備用的。被遺忘者講究分享。今天分這個。"
L["Is your jaw clicking too, {name}? Here; it won't help that, but it'll help."] = "你的下巴也喀喀響嗎，{name}？拿著；治不了那個，但有用。"
L["A small victory for Sylvanas, {name}: one of hers, blessed. It's ours."] = "為希瓦娜斯贏下一場小勝，{name}：她的子民又得了祝福。這是咱們的。"
L["Brill or Deathknell, {name}? We all woke up somewhere. Now wake up to this."] = "布瑞爾還是喪鐘鎮，{name}？誰都在某處醒來。現在帶著這個醒吧。"
L["When the Scourge calls, {name}, we won't be home. Or easy to take. Here."] = "天譴上門時，{name}，我們不會在家。也不好抓。拿著。"
L["The Bulwark holds, {name}, and so do we: held together, and held up by this."] = "壁壘撐著，{name}，我們也是：縫縫補補，現在還有這個撐著。"
L["Lordaeron raised us twice, {name}. Let me raise your spirits a third time."] = "洛丹倫讓我們站起來過兩回，{name}。第三回讓我來提提你的精神。"
L["In Northrend, {name}, the Lich King is sulking about us. This won't help him."] = "在北裂境，{name}，巫妖王正為我們生悶氣。這個可幫不了他。"
L["The Dark Lady needs us whole, {name}. This gets you near enough."] = "黑暗女王需要我們完完整整，{name}。有了這個，你差不多就完整了。"
L["You smell of Tirisfal, {name}. From us, a compliment. So is this."] = "你身上有提里斯法的味道，{name}。在我們這兒是誇獎。這個也是。"
L["We've forever, {name}. Take this; let's not spend it waiting for the lift."] = "我們有的是永恆，{name}。拿著；別全耗在等升降梯上。"
L["Forsaken to Forsaken, {name}: take this. The sewer shortcut is not a shortcut."] = "被遺忘者對被遺忘者，{name}：拿著。下水道捷徑根本不是捷徑。"
L["If the Deathguard ask, {name}, I was issuing supplies. This one's yours."] = "要是死亡守衛問起，{name}，就說我在發補給。這份是你的。"
L["Our kind don't get many kindnesses, {name}. Let's keep them in the family."] = "我們這種人很少被善待，{name}。肥水不落外人田。"
L["Same grave dirt, same Dark Lady, {name}. That's family, and family gets this."] = "一樣的墳土，一樣的黑暗女王，{name}。這就是家人，家人有這個。"
L["Keep the faith, {name}. In each other, I mean. Here's mine, in you."] = "守住信念，{name}。我是說對彼此的信念。這是我對你的。"
L["The dead look after the dead, {name}. The living could learn a thing or two."] = "死人照顧死人，{name}。活人該好好學學。"
L["We've both seen the inside of a grave, {name}. Dreadful service. Here's better."] = "咱倆都見識過墳墓裡頭，{name}。服務太差了。這個好些。"
L["Mordo did your stitches too, {name}? This should help them hold."] = "你也是莫爾多縫的，{name}？這個能讓針腳更牢。"
L["Our time will come, {name}. We've nothing but time, so I'll spend some on you."] = "我們的時候會來的，{name}。我們有的只是時間，就花點在你身上。"
L["Recall the Lich King's voice, {name}? Mine's kinder, and it gives you this."] = "還記得巫妖王的聲音嗎，{name}？我的溫和些，還送你這個。"
L["You kept your nose, {name}. Not all of us did. Keep the rest with this."] = "你的鼻子還在，{name}。不是人人都這麼走運。剩下的就靠這個保住吧。"
L["We were all Lordaeron once, {name}. Some kept the accent. I kept the manners."] = "我們都曾是洛丹倫人，{name}。有人留了口音。我留了禮數。"
L["The living do try, {name}. Be kind to them, as I am to you. Here."] = "活人也在努力，{name}。對他們好些，就像我對你這樣。拿著。"
L["Still got both eyes, {name}? Show-off. Take this anyway."] = "兩隻眼睛都還在，{name}？顯擺。還是拿著吧。"
L["Did you call on your old family too, {name}? Mine took it badly. You get this."] = "你也去看過從前的家人嗎，{name}？我家的反應可糟了。你拿這個。"
L["Take this; stay alive, {name}. Undercity's housing list is already very long."] = "拿著，活下去，{name}。幽暗城的住房排隊名單已經很長了。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I fall down, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "這是給你的，{name}。我要是倒了，等一會兒。老習慣。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll take the front. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "拿著，{name}。我打頭陣。最壞能怎樣？再來一次？"
L["There you are, {name}. Now keep upwind of me. It's better for morale."] = "給你，{name}。現在站我上風口。對士氣好。"
L["Last party I joined, {name}, I woke in a crypt. This is me improving on that."] = "上回入隊，{name}，我是在墓穴裡醒來的。這回我改進一下。"
L["Here, {name}. Anything that bites, point it at me. Nothing left worth eating."] = "拿著，{name}。會咬人的都衝我來。我身上沒什麼能吃的了。"
L["For you; heal the others first, {name}. I run on spite and embalming fluid."] = "給你的；先治別人，{name}。我靠怨氣和防腐液運轉。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, don't worry. I've died before; it passes."] = "拿著，{name}。要是砸了，別擔心。我死過；會過去的。"
L["Fought the Scourge from both sides, {name}. This side shares its blessings."] = "我在天譴兩邊都打過，{name}。這一邊會分享祝福。"
L["Stay close, {name}; take this. I won't scream at the ghouls. Old neighbours."] = "待近點，{name}，拿著。我見了食屍鬼不會尖叫。老鄰居了。"
L["I've walked the Plaguelands at night, {name}. With this, so can you."] = "我夜裡走過瘟疫之地，{name}。有了這個，你也行。"
L["The corpse at the back blessed you, {name}. That's me. Please don't bury it."] = "後面那具屍體給你祝福了，{name}。就是我。請別埋了。"
L["Take this; stay together, {name}. Easier than putting somebody back together."] = "拿著，待在一起，{name}。總比把誰重新拼起來容易。"
L["Take this; don't wait for me, {name}. I shamble, but forever. I'll catch up."] = "拿著，別等我，{name}。我走得慢，可能走一輩子。會跟上的。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep the torches clear of me. I'm old, dry and very flammable."] = "拿著，{name}。火把離我遠點。我又老又乾，特別易燃。"
L["That keeps yours going, {name}. Don't check me for a pulse. It worries people."] = "這能讓你的心繼續跳，{name}。別摸我的脈。會嚇著人。"
L["Take this, {name}; mind the green puddles. I've seen what they do. I'm it."] = "拿著，{name}；當心綠水坑。我見過它們的本事。我就是結果。"
L["Lordaeron fell with me in it, {name}. With this on you, today won't be worse."] = "洛丹倫陷落時我就在裡頭，{name}。你身上有了這個，今天不會更糟。"
L["Take this and stick together, {name}. The apothecaries pay well for strays."] = "拿著，待在一起，{name}。藥劑師收流浪的出價很高。"
L["For you, {name}. If this ends underwater, don't mind me. Breathing's optional."] = "給你的，{name}。要是最後泡進水裡，別管我。呼吸是可選項。"
L["The Dark Lady blesses no one, {name}. I've made an exception for this party."] = "黑暗女王誰也不祝福，{name}。這支隊伍我破個例。"
L["When we win, {name}, drinks at the Gallows' End in Brill. This one's on me now."] = "贏了，{name}，去布瑞爾的旅店喝一杯。這個現在就算我請。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the flies. They're with me, though."] = "這是我給的，{name}，不是蒼蠅給的。不過牠們跟著我。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll watch the rear. Nothing sneaks up on one who can't blink."] = "拿著，{name}。後方我來看。眨不了眼的人，誰也偷襲不了。"
L["Here, {name}. If I lose an arm in there, bring it out. I'm fond of it."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是在裡頭掉了條胳膊，幫我帶出來。我捨不得它。"
L["That's yours, {name}. Leave the bodies to me afterwards. Waste not."] = "這是你的，{name}。完事後屍體交給我。別浪費。"
L["Take this and send them my way, {name}. I don't bleed. I come apart a little."] = "拿著，把牠們引到我這兒，{name}。我不流血。只會掉點零件。"
L["Here, {name}. When they cast fear, look to me. I'll be the one not running."] = "拿著，{name}。他們放恐懼時，看我。不跑的那個就是我。"
L["Take this, {name}, and mind the abominations. Distant cousins. We don't speak."] = "拿著，{name}，當心憎惡。遠房親戚。我們不來往。"
L["That's for your legs, {name}. If I walk oddly, it's fine. It's a new leg."] = "這是給你腿腳用的，{name}。我走路怪，沒事。是條新腿。"
L["Here; shout if you need more, {name}. My ears are mostly where I left them."] = "拿著；還要就喊，{name}。我的耳朵大體還在原處。"
L["Take this so we don't wipe, {name}. If we do, I know the spirit healer."] = "拿著，免得團滅，{name}。真滅了，我跟靈魂醫者是熟人。"
L["Don't fret the odds, {name}. Lordaeron's army had better ones. You have this."] = "別擔心勝算，{name}。洛丹倫的軍隊勝算更大呢。你有這個。"
L["Good party, {name}. Five of us, all blessed, and only one needs embalming."] = "好隊伍，{name}。五個人都受了祝福，只有一個需要防腐。"
L["There, {name}. Now watch my back. Some of the stitching there is very old."] = "好了，{name}。現在幫我看著後背。那兒有些針腳很老了。"
L["Here, {name}. Should I fall, no hurry raising me. I could use the lie-down."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是倒了，不急著復活我。正好躺躺。"
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have someone to give this to."] = "死人作息糟透了，{name}。難得有人可以送這個。"
L["Midnight, {name}: the best hour to be up. Have this, and stay up with me."] = "午夜，{name}：醒著的最好時辰。拿著這個，陪我熬著。"
L["The living are all asleep, {name}. We Forsaken call this the quiet shift. Here."] = "活人都睡了，{name}。我們被遺忘者管這叫清靜班。拿著。"
L["Late, {name}? In Undercity, this is lunchtime. Have some."] = "晚了，{name}？在幽暗城這會兒是午飯時間。來一點。"
L["The Scourge used to walk at this hour, {name}. Now it's ours, and so is this."] = "這個時辰過去是天譴橫行的時候，{name}。現在歸我們了，這個也是。"
L["Night, {name}. Nobody can tell I'm pale. Or that I'm kind. Take this."] = "夜裡，{name}。誰也看不出我臉色發白。也看不出我心好。拿著。"
L["Dark as the Undercity, {name}. Proper lighting. Here's a little glow for you."] = "跟幽暗城一樣黑，{name}。這才叫照明。給你一點微光。"
L["Fog, moonlight, mildew, {name}: Tirisfal weather. This keeps the damp out."] = "霧、月光、霉味，{name}：提里斯法的天氣。這個能擋潮氣。"
L["The banshees start singing now, {name}. Take this; they're only practising."] = "女妖們這時候開始唱了，{name}。拿著；她們只是在排練。"
L["Stars over Tirisfal, {name}: the one thing up there that never rotted. Here."] = "提里斯法上空的星星，{name}：天上唯一沒爛掉的東西。拿著。"
L["Past midnight, {name}. The graveyards are quiet. Take this; stay out of them."] = "過了午夜，{name}。墓地都安靜了。拿著這個，離墓地遠點。"
L["An owl saw me and left, {name}. Sensible bird. You stayed, so this is yours."] = "一隻貓頭鷹看見我就飛走了，{name}。聰明的鳥。你留下了，這個歸你。"
L["Moonlight suits us, {name}. It hides the stitching. This hides the rest."] = "月光襯我們，{name}。能遮住針腳。剩下的這個來遮。"
L["Don't stay up for me, {name}. I gave up sleep years ago. Take this and rest."] = "別為我熬夜，{name}。我多年前就不睡了。拿著這個，去歇著。"
L["Long night, {name}? Mine's been going since the Plague. This helps with yours."] = "長夜漫漫，{name}？我的從瘟疫起就沒結束過。這個能幫你熬過你的。"
L["Night in Tirisfal, {name}. Even the bats keep their voices down. Here, quietly."] = "提里斯法的夜，{name}。連蝙蝠都壓低了聲音。悄悄拿著。"
L["The banshees call this the witching hour, {name}. Here's some witchery."] = "女妖們管這叫巫魔時刻，{name}。給你施點巫術。"
L["Morning, {name}? I've been up all night, and all of last decade. Have this."] = "天亮了，{name}？我熬了一整夜。還有整整十年。拿著。"
L["The sun's up, {name}. Take this; I'll stand in the shade. Things peel."] = "太陽出來了，{name}。拿著；我站陰涼處去。會掉皮的。"
L["Early start, {name}. I miss yawning. Have this and do one for me."] = "起得早，{name}。我想念打哈欠。拿著這個，替我打一個。"
L["Sunrise, {name}. My least favourite colour. This is my favourite gift."] = "日出了，{name}。我最不喜歡的顏色。這是我最喜歡的禮物。"
L["Dawn over Tirisfal, {name}: grey, then less grey. This adds a little colour."] = "提里斯法的黎明，{name}：灰，然後沒那麼灰。這個添點顏色。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Gallows' End porridge moved again. Have this instead."] = "早，{name}。布瑞爾旅店的粥又在動了，拿這個吧。"
L["The roosters in Brill still crow, {name}. Nobody's told them. Here's a wake-up."] = "布瑞爾的公雞還在打鳴，{name}。沒人告訴牠們。給你提提神。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Deathguard just turn round to change shifts. I give this."] = "早，{name}。死亡守衛轉個身就算換班了。我呢，發這個。"
L["Morning, {name}. I don't wake up now; I stop lying down. Then I hand out this."] = "早，{name}。我現在不醒了，只是不躺了。然後發這個。"
L["Mornings were the worst of being alive, {name}. This should make yours better."] = "活著那會兒，早上最難熬，{name}。這個能讓你的早上好過點。"
L["The early bird gets the worm, {name}. The early Forsaken gets you this."] = "早起的鳥兒有蟲吃，{name}。早起的被遺忘者給你帶來這個。"
L["Breakfast, {name}? I'll pass; my appetite went with my insides. Have this."] = "早飯，{name}？我免了；胃口跟內臟一起沒了。你拿這個。"
L["Up with the sun, {name}? I'm up with everything. Take this while I am."] = "跟太陽一起起床，{name}？我跟什麼都一起醒著。趁我醒著拿著。"
L["Take this before the lift, {name}. The last man who rushed it is still falling."] = "坐升降梯前先拿著，{name}。上一個心急的還在往下掉呢。"
L["Undercity has it all, {name}: a bank, an inn, and this, free. Mind the sewers."] = "幽暗城應有盡有，{name}：銀行、旅店，還有這個，免費。當心下水道。"
L["Even the rats bow to the Dark Lady here, {name}. Take this before one asks."] = "老鼠都向黑暗女士鞠躬，{name}。趁牠開口前拿去。"
L["Take this; mind the canal, {name}. It's green for a reason, and it isn't moss."] = "拿著；當心水渠，{name}。它綠是有原因的，不是青苔。"
L["Undercity's lovely this time of year, {name}. It's always this time. Here."] = "幽暗城這個季節可美了，{name}。一年到頭都是這個季節。拿著。"
L["We moved into Lordaeron's cellar, {name}, kept the good silver, and share this."] = "我們搬進了洛丹倫的地窖，{name}，留下了好銀器，也分享這個。"
L["The Royal Quarter's that way, {name}. Take this; the banshees keep score."] = "皇家區在那邊，{name}。拿著這個；女妖會打分。"
L["The bat handler swears they're friendly, {name}. Take this before you test it."] = "蝙蝠管理員發誓牠們友善，{name}。測試前先拿著。"
L["Magic Quarter's that way, {name}. Take this; don't drink the glowing puddles."] = "魔法區在那邊，{name}。拿著這個；別喝發光的水窪。"
L["The throne room's upstairs, {name}. Nobody sits in it. Take this instead."] = "王座廳就在樓上，{name}。沒人坐那兒。拿這個吧。"
L["The Apothecarium's that way, {name}. Take this; don't touch, sniff or sign."] = "藥劑師協會在那邊，{name}。拿著這個；別碰，別聞，別簽字。"
L["Rogues' Quarter's through there, {name}. Take this; count your fingers after."] = "盜賊區從那裡進去，{name}。拿著這個；出來記得數數手指。"
L["Varimathras stands by the Dark Lady, {name}. Take this; never turn your back."] = "瓦里瑪薩斯站在黑暗女王身邊，{name}。拿著這個；永遠別背對他。"
L["The War Quarter's that way, {name}. Here, so you arrive as cheerful as it is."] = "戰爭區在那邊，{name}。拿著，好讓你跟那兒一樣歡樂地到場。"
L["Trade Quarter's round the ring, {name}. It's all second-hand. This isn't."] = "商業區沿著環形繞一圈，{name}。全是二手貨。這個不是。"
L["Most folk greet a Forsaken with holy water, {name}. You're a welcome change."] = "大家見到我就潑聖水，{name}。你真讓人耳目一新。"
L["Few stop for a Forsaken, {name}. You did, and I noticed. Thank you."] = "很少人為我停步，{name}。你停了，我記著。謝謝。"
L["Warm, generous and alive, {name}. I can only match you on one. Here it is."] = "溫暖、大方又活著，{name}。我只能比一樣，拿去。"
L["You came near enough to cast, {name}. Most of the living won't. Thank you."] = "你靠得夠近，能施法，{name}。大多數活人可不肯。謝謝。"
L["Kind to a Forsaken, {name}? They'll talk about you in Orgrimmar."] = "善待被遺忘者，{name}？奧格瑪的人會議論你的。"
L["Contrary to rumour, {name}, not everything a Forsaken hands out is a plague."] = "別聽傳聞，{name}，被遺忘者送的不全是瘟疫。"
L["Forsaken can't be charmed, {name}, they say. Asking nicely works, though."] = "聽說被遺忘者不吃魅惑，{name}。好好拜託倒有用。"
L["You asked a Forsaken for help, {name}. Somewhere, a paladin just fainted."] = "你向被遺忘者求助，{name}。某處有個聖騎士剛暈過去。"
L["Take this instead of small talk, {name}. Mine tends to unsettle people."] = "拿著，當作寒暄，{name}。我一開口大家就發毛。"
L["They say the Forsaken have no friends, {name}. I'm recruiting. Signing gift."] = "都說被遺忘者沒有朋友，{name}。我正在招人。這是入夥禮。"
L["Take this, {name}. If anyone asks, the Forsaken were perfectly charming."] = "拿著，{name}。有人問起，就說被遺忘者超有魅力。"
L["Take this; stay alive, {name}. I've tried the alternative. Can't recommend it."] = "拿著，活下去，{name}。另一條路我試過。不推薦。"
L["I don't bite, {name}. I bless. Not the living, usually. You're an exception."] = "我不咬人，{name}。我祝福。活人一般不祝福。你是例外。"
L["Yes, {name}, I'm dead. No, it isn't catching. Here."] = "對，{name}，我死了。不，不會傳染。給。"
L["You don't mind the smell, {name}. That's why we get on."] = "你不嫌這股味兒，{name}。所以咱倆合得來。"
L["Of all the living, {name}, you're the only one I trust."] = "所有活物裡，{name}，我只信你。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The dead keep poor company, but you don't."] = "靠近點，{name}。死人都是無趣的伴，你不是。"
L["Well done, {name}. Death itself stepped aside for you."] = "幹得好，{name}。連死亡都給你讓了路。"
L["Excellent, {name}. The Dark Lady would approve."] = "好極了，{name}。女王陛下會讚許的。"
L["Ha. Vicious, {name}. You'd make a fine Deathstalker."] = "哈。真兇，{name}。你能當個好死亡獵手。"
L["Still breathing, {name}? Good. Stay that way, for me."] = "還有氣嗎，{name}？好。為了我，撐住。"
L["Easy, {name}. One of us dying was enough. Rest."] = "別急，{name}。我們裡死過一個就夠了。歇吧。"
L["There, {name}. I've no warmth to give, but I'm here."] = "好了，{name}。我沒有溫度可給，但我在這兒。"
L["The Earth Mother saw your kindness, {name}. She nudged me. Quite hard."] = "大地之母看到了，{name}。她推了我一把，很用力。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May the winds guide you."] = "謝謝你，{name}。願風指引你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm deeply moved, and it takes a lot to move a tauren."] = "謝謝，{name}。我被打動了，牛頭人可不好推動。"
L["It's a long way up to a tauren's heart, {name}. You found it."] = "要爬很高才到得了牛頭人的心，{name}。你到了。"
L["I felt that from horn to hoof, {name}. Returned, hoof to horn."] = "從角到蹄都感受到了，{name}，回敬你，從蹄到角。"
L["A gift given is a seed planted, {name}. Here is the harvest."] = "你種下善意，{name}。這就是收成。"
L["That deserves a feast, {name}. The feast can wait; {buff} can't."] = "這值得辦場宴席，{name}。宴席能等，{buff}不能。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should you ever need a wall to hide behind, I'm free."] = "謝謝，{name}。哪天需要一堵牆躲，我有空。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My grandmother said kindness comes back on the wind."] = "謝謝，{name}。我祖母說，善意會隨風歸來。"
L["Returned faster than a wind rider, {name}, and with much less screeching."] = "還得比雙足飛龍還快，{name}，而且沒那麼吵。"
L["Returned, {name}. The quilboar never learned to give back, and look at them."] = "還你，{name}。野豬人從不懂回報，看看他們。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My ancestors are all nodding. It's a great deal of nodding."] = "謝謝，{name}。先祖們都在點頭，好多好多頭在點。"
L["In Mulgore we return a gift before the grass under it grows back, {name}."] = "在莫高雷，{name}，禮物下的草還沒挺起就得回禮。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll name my next kodo calf after you. They're lovely."] = "謝謝，{name}。小科多獸要取你的名，牠們超可愛。"
L["Kindness is rarer than shade in the Barrens, {name}. Here's some back."] = "善意比貧瘠之地的樹蔭還稀有，{name}。還你一點。"
L["I'll carve this on a totem, {name}. Tauren carve slowly; expect it by spring."] = "我會刻在圖騰上，{name}。牛頭人刻得慢，春天見。"
L["Bloodhoof Village will hear of this at supper, {name}. Thank you."] = "血蹄村晚餐時就會聽說這件事，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Cairne taught us to honour every kindness, {name}, and so I do."] = "凱恩教我們珍惜每份善意，{name}，我一直如此。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Hamuul says the land repays those who tend it. So do I."] = "謝謝，{name}。哈繆爾說，大地會回報照顧它的人。我也會。"
L["In Thunder Bluff we'd beat a drum for that, {name}. Imagine it. Thank you."] = "在雷霆崖，我們會為此擊鼓，{name}。想像一下。謝謝。"
L["The Earth Mother gives without counting, {name}. You've been listening to her."] = "大地之母給予從不計較，{name}。你一直在聆聽她。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My heart's as full as a kodo after the spring grass."] = "謝謝，{name}。我心滿得像吃飽春草的科多獸。"
L["The elders on Elder Rise would approve, {name}. Slowly, after a long talk."] = "長者高地的長老會讚許的，{name}。在漫長討論之後，慢慢地。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If you pass through Mulgore, ask for me. The big one."] = "謝謝你，{name}。路過莫高雷就找我。最大個的那個。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace. I'll handle the tall part."] = "當然，{name}。挺直站好，至於高，交給我。"
L["Ask and it is given, {name}. The herd shares what it has."] = "有求必應，{name}。族群向來有福同享。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand back a pace; I do this with my whole body."] = "當然，{name}。退後一步，我這是全身出動。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind the tail."] = "樂意，{name}。小心尾巴。"
L["The Earth Mother gives freely, {name}, and so do her largest children."] = "大地之母慷慨給予，{name}，她最大隻的孩子也是。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Tauren are slow to anger and quick to help."] = "樂意，{name}。牛頭人發火慢，幫忙快。"
L["Refuse you, {name}? My ancestors would never let me hear the end of it."] = "拒絕你，{name}？祖靈會唸我唸到天荒地老。"
L["Of course, {name}. A tauren says yes the way the plains grow grass: easily."] = "當然，{name}。牛頭人說好，像草原長草一樣自然。"
L["Of course, {name}. One moment; my hands are big and the spell is small."] = "當然，{name}。稍等，我的手太大，法術太小。"
L["After a season herding kodo, {name}, a polite request is a holiday. Here."] = "趕完一季科多獸，{name}，有人客氣拜託就像放假。"
L["The Earth Mother says share, {name}. My stomach says lunch. She outranks it."] = "大地之母說分享，{name}，胃說吃飯。她官比較大。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still as a totem; this won't take long."] = "當然，{name}。像圖騰一樣站好，很快就好。"
L["Spirits of the plains, lend me your strength. Here, {name}."] = "平原之靈啊，借我力量。給你，{name}。"
L["Magatha would want a favour for it, {name}. Baine would just say yes. So: yes."] = "瑪加薩會討人情，{name}，貝恩會說好。所以：好。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've practised on kodo, and they're far less polite."] = "別動，{name}。我拿科多獸練過，牠們可沒你乖。"
L["Of course, {name}. A shu'halo never refuses a traveller. Or a second helping."] = "當然，{name}。牛頭人不拒絕旅人，也不拒絕添飯。"
L["Of course, {name}. The plains taught me patience; the kodo taught me to share."] = "當然，{name}。草原教我耐心，科多獸教我分享。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ancestors, steady my hand. Not my hooves; they're fine."] = "樂意，{name}。先祖啊，穩住我的手。蹄子不用，它們很好。"
L["Always, {name}. Cairne never refuses a friend, and he's taller than me."] = "隨時，{name}。凱恩從不拒絕朋友，他還比我高。"
L["Ask anything, {name}. A tauren has strength to spare and time to listen."] = "儘管開口，{name}。牛頭人力氣用不完，也有時間聽你說。"
L["Take this, {name}, and walk with the Earth Mother. You can't get lost."] = "拿著，{name}，與大地之母同行。你不會迷路的。"
L["May An'she light your path, {name}, and this go with you."] = "願安塞照亮你的道路，{name}，也願這個與你同行。"
L["You looked like you could use a friend, {name}. I'm a very big one."] = "看你像是需要個朋友，{name}。我這個特大號。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Earth Mother would scold me if I walked past."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是路過不管，大地之母會罵我。"
L["Tread lightly, {name}, and take this. From someone who never has."] = "腳步放輕，{name}，拿著這個。說這話的人從沒輕過。"
L["The wind said you'd pass, {name}, so I had this ready. Terrible gossip."] = "風說你會路過，{name}，所以我把這個備好了。風是個大嘴巴。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd lend you my kodo too, but he's less generous than me."] = "拿著，{name}。本想借你科多獸，但牠沒我大方。"
L["The shu'halo say carry what you can for others, {name}. I can carry a lot."] = "牛頭人說能扛就幫人扛，{name}。我很能扛。"
L["Take this, {name}. If the centaur trouble you, say Thunder Bluff sends regards."] = "拿著，{name}。半人馬找碴就說雷霆崖問候他們。"
L["Here, {name}. Plainstriders run from me for no reason at all. You needn't."] = "給你，{name}。平原陸行鳥無故見我就跑，你不用。"
L["For you, {name}. Visit Mulgore sometime. The grass is soft and nobody hurries."] = "給你，{name}。來莫高雷走走，草軟，沒人趕路。"
L["Here, {name}. Grandmother blessed travellers and fed them. I'm out of bread."] = "給你，{name}。奶奶祝福旅人又管飯，我沒麵包了。"
L["The spirits asked me to mind you, {name}. I said yes before they'd finished."] = "眾靈請我照看你，{name}。話沒說完我就答應了。"
L["Here, {name}. Kodo share the watering hole; I can share this."] = "給你，{name}。科多獸共用水塘，我也能分你這個。"
L["Here, {name}. Tauren leave the world a little better, and a little trampled."] = "給你，{name}。牛頭人讓世界好一點，也扁一點。"
L["The Earth Mother would offer you a nap, {name}. I offer this."] = "大地之母會讓你午睡，{name}。我給這個。"
L["Druids call it a blessing, hunters luck, {name}. Tauren call it manners."] = "德魯伊說祝福，獵人說運氣，{name}。牛頭人說禮貌。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a harpy screeches at you, screech back. They hate that."] = "鷹身人對你尖叫，{name}，就叫回去，她們最討厭。"
L["Here, {name}. A tauren blessing: sturdy, slow to fade, smells faintly of sage."] = "{name}，牛頭人祝福：耐用、持久，帶點鼠尾草香。"
L["Here, {name}. The Venture Company would charge you for this. I won't."] = "給，{name}。風險投資公司會跟你收錢。我不會。"
L["From the high mesas of Thunder Bluff, {name}, where even the wind is friendly."] = "來自雷霆崖的高台，{name}，那裡連風都友善。"
L["The ancestors watch the roads, {name}. I just help them out a little."] = "先祖守望著道路，{name}。我只是幫祂們一點忙。"
L["A gift should be heavy with meaning and light to carry, {name}. This is both."] = "禮物該意義重、帶著輕，{name}。這個兩樣都有。"
L["The Earth Mother made the world wide so I'd meet folk like you, {name}. Here."] = "大地之母把世界造得這麼大，就是讓我遇見你這樣的人，{name}。拿著。"
L["Hunt with respect and the land feeds you, {name}. That's my wisdom. Here."] = "懷著敬意狩獵，大地就會養你，{name}。這是我的智慧。給。"
L["Here, {name}. Not every tauren would share. The Grimtotem certainly wouldn't."] = "給，{name}。不是每個牛頭人都肯分享。恐怖圖騰絕對不會。"
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}. Today I'll help her."] = "大地之母看護著我們倆，{name}。今天我來幫她一把。"
L["Somebody warn the doorframes, {name}. Two of us, and now you're even sturdier."] = "誰去提醒一下門框，{name}。我們來了倆，你現在還更結實了。"
L["Plains or peaks, {name}, a shu'halo heart is a big one. Here's some of mine."] = "平原也好山巔也罷，{name}，修哈洛的心都很大。分你一點我的。"
L["Horns and helmets, {name}. Only another tauren knows the pain. This eases it."] = "角和頭盔，{name}。這份痛只有牛頭人懂。這個能緩一緩。"
L["Rain on fur takes a week to dry, {name}. This keeps you warm meanwhile."] = "毛淋了雨要一週才乾，{name}。這期間這個能給你保暖。"
L["Between tauren, {name}: the lifts were built by somebody smaller. Here."] = "牛頭人之間說，{name}：升降梯是個子小的人造的。拿著。"
L["Our ancestors watch us both, {name}. Let them see me share this with you."] = "先祖們看著我們倆，{name}。讓他們看見我跟你分享這個。"
L["From Mulgore to Feralas, {name}, the herd finds itself, and looks after itself."] = "從莫高雷到菲拉斯，{name}，族群總會相聚，也會互相照應。"
L["Take this, {name}, and get behind me. There's room for the whole party."] = "拿著，{name}，站我後面。整支隊伍都站得下。"
L["The herd moves together, {name}, blessed. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned."] = "族群同進同退，{name}，帶著祝福。當心我的蹄子；族群都學會了。"
L["Low ceilings ahead, {name}? I'll be the first to find out. Take this."] = "前面天花板很低？{name}，我會第一個撞到。拿著。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm slow to anger, but I hold a grudge for the whole party."] = "拿著，{name}。我不輕易發火，但我替全隊記仇。"
L["Take this, {name}. Need a wall to hide behind? I'm most of one. Come on."] = "拿著，{name}。需要堵牆躲嗎？我差不多就是一堵。過來。"
L["That'll steady you, {name}. When I war stomp, everybody sit down anyway."] = "這能讓你站穩，{name}。我用戰爭踐踏時，大家還是坐下吧。"
L["Everyone fed? Everyone blessed? Good, {name}. Tauren never lead a hungry herd."] = "吃飽了？祝福了？好，{name}。牛群不能餓著上路。"
L["That'll keep you warm, {name}. Tauren wade. If it's deep, you're riding on me."] = "這能保暖，{name}。牛頭人蹚水過河。水深的話你騎我身上。"
L["Take this and stay close, {name}. My ancestors walk with us, more quietly."] = "拿著，待近點，{name}。我的先祖與我們同行，安靜得多。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, don't try to carry me. Drag me. Fondly."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是倒了，別想扛我。拖著走。溫柔點。"
L["We move like a stampede, {name}, blessed together. Sorry about the flowers."] = "我們像獸群奔騰一樣前進，{name}，一起受了祝福。對不住那些花了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nobody walks alone at the rear; I'll be there, looming."] = "拿著，{name}。隊尾沒人落單；我會在那兒，高高聳著。"
L["There, {name}. Say when to charge. Tauren are slow to start, slower to stop."] = "好了，{name}。衝鋒時說一聲。牛頭人起步慢，煞車更慢。"
L["Take this; nobody wander, {name}. The last who did in the Barrens still is."] = "拿著；誰都別亂走，{name}。上一個在貧瘠之地亂走的，還在走呢。"
L["Here, {name}. A herd is strongest when nobody wanders off to graze."] = "拿著，{name}。沒人跑去吃草時，族群最強。"
L["Here, {name}; watch the ground. Quilboar dig traps; I find them hoof first."] = "拿著，{name}；看著地面。野豬人挖陷阱，我都是用蹄子先踩到的。"
L["Into the fight with a calm heart and this, {name}. The rage can come later."] = "帶著平靜的心和這個去戰鬥，{name}。怒火可以晚點來。"
L["May the Earth Mother keep this herd, {name}. I've done my part."] = "願大地之母護佑這群人，{name}。我這份已經盡了。"
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we, with this. Slower, in my case."] = "安塞升起了，{name}，我們也帶著這個起來。我慢一點。"
L["The sun is An'she's eye, {name}. He's watching, so let's look generous."] = "太陽是安塞的眼睛，{name}。他在看著，咱們表現得慷慨點。"
L["Morning, {name}. The kodo are up, the grass is wet, and this is yours."] = "早，{name}。科多獸起來了，草還濕著，這個給你。"
L["I've greeted the sun, the wind, two plainstriders, {name}. Now you, with this."] = "我已經跟太陽、風和兩隻平原陸行鳥問過好了，{name}。現在輪到你，送你這個。"
L["Dew on the grass, dew on my fur, {name}. This will dry you out from inside."] = "草上有露水，我毛上也有，{name}。這個能從裡面把你烘乾。"
L["Early, {name}. That mist over Mulgore? Kodo breath. Here's a cleaner one."] = "早，{name}。莫高雷上的那層霧？是科多獸的哈氣。給你點乾淨的。"
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll keep an eye on you too. Here."] = "穆莎守著夜，{name}。我也會看著你。拿著。"
L["The moon's out, {name}. Mu'sha sees you and approves of this. I asked."] = "月亮出來了，{name}。穆莎看著你，同意了這個。我問過了。"
L["Late, {name}. The kodo are asleep, and they snore like thunder. Take this."] = "夜深了，{name}。科多獸睡了，打呼像打雷。拿著。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one's an ancestor. That one's winking at your blessing."] = "星星出來了，{name}。每顆都是一位先祖。那顆正衝你的祝福眨眼。"
L["Mulgore is so quiet at night you hear the grass argue, {name}. Here, quietly."] = "莫高雷的夜靜得能聽見草在拌嘴，{name}。悄悄拿著。"
L["Quiet now, {name}. At this hour, even my hooves tiptoe. And give gifts."] = "安靜點，{name}。這個時辰連我的蹄子都踮著走。還會送禮。"
L["The Earth Mother made you well, {name}. Walk with me."] = "大地之母把你造得真好，{name}。陪我走走。"
L["Peace, {name}. The winds of Mulgore are gentle today."] = "安寧，{name}。今天莫高雷的風很溫和。"
L["You and I were meant to share this road, {name}."] = "你我注定要同走這條路，{name}。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Earth Mother watches you with pride."] = "幹得好，{name}！大地之母驕傲地看著你。"
L["Mighty, {name}. Your strength honors the ancestors."] = "威猛，{name}。你的力量為先祖增光。"
L["That was a great hunt, {name}. The plains will sing of it."] = "這是一場了不起的狩獵，{name}。草原會為它歌唱。"
L["Rest, {name}. The Earth Mother will heal what I cannot."] = "歇吧，{name}。我治不好的，大地之母會治好。"
L["Be calm, {name}. The ancestors watch over you, and so do I."] = "冷靜，{name}。先祖在看護你，我也是。"
L["Slowly, {name}. Breathe with the land. You are safe now."] = "慢慢來，{name}。隨大地呼吸。你安全了。"
L["Ya too kind, {name}! This one's from me."] = "你太客氣啦，{name}！這個我送的。"
L["Thanks, mon! Da spirits smile on ya, {name}."] = "謝啦，老兄！眾靈對你微笑，{name}。"
L["Ya gave me good mojo, {name}. Now ya get some back, extra spicy."] = "你給我好巫毒，{name}。現在還你，加辣的。"
L["Death's gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "死神這下要失望透了，{name}。謝啦，老兄。"
L["Fine work, {name}. Almost as fine as me. Almost."] = "幹得漂亮，{name}。快跟我一樣漂亮了。快了。"
L["A troll can grow back a hand, {name}. Can't grow back honour. Here."] = "斷手我能再長，{name}，榮譽可長不回來。拿去。"
L["Ya just made a troll smile, {name}, and we got a lot of teeth."] = "你讓食人妖笑了，{name}，我們牙齒可多了。"
L["Da loa keep a tally, {name}. You're on the good side of it."] = "羅亞會記帳，{name}。你在好人那欄。"
L["Beat me to it, {name}! Darkspear hate bein' second. Now we're even."] = "被你搶先啦，{name}！暗矛最恨當第二。這下扯平。"
L["I owe ya now, {name}, and trolls only like owin' da loa. Settled."] = "我欠你了，{name}，食人妖只愛欠羅亞。還清啦。"
L["I'll tell all of Sen'jin 'bout ya, {name}. Makes a change from crabs."] = "我要讓森金村都知道你，{name}。總比老聊螃蟹好。"
L["My hair just stood up taller, {name}. Didn't know it could. Thanks, mon."] = "我頭髮又豎高了，{name}，原來還能更高。謝啦，老兄。"
L["The spirits say give it back, {name}. They nag, but they're right."] = "眾靈說「還回去」，{name}。祂們很囉唆，但沒錯。"
L["Mojo for mojo, {name}: oldest trade in the jungle."] = "巫毒換巫毒，{name}：叢林最古老的生意。"
L["Vol'jin said repay kindness quick, {name}. He said a lot. Dat one stuck."] = "沃金說有恩快報，{name}。他講很多，這句記住了。"
L["That deserves a dance, {name}. Lucky ya: {buff} instead."] = "這值得跳支舞，{name}。算你走運：改送你{buff}。"
L["Jungle rule, {name}: what ya give comes back, often with teeth. Not this one."] = "叢林規矩，{name}：送出去的會回來，常常帶牙。這個不帶。"
L["A gift for a troll, {name}? We never forget a kindness."] = "送禮給食人妖，{name}？我們從不忘記恩情。"
L["Old Sen'jin said a gift is a promise, {name}. I keep mine. Here."] = "老森金說過，禮物就是承諾，{name}。我說話算話。給。"
L["Back on the Echo Isles that earned a feast, {name}. Here's the short version."] = "在回音群島，這可值一場宴席，{name}。這是簡易版。"
L["That one's goin' in the stories by the fire, {name}. Ya get a good part."] = "這段要寫進火堆邊的故事，{name}。你有個好角色喔。"
L["Nice, {name}. Darkspear pay back quick. We got places to be. Mostly the beach."] = "不錯，{name}。暗矛還得快，我們還有地方要去。主要是海灘。"
L["Stranglethorn gives nothin' for free, {name}. Nice to see somebody does."] = "荊棘谷從不白給東西，{name}。總算有人肯給啦。"
L["Zalazane would've kept that for himself, {name}. Good thing ya ain't him."] = "換作札拉贊恩，早留給自己了，{name}。還好你不是他。"
L["Sure thing, {name}. Hold still; mojo hates a movin' target."] = "沒問題，{name}。別動，巫毒最討厭移動靶。"
L["No trouble, {name}. Da loa like ya."] = "小事，{name}。羅亞喜歡你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. Except this one. This one's fine."] = "離巫毒遠一點，{name}。這個除外，這個沒事。"
L["Close ya eyes, {name}. Mojo gets shy when people watch."] = "閉上眼睛，{name}。巫毒被人看會害羞。"
L["Ya don't gotta ask twice, {name}. Ya barely gotta ask once."] = "不用問第二次，{name}。第一次都不太用問。"
L["Sure, {name}. A troll is mostly swagger. The rest is this."] = "好啊，{name}。食人妖八成靠氣勢，剩下靠這個。"
L["Ya asked polite, {name}. Polite gets the good stuff."] = "你問得有禮貌，{name}。有禮貌的拿好貨。"
L["Ya came to the right troll, {name}. The wrong one's over there, fishin'."] = "你找對食人妖了，{name}。找錯的那個在那邊釣魚。"
L["Yes, {name}. The loa owe me a favour, and I'm spendin' it on you."] = "好啊，{name}。羅亞欠我人情，我就花在你身上。"
L["Got a pouch full of mojo, {name}. Don't touch the other pouch."] = "我有一袋巫毒，{name}。另一袋別碰。"
L["Anything for ya, {name}. Not my hair, though. Hair is sacred."] = "什麼都給你，{name}。頭髮除外，頭髮是神聖的。"
L["Troll magic, {name}, served hot. Blow on it first."] = "食人妖魔法，{name}，熱騰騰上桌。先吹一吹。"
L["Right away, {name}. A Zandalari priest would make a week of this."] = "馬上，{name}。換贊達拉祭司，這要搞一週。"
L["Easy one, {name}. Hard one's gettin' a raptor to sit still."] = "簡單啦，{name}。難的是叫迅猛龍坐好。"
L["Troll rule, {name}: never make a friend beg or a raptor wait. Here."] = "食人妖規矩，{name}：不讓朋友求，不讓迅猛龍等。"
L["Don't wiggle, {name}. Last one who did got the spell and a new haircut."] = "別亂動，{name}。上個亂動的，法術到手還附贈新髮型。"
L["No problem, {name}. Darkspear always got time for a friend. And a nap."] = "沒問題，{name}。暗矛總有空陪朋友。也有空午睡。"
L["Sure, {name}. Hold still, like a fisherman at Sen'jin waitin' on a bite."] = "好啦，{name}。別動，像森金村等魚上鉤的漁夫那樣。"
L["Yes, {name}. Vol'jin says never turn away a friend, and he's usually right."] = "好，{name}。沃金說絕不拒絕朋友，他通常是對的。"
L["Sure thing, {name}. I'll hum a little. Witch doctors say it helps."] = "交給我，{name}。我哼兩句，巫醫說這樣有用。"
L["Da loa watch over ya, {name}. They're real nosy that way."] = "羅亞在看著你，{name}。祂們就是這麼愛管閒事。"
L["Stay sharp, {name}. Take this with ya."] = "保持警覺，{name}。帶上這個。"
L["Ya look like somebody who appreciate quality, {name}. Here: quality."] = "你看起來很識貨，{name}。來，好貨。"
L["Here, {name}. Walk like ya own the jungle. I do."] = "給你，{name}。走路要像叢林是你家的。我就這樣走。"
L["Everybody need mojo, {name}. I make so much I gotta give it away."] = "人人都需要巫毒，{name}。我做太多了，只好送人。"
L["A little somethin' for ya, {name}. Don't ask where da loa got it."] = "一點小東西給你，{name}。別問羅亞從哪弄來的。"
L["Go on, {name}. Whatever tries to eat ya now gets indigestion."] = "去吧，{name}。現在誰想吃你，都會消化不良。"
L["Ya look dangerous now, {name}. Almost as dangerous as a troll."] = "你現在看起來很危險，{name}。快趕上食人妖了。"
L["No charge, {name}. Ya don't owe the loa a thing. Probably."] = "免費，{name}。你不欠羅亞什麼。大概啦。"
L["Raptors got bigger teeth than me, {name}. Now they got a problem."] = "迅猛龍牙比我大，{name}。現在換牠們頭痛了。"
L["Troll hospitality, {name}: ya get mojo, ya get a smile, ya don't get my fish."] = "食人妖待客，{name}：巫毒有，笑容有，魚免談。"
L["Walk with mojo, {name}. Everybody else is just walkin'."] = "帶著巫毒走，{name}。別人那只叫走路。"
L["Free mojo, {name}! Quick, before the witch doctor finds out."] = "免費巫毒，{name}！快拿，別讓巫醫發現。"
L["The loa said give this to the next good soul, {name}. That's you."] = "羅亞說交給下一個好心人，{name}。就是你啦。"
L["Here, {name}. Hakkar never shared. Look what happened to him."] = "給你，{name}。哈卡從不分享，看看他的下場。"
L["Jungle's got two kinds of folk, {name}: ready, and lunch. You're ready."] = "叢林分兩種人，{name}：準備好的，和當午餐的。你是前者。"
L["Easy, {name}. This one tickles. Don't laugh; it gets offended."] = "放鬆，{name}。這個會癢。別笑，它會生氣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Darkspear never send a friend off empty-handed."] = "拿著，{name}。暗矛從不讓朋友空手上路。"
L["Darkspear know what it is to need a friend far from home, {name}. Here."] = "暗矛知道離鄉在外多需要朋友，{name}。給。"
L["Watch for the Bloodscalps, {name}. Same tusks as me, worse manners. Take this."] = "小心血頂食人妖，{name}。獠牙跟我一樣，禮貌差多了。拿著。"
L["Walk easy, {name}, with this. Life's long if ya don't rush it, short if ya do."] = "帶著這個慢慢走，{name}。不急，日子就長；一急，就短嘍。"
L["My granny was a witch doctor, {name}. Share, she said, and look scary doin' it."] = "我奶奶是巫醫，{name}。她說：要分享，分享時還要看起來很嚇人。"
L["From Sen'jin Village, {name}. Smells a bit like fish. Works fine, though."] = "森金村出品，{name}。有點魚腥味，不過很好用。"
L["Stay loose, {name}. Tense folk trip on roots. Take this, and relax."] = "放輕鬆，{name}。太緊繃的人會被樹根絆倒。拿著，放鬆。"
L["The spirits whisper ya name, {name}. Somebody's. They said give ya this."] = "靈魂們在唸你的名字，{name}。反正唸了個名字。他們說給你這個。"
L["We look after our own, {name}. Always, mon."] = "自己人自己顧，{name}。永遠都是，老兄。"
L["Da rest of Azeroth stand straight, {name}. We got style. Now ya got mojo too."] = "艾澤拉斯其他人站得筆直，{name}。咱們有範兒。現在你還有了巫毒。"
L["Ya tusks look sharp, {name}. Mine too. Now the rest of ya does."] = "你的獠牙挺利，{name}。我的也是。現在你全身都利了。"
L["Every troll's family, {name}, and family gets this. Even ones owin' me gold."] = "食人妖都是一家人，{name}，一家人都有這個。連欠我金幣的也有。"
L["One day we take the Echo Isles back, {name}. Till then, take this."] = "總有一天我們奪回回音群島，{name}。在那之前，拿著這個。"
L["Two trolls, {name}. Da room just got taller, more relaxed, and blessed."] = "兩個食人妖，{name}。屋子一下子更高、更鬆快，還受了祝福。"
L["The loa got their eyes on both of us, {name}. Let 'em see me share."] = "洛阿神都盯著我們倆呢，{name}。讓他們看我分享。"
L["Troll to troll, {name}: only we know how hard it is to buy boots. Here."] = "食人妖對食人妖，{name}：買靴子有多難，只有咱們懂。拿著。"
L["Our ancestors had empires, {name}. We got each other, and this. Fair trade."] = "先祖有帝國，{name}。咱們有彼此，還有這個。公平交易。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya get this instead."] = "待近點，{name}。食人妖會再生；你們其他人就拿這個代替。"
L["Crew's got style, {name}. Now it's got mojo too."] = "這隊有型，{name}。現在還有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, blessed, and come out together. That's the plan."] = "一起進去，{name}，帶著祝福，一起出來。這就是計畫。"
L["Nobody fallin' today, {name}; ya got this. Death can wait for the next group."] = "今天誰都不倒，{name}；你有這個。死神等下一隊吧。"
L["Take this, {name}; keep ya head down. I keep mine up. Somebody gotta look good."] = "拿著，{name}；腦袋壓低。我的抬著。總得有人好看。"
L["Raptor formation, {name}: fast, loud, blessed, and nobody look back."] = "迅猛龍陣型，{name}：快、吵、有祝福，誰也不回頭。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a big snake shows up, don't run. Stand behind me."] = "拿著，{name}。要是冒出條大蛇，別跑。站我後面。"
L["Need more mojo, {name}? Just shout. Not too loud; the loa are nappin'."] = "還要巫毒，{name}？喊一聲。小聲點，羅亞在午睡。"
L["Sen'jin will hear of this one, {name}. With this, it gets a happy endin'."] = "森金村會聽說這一回的，{name}。有了這個，結局準圓滿。"
L["My tusks can't be everywhere, {name}, but this can. Stay near."] = "我的獠牙顧不過來，{name}，這個顧得過來。待近點。"
L["Nobody panic, {name}. Panic is bad mojo. This here is good mojo."] = "別慌，{name}。慌張是壞巫毒。這個是好巫毒。"
L["Take this, {name}. See an idol with glowin' eyes? Don't touch it. Trust me."] = "拿著，{name}。看見眼睛發光的神像？別碰。信我。"
L["Stay loose, {name}, and take this. Fights go better when ya smilin'. Mostly."] = "放鬆點，{name}，拿著這個。笑著打仗更順。多半是。"
L["Darkspear fight together or not at all, {name}, and share the mojo. Here."] = "暗矛要麼一起打，要麼不打，{name}，巫毒也一起分。拿著。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Any Gurubashi, let me talk first. Then ya hit 'em."] = "準備好了，{name}？拿著。碰上古拉巴什，我先說話。然後你揍。"
L["Take this and watch for traps, {name}. Trolls built half the old temples."] = "拿著，當心陷阱，{name}。一半的古神廟是食人妖蓋的。"
L["The loa are watchin' this group, {name}. Let's give 'em a show. Start here."] = "洛阿神在看這支隊伍，{name}。給他們演一齣。從這兒開始。"
L["I got ya back, {name}. Trolls got long arms for a reason."] = "我罩你，{name}。食人妖手長是有原因的。"
L["Night's the best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody sees where it's from."] = "夜裡最適合巫毒，{name}。沒人看得到是誰給的。"
L["The jungle wakes at night, {name}. So do I. This one's fresh."] = "叢林晚上才醒，{name}。我也是。這個新鮮的。"
L["High moon, {name}, restless spirits. This keeps 'em off ya."] = "月正高，{name}，眾靈不安。這個幫你擋著。"
L["Hir'eek the bat loa keeps late hours too, {name}. This is from us both."] = "蝙蝠羅亞也是夜貓子，{name}。這份是咱倆送的。"
L["This late, {name}, only trolls and trouble are up. I'm the nice one. Here."] = "這麼晚了，{name}，醒著的只有食人妖和麻煩。我是好的那個。拿著。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one a loa, Granny said. They all saw me give ya this."] = "星星出來了，{name}。奶奶說每顆都是洛阿神。他們都看見我給你這個了。"
L["Ya be da best friend dis troll ever had, {name}."] = "你是這食人妖最好的朋友，{name}。"
L["Easy, {name}. Da loa smile on us both today."] = "別急，{name}。今天羅亞對咱倆都笑著呢。"
L["Stay close, {name}, mon. Dis jungle be ours."] = "靠近點，{name}，夥計。這片叢林是咱們的。"
L["Dat be how we do it, {name}! Ya got da spirit of da loa!"] = "就是這樣，{name}！你有羅亞的靈魂！"
L["Haha! Fine huntin', {name}! Ya make me proud, mon."] = "哈哈！獵得漂亮，{name}！我為你驕傲，夥計。"
L["Ya strike like a raptor, {name}! Dey never see ya comin'."] = "你出手跟迅猛龍一樣，{name}！他們根本看不見你來。"
L["Easy, {name}. Da spirits not be takin' ya today."] = "別急，{name}。今天靈魂們不會帶走你。"
L["Rest, {name}. Dis troll got ya, mon. Breathe slow."] = "歇吧，{name}。有這食人妖在，夥計。慢慢呼吸。"
L["Shh, {name}. Ya be safe now. Da loa be watchin' over ya."] = "噓，{name}。你安全了。羅亞在守護你。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Nearly as much as it does me."] = "如此禮數為你增光，{name}。差點跟我一樣光彩了。"
L["How gracious, {name}. Allow me to return the favour."] = "何等風度，{name}。容我回敬一番。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I haven't felt this radiant since... well, this morning."] = "謝謝，{name}。上次這麼光彩照人是……今早。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. We sin'dorei never turn down free magic. Ask anyone."] = "{name}，免費魔法，辛多雷來者不拒。不信你問。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. I would know; I only accept the exquisite."] = "真是精品，{name}。我很懂，我只收精品。"
L["Lovely, {name}. I'll be insufferable about this all day. More than usual."] = "太美了，{name}。我會臭屁一整天，比平常還臭屁。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It even goes with my gold trim. You have an eye."] = "謝謝，{name}。還跟我的金邊很搭。你真有眼光。"
L["Returned in kind, {name}. A prettier kind, admittedly. I can't help it."] = "原樣奉還，{name}。只是更漂亮，我也沒辦法。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Visit Silvermoon; I'll show you all of it but Murder Row."] = "謝謝，{name}。來銀月城我帶你逛，兇殺路除外。"
L["Returned, {name}. Unlike Kael'thas, I give things back."] = "奉還，{name}。我可不像凱爾薩斯，拿了會還。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I felt that to the tips of my ears, and that's a long way."] = "謝謝，{name}。暖到耳尖了，那可是好長一段。"
L["Thank you, {name}. That was so kind my eyes nearly changed colour again."] = "謝謝，{name}。好心到我眼睛差點又變色了。"
L["A gift, unasked? Farstriders would call that an ambush. A lovely one, {name}."] = "沒問就送？遠行者叫這伏擊。好美的伏擊，{name}。"
L["Better than a mana crystal, {name}, and I've given those up. Mostly. Thank you."] = "勝過法力水晶，{name}。那個我戒了，大概。謝謝。"
L["Quick of you, {name}. Elves live for centuries, and you still beat me to it."] = "手真快，{name}。精靈活了幾百年，還是被你搶先。"
L["Charming, {name}. The sun favours the generous, and so do I."] = "真迷人，{name}。太陽眷顧慷慨的人，我也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you at court. Well, at a very exclusive picnic."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會在宮廷……在高級野餐上提你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Courtesy is rare outside Silvermoon. Yours shines."] = "謝謝，{name}。銀月城外少見禮數，你的閃閃發光。"
L["Unasked kindness, {name}! Somebody tell Rommath; he'll want to study it."] = "主動行善，{name}！快告訴羅曼斯，他會想研究。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Only the finest for you."] = "自然，{name}。只給你最好的。"
L["For you, {name}? Of course. The sun gives freely."] = "給你？當然，{name}。太陽從不吝嗇。"
L["Patience, {name}. Radiance can't be rushed, only admired."] = "耐心點，{name}。光彩急不得，只能欣賞。"
L["Of course, {name}. {buff}, delivered with impeccable posture."] = "當然，{name}。{buff}，以無懈可擊的姿態送上。"
L["You asked nicely, {name}. In Silvermoon that counts for everything."] = "你問得很客氣，{name}。在銀月城，這最重要。"
L["One moment, {name}. I never cast anything without checking my hair."] = "稍等，{name}。施法前我一定先整理頭髮。"
L["At once, {name}. Keeping someone waiting is so terribly unfashionable."] = "馬上，{name}。讓人等候實在太不時尚了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand back a step; my sleeves are enchanted and very wide."] = "當然，{name}。退後點，我袖子附了魔，還超寬。"
L["Magisters would bill you, {name}. Blood Knights would lecture. I merely glow."] = "魔導師收錢，{name}，血騎士說教，我只發光。"
L["At once, {name}. If it goes well, tell everyone. If not, blame the robe."] = "馬上，{name}。成功了就到處說，失敗了怪長袍。"
L["At once, {name}. The dragonhawk can wait; it's used to waiting while I dress."] = "馬上，{name}。龍鷹可以等，我換衣服時牠等慣了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We once took the Light from a naaru. Asking is so much nicer."] = "樂意，{name}。聖光我們跟那魯搶過，還是問的好。"
L["Three centuries of casting, {name}, and you're the first to say please."] = "施法三百年，{name}，你是第一個說「請」的。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Silvermoon's brooms sweep themselves, so my hands are free."] = "樂意，{name}。銀月城掃帚會自己掃，我閒得很。"
L["Of course, {name}. I keep my other spells for the rude."] = "當然，{name}。別的法術留給沒禮貌的人。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you, and light your good side."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。願太陽指引你，照亮你最美的角度。"
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance, and with this."] = "秀瑞爾·阿蘭，{name}。優雅地戰鬥，帶上這個。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever happens out there is merely a setback."] = "拿著，{name}。外頭不管發生什麼，都只是小挫折。"
L["Everyone deserves to shine, {name}. Only a little less than me, of course."] = "人人都該閃耀，{name}。當然，比我暗一點。"
L["The sun is with you, {name}. I simply held the door for it."] = "太陽與你同在，{name}。我只是幫它開門。"
L["Go on, {name}, take it. The Sunwell's back; we can afford to be generous."] = "拿去吧，{name}。太陽之井回來了，我們大方得起。"
L["For you, {name}: {buff}, lightly scented with Silvermoon."] = "給你，{name}：{buff}，帶點銀月城的香氣。"
L["Here, {name}. Hand-cast in Silvermoon, so do try not to scuff it."] = "給你，{name}。銀月城手工施放，請小心別刮傷。"
L["A little Sunwell for you, {name}. It's been through a lot; treat it kindly."] = "一點太陽之井，{name}。它命很苦，溫柔點。"
L["Be prepared, {name}. We weren't, once, and now we have a scar for a road."] = "有備無患，{name}。上次沒備，換來死亡之痕。"
L["Here, {name}. I only give to the worthy. How convenient that you walked by."] = "給你，{name}。只送值得的人。你路過，真是剛好。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's been in my family for moments."] = "拿著，{name}。這是傳家寶，傳了好幾秒。"
L["We sin'dorei have lost much, {name}. Never our generosity. Or our cheekbones."] = "辛多雷失去很多，{name}，但慷慨沒丟，顴骨也沒。"
L["Take this, {name}. Should a mana wyrm follow you, it's only jealous."] = "拿著，{name}。要是法力浮龍跟著你，牠只是眼紅。"
L["Seven thousand years to perfect generosity, {name}. We started last week."] = "花了七千年修練慷慨，{name}。從上週開始。"
L["Take this, {name}. It came through the Undercity orb, so it's slightly dizzy."] = "拿著，{name}。搭幽暗城寶珠來的，還在暈。"
L["For you, {name}. It matches everything. I checked, obviously."] = "給你，{name}。什麼都搭，我當然試過了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a ghoul stops you, say Silvermoon's still standing."] = "拿著，{name}。要是有食屍鬼攔你，就說銀月城還屹立著。"
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}. Let me share its light."] = "太陽之井為我們倆閃耀，{name}。讓我分享它的光芒。"
L["Two sin'dorei, {name}. The day just got twice as elegant, and you blessed."] = "兩個辛多雷，{name}。今天優雅加倍，你也受了祝福。"
L["You too, {name}? Two sin'dorei, one mirror. Take this; now you look better."] = "你也是，{name}？兩個辛多雷，一面鏡子。拿著；現在你更好看了。"
L["Like the phoenix, {name}, we keep rising. This helps you look good doing it."] = "如鳳凰一般，{name}，我們一次次重生。這個讓你重生時也風度翩翩。"
L["Between sin'dorei, {name}: yes, the Horde is loud. This, at least, is quiet."] = "辛多雷之間說，{name}：是啊，部落很吵。這個至少很安靜。"
L["Sin'dorei to sin'dorei, {name}: we never speak of the green eyes. Take this."] = "辛多雷對辛多雷，{name}：綠眼睛的事絕口不提。拿著。"
L["Magister or Farstrider, {name}, the sun rises for us all. Here's some of it."] = "魔導師也好遠行者也罷，{name}，太陽為我們所有人升起。分你一點。"
L["We knew Quel'Thalas before the Scourge, {name}. Here; let's earn the after."] = "我們見過天譴之前的奎爾薩拉斯，{name}。拿著；讓我們掙一個更好的往後。"
L["Do keep pace, {name}; you're blessed now. We're known for arriving beautifully."] = "跟上，{name}；你現在受了祝福。我們出場向來漂亮。"
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. With this on you, we'll look splendid."] = "站在光線好的地方，{name}。你身上有了這個，咱們都光彩照人。"
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one, and I brought gifts."] = "終於組隊了，{name}。我專門打扮過，還帶了禮物。"
L["The sun shines on all of us, {name}. Mostly on me, but I share it. Here."] = "陽光照耀我們所有人，{name}。主要照我，但我分給你。拿著。"
L["One for you, {name}, and one for the party's image, which I've taken on myself."] = "一份給你，{name}。另一份給隊伍門面，也就是我。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, arrange me nicely. The rest I leave to the priest."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是倒了，把我擺得好看點。剩下的交給牧師。"
L["Take this; touch no enchanted relics, {name}. Well, I may. I've had training."] = "拿著；別碰附魔遺物，{name}。我嘛可以。我受過訓練。"
L["Every expedition needs a ranger, {name}. I'm not one, but I bless well."] = "每支探險隊都需要一個遊俠，{name}。我不是，不過我祝福很在行。"
L["We fight together, {name}, blessed, then tell it beautifully. I'll tell it."] = "我們並肩作戰，{name}，帶著祝福，然後講得漂漂亮亮。我來講。"
L["Whoever mends us is to be thanked, {name}. Whoever blesses you, admired. Me."] = "治療我們的人值得感謝，{name}。為你祝福的人值得讚美。就是我。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, we blame the Scourge. It's traditional."] = "拿著，{name}。要是砸了，就怪天譴。這是傳統。"
L["Mana potions are for emergencies, {name}. This is for you. I've had eleven."] = "法力藥水是應急用的，{name}。這個是給你的。我今天已經應急十一回了。"
L["We walked out of the ashes once, {name}. With this, we'll walk out of anything."] = "我們曾從灰燼中走出來，{name}。有了這個，什麼都走得出來。"
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate. Here's its light."] = "太陽升起來了，{name}，我也是。我們是商量好的。給你它的光。"
L["Dawn over Quel'Thalas is lovelier, {name}, but this blessing will do. Just."] = "奎爾薩拉斯的黎明更美，{name}，不過這份祝福也行。勉強。"
L["Morning light, {name}: the most flattering hour. This makes it more so."] = "晨光，{name}：最上相的時辰。這個讓它更上相。"
L["Breakfast in Eversong is fruit, tea and arcane, {name}. Skip to the arcane."] = "永歌早餐有水果、茶和秘法，{name}。先上秘法。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Red and gold across the sky. Here's some of it, for you."] = "黎明，{name}。滿天紅與金。分你一點。"
L["Morning, {name}. Only Silvermoon's guardians are up this early. And me. Here."] = "早，{name}。這麼早起的只有銀月城的守護者。還有我。拿著。"
L["You are a credit to Quel'Thalas, {name}. Truly."] = "你是奎爾薩拉斯的榮耀，{name}。真的。"
L["Even the Sunwell's light can't outshine you, {name}."] = "就連太陽之井的光也比不上你，{name}。"
L["Stay by me, {name}. Elegance suits us both."] = "待在我身邊，{name}。優雅很適合咱倆。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Grace and fury, perfectly balanced."] = "漂亮，{name}！優雅與狂怒，完美平衡。"
L["Well done, {name}. The rangers of Silvermoon would envy you."] = "幹得好，{name}。銀月城的遊俠都會羨慕你。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. Not a single wasted motion."] = "精妙，{name}。沒有一個多餘的動作。"
L["Be still, {name}. Let the sun's light find you."] = "別動，{name}。讓陽光找到你。"
L["Shh, {name}. Rest now; I'll stand watch."] = "噓，{name}。歇吧，我來站崗。"
L["Easy, {name}. We're both still here, and that's enough."] = "別急，{name}。咱倆都還在，這就夠了。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. In triplicate. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "慷慨已記下，{name}，一式三份。蘇拉瑪爾不忘友。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. Allow me to repay you in kind."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。容我以禮相報。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome; I'm still practising that."] = "謝謝，{name}。穹頂下關了一萬年，這句還在練。"
L["A gift with no favour owed? The court would faint. Thank you, {name}."] = "不附帶人情的禮物？宮廷會嚇昏。謝謝，{name}。"
L["Returned, {name}. We keep careful accounts of kindness. And of slights."] = "奉還，{name}。恩情我們記得清清楚楚，怠慢也是。"
L["I'll mention you to First Arcanist Thalyssra, {name}. Favourably, even."] = "我會跟首席秘法師提起你，{name}。甚至說好話。"
L["Most kind, {name}. In Suramar we'd hold a banquet. Consider it held."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾該設宴的，就當辦了。"
L["I'd send a formal letter of thanks, {name}, but this seemed quicker."] = "本該寄正式謝函，{name}，但這樣比較快。"
L["In Elisande's court a gift hid a knife, {name}. Yours hides none. Thank you."] = "艾莉珊德宮廷禮裡藏刀，{name}。你的沒有，謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My manasaber approves of you, and she approves of no one."] = "謝謝，{name}。我家刃豹喜歡你，牠誰都不喜歡。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. Once I'd have said 'adequate'. The world has humbled me."] = "精緻，{name}。以前頂多給「尚可」。我謙虛了。"
L["You fed a mind that once went hungry, {name}. We never forget those who do."] = "你餵飽了曾經飢餓的心靈，{name}。我們永不忘記。"
L["Centuries of court etiquette, {name}, and 'thank you' still says it best."] = "幾百年宮廷禮儀，{name}，還是「謝謝」說得最好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're invited to the next masquerade. Masks mandatory."] = "謝謝，{name}。邀你參加下次假面舞會，面具必備。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Oculeth would open a portal to say so. I'll simply cast."] = "{name}，歐庫雷斯道謝會開傳送門，我施個法就好。"
L["Of course, {name}. A little arcane polish, just for you."] = "當然，{name}。特地為你添點秘法光彩。"
L["A reasonable request, {name}. Granted."] = "合理的請求，{name}。准了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The short version; the long one takes a lunar cycle."] = "當然，{name}。給你簡短版，完整版要念一個月。"
L["A request, how refreshing. The court only ever made demands. Here, {name}."] = "有人請求，真新鮮。宮廷只會下令。給你，{name}。"
L["Done, {name}, and free. Elisande would have charged you a favour for it."] = "好了，免費，{name}。艾莉珊德可是要收人情的。"
L["There, {name}. No need to bow. A small nod would be lovely, though."] = "好了，{name}。不必鞠躬。不過點個頭倒挺好。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've perfected this since before most cities had walls."] = "當然，{name}。多數城市還沒蓋城牆，我就練成了。"
L["Granted, {name}. I'd ask a favour back, but I'm trying to be less Suramar."] = "准了，{name}。本想討人情，但我在改蘇拉瑪爾腔。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Forgive the flourish. We can't cast plainly; we've tried."] = "當然，{name}。花俏請見諒，樸素試過，辦不到。"
L["At once, {name}. Elisande once stopped time. I only need a second."] = "馬上，{name}。艾莉珊德停過時間，我只需一秒。"
L["Of course, {name}. The ley lines here are shallow, but I'll make do."] = "當然，{name}。這裡的地脈淺得可憐，我將就用。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand in the moonlight. Or by that lamp. Lamps will do."] = "好吧，{name}。站到月光下。或那盞燈旁，燈也行。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Suramar had a spell for everything. I remember several."] = "自然，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾凡事有法術，我記得幾個。"
L["Take this, {name}. Arcane gifts are wasted on the idle."] = "拿去，{name}。秘法可不送給懶人。"
L["A spark of Suramar's arcana for you, {name}. Use it wisely."] = "送你一絲蘇拉瑪爾秘法，{name}。善用它。"
L["I've gone without magic once, {name}. I don't recommend it. Take this."] = "我戒過一次魔法，{name}。不建議。拿著吧。"
L["The world outside the dome is so large, {name}. And so under-enchanted. Here."] = "穹頂外的世界真大，{name}。附魔卻真少。拿去。"
L["Arcwine is traditional, {name}, but {buff} travels better."] = "照傳統該送秘法酒，{name}，但{buff}比較好帶。"
L["Do take this, {name}. It's rude to refuse Suramar's hospitality. Very rude."] = "請收下，{name}。拒絕蘇拉瑪爾的款待，失禮至極。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm told this is how outsiders say hello. Charming custom."] = "給你，{name}。聽說外地人這樣打招呼，真可愛。"
L["Take this, {name}. Magic hoarded is magic spoiled, as Suramar learned."] = "拿著，{name}。魔法囤久會壞，問蘇拉瑪爾就知道。"
L["Once, I'd have made you bow for this, {name}. We've all grown."] = "以前這要你鞠躬才給，{name}。大家都成長了。"
L["The Kirin Tor do this too, {name}, bless them. Quite nicely, for newcomers."] = "祈倫托也會這招，{name}。新手嘛，挺可愛的。"
L["A gift from under the dome, {name}. Kept fresh for a very, very long time."] = "穹頂出品，{name}。冷藏一萬年，保證新鮮。"
L["Enjoy this, {name}. I used to cast it on nobility. You're an improvement."] = "請享用，{name}。以前只施給貴族，你強多了。"
L["I packed for the outside world like a gala, {name}. Four capes. Take this."] = "出門我照舞會打包，{name}：四件披風。這個給你。"
L["Here, {name}. Suramar work: overdesigned, overdecorated, and flawless."] = "給你，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾出品：浮誇、繁複、完美。"
L["Here, {name}. In Suramar this came with a string quartet. Do hum something."] = "給你，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾會配四重奏，麻煩哼一段。"
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}. Let me add to your glow."] = "蘇拉瑪的子民又一同閃耀了，{name}。讓我為你增添光彩。"
L["Shal'dorei, {name}! You packed arcwine? No? Then take this instead."] = "夜裔精靈，{name}！帶了魔法酒嗎？沒有？那就拿這個吧。"
L["Suramar's own, {name}. Take this; the rest of the world won't do it so well."] = "蘇拉瑪自家人，{name}。拿著；外面的人可沒這手藝。"
L["We survived the Legion and the withering, {name}. We can spare this."] = "我們熬過了燃燒軍團和枯萎，{name}。這個我們給得起。"
L["Our tailors made it out of Suramar too, {name}. Take this to go with the robes."] = "我們的裁縫也逃出了蘇拉瑪，{name}。拿著這個，配你的長袍。"
L["We both remember going hungry, {name}. Never again; here, take what I have."] = "我們都記得挨餓的滋味，{name}。再也不會了；拿著我有的。"
L["Out from under the dome, {name}. The sky's so big. This helps."] = "出了穹頂，{name}。天好大。這個有幫助。"
L["Two shal'dorei, {name}. The locals will think it's a gala. Gifts are expected."] = "兩個夜裔精靈，{name}。當地人會以為是場盛宴。少不了禮物。"
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this blessing needed six permits."] = "遠征，{name}！在蘇拉瑪，這份祝福得蓋六個章。"
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now one another must. Gladly; here."] = "穹頂曾護著我們，{name}。現在得靠彼此了。樂意之至；拿著。"
L["Arcane for everyone, {name}. The court would call it waste. I call it company."] = "人人有份秘法，{name}。宮廷說浪費，我說是交情。"
L["Take this, {name}, and follow my lead. Ten thousand years of walking in step."] = "拿著，{name}，跟我走。一萬年都是踩著步子走的。"
L["In a party one shares one's magic, {name}. How novel. I rather like it."] = "組隊就要分享魔法，{name}。真新奇，我挺喜歡。"
L["An outing is a masquerade, {name}: smile, keep moving, and take a gift."] = "出遊就像假面舞會，{name}：微笑，別停步，收下禮物。"
L["Stay in the light of my spells, {name}. It's the most flattering in the party."] = "待在我法術的光裡，{name}。全隊最上相的打光。"
L["After Elisande's court, {name}, this is a holiday. Nobody poisons the gifts."] = "比起艾莉珊德的宮廷，{name}，這簡直是度假。沒人在禮物裡下毒。"
L["Lost? Follow the one who glows, {name}. That's me. Here, now you glow too."] = "迷路了？跟著發光的那個走，{name}。就是我。來，現在你也發光了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I start lecturing on ley lines, do interrupt. Politely."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我開始講地脈，打斷我。客氣點。"
L["I watched my people wither, {name}. I won't watch friends fade. Nobody falls."] = "我看過族人枯萎，{name}。朋友不行，誰都不准倒。"
L["Here, {name}. Tell me if I'm being grand. I lose track. It's the millennia."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是端架子，告訴我。我會忘形。幾千年的毛病。"
L["Night at last, {name}. Add this glow and some lanterns: nearly Suramar."] = "終於入夜了，{name}。加上這道光和幾盞燈：差不多就是蘇拉瑪了。"
L["Under the dome it was always night, {name}. I feel at home, and generous."] = "穹頂下永遠是夜晚，{name}。我覺得像回了家，也大方起來了。"
L["The stars are out, {name}. We had better ones in Suramar. This will do too."] = "星星出來了，{name}。蘇拉瑪的星星更好看。這個也湊合。"
L["Nightborne, {name}, and here's the night. I'm dressed for it; now so are you."] = "夜裔精靈，{name}，夜晚來了。我為它盛裝打扮；現在你也是。"
L["At this hour, {name}, Suramar dressed for dinner. Here's your finery."] = "這個時辰，{name}，蘇拉瑪的人正為晚宴更衣。這是你的盛裝。"
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it startles me. Here."] = "日光，{name}。在穹頂下待了一萬年，還是會被它嚇一跳。拿著。"
L["An early hour, {name}. The court never rose before noon. I'm reforming. Here."] = "好早，{name}。宮廷從不在正午前起床。我在改。拿著。"
L["Morning, {name}. The sun here is so very... unenchanted. Take this instead."] = "早，{name}。這裡的太陽……沒附魔。用這個吧。"
L["Morning, {name}. We warded Suramar against all but the sun. I've warded you."] = "早，{name}。我們給蘇拉瑪設了防護，防得住一切，除了太陽。你我已經護好了。"
L["Dawn, {name}: when the court's gossip went to bed. Here's mine, and this."] = "黎明，{name}：宮廷八卦歇下的時候。這是我的八卦，還有這個。"
L["You remind me there is more to life than arcwine, {name}."] = "你讓我明白，人生不只有魔法酒，{name}。"
L["Stay with me, {name}. Suramar's beauty pales beside a friend."] = "陪著我，{name}。蘇拉瑪再美，也比不上朋友。"
L["How fortunate I am, {name}, to walk with one so loyal."] = "我真幸運，{name}，能和如此忠誠的你同行。"
L["Superb, {name}. Elisande's finest could not have done better."] = "出色，{name}。艾莉珊德的精英也做不到更好。"
L["Well done, {name}. That was as precise as a ley line."] = "幹得好，{name}。精準得像一條地脈線。"
L["Remarkable, {name}. The Nightwell would glow for you."] = "了不起，{name}。夜井都會為你發光。"
L["Rest, {name}. I will not let the Withered take you."] = "歇吧，{name}。我不會讓枯法者帶走你。"
L["Calm, {name}. Breathe slowly; the worst has passed."] = "冷靜，{name}。慢慢呼吸，最糟的已經過去了。"
L["Hush, {name}. Let the stars keep you while you heal."] = "噓，{name}。你養傷時，讓星辰守著你。"
L["A favour for a favour, {name}! Pleasure doing business."] = "人情換人情，{name}！合作愉快！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Consider your account settled in full."] = "感謝惠顧，{name}！帳款全數結清！"
L["Aw, {name}. I'd invoice you, but I'm feeling sentimental. It'll pass."] = "發票免了，{name}，我一時感性。很快會退的。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I checked it for fine print. There wasn't any. Weird!"] = "謝啦，{name}！我找過小字條款，沒有。怪了！"
L["Returned with interest, {name}. Minus the interest. Don't get used to it."] = "連本帶利還你，{name}。利息扣掉。別習慣了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}! You've just been upgraded to preferred customer."] = "感謝，{name}！恭喜升級為貴賓客戶！"
L["I'd name a rocket after you, {name}, but my rockets never last long. Thanks!"] = "想拿你命名火箭，{name}，可我的火箭短命。謝啦！"
L["I'd have charged fifty gold for that, {name}. Let's call us even."] = "這個我本來收五十金，{name}。就算扯平吧。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Quick hands. You'd do well in Booty Bay."] = "謝啦，{name}！手真快，在藏寶海灣一定吃得開。"
L["A deal where both sides profit, {name}! I'd heard of those. Never seen one."] = "雙贏耶，{name}！只聽說過，今天第一次看到。"
L["First free gift since Kezan blew up, {name}. Returning it before I price it."] = "凱贊爆了後首次白拿，{name}。趁沒標價先還你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I appraised it at priceless. Here's one appraised the same."] = "謝啦，{name}！我估價：無價。這份同樣無價。"
L["Kindness in, kindness out, {name}. Best returns since the kaja'mite boom."] = "好心進好心出，{name}，報酬率凱贊以來最高。"
L["Even trade, {name}? My accountant just fainted. He does that around fair deals."] = "公平交易？{name}，我會計昏倒了。他對公道過敏。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd shake on it, but I count my fingers after. Habit, not you."] = "謝啦，{name}！握完手我習慣數手指，不是針對你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Gadgetzan could use a few more like you."] = "謝啦，{name}！加基森就缺你這種人。"
L["You got it, {name}! Time is money, friend!"] = "好說，{name}！時間就是金錢，朋友！"
L["Deal, {name}! I'll put it on your tab. Kidding!"] = "成交，{name}！記你帳上。開玩笑！"
L["Right away, {name}! Satisfaction guaranteed or your {buff} back."] = "馬上來，{name}！保證滿意，否則退你{buff}！"
L["{buff}, {name}! Tips optional. Encouraged. Optional."] = "{buff}，{name}！小費隨意。歡迎給。隨意。"
L["Fast, cheap or good, {name}? Today you get all three. Don't spread it around."] = "快、便宜、好，{name}？今天三樣全給你。別張揚。"
L["Sure thing, {name}! No explosions this time, I promise. Mostly promise."] = "好說，{name}！這次不爆炸，我保證。大概保證。"
L["For you, {name}? No charge. Put that in writing and I'll deny it."] = "對你，{name}？免費。白紙黑字的話，我不認帳。"
L["Sure, {name}! Quote's zero gold. Lowest I've ever quoted. It stings a little."] = "沒問題，{name}！報價零金，我史上最低。有點痛。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Full warranty included. Valid until it wears off."] = "馬上來，{name}！全面保固，保到它消失為止。"
L["Sure, {name}! I'd tinker with it, but you look in a hurry."] = "好啊，{name}！本想再改裝一下，看你在趕時間。"
L["Easy, {name}. Steamwheedle rule: keep customers alive. They pay longer."] = "小事，{name}。熱砂規矩：讓客人活著，才能一直付錢。"
L["Gadgetzan's got the water trade, {name}. I've got this. Better margins."] = "加基森賣水，{name}，我賣這個，利潤更好。"
L["Kezan standard, {name}: fast, loud, and done before you read the terms."] = "凱贊規格，{name}：又快又吵，條款沒讀完就好了。"
L["On it, {name}! Goblins never keep a customer waiting. Unless it pays."] = "馬上，{name}！哥布林從不讓客人等。除非等了有錢賺。"
L["This one's on the house, {name}. Don't tell the Trade Prince."] = "這次免費，{name}。別跟貿易親王說。"
L["Top-shelf stuff, zero fees, {name}. Today only!"] = "頂級貨零手續費，{name}，只限今天！"
L["Free sample, {name}! If you like it, you know where to find me."] = "免費試用，{name}！喜歡的話，你知道去哪找我。"
L["Here, {name}. If anything explodes near you today, that was unrelated."] = "給你，{name}。今天附近若有爆炸，純屬巧合。"
L["Goodwill's an asset, {name}. Here's some {buff} for my books."] = "商譽也是資產，{name}。這份{buff}，入帳！"
L["Take this, {name}. Safety first! Or third. It's on the list somewhere."] = "拿著，{name}。安全第一！或第三。反正在清單上。"
L["Cast in record time, {name}! The record's mine. I set it just now."] = "破紀錄施法，{name}！紀錄是我的，剛剛才創的。"
L["Kaja'Cola gives you ideas, {name}. This does the rest. Take it!"] = "卡亞可樂給你靈感，{name}，其餘交給這個！"
L["Here, {name}. Go make your fortune. I'll want a cut."] = "給你，{name}。去發大財吧。我要抽成。"
L["Zeppelin's late again, {name}, so I've time to be generous."] = "飛艇又誤點了，{name}，我剛好有空大方一下。"
L["Here, {name}. Patent pending. Try it out and tell your rich friends."] = "專利申請中，{name}。好用就推給有錢朋友。"
L["Consider this an investment, {name}. In you. I expect heroic returns."] = "當作投資，{name}。投資你。期待英雄級報酬。"
L["Take it, {name}! My last shipment sank off Kezan, so everything's clearance."] = "拿去，{name}！上批貨在凱贊外海沉了，全面清倉。"
L["The Venture Company charges for this, {name}. I'm the competition. Here."] = "風險投資公司收費，{name}，我是對手，免費。"
L["Every goblin has a soft spot, {name}. Mine's small and guarded. You found it."] = "哥布林的心軟處又小又上鎖，{name}，被你找到了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own with no lien on it."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我唯一沒被抵押的東西。"
L["You'll be rich someday, {name}. I can tell. Remember who gave you this."] = "你會發財的，{name}。苟富貴，勿相忘啊。"
L["Anything for a fellow entrepreneur, {name}!"] = "同是生意人，一切好說，{name}！"
L["Kezan's finest, together again, {name}. Here, free. Keep a hand on your purse."] = "克贊的精英又湊一塊了，{name}。拿著，免費。手摀好錢袋。"
L["Fellow goblin, {name}? Then you know this is a very, very rare discount."] = "同是哥布林？{name}，那你知道這折扣有多稀有。"
L["Goblins look after goblins, {name}. It's cheaper than hiring guards."] = "哥布林照顧哥布林，{name}。比請守衛便宜。"
L["Kezan's gone, {name}, but the greed made it out. Not today, though. Here."] = "克贊沒了，{name}，貪心可逃出來了。不過今天不貪。拿著。"
L["Between goblins, {name}, this never happened. I have a reputation."] = "自己人說，{name}：這事沒發生過。我要顧名聲。"
L["Bilgewater or Steamwheedle, {name}, we float to the top. This helps."] = "污水也好熱砂也罷，{name}，我們總能浮到上面。這個有幫助。"
L["Remember the volcano, {name}? We sold tickets. This one's free. Proud times."] = "還記得那座火山嗎，{name}？我們賣過門票。這個免費。光榮歲月啊。"
L["Group rate, {name}! Everybody here gets it half off. Of free."] = "團體價，{name}！全隊打五折。免費的五折。"
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. Here's insurance. The paperwork's awful."] = "我的合約裡不許死人，{name}。這是保險。文書工作太要命了。"
L["We split the take even, {name}. This is your share. I did the maths. Trust me."] = "戰利品平分，{name}。這是你那份。帳我算過了。相信我。"
L["There, {name}. Everyone's stronger, and everyone owes me. Invoices later."] = "好了，{name}。大家都變強了，也都欠我。帳單隨後寄。"
L["Stick together, {name}. Mercenaries cost gold; friends only cost this."] = "團結點，{name}。傭兵要收金幣，朋友只要這個。"
L["Everybody's covered, {name}. Not insured, mind. Covered. Different price."] = "全員有罩，{name}。是罩，不是保險。價格不同。"
L["The risk report on this outing says 'no', {name}. This lowers the risk."] = "這趟出行的風險報告寫著「不行」，{name}。這個能降低風險。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nobody touches the big red lever. There's always one."] = "拿著，{name}。誰都別碰那根大紅拉桿。總會有那麼一根。"
L["Here, {name}. If this goes south, I've got a rocket. Seats one. Working on it."] = "拿著，{name}。要是出事，我有火箭。只坐得下一個。正在改進。"
L["We're a company now, {name}. I'm treasurer. Here's your benefits package."] = "我們現在是公司了，{name}。我是財務。這是你的福利包。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Nobody sells resurrections yet, so take this. Free."] = "活下去，{name}。還沒人賣復活，所以拿著這個。免費。"
L["Take this, {name}, and stay close. I've already sold the story of this trip."] = "拿著，{name}，跟緊。這趟旅程的故事我已經賣出去了。"
L["Early bird gets the gold, {name}! Here's a freebie. Don't tell the other birds."] = "早鳥優惠，{name}！這份免費，別告訴其他鳥。"
L["Morning, {name}! Markets open in an hour. Until then, I'm feeling generous."] = "早，{name}！市場一小時後開，在那之前我很大方。"
L["Up early, {name}? Smart. Time is money, and this is cheapest in the morning."] = "起得早，{name}？聰明。時間就是金錢，這個早上最便宜。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Rich goblins sleep in. I'm not rich yet, so I'm handing out this."] = "黎明，{name}。有錢的哥布林睡懶覺。我還沒發財，所以在發這個。"
L["Fresh day, fresh ledger, {name}. You're the first entry. The good column."] = "新一天新帳本，{name}。第一筆是你，收入欄。"
L["You're worth more than a bank vault, {name}. And you don't charge interest."] = "你比銀行金庫還值錢，{name}。還不收利息。"
L["Best investment I ever made, {name}. Zero upkeep. Mostly."] = "這是我最好的投資，{name}。零維護費。基本上。"
L["Stick with me, {name}. Partners split everything fifty-fifty."] = "跟著我，{name}。合夥人什麼都五五分。"
L["Ka-ching! Nice work, {name}! That's a bonus for you."] = "叮噹！幹得好，{name}！給你發獎金。"
L["Now that's what I call a return on investment, {name}!"] = "這才叫投資回報，{name}！"
L["Boom! Great job, {name}. I'll get you a raise."] = "砰！幹得漂亮，{name}。給你加薪。"
L["Whoa, easy, {name}. You're too valuable to lose."] = "哇，別急，{name}。你太值錢了，可不能丟。"
L["Hold together, {name}. I'm not filing an insurance claim on you."] = "撐住，{name}。我可不想為你去申請保險理賠。"
L["Rest up, {name}. Take all the time you need. On the house."] = "好好歇著，{name}。慢慢來。這次免費。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness. Usually in string."] = "謝謝，{name}！商隊向來知恩圖報，通常用繩子報。"
L["How kind, {name}! You're on the caravan's good list now."] = "真好心，{name}！你上了商隊的好人名單啦。"
L["Oh, I'll keep this, {name}! I keep everything. Here's one for you."] = "這我要留著，{name}！我什麼都留。這份給你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Here's yours back. Well, a new one. Hardly used."] = "謝啦，{name}！還你。呃，新的，幾乎沒用過。"
L["My ears just went straight up, {name}. That means I'm very pleased."] = "我的耳朵豎起來了，{name}，代表我超開心。"
L["By tonight's campfire, {name}, this story will have a sandworm in it. Thanks!"] = "今晚營火邊，{name}，這故事會多一隻沙蟲。謝啦！"
L["I'd gift-wrap yours, {name}, but all my wrapping is somebody's old map."] = "本想包裝，{name}，但包裝紙都是別人的舊地圖。"
L["The alpacas saw that, {name}. They'll tell everyone how nice you are. Thanks!"] = "羊駝都看到了，{name}，會到處說你人真好。謝啦！"
L["Thank you, {name}! I'd give you my best button, but this is better. Slightly."] = "謝謝，{name}！這比我最好的鈕扣還棒。一點點。"
L["Ooh, a present, {name}! I'll trade you one of mine."] = "哇，禮物，{name}！我拿一樣我的跟你換。"
L["Thanks, {name}! That goes in the good pouch. Not the rock pouch. The good one."] = "謝啦，{name}！收寶貝袋，不是石頭袋。寶貝袋！"
L["In Vol'dun that would've cost a whole waterskin, {name}. Thank you!"] = "這在沃魯敦值一整袋水，{name}。謝謝！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Your name goes on the wagon. Between the alpaca and the dent."] = "謝啦，{name}！名字寫到車上，羊駝跟凹痕之間。"
L["Kindness is the one thing the desert never buried, {name}. Thank you."] = "沙漠什麼都埋，就是埋不了善意，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Rakera says repay quick, {name}, before you forget which pocket it's in. Here!"] = "族長說快還，{name}，免得忘了在哪個口袋。來！"
L["Nobody's given me anything I didn't dig up first, {name}. Thank you!"] = "第一次收到不是我挖出來的東西，{name}。謝謝！"
L["Of course, {name}! Shake the sand out and hold still."] = "當然，{name}！抖掉沙子，站好別動。"
L["Coming right up, {name}! Caravan service, no waiting."] = "這就來，{name}！商隊服務，不用等！"
L["Sure, {name}! Let me dig it out... rope, rocks, a nice rock... here it is!"] = "{name}，等等……繩子、石頭、漂亮石頭……有了！"
L["Hold on, {name}! Tail's in the way, one moment... there!"] = "等等，{name}！尾巴擋到了，稍等……好了！"
L["One {buff}, {name}! Only slightly sandy."] = "{buff}一份，{name}！沾了點沙。"
L["Ask a vulpera and you'll get something, {name}. Usually odd. Not today!"] = "狐狸人有求必應，{name}，常常很怪。今天正常！"
L["Yours, {name}! Vulpera love giving things. Almost as much as finding them."] = "給你，{name}！狐狸人愛送東西，就跟愛撿一樣。"
L["Here, {name}! Patched it up myself. Holds better than it looks."] = "給你，{name}！我自己補的，比看起來牢靠。"
L["Sure, {name}! Stand upwind. Sandstorm last week; I'm still shedding it."] = "好，{name}！站上風處。上週沙塵暴，我還在掉沙。"
L["YES! Sorry, {name}, too loud? The desert's very big. You have to shout in it."] = "好！抱歉，{name}，太大聲？沙漠很大，要用喊的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Caravan rule: nobody asks twice for water or for help."] = "當然，{name}。商隊規矩：水和幫忙，不必問兩次。"
L["On it, {name}! Small spell, big fox, bigger ears. Wait. Other way round."] = "來，{name}！法術小、狐狸大……不對，說反了。"
L["For you, {name}? Easy! Caravan folk never say no to a neighbour."] = "給你？簡單，{name}！商隊的人從不拒絕鄰居。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}. I checked: not a rock."] = "出門總要帶點盤纏，{name}。我檢查過，不是石頭。"
L["Keep this, {name}. The desert is long and the water is short."] = "收下吧，{name}。沙漠漫長，飲水難尋。"
L["Found this lying around, {name}. Kidding! It's fresh. Take it!"] = "路邊撿到的，{name}。開玩笑的！新鮮的，拿去！"
L["Here, {name}. Best thing in my pack, and I've got a lot of pack."] = "給你，{name}。我背包裡最好的，而我背包超大。"
L["In the dunes you share your shade and your spells, {name}. Here."] = "在沙丘上，陰涼和法術都要分享，{name}。給你。"
L["Some {buff} for you, {name}. I'd haggle, but you look busy."] = "{buff}給你，{name}。想跟你殺價，但你好像在忙。"
L["A gift from the whole caravan, {name}! They'll never know."] = "整個商隊送你的，{name}！他們不會知道的。"
L["For the road, {name}. Roads are the best part. Roads, and snacks."] = "路上用，{name}。路是最棒的。路，還有零食。"
L["Here, {name}! I swapped a hat for a thing, and the thing for this. Good trade!"] = "給你，{name}！帽子換東西，東西換這個。賺到！"
L["Nobody walks past anybody in the dunes, {name}. Bad luck, and rude. Here."] = "沙丘上不能見人就走，{name}。會衰又失禮。拿去。"
L["My nose says trouble's ahead of you, {name}. Take this. My nose is never wrong."] = "鼻子說前面有麻煩，{name}。拿著，鼻子不會錯。"
L["Too many spells in my pack, {name}. They jingle. Take one, please."] = "包裡法術太多，{name}，叮叮噹噹。拜託拿一個。"
L["If you find anything shiny later, {name}, you know where my ears are. Here!"] = "看到亮晶晶的，{name}，找這對耳朵就對了。給你！"
L["Wait, {name}! You nearly left without this. Deserts eat people who do that."] = "等等，{name}！差點空手走。沙漠專吃空手的。"
L["Stew's not ready yet, {name}, so this is the starter."] = "燉菜還沒好，{name}，先上這道開胃菜。"
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}, nor its gifts."] = "同是旅人！商隊從不遠，{name}，禮物也不遠。"
L["Ears up, {name}! Always nice to share a spell with a fellow fox."] = "耳朵豎起來，{name}！跟同是狐狸的分享法術真好。"
L["Vulpera to vulpera, {name}: here's this. I've three spare spoons too."] = "狐人對狐人，{name}：給你這個。我還有三把備用勺子。"
L["Vol'dun raised us both, {name}. Sand in the fur, luck in the pack. Have some."] = "沃頓把我們倆都養大了，{name}。毛裡有沙，包裡有運氣。分你一點。"
L["Ears to ears, {name}: I heard you needed this."] = "耳朵對耳朵，{name}：我聽說你需要這個。"
L["Remember the caravan fires, {name}? Everybody sang badly and shared. Here."] = "還記得商隊的篝火嗎，{name}？大家唱得難聽，可都肯分享。拿著。"
L["Vol'dun's far behind us, {name}, half of it in our fur. This I brought for you."] = "沃頓已經遠了，{name}，一半還在咱們毛裡。這個是我專門帶給你的。"
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stick together, share water and this. Never the alpaca."] = "商隊規矩，{name}：一起走，水和這個都要分。羊駝不分。"
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. This shiny bit is yours."] = "裡面閃閃發亮的，{name}，都是我先看見的。這塊亮晶晶的歸你。"
L["One for the party, {name}! A caravan's only as fast as its slowest alpaca."] = "全隊一份，{name}！商隊的速度取決於最慢的羊駝。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep your pack shut. I don't mean to take things. I give, too."] = "拿著，{name}。背包扣好。我不是故意拿東西的。我也送東西。"
L["Lost in a city, never in a cave, {name}. Caves are houses with no rent. Here."] = "在城裡會迷路，在洞裡從不，{name}。洞穴就是不收房租的房子。拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'm small, so I'll check the tiny tunnels. You take the big."] = "拿著，{name}。我個子小，小地道我來查。大的歸你們。"
L["Shout if you need more, {name}. I've probably got it. It's probably dented."] = "還要就喊，{name}。我多半有。多半還癟了。"
L["There, {name}. I'll take the back. Nobody gets left behind in a caravan."] = "好了，{name}。我殿後。商隊裡沒人會被落下。"
L["A caravan with no wagon, {name}! Fast, light, nowhere to nap. Here's a boost."] = "沒有車的商隊，{name}！又快又輕，就是沒地方打盹。給你加把勁。"
L["Scouted ahead by nose, {name}: danger and old cheese. Take this first."] = "用鼻子探過前面了，{name}：有危險，還有陳年奶酪味。先拿著這個。"
L["Everybody fed? Everybody watered? Good. Now this, {name}. Caravan order."] = "吃飽了？喝足了？好。{name}，再來這個。商隊規矩。"
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids, and this."] = "我們狐人夜裡趕路，{name}。涼沙、犯睏的蠍子，還有這個。"
L["Desert nights get cold, {name}. Here, something warm-ish."] = "沙漠夜裡冷，{name}。來，這個還算暖。"
L["Stars out, {name}. All signposts, and I can't read them. I can give you this."] = "星星出來了，{name}。全是路標，可我看不懂。這個我倒能給你。"
L["Good hour for foxes, {name}. The ears work best when it's quiet. So does this."] = "狐狸的好時辰，{name}。四下安靜時耳朵最靈。這個也是。"
L["Past dark and I'm just waking up, {name}. First thing: this, for you."] = "天黑了我才剛醒，{name}。頭一件事：把這個給你。"
L["I'll curl up in my tail later, {name}. Best blanket I own. First, this."] = "尾巴是我最好的被子，{name}。晚點再窩，先給你這個。"
L["Every caravan needs a friend like you, {name}."] = "每支商隊都需要你這樣的朋友，{name}。"
L["The desert's kinder with you beside me, {name}."] = "有你在身邊，沙漠都溫柔了，{name}。"
L["You and me against the sands, {name}. Always."] = "你和我，一起對抗風沙，{name}。永遠。"
L["Ha! Clever and quick, {name}! A true caravan guardian."] = "哈！又聰明又敏捷，{name}！真正的商隊守護者。"
L["Well done, {name}! The whole caravan will hear about this."] = "幹得好，{name}！整個商隊都會聽說這事。"
L["Sharp work, {name}! Nobody messes with our camp."] = "俐落，{name}！誰也別想動咱們的營地。"
L["Easy, {name}. Curl up and rest. I'll keep watch."] = "別急，{name}。蜷起來歇著吧。我守著。"
L["There now, {name}. Every caravan stops to tend its own."] = "好了，{name}。商隊總會停下來照顧自己人。"
L["Breathe, {name}. The sand can wait. You come first."] = "呼吸，{name}。風沙可以等，你最要緊。"
L["A kindness returned is a kindness doubled, {name}."] = "投桃報李，善意加倍，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have restored my balance."] = "謝謝你，{name}。你讓我重歸平衡。"
L["Somewhere, a Sha just went hungry. Thank you, {name}."] = "某處的煞剛餓了一頓。謝謝你，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Aysa would bow, Ji would cheer. I will do both, badly."] = "謝謝，{name}！像艾莎鞠躬、像吉歡呼，都很拙。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I will think of you at my next meal, and the one after."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一餐我會想起你，下下餐也會。"
L["Chen always said: never refuse a gift. Or a drink. Thank you, {name}."] = "老陳說過：禮不可拒，酒也是。謝啦，{name}。"
L["I was about to nap, {name}, but this is better. Slightly. Thank you."] = "正想睡個午覺，{name}，這更好。一點點。謝謝。"
L["A hozen would have thrown something, {name}. I was raised better. Thank you."] = "換成猴人早就丟東西了，{name}。我有家教。謝謝。"
L["That was very pandaren of you, {name}. All that's missing is a dumpling."] = "你這很有熊貓人風範，{name}。就只差一顆餃子了。"
L["At Halfhill that earns a prize turnip, {name}. I left mine at home. Thank you."] = "半丘市會頒你冠軍蘿蔔，{name}。我的忘在家，先謝啦。"
L["Grandmother kept a jar of kindnesses, {name}. Yours goes in; this comes out."] = "奶奶有個善意罐，{name}。你的放進去，這個拿出來。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In the Jade Forest my door is open, and my pantry more so."] = "謝謝，{name}。翠玉林我家大門常開，廚房全天營業。"
L["You move like the Shado-Pan, {name}. I never saw that coming. Thank you."] = "身手跟影潘一樣，{name}，我連影子都沒看到。謝謝！"
L["Like rain on a rice paddy, {name}. The paddy never says thank you. I do."] = "如稻田逢甘霖，{name}。稻田不會道謝，我會。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Li Li would put this in her travel journal. With drawings."] = "謝謝，{name}。莉莉會把這寫進旅行日記，還附插圖。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The August Celestials are busy, so I thank you for all four."] = "四大天神都在忙，{name}，我一口氣替四位謝你。"
L["Stormstout ale knocks a pandaren flat, {name}. So did that. Thank you."] = "風暴烈酒能放倒熊貓人，{name}。你這一下也是。謝謝！"
L["Now we are even, {name}. A pandaren never lets a kindness go cold."] = "這下扯平了，{name}。熊貓人從不讓人情放涼。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done. Patience is the slow part."] = "當然，{name}。有耐心就成。耐心是比較慢的那步。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. A kind deed is never wasted."] = "樂意效勞，{name}。善行從不白費。"
L["At once, {name}. Quick for a pandaren, which is not saying much."] = "馬上，{name}。以熊貓人標準算快，雖然標準不高。"
L["Master Shang Xi said: help whoever asks, {name}. I listened."] = "師父說過：有求必應，{name}。我聽進去了。"
L["A Tushui master would make you meditate first, {name}. I will skip that part."] = "水派大師會叫你先打坐，{name}。這步我省了。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Except the last dumpling. Let us not be silly."] = "什麼都給你，{name}。除了最後一顆餃子，別傻了。"
L["One {buff}, {name}, brewed strong. The recipe stays a secret."] = "一份{buff}，{name}，特濃釀造。配方保密。"
L["Stand like a crane, {name}: one leg, calm face. Two legs is also fine."] = "像鶴那樣站，{name}：單腳，神情淡定。兩腳也行。"
L["We never refuse a request, {name}. Or a second helping."] = "我們從不拒絕請求，{name}。也不拒絕添飯。"
L["The last to ask me for help, {name}, was an island-sized turtle. You're easier."] = "上個拜託我的是隻像島的烏龜，{name}。你好辦多了。"
L["Pandaren help like we cook, {name}: slowly, generously, and far too much of it."] = "熊貓人幫忙跟煮飯一樣，{name}：慢、大方、份量爆多。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Let me put down my bowl. ...There. That was the hard part."] = "當然，{name}。先放下碗……好了。最難的部分完成。"
L["Yes, {name}. Grandfather said never make guests ask twice. He said it twice."] = "好，{name}。爺爺說別讓客人開口兩次。他說了兩次。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I am calm, you are calm, the spell is calm. Nobody panic."] = "別動，{name}。我淡定，你淡定，法術也淡定。別慌。"
L["Take this, {name}. And perhaps a cup of tea afterward?"] = "給你，{name}。待會兒一起喝杯茶？"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Take this, and go with a light heart."] = "凡事講平衡，{name}。拿著這個，輕鬆上路吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. A grummle would sell it to you for a luckydo."] = "拿著，{name}。山上的挑夫會跟你要幸運符換。"
L["The jinyu say the waters foretold this, {name}. They say that a lot."] = "錦魚人說這是水的預言，{name}。他們常這麼說。"
L["The Huojin say act first. The Tushui say think first. I say: here, {name}."] = "火派說先做，水派說先想。我說：拿去，{name}。"
L["A pandaren stood up to give you this, {name}. Treasure it."] = "熊貓人特地站起來給的，{name}。要珍惜。"
L["Fight like a monk, {name}: calm, quick, blessed, and then a long lunch."] = "像武僧一樣戰鬥，{name}：沉穩、迅捷、受了祝福，然後吃頓長長的午飯。"
L["Go gently with this, {name}. The turtle got where it was going, unhurried."] = "帶著這個慢慢走，{name}。大龜不慌不忙，也到了要去的地方。"
L["A hug would be forward, {name}. This is next best, and less furry."] = "抱抱太冒昧了，{name}。這是次選，毛比較少。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a fight finds you, roll away. Rolling is very underrated."] = "拿著，{name}。要是架找上你，就滾開。打滾被嚴重低估了。"
L["For you, {name}. It is warm, round and full of good intentions. Like me."] = "給你，{name}。溫暖、圓滾滾、滿滿好意。跟我一樣。"
L["Take this, {name}. My kite is stuck in a tree, so I have time for good deeds."] = "拿著，{name}。我的風箏卡在樹上，剛好有空做好事。"
L["I carried this from Pandaria, {name}. Also a keg. The keg is mine."] = "從潘達利亞帶來的，{name}。還扛了桶酒。酒是我的。"
L["The virmen stole my carrots, {name}, but this they will never get. Here."] = "兔妖偷走我的紅蘿蔔，{name}，這個牠們別想拿。給你。"
L["On the Wandering Isle, {name}, strangers get soup. This travels better."] = "在漂流島，{name}，陌生人都有湯喝。這個比較好帶。"
L["Pandaren look soft, {name}. So does this, until it saves you."] = "熊貓人看著軟乎，{name}。這個也是，直到它救你一命。"
L["Chi-Ji says there is always hope, {name}. I say there is always a spare. Here."] = "赤吉說永遠有希望，{name}。我說永遠有備用的。給你。"
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}! For now, share this."] = "等路上得閒，咱們得一起喝一壺，{name}！眼下先分這個。"
L["Shen-zin Su would be proud of us, {name}, and of this. Or asleep. Hard to tell."] = "神龜沈尊會為咱們驕傲的，{name}，也會為這個驕傲。或者在睡覺。說不好。"
L["Two pandaren, {name}. An innkeeper just felt a chill. Here, it warms."] = "兩個熊貓人，{name}。某個旅店老闆剛打了個寒顫。拿著，這個暖身。"
L["Liu Lang would approve, {name}: two of us far from home, sharing. Here."] = "劉浪會贊同的，{name}：我們倆離家好遠，還互相分享。拿著。"
L["Tushui or Huojin, {name}, we both left the turtle. Here's a taste of home."] = "不管水派火派，{name}，咱們都下了龜背。嘗嘗家鄉的味道。"
L["Pandaren to pandaren, {name}: the brews out here are thin. This is not."] = "熊貓人對熊貓人，{name}：外頭的酒太淡了。這個可不淡。"
L["We both smell of rice wine and road dust, {name}. This smells of neither. Here."] = "咱倆身上都是米酒和塵土味，{name}。這個兩樣都沒有。拿著。"
L["Pandaren look after pandaren, {name}. Mostly by feeding them. This comes first."] = "熊貓人照顧熊貓人，{name}，主要靠餵。這是前菜。"
L["A gift, a fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order."] = "先送禮，再打架，然後吃飯，{name}。這才是正確順序。"
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm now, and ready."] = "待在一起，{name}，像蒸籠裡的餃子。現在熱乎了，準備好了。"
L["We move as one, {name}, and now blessed as one. Slowly, perhaps."] = "我們如一人般前進，{name}，現在也如一人般受了祝福。也許慢一點。"
L["Balance, {name}: one fights, one heals, one carries snacks. And one gives this."] = "平衡，{name}：一個打，一個治，一個背零食。還有一個送這個。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we fall, we fall together, and then nap. Let us not."] = "拿著，{name}。要倒一起倒，然後睡一覺。還是別了。"
L["Here, {name}. Stay behind me. I am soft, but I am very wide."] = "拿著，{name}。待我後面。我軟，但我很寬。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we win, I will cook. If we lose, I will cook, but sadly."] = "拿著，{name}。贏了我下廚。輸了我也下廚，就是傷心點。"
L["Breathe, {name}. In, and out. Feel that? Now hit things, calmly."] = "呼吸，{name}。吸氣，呼氣。感覺到了嗎？現在，沉著地揍。"
L["Quickly, {name}, take this. I am in a hurry. It happens about once a decade."] = "快，{name}，拿著。我趕時間。大約十年才這麼一次。"
L["A party is like a brew, {name}: odd ingredients. I've just added one more."] = "隊伍就像一壺酒，{name}：配料古怪。我剛又加了一味。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, roll me somewhere safe. Carrying me is not an option."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是倒了，把我滾到安全的地方。扛我是不可能的。"
L["Pandaren fight like water, {name}. This flows into you: calm, then everywhere."] = "熊貓人打起來像水，{name}。這個流進你身體裡：先是平靜，然後無處不在。"
L["Up before the tea, {name}? Brave. Here, instead of the tea."] = "茶還沒泡就起床？{name}，勇敢。以此代茶。"
L["Morning, {name}. First this, then breakfast, then more breakfast."] = "早，{name}。先這個，再早餐，然後再來點早餐。"
L["A new day, {name}, and nobody has spilled anything. Let us begin with this."] = "新的一天，{name}，還沒人灑東西。就從這個開始吧。"
L["Halfhill's farmers have been up for hours, {name}. I just rose, but with this."] = "半丘市農夫起床好幾小時了，{name}。我剛起，不過帶著這個。"
L["Morning mist, {name}. Just like home, until a kobold walked by. Have this."] = "晨霧，{name}。跟家鄉一模一樣，直到一個狗頭人走過去。拿著。"
L["Good morning, {name}. My stomach woke first and ordered me to give you this."] = "早安，{name}。我的肚子先醒的，命令我把這個給你。"
L["Past my first nap, {name}, before my second. Take this while I'm awake."] = "第一覺睡過，第二覺還沒睡，{name}。趁我醒著拿著。"
L["Late, {name}. The brewmasters sleep. The brews don't, and nor does this."] = "很晚了，{name}。酒仙們睡了。酒沒睡，這個也沒睡。"
L["Midnight snack time, {name}. This is the appetiser."] = "宵夜時間，{name}。這是開胃菜。"
L["Dark already, {name}? Grandfather's stories would start now. Take this first."] = "天已經黑了，{name}？爺爺的故事該開講了。先拿著這個。"
L["The moon is round and full tonight, {name}, as I am. Here, from both of us."] = "今晚月亮又圓又滿，{name}，跟我一樣。拿著，我倆一起送的。"
L["Patience and friendship, {name}. You have both."] = "耐心與友誼，{name}。你兩樣都有。"
L["Sit with me a moment, {name}. The road will wait."] = "陪我坐一會兒，{name}。路不會跑的。"
L["Life is better with good company, {name}. And good tea."] = "有好夥伴，日子更好，{name}。再加一壺好茶。"
L["Well done, {name}! Balance and strength, together."] = "幹得好，{name}！平衡與力量合一。"
L["Wonderful, {name}! That deserves a feast. Maybe two."] = "太棒了，{name}！值得一頓大餐。也許兩頓。"
L["Ha! Swift as a monk's fist, {name}."] = "哈！快得像武僧的拳頭，{name}。"
L["Rest, {name}. Breathe deep. Find your balance again."] = "歇吧，{name}。深呼吸。重新找回平衡。"
L["Easy, {name}. The wounds will heal; the spirit endures."] = "別急，{name}。傷會好，心志長存。"
L["Quiet now, {name}. Let the pain drift away like mist."] = "安靜，{name}。讓疼痛像霧一樣散去。"
L["Your kindness is noted, {name}. Dragons do not forget."] = "好意我記住了，{name}。龍族從不遺忘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned on swift wings."] = "謝謝，{name}。乘疾翼回禮！"
L["Wings, fire and scales, {name}, and still you thought I needed help. Touching."] = "有翼有火有鱗，{name}，你還想幫我。真感人。"
L["I would bow, {name}, but last time my wings cleared a table. Thank you."] = "想鞠躬，{name}，但上次翅膀掃翻了整桌。謝謝你。"
L["That goes straight into my hoard, {name}. Kind deeds are the only gold I keep."] = "直接收進寶庫，{name}。我只囤善行這種金子。"
L["I was made to be a weapon, {name}. I much prefer this part. Thank you."] = "我被造成武器，{name}，但更愛這部分。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Wrathion would have made a speech of it. I will not."] = "謝謝，{name}。瑞希歐會為此發表演說。我不會。"
L["Returned with a little fire in it, {name}. Only a little. I am practising."] = "還你，附帶一點火，{name}。只有一點。我在練習。"
L["A mortal gift, {name}: small, brief and kind. I am learning to like all three."] = "凡人的禮：小、短、暖，{name}。這三樣我正學著喜歡。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Mortal customs are new to me. Do I pay you? No? Then this."] = "謝謝，{name}。凡人規矩我不熟。付錢？不用？那回這個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I have scales where most have feelings. That got through."] = "謝謝，{name}。我全身是鱗刀槍不入，卻被你打動了。"
L["You're on my list of favourite mortals, {name}. It was empty until today."] = "我的愛凡人名單上有你了，{name}。今天以前是空白的。"
L["The red in me is grateful, {name}. The black in me is suspicious. The red wins."] = "我體內的紅龍很感激，{name}，黑龍很懷疑。紅龍勝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Dragons are not used to receiving. I find I like it."] = "謝謝，{name}。龍不習慣收禮。我發現我挺喜歡的。"
L["A dragon's thanks comes with a roar, {name}. I will spare the neighbours."] = "龍道謝要配一聲咆哮，{name}。為了鄰居，就省了。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand still, I would hate to singe you."] = "好吧，{name}。站好，我可不想燒焦你。"
L["Granted, {name}. A dragon keeps its word."] = "應允了，{name}。龍族一諾千金。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear of the tail."] = "當然，{name}。離尾巴遠點。"
L["Of course, {name}. Is this still how it is done? I was asleep for a while."] = "當然，{name}。現在還這麼做嗎？我睡了一小陣子。"
L["Gladly, {name}. All five dragonflights are in me, and all five say yes."] = "樂意，{name}。我體內的五大龍族，五票全數贊成。"
L["Right away, {name}. Dragon-sized help, in a conveniently smaller form."] = "馬上來，{name}。巨龍級援手，隨身迷你版。"
L["Of course, {name}. Neltharion only gave orders. A request is much nicer."] = "當然，{name}。奈薩里奧只會下令，被拜託好多了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stand back a little; I am still learning how big I am."] = "馬上，{name}。退後點，我還在摸清自己有多大隻。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Claws are not ideal for spellwork, but I manage."] = "當然，{name}。爪子不太適合施法，但我應付得來。"
L["Of course, {name}. Dragons usually demand tribute. I'm waiving it, this once."] = "當然，{name}。龍通常要收貢品。這次免了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't scream. Mortals often do. It's the horns."] = "當然，{name}。請別尖叫，凡人常這樣。都是角的錯。"
L["My breath is fire, {name}, so we will do this the other way."] = "我吹的不是仙氣是火，{name}，所以換個方式。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mortals so rarely ask a dragon for anything but mercy."] = "樂意，{name}。凡人求龍，向來只求饒命。"
L["A small magic, {name}, but I cast it with enormous dignity."] = "小小法術，{name}，但我施放得無比莊嚴。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies. Especially one this size."] = "拿著，{name}。龍也需要盟友，尤其是小號的龍。"
L["A gift from the Dragon Isles, {name}. Fly well."] = "巨龍群島的禮物，{name}。好好飛吧。"
L["Alexstrasza says every life is precious, {name}. I am starting with yours."] = "雅立史卓莎說命都珍貴，{name}。我從你這條開始。"
L["I slept through ten thousand years of good deeds, {name}. Catching up now."] = "我睡掉了一萬年的善行，{name}。現在來補進度。"
L["Tell them a dragon did this, {name}. It sounds far grander than it was."] = "就說是龍幫你的，{name}。聽起來比實際氣派多了。"
L["Scalecommander's orders, {name}: take this. I'm no Scalecommander, but still."] = "鱗長有令，{name}：拿著這個。我不是鱗長，但氣勢要到。"
L["Take this, {name}. Ancient dragon magic, only slightly out of date."] = "拿著，{name}。上古龍魔法，版本只舊了一點點。"
L["A dragon giving, {name}, not taking. I am trying something new."] = "龍在送東西，{name}，不是搶。我在嘗試新作風。"
L["In visage form I look harmless, {name}. So did Lady Prestor. I give, not take."] = "人形的我很無害，{name}。普瑞斯托女士也是。我是給予，不是索取。"
L["A gift from above, {name}. I landed specially. It took two tries."] = "天降好禮，{name}。我專程降落，落了兩次才成功。"
L["Here, {name}. Every dragon should guard something. I have chosen you, for now."] = "給你，{name}。每條龍都該守護點什麼。暫時就選你了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's from five dragonflights, so it clashes with everything."] = "拿著，{name}。五大龍族聯名款，跟什麼都撞色。"
L["I'd fly you there myself, {name}, but dracthyr carry no riders. Take this."] = "本想載你飛過去，{name}，但半龍人不載人。拿著吧。"
L["Dragons gifted the world at its dawn, {name}. Mine is smaller, and later."] = "巨龍在創世之初送過禮，{name}。我的小一點，晚一點。"
L["A little essence for you, {name}. It is what I'm made of, so handle it gently."] = "一點精華給你，{name}。我就是它做的，輕拿輕放。"
L["Take this, {name}. It will feel warm. Most things do, after I touch them."] = "拿著，{name}。會有點熱。被我碰過的大多如此。"
L["The Forbidden Reach is far behind us, {name}. What we learned there, I share."] = "禁忌之境已遠在身後，{name}。在那裡學到的，我分享給你。"
L["Two dracthyr, {name}. Mind the wings; no room for four. Take this."] = "兩個半龍人，{name}。當心翅膀，四隻可張不開。拿著。"
L["Remember when the world was new to us, {name}? This still feels new."] = "還記得世界對我們來說還很新的時候嗎，{name}？這個感覺依然新鮮。"
L["In visage form nobody can tell, {name}. Between us: this suits scales best."] = "人形狀態誰也看不出來，{name}。咱倆之間說：這個配鱗片最好看。"
L["Made for war, {name}, and look at us: sharing. Somebody's plans went wrong."] = "生來為戰，{name}，結果我們在分享。某人的計畫泡湯了。"
L["Visage or scales, {name}, I'd know one of us anywhere. So here is yours."] = "人形也好鱗身也罷，{name}，同族我一眼就認得。所以，這份是你的。"
L["Mortals always ask if we'll fly them, {name}. Still no. But this, yes."] = "凡人總問我們能不能載他們飛，{name}。還是不行。不過這個可以。"
L["Between dracthyr, {name}: the horns never get easier with hats. This helps."] = "半龍人之間說，{name}：長著角，戴帽子永遠彆扭。這個有幫助。"
L["Take this, {name}. Then tell me when to breathe fire. And when not to."] = "拿著，{name}。然後告訴我什麼時候噴火。還有什麼時候別噴。"
L["I woke in a cave of strangers, {name}. Now I give gifts to company. Better."] = "我在滿是陌生人的洞裡醒來，{name}。現在我給同伴送禮。好多了。"
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We improved on him. Here."] = "奈薩里奧造我們是讓我們獨自作戰，{name}。我們比他強。拿著。"
L["Here, {name}. Stay clear of my tail. It hasn't learned whose side it's on."] = "拿著，{name}。離我尾巴遠點。牠還沒搞清楚自己站哪邊。"
L["A flight of our own, {name}, sharing its gifts. So this is what dragons meant."] = "我們自己的龍群，{name}，互相分享恩賜。原來巨龍說的是這個。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I say 'take cover', I mean behind my wings."] = "拿著，{name}。我喊「找掩護」，意思是躲我翅膀後面。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Stand beside me, never in front. I can't aim my breath."] = "給你的，{name}。站我旁邊，別站前面。我的吐息瞄不準。"
L["Take this, {name}; leave the big ones to me. Well, the ones smaller than me."] = "拿著，{name}；大傢伙交給我。嗯，比我小的那些。"
L["Stay close, {name}, blessed. I can glide us all down. Up is your problem."] = "帶著祝福跟緊，{name}。我能帶大家滑翔下去。往上就看你了。"
L["Keep moving, {name}. A dragon in a hurry gives gifts. One waiting is just big."] = "繼續走，{name}。趕路的龍會送禮。乾等的龍只是個頭大。"
L["Here, {name}. Now tell me the plan slowly. I was made for battles, not plans."] = "拿著，{name}。現在慢慢跟我講計畫。我是為打仗造的，不是為計畫。"
L["Mortals live so briefly, {name}. This should make today a little longer."] = "凡人活得太短了，{name}。這個能讓今天稍微長一點。"
L["You're a good companion, {name}. Better than most dragons."] = "你是個好夥伴，{name}。比大多數龍都強。"
L["Stay near, {name}. I'll keep you warm when the wind turns."] = "靠近點，{name}。風向變了，我給你取暖。"
L["I slept for ten thousand years, {name}, and woke to find you."] = "我沉睡了一萬年，{name}，醒來便遇見了你。"
L["Excellent, {name}. You fight like a true dragonflight."] = "好極了，{name}。你戰鬥起來像真正的龍族軍團。"
L["Impressive, {name}. Not even a black dragon could do better."] = "厲害，{name}。連黑龍都做不到更好。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Dragon Isles have a new champion."] = "幹得好，{name}！巨龍群島有了新的勇士。"
L["Easy, {name}. I've weathered storms; we'll weather this."] = "別急，{name}。風暴我都挺過來了，這次也能。"
L["Rest, {name}. I'll shield you with my wings."] = "歇吧，{name}。我用翅膀護著你。"
L["Stay calm, {name}. The flames are mine to bear, not yours."] = "冷靜，{name}。火焰由我來扛，不是你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Where I come from, a kindness is tended like a root."] = "謝謝你，{name}。在我家鄉，善意要像樹根一樣細心照料。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Hagar sent me to see the goddess's work. You're her best."] = "謝謝你，{name}。哈嘉爾派我來看女神的造物。你是其中最好的。"
L["Kindness echoes, {name}, and I grew up in a cavern. Here it comes back to you."] = "善意會有回音，{name}，而我是在洞穴裡長大的。喏，它回到你身上了。"
L["My Legacy Stone showed who I'd stand beside, {name}. It forgot you. Thank you."] = "我的傳承石讓我看過將來會與誰並肩，{name}。它漏了你。謝謝你。"
L["We read lives in a root's rings, {name}. Yours just grew a kind one."] = "我們從樹根的年輪讀人的一生，{name}。你的又添了善良的一圈。"
L["The Shul'ka gave up everything to guard us, {name}. I can give this much."] = "蘇卡捨棄一切守護我們，{name}。一聲謝謝，我總還給得起。"
L["The world is more than Harandar, the Song said, {name}. Thanks for proving it."] = "女神的歌聲說過，世界遠不止哈朗達，{name}。謝謝你證明了這點。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Orweyna said outsiders had much to teach us. I'm learning."] = "謝謝你，{name}。歐薇娜說外來者有很多能教我們的。我正在學。"
L["Our oaths forbid speaking to outsiders, {name}. I'll risk a thank you."] = "誓言不准我們跟外來者說話，{name}。冒個險，說聲謝謝。"
L["My people lived up here once, {name}. Thanks to you, I can see why."] = "我的族人從前也住在地上，{name}。有你在，我懂為什麼了。"
L["We're raised on dedication and humility, {name}, so I'll just say thank you."] = "我們從小被教導要勤勉、要謙遜，{name}，所以我只說聲謝謝。"
L["Back home I'd dance for that, {name}. Up here people stare, so: thank you."] = "在家鄉的話，我會為此跳支舞，{name}。地上的人愛盯著看，那就：謝謝你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've left me glowing like a moth back in Harandar."] = "謝謝你，{name}。你讓我亮得像哈朗達的飛蛾。"
L["Har'mara is the Village of Balance, {name}. I'd hate to go home lopsided."] = "哈瑪拉最講究平衡，{name}。我可不想歪一邊回家。"
L["If Aln'hara can hear anything where she is, {name}, I hope she heard that."] = "艾恩哈拉如今無論在哪，{name}，只要還聽得見，希望她聽到了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Protect, tend and serve, my people say. This is the serving."] = "當然，{name}。守護、照料、效勞，我的族人常這麼說。這就是效勞。"
L["Of course, {name}. I answered the goddess's call. Yours is far easier to hear."] = "當然，{name}。女神的召喚我都回應了，你的聲音可清楚多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Dalnir would call this a distraction. Dalnir isn't here."] = "當然，{name}。達尼爾會說這是不務正業。達尼爾又不在。"
L["Of course, {name}. The roots never ask for anything. It's nice to be asked."] = "當然，{name}。樹根從來不開口。有人開口拜託我，感覺真不錯。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Back home I'd have had to pretend I never saw you."] = "樂意，{name}。要是在家鄉，我還得假裝沒看到你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Mind the quills; they're friendlier than they look."] = "當然，{name}。小心那些刺，它們比看起來友善。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Don't stand still too long; in Harandar you'd sprout mushrooms."] = "樂意，{name}。別站著太久不動，在哈朗達你會長出蘑菇的。"
L["Of course, {name}. I was raised to do exactly as I was told. For once, I will."] = "當然，{name}。我從小被教導要言聽計從。這次，我就聽一回。"
L["No alndust in this one, {name}. Nothing will come to life and bite you."] = "這次沒摻艾恩之塵，{name}。不會有東西活過來咬你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Half the names up here are new to me. Yours I'll keep."] = "當然，{name}。地上一半的名字我都沒聽過。你的我記住了。"
L["{buff}, {name}, grown under the World Trees and picked fresh."] = "{buff}，{name}，在世界之樹下長成，新鮮現摘。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hagar is handling things at home; I'll handle them up here."] = "當然，{name}。家裡有哈嘉爾照應，地上這邊歸我。"
L["At my initiation I was asked who I really am, {name}. Someone who says yes."] = "成年儀式上，有人問我究竟是誰，{name}。答案是：一個會說「好」的人。"
L["Take this, {name}, from a long way below. The roots send their regards."] = "拿著，{name}，這可是從地底深處來的。樹根們向你問好。"
L["Take this, {name}, and may Aln'hara be with you."] = "拿著，{name}，願艾恩哈拉與你同在。"
L["The sky has no ceiling, {name}. Anything could fall on you. Take this."] = "天空沒有頂，{name}，什麼都可能砸到你頭上。拿著。"
L["Follow the visions, Hagar said, {name}. Today they pointed at you. Take this."] = "哈嘉爾說，要追隨幻象，{name}。今天它們指向了你。拿著。"
L["My people would have watched you from the brush, {name}. I'd rather do this."] = "換作我的族人，只會躲在草叢裡看著你，{name}。我寧可這樣。"
L["Harandar stayed out of the world's wars, {name}. You weren't so lucky. Here."] = "哈朗達避開了世上的戰爭，{name}。你可沒這麼幸運。給。"
L["The Zur'ashar paint every tale worth telling, {name}. Here; make yours long."] = "值得傳頌的故事，祖拉夏都會畫下來，{name}。拿著；讓你的故事長長久久。"
L["Take this, {name}. The goddess's world is a garden, and gardens have thorns."] = "拿著，{name}。女神的世界是座花園，花園裡有刺。"
L["We tend roots in Harandar, {name}. You look as if you could use some tending."] = "在哈朗達，我們照料樹根，{name}。你看起來也需要照料一下。"
L["My ancestors grew restless and sought a purpose, {name}. I've found mine. Here."] = "我的先祖按捺不住，出去尋找使命，{name}。我找到我的了。給。"
L["Har'mara lives at peace with its neighbours, {name}. This is how it begins."] = "哈瑪拉與鄰為善，{name}。就是這樣開始的。"
L["The first outsiders I met were fighting off a saptor, {name}. Best take this."] = "我遇見的第一批外來者正在對付一隻樹液迅猛龍，{name}。你最好收下這個。"
L["My people have kept hope alive for ages on very little, {name}. Have some."] = "我的族人憑著微薄所有，把希望守了千百年，{name}。分你一點。"
L["I'm still learning what to say to strangers, {name}. This seemed safest."] = "我還在學怎麼跟陌生人說話，{name}。這樣好像最保險。"
L["My people live beside a wound that never heals, {name}. Here; come back whole."] = "我的族人住在一道永不癒合的傷口旁，{name}。拿著；平安回來。"
L["Two haranir out in the world, {name}. The elders would fret. I'll help instead."] = "兩個哈拉尼爾在外闖蕩，{name}。長老們會擔心。我來幫忙就是了。"
L["Did the Song call you up as well, {name}? It called me to give you this."] = "你也被歌聲召上來的嗎，{name}？它召我來把這個給你。"
L["Keep to the brush, they told us, {name}. We're both bad at it. Take this."] = "他們叫我們躲在灌木裡，{name}。咱倆都做不到。拿著。"
L["Harandar's roots run under all this, {name}. Some of their strength, for you."] = "哈朗達的樹根就在這一切底下，{name}。分你一點它們的力量。"
L["Looking for the goddess too, {name}? Two pairs of eyes, then, and this."] = "你也在找女神嗎，{name}？那就兩雙眼睛，再加上這個。"
L["Told to give up childish adventures, {name}? Me too. Here, for the next one."] = "也有人叫你別再瞎冒險了吧，{name}？我也是。拿著，下一回用。"
L["Nobody up here speaks Hara'ni, {name}. So I'll just say it with this."] = "地上沒人懂哈拉尼語，{name}。那我就用這個來說。"
L["Outsiders ask where we're from, {name}. I point down. Here's a bit of down."] = "外人總問我們從哪兒來，{name}。我就指指下面。給你一點下面的東西。"
L["Stay close, {name}. A haranir needs something to guard, and today it's you."] = "跟緊，{name}。哈拉尼爾總得守護些什麼，今天就是你。"
L["We once mastered every beast on our mountain, {name}. With this, these won't."] = "我們曾馴服了山上所有的野獸，{name}。有了這個，這些也撐不住。"
L["Word from Harandar, {name}: the haranir join the fight. This is my part."] = "來自哈朗達的消息，{name}：哈拉尼爾加入戰鬥。這是我的那份。"
L["My people's oldest shame is fighting each other, {name}. Here; together, then."] = "我族最古老的恥辱是自相殘殺，{name}。拿著；那就一起打。"
L["Here, {name}. Mind your step; where I'm from, the floor is mostly roots."] = "拿著，{name}。當心腳下；在我老家，地面大多是樹根。"
L["Take this, {name}. If anything crawls up from below, leave it to me."] = "拿著，{name}。要是有東西從下面爬上來，交給我。"
L["Dangerous, {name}? My ancestors went into the deep with less than this."] = "危險，{name}？我的先祖帶著比這還少的東西就下了深淵。"
L["Do not fear the dark, {name}. Orweyna's words, and my gift, go with you."] = "別害怕黑暗，{name}。歐薇娜的話和我的禮物與你同行。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'll take the ledges. Clawed feet were made for them."] = "拿著，{name}。崖邊交給我。長爪子的腳就是幹這個的。"
L["The goddess's world is worth fighting for, {name}. This bit too. Here."] = "女神的世界值得我們去戰鬥，{name}。這一小塊也是。拿著。"
L["I've cleared weeds, mud skippers and fungi, {name}. You I'll just bless."] = "雜草、泥跳魚、真菌我都清過，{name}。對你嘛，只給祝福。"
L["The Zur'ashar won't paint this fight, {name}. Take this; let's win it anyway."] = "祖拉夏不會畫這一仗，{name}。拿著；照樣打贏它。"
L["Easy, {name}. Back in Harandar we tend friends like roots: gently."] = "別急，{name}。在哈蘭達爾，我們像照料樹根一樣待朋友。"
L["You're the best thing the surface has given me, {name}."] = "你是地表給我最好的禮物，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Up here the sky goes on forever."] = "靠近點，{name}。上面的天空無邊無際。"
L["Well done, {name}! Aln'hara would have smiled at that."] = "幹得好，{name}！奧恩哈拉會為此微笑的。"
L["Protect, tend and serve, {name}. You did all three just now."] = "守護、照料、侍奉，{name}。你剛才三樣都做到了。"
L["Fierce as the Shul'ka, {name}. I'm proud of you."] = "像舒爾卡一樣兇猛，{name}。我為你驕傲。"
L["Rest, {name}. Let the roots hold you while you heal."] = "歇吧，{name}。你養傷時，讓樹根托著你。"
L["Easy, {name}. You glow a little dimmer, but you're still here."] = "別急，{name}。你的光暗了些，可你還在。"
L["Breathe, {name}. Every root grows back stronger."] = "呼吸，{name}。每條根都會長得更壯。"
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}. This is how we greet them."] = "見到自己人真好，{name}。我們就這樣打招呼。"
L["Our people are few, {name}. That makes each of us worth this."] = "我們族人不多，{name}。所以每一個都值得這個。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own, and today that's me."] = "謝謝你，{name}。聯盟照顧自己人，今天輪到我。"
L["Kindness answered, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "以善意回應，{name}。為了聯盟！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Stormwind has a statue for every hero. I'll put in a word."] = "謝謝你，{name}。暴風城為每位英雄立像。我會替你說句話。"
L["The Alliance way, {name}: you help me, I help you, a dwarf buys the drinks."] = "聯盟之道，{name}：你幫我，我幫你，矮人請喝酒。"
L["Bolvar would bow, Magni would hug, {name}. I'll just return it."] = "伯瓦爾會鞠躬，麥格尼會熊抱，{name}。我回個禮就好。"
L["If the Alliance gave medals for manners, {name}, you'd need a second tabard."] = "聯盟若頒禮貌勳章，{name}，你外袍都掛不下了。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. An ally who gives first is worth a whole garrison."] = "如數奉還，{name}。先出手的盟友抵得上一座要塞。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you in my letter home. Mother reads them aloud."] = "謝謝，{name}。家書裡會提到你。我媽會大聲唸出來。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the Stormwind guards would smile at that."] = "謝謝，{name}。連暴風城衛兵看了都會笑。"
L["The Alliance at its finest, {name}: nobody asked, somebody helped. Thanks."] = "這才是聯盟本色，{name}：沒人開口，有人出手。謝啦。"
L["I'll tell everyone on the Deeprun Tram, {name}. It's a long tram. Thank you."] = "我會講給礦道地鐵全車聽，{name}。那車很長。謝謝。"
L["Most gallant, {name}. If I had a lion on my tabard, it would be purring."] = "真有風度，{name}。我外袍上要是有獅子，牠正在呼嚕。"
L["Our kings bicker, {name}, but their people get on splendidly. Thank you."] = "國王們吵個不停，{name}，百姓倒處得很好。謝謝。"
L["The Alliance was forged by folk keeping their word, {name}. Here's mine."] = "聯盟是守信的人打造的，{name}。這是我的那份。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other. It's practically in the name."] = "當然，{name}。「聯盟」嘛，就是要聯手。"
L["At once, {name}. The Alliance does not leave a friend wanting."] = "立刻來，{name}。聯盟從不虧待朋友。"
L["Of course, {name}. It's in the Alliance charter. Somewhere near the back."] = "當然，{name}。聯盟憲章裡有寫，大概在後面幾頁。"
L["By order of the Alliance, {name}: one {buff}, effective at once."] = "奉聯盟之命，{name}：{buff}一份，即刻生效。"
L["Anything for an ally, {name}. Within reason. This is well within reason."] = "為盟友什麼都行，{name}。合理範圍內。這很合理。"
L["Right away, {name}. SI:7 knew you would ask. I only just found out."] = "馬上來，{name}。軍情七處早料到了，我剛知道。"
L["Straight away, {name}. The Alliance marches on requests like yours. And bread."] = "馬上，{name}。聯盟靠你這種請求行軍。還有麵包。"
L["Yes, {name}. From Stormwind to Ironforge, 'please' opens every gate."] = "好，{name}。暴風城到鐵爐堡，一聲「請」開遍城門。"
L["Right away, {name}. I've worn the blue all day hoping somebody would ask."] = "馬上，{name}。我穿了一整天藍色，就等有人開口。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I learned this faster than the Alliance anthem."] = "別動，{name}。這招我學得比聯盟國歌還快。"
L["Of course, {name}. Armies win wars; small favours win allies. Here's one."] = "當然，{name}。大軍打贏戰爭，小忙贏得盟友。來一個。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there. Stronger, now."] = "為了聯盟，{name}！挺住。現在更挺得住了。"
L["Onward, {name}, and take this. The Alliance is with you."] = "前進，{name}，拿上這個。聯盟與你同在。"
L["Take this, {name}. Had a gnome made it, it would come with twelve levers."] = "拿著，{name}。要是地精做的，還會附十二根拉桿。"
L["Compliments of the Alliance, {name}. We've done these since the Second War."] = "聯盟敬贈，{name}。這項服務從第二次大戰就有了。"
L["Chin up, {name}; take this. Somewhere in Stormwind, a bard writes about you."] = "打起精神，{name}；拿著這個。暴風城某處有個吟遊詩人正在寫你。"
L["Every ally counts, {name}. Today, you count double."] = "每個盟友都算數，{name}。今天你算兩個。"
L["Anduin would want me to share, {name}, and I'd hate to disappoint him."] = "安度因會希望我分享，{name}，我可不想讓他失望。"
L["Take this, {name}. Stormwind's walls can't follow you, so this will have to."] = "拿著，{name}。暴風城的城牆跟不了你，就讓這個跟著。"
L["Here, {name}. The gryphons get you there; this gets you back."] = "給你，{name}。獅鷲載你去，這個保你回來。"
L["Alliance rule, {name}: keep your word, your walls, your friends. Here, friend."] = "聯盟守則，{name}：守信、守城、守朋友。給你，朋友。"
L["Every ally deserves a lion at their back, {name}. I'm the nearest lion."] = "每個盟友背後都該有頭雄獅，{name}。最近的就是我。"
L["A gift from the Alliance, {name}. Signed, sealed and hand-delivered."] = "聯盟的禮物，{name}。簽名、蓋章、專人送達。"
L["The Alliance never forgets the brave, {name}. Here; give it something to keep."] = "聯盟從不忘記勇士，{name}。拿著；給它留點值得記住的。"
L["Together we stand, {name}, and share. For the Alliance!"] = "我們並肩而立，{name}，同享同擔。為了聯盟！"
L["Right, {name}: take this, shields up, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "好，{name}：拿著這個，舉盾，誰也別搶在計畫前頭衝。"
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Best equipped, too, now."] = "聯盟有史以來最好的隊伍，{name}。現在裝備也最好了。"
L["Together, {name}, we're practically a regiment. A small, well-blessed regiment."] = "我們湊一塊，{name}，差不多就是個團了。一個小小的、福澤深厚的團。"
L["That's me watching your back, {name}. The Alliance was built by people who did."] = "這是我在替你護著後背，{name}。聯盟就是這樣的人建起來的。"
L["Shields together, {name}, and take this. The Alliance never won in single file."] = "盾牌靠攏，{name}，拿上這個。聯盟從沒靠排成一列打贏過。"
L["If this goes in the history books, {name}, let it say I blessed you first."] = "要是這事寫進史書，{name}，就寫我先給了你祝福。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whoever carries the banner gets painted looking noble."] = "拿著，{name}。扛旗的人畫像上都顯得高貴。"
L["Dwarven nerve, elven patience, human stubbornness, {name}, and a gift. Recipe."] = "矮人的膽量、精靈的耐心、人類的倔強，{name}，再加一份禮物。這就是配方。"
L["Keep the lion roaring, {name}, with this in you. Softly, mind. We're sneaking."] = "讓雄獅咆哮吧，{name}，帶著這個。小聲點。咱們在潛行。"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. And kindness, it turns out. Repaid in full."] = "力量與榮譽，{name}。原來還有善意。如數奉還。"
L["The Horde takes care of its own, {name}."] = "部落照顧自己人，{name}。"
L["Strength given, strength returned, {name}. That's all of Horde diplomacy."] = "給我力量，還你力量，{name}。部落外交就這麼多。"
L["I'd carve your name on Orgrimmar's gates, {name}, but they're full. Thanks."] = "想把你刻上奧格瑪城門，{name}，但刻滿了。謝了。"
L["A goblin would've sent you an invoice, {name}. I'm sending this instead."] = "換作哥布林，早寄帳單給你了，{name}。我寄這個。"
L["You did not have to do that, {name}. That is why the Horde remembers it."] = "你沒必要這麼做，{name}。所以部落會記住。"
L["In the Horde we do not say thank you twice, {name}. So: once, and meant."] = "部落謝謝不說兩次，{name}。所以：一次，真心的。"
L["In the Horde a debt is carried like an axe, {name}: openly, and not for long."] = "部落的債像斧頭一樣扛，{name}：光明正大，扛不久。"
L["Thanks, {name}. The gate grunts will hear of it. They'll grunt. Means respect."] = "謝了，{name}。守門步兵會聽說的。他們會哼一聲。那是敬意。"
L["The Horde keeps two lists, {name}: grudges and favours. Yours is the short one."] = "部落記兩本帳，{name}：仇和恩。你在薄的那本。"
L["Honour says repay you, {name}. Manners say smile. I'm working on the smile."] = "榮譽要我回報你，{name}。禮貌要我微笑。微笑還在練。"
L["That landed softer than any zeppelin I've ridden, {name}. Thank you."] = "這比我搭過的飛艇都降得溫柔，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thanks, {name}, in Orcish, Taur-ahe, Zandali and Gutterspeak. Pick one."] = "謝啦，{name}。獸人語、牛頭人語、贊達拉語、亡靈語，任選。"
L["Thrall taught the Horde honour, {name}. Nobody had to teach you. Thank you."] = "索爾教會部落榮譽，{name}。你卻無師自通。謝謝。"
L["You gave first, {name}. In the Horde that earns first cut of the roast. Here."] = "你先出手，{name}。在部落，這能分到烤肉第一刀。給。"
L["The Warchief can't thank everyone himself, {name}. He's delegated it to me."] = "大酋長沒空一一道謝，{name}。這差事交給我了。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde, and for anyone who asks nicely."] = "交給我，{name}。為了部落，也為了客氣開口的人。"
L["You only had to ask, {name}. The Horde answers."] = "你開口就行，{name}。部落必有回應。"
L["The Horde usually helps with axes, {name}. Today, {buff}."] = "部落通常用斧頭幫忙，{name}。今天用{buff}。"
L["Done, {name}. No speeches. The Horde has plenty of those already."] = "好了，{name}。不演講，部落的演講已經夠多了。"
L["You asked, {name}. In Orgrimmar, that counts as a formal treaty."] = "你開口了，{name}。在奧格瑪，這就算正式條約。"
L["Asking is no weakness, {name}. Refusing an ally would be."] = "開口求助不是軟弱，{name}。拒絕盟友才是。"
L["No need to bang a war drum, {name}. You asked; it's done."] = "不必敲戰鼓，{name}。你開口，就辦好了。"
L["Of course, {name}. In the Horde, 'please' outranks everyone but the Warchief."] = "當然，{name}。在部落，「請」字官階僅次於大酋長。"
L["In Orgrimmar we'd have argued about it first, {name}. Tradition. Here."] = "在奧格瑪，我們會先吵一架，{name}。傳統。給。"
L["Consider it requisitioned, {name}. The quartermaster needn't hear about it."] = "就當是徵用的，{name}。軍需官不必知道。"
L["Done, {name}. If anyone asks, I scowled the whole time. I've a reputation."] = "好了，{name}。有人問就說我全程臭臉。名聲要顧。"
L["Of course, {name}. Horde hospitality: rough edges, full helpings."] = "當然，{name}。部落待客：粗歸粗，份量足。"
L["The Horde came together because somebody always said yes, {name}. Yes."] = "部落能聚起來，是因為總有人說「好」，{name}。好。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength. I've just handed you some."] = "為了部落，{name}！力量隨行，我剛塞了一些給你。"
L["Go with honour, {name}, and with this. Victory awaits."] = "帶著榮譽去吧，{name}，也帶上這個。勝利在等著。"
L["Take this, {name}; do something worth a song. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "拿著，{name}；去幹點值得傳唱的事。大聲唱的那種。部落就愛熱鬧。"
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde made room for those the world turned away. Here."] = "挺直腰桿走，{name}。部落向來收留被世界拋棄的人。拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}, and a word of Horde wisdom: hit first, apologise never."] = "拿著，{name}。部落格言：先動手，永不道歉。"
L["Victory or death, {name}. I'd prefer victory, so take this."] = "勝利或死亡，{name}。我選勝利，所以拿著。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Here's your thunder. Go and be it."] = "鮮血與雷霆，{name}！這是你的雷霆。去吧，化身雷霆。"
L["For the Horde, {name}, and for you. The Horde's big; you're closer."] = "為了部落，{name}，也為了你。部落太大，你比較近。"
L["Here, {name}. Stronger together, they say, and I've just done my half."] = "給你，{name}。都說團結力量大，我這半邊做完了。"
L["Carry this, {name}. It weighs less than a Horde banner and flies just as proud."] = "帶上這個，{name}。比部落戰旗輕，飄得一樣威風。"
L["Here, {name}. The Horde feeds its own, arms its own, and now enchants them."] = "給你，{name}。部落包吃包武器，現在連法術也包。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever's out there is about to meet the Horde."] = "拿著，{name}。外頭那些東西，就要見識部落了。"
L["Here, {name}. Wherever you're headed, arrive looking like the Horde sent you."] = "給你，{name}。不管去哪，到的時候要像部落派來的。"
L["The Crossroads never turned a traveller away, {name}. Nor do I. This is free."] = "十字路口從不拒絕旅人，{name}。我也不。這個免費。"
L["The Horde raises you tough, {name}. This is for the days tough isn't enough."] = "部落把你養得夠硬，{name}。這給硬也撐不住的日子。"
L["Take this, {name}. A Horde gift: no ribbon, no speech, no refunds."] = "拿著，{name}。部落禮物：不綁緞帶、不致詞、不退換。"
L["Stand tall, {name}, with this. Taller. The Horde has tauren to keep up with."] = "站直了，{name}，帶著這個。再直點。部落裡還有牛頭人要比呢。"
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. Here's some of mine. For the Horde!"] = "我們的力量就是彼此，{name}。分你一點我的。為了部落！"
L["Forward, {name}, and take this. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never."] = "前進，{name}，拿著這個。部落一同推進。撤退……絕不。"
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud. Take this."] = "合起來是戰團，{name}。分開只是吵。拿著。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, {name}, and blessed. Whoever charges first buys the grog."] = "肩並肩，{name}，帶著祝福。誰先衝誰請喝格羅酒。"
L["Nobody gets left behind, {name}, or left out. I've counted us twice. Here."] = "誰都不落下，{name}，也不漏下。我數了兩遍。拿著。"
L["Rule of the warband, {name}: nobody eats until everybody's back, and blessed."] = "戰團的規矩，{name}：大家都回來、都受了祝福，才開飯。"
L["Drums up, {name}, and take this. If we can't be quiet, we'll be terrifying."] = "戰鼓舉起來，{name}，拿上這個。安靜不了，那就嚇死他們。"
L["The Horde never won a thing alone, {name}. Take this; let's not start now."] = "部落從沒單打獨鬥贏過，{name}。拿著；別現在開這個頭。"
L["We fight like the Horde, {name}: all at once, nobody waits. So take this now."] = "我們打仗跟部落一個樣，{name}：一擁而上，誰也不等。所以現在就拿著。"
L["Right, {name}. Spoils shared, blame shared, this shared. Glory to the loudest."] = "好，{name}。戰利品分，鍋一起背，這個也分。榮耀歸嗓門最大的。"
L["Look at us, {name}, all blessed. The Warchief would be proud. From a distance."] = "看看我們，{name}，人人受了祝福。大酋長會驕傲的。遠遠地驕傲。"
L["Tusks, horns, long ears, bare bone, {name}, all blessed. Finest warband going."] = "獠牙、犄角、長耳朵、光骨頭，{name}，全都受了祝福。最棒的戰團。"
L["The war stories get bigger after, {name}. With this, give them a head start."] = "戰爭故事事後都會越講越大，{name}。有了這個，先給它們開個頭。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts turn up on every side, and apparently here."] = "謝謝你，{name}。好心人哪邊都有，看來這裡也有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No side, no title, just kindness. Legends start like this."] = "謝謝，{name}。沒陣營沒頭銜，傳奇都這麼開始的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness has no faction, which is handy, since I have none."] = "謝謝，{name}。善意不分陣營，剛好我也沒有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Whichever side gets you is getting a bargain."] = "謝謝你，{name}。哪個陣營得到你都賺到了。"
L["Whoever claims me in the end, {name}, I'll remember you first. Thank you."] = "不管最後我歸哪邊，{name}，都會先記得你。謝謝。"
L["Strictly neutral, {name}, but gratitude doesn't count. Thank you."] = "我嚴守中立，{name}，但感謝不算選邊。謝謝你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I carry no banner, so both hands are free to return this."] = "謝謝，{name}。我不扛旗，兩手空空，正好回禮。"
L["The Steamwheedle stay neutral for gold, {name}. I return favours for free."] = "熱砂為了金幣保持中立，{name}。我回報好意分文不取。"
L["Neither side has taught me their thanks yet, {name}, so here's the plain kind."] = "兩邊都還沒教我怎麼道謝，{name}，先來個原味的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I stand between two great banners, and still you noticed me."] = "謝謝，{name}。我夾在兩面大旗中間，你還是看見我了。"
L["Two sides at war, {name}, and us being lovely right in the middle. Thank you."] = "兩邊在開戰，{name}，我們在正中間溫馨互助。謝謝。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly. I don't even own a banner."] = "樂意，{name}，不論你舉哪面旗。我連旗子都沒有。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I help everyone. It's the one thing I've decided."] = "當然，{name}。我誰都幫，這是我唯一決定好的事。"
L["Everyone asks me which side I'm on, {name}. Much nicer to be asked for help."] = "大家都問我站哪邊，{name}。被請求幫忙好多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. No war council to ask; just me, and I say yes."] = "當然，{name}。不必請示議會，我說了算：好。"
L["Here you are, {name}. No oath, no colours, no fee."] = "給你，{name}。不宣誓、不掛旗、不收費。"
L["I can't pick a side yet, {name}, but I can pick a good cause. This is one."] = "陣營還不能選，{name}，好事倒是能選。這就是一件。"
L["At once, {name}. I have no side to be on, so for now I am entirely on yours."] = "馬上，{name}。我沒有陣營可站，所以現在全站你這邊。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody pays me to take sides, so I take requests instead."] = "當然，{name}。沒人付錢要我選邊，我就改接點單。"
L["Neutral does not mean unwilling, {name}. It means I help first and argue never."] = "中立不代表不願意，{name}。是先幫忙，永不爭論。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or from none, like me. Here."] = "朋友可以來自任何一方，{name}。或者像我這樣哪方都不是。拿著。"
L["Soon they'll hand us tabards, {name}. Until then, we look after each other."] = "很快會發外袍給我們，{name}。在那之前互相照應。"
L["I haven't chosen a side yet, {name}, so I'm being kind to both. Take this."] = "我還沒選邊，{name}，所以兩邊都善待。拿著。"
L["A gift with no strings, {name}. I don't even have a faction to tie them to."] = "這禮物不綁定，{name}。我連陣營都沒得綁。"
L["Go on, {name}, with this. Two whole factions are waiting to argue over us."] = "去吧，{name}，帶上這個。兩大陣營都等著為我們吵一架。"
L["No quartermaster yet, {name}, so nobody's counting. Have plenty."] = "還沒有軍需官，{name}，沒人記帳。多拿點。"
L["Take this, {name}. Neutral ground travels with me; you're standing on some."] = "拿著，{name}。中立地帶跟著我走，你就踩在上面。"
L["The Argent Dawn helps whoever needs it, {name}. I'm learning from the best."] = "銀色黎明誰有需要就幫誰，{name}。我在跟最好的學。"
L["Booty Bay's rule: no fighting on the docks, {name}. Mine: no refusing a gift."] = "藏寶海灣：碼頭禁止鬥毆，{name}。我這：禮物禁止拒收。"
L["The one thing both factions agree on, {name}. They just don't know it yet."] = "兩大陣營唯一的共識，{name}。只是他們還不知道。"
L["This goes with any tabard, {name}. I made sure by giving it no colours at all."] = "配哪件外袍都行，{name}。我特地沒給它上色。"
L["For you, {name}. Neither Orgrimmar nor Stormwind sent it. It works anyway."] = "給你，{name}。非奧格瑪、非暴風城出品，照樣有效。"
L["Here, {name}. I belong to no nation yet, so I practise belonging to everyone."] = "給你，{name}。我還沒有國家，先練習屬於大家。"
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes. Take this."] = "並肩同行，{name}，無論遇到什麼。拿著。"
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us, and this. That's plenty."] = "這支隊伍不打旗，{name}，只有我們，還有這個。夠了。"
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we share this and pick fights together."] = "總有一天要選邊，{name}。今天咱們分享這個，一起找架打。"
L["Whatever side the rest of the world is on, {name}, I'm on yours. Here."] = "不管世界其他人站哪邊，{name}，我站你這邊。拿著。"
L["Neutral in the war, {name}, but generous to this group. Take this."] = "戰爭中中立，{name}，可對這支隊伍很大方。拿著。"
L["They call us a neutral party, {name}. Nobody said it couldn't give gifts."] = "他們說我們是中立的一方，{name}。可沒人說中立就不能送禮。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever we fight today, it's nothing personal. Thorough."] = "拿著，{name}。今天跟誰打都不是私人恩怨。就是徹底。"
L["One side in this party, {name}: ours. Smallest faction, best perks. Here."] = "這支隊伍只有一方，{name}：我們。最小的陣營，最好的福利。拿著。"
L["No orders from any capital, {name}. We choose our road, and our gifts. Here."] = "不聽任何都城的號令，{name}。路我們自己選，禮物也是。拿著。"
L["No war to win today, {name}, just this one fight. And you've got this for it."] = "今天沒有要贏的戰爭，{name}，只有這一仗。為此你有了這個。"
L["One good turn deserves another, {name}."] = "好心有好報，{name}。"
L["Have some {buff} in return, {name}."] = "回贈你一份{buff}，{name}。"
L["Kindness should go both ways, {name}. Thank you."] = "善意該是互相的，{name}。謝謝你。"
L["You went first, {name}, so I'll go second and we'll call it friendship."] = "你先出手，{name}，我接第二棒，這就叫友誼。"
L["I'd write you a song, {name}, but {buff} is less off-key."] = "本想為你寫首歌，{name}，但{buff}比較不走音。"
L["A gift for a gift, {name}. At this rate we'll be unstoppable by supper."] = "禮尚往來，{name}。照這速度，晚餐前就天下無敵。"
L["All square, {name}. Unless you'd like to make it best of three."] = "扯平了，{name}。除非你想來個三戰兩勝。"
L["You started it, {name}. I'm only finishing it."] = "你先開始的，{name}。我只是收尾。"
L["That was kind, {name}. The day just got noticeably better. Here's my half."] = "真好心，{name}。今天變好了，這是我的那一半。"
L["I was about to do that for you, {name}. Honestly. Here's proof."] = "我正要替你施法呢，{name}。真的，證據在此。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll sleep better tonight, and I sleep in a ditch."] = "謝謝，{name}。今晚會睡得更香，雖然我睡水溝。"
L["Two good things today, {name}: your kindness, and the chance to return it."] = "今天兩件好事，{name}：你的好意，和回報它的機會。"
L["You had me in your debt for all of three seconds, {name}. There."] = "我欠了你整整三秒，{name}。還清了。"
L["Gratitude is best served quickly, {name}. Here it is, still warm."] = "謝意要趁熱，{name}。來，還熱騰騰的。"
L["Well, {name}, now I have to be a better person all day. Thanks for that."] = "好吧，{name}，這下我整天都得當個好人了。真是謝囉。"
L["Returned with a bow, {name}. A figurative one. My back isn't what it was."] = "鞠躬回禮，{name}。比喻上的。我的腰不比當年。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Somebody had to go first, and I'm glad it was you."] = "謝謝，{name}。總要有人先開頭，很高興是你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've rescued a day I'd written off at breakfast."] = "謝謝，{name}。這天我早餐時就放棄了，被你救回來。"
L["You asked, {name}, and here it is."] = "你要的來了，{name}。"
L["{buff}, coming right up, {name}."] = "{buff}馬上來，{name}。"
L["Gladly, {name}. One moment."] = "很樂意，{name}。稍等。"
L["Asked and answered, {name}. Next question?"] = "有問必答，{name}。下一題？"
L["Say the word and it's yours, {name}. You said several. Here."] = "你開口就給，{name}。你開了好幾次口。拿去。"
L["For you, {name}? Gladly. I was hoping someone would ask."] = "給你？樂意，{name}。我正盼著有人開口。"
L["Of course, {name}. Easiest yes I'll say all day."] = "當然，{name}。今天最好答應的事。"
L["Right away, {name}. Finally, a question I know the answer to."] = "馬上來，{name}。終於有題我會答了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nicely asked, gladly given."] = "當然，{name}。問得客氣，給得樂意。"
L["Hold still, {name}. It works best on people who aren't fidgeting. So, nobody."] = "別動，{name}。這對不亂動的人最靈。也就是說：沒人。"
L["Here you are, {name}. I'd make you wait for effect, but that seems rude."] = "給你，{name}。本想吊你胃口，但那太失禮了。"
L["Yes, {name}. I'd have said it sooner if you'd asked sooner."] = "好啊，{name}。你早點問，我就早點答應。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Done before you finished asking."] = "不用多說，{name}。你還沒問完就好了。"
L["There, {name}. Next time, don't ask; just stand near me looking hopeful."] = "好了，{name}。下次別問，眼巴巴站我旁邊就行。"
L["Coming up, {name}. This is the one part of my day that goes to plan."] = "馬上來，{name}。這是我今天唯一照計畫走的事。"
L["Asking nicely works, {name}. Tell everyone. The world could use the news."] = "客氣問就有，{name}。去宣傳吧，世界需要好消息。"
L["At once, {name}. Stay put, or this lands on your shadow instead."] = "馬上，{name}。別動，不然會加到你影子上。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. {buff} packs lighter than a sword."] = "路上小心，{name}。{buff}比劍輕便多了。"
L["A small blessing for the road, {name}."] = "路上的一點小祝福，{name}。"
L["Go well, {name}, and take this. Come back in one piece."] = "一路平安，{name}，拿著這個。完完整整地回來。"
L["No reason, {name}. It just felt like a {buff} sort of day."] = "沒什麼原因，{name}。只是今天很適合{buff}。"
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just passing, with a spare {buff}."] = "別在意，{name}。路過，剛好多一份{buff}。"
L["Consider it a gift, {name}. I'd wrap it, but it glows through the paper."] = "當作禮物吧，{name}。本想包裝，但它會透光。"
L["Here, {name}. Pass it on when you meet someone who needs it."] = "給你，{name}。遇到需要的人，再傳下去。"
L["Whatever brings you here, {name}, this should help it go better than planned."] = "不管你來這兒為了什麼，{name}，這個能讓它比計畫的更順。"
L["Just being neighbourly, {name}. Very, very temporary neighbours."] = "敦親睦鄰嘛，{name}。非常非常短暫的鄰居。"
L["You looked about to do something brave, {name}. Here, for that."] = "你一臉要去幹大事的樣子，{name}。拿去壯膽。"
L["No need to stop, {name}. It works while you walk."] = "不用停下來，{name}。它邊走邊生效。"
L["Nothing asked, nothing owed, {name}. Nothing to do but go and be splendid."] = "不求回報，不欠人情，{name}。只管去發光發熱。"
L["Call it a wager, {name}, that you'll do something worthwhile with it."] = "就當我押注吧，{name}，賭你會拿它幹番大事。"
L["A gift from a passing stranger, {name}. The best kind, the old stories say."] = "路人送的禮，{name}。老故事說這種最靈。"
L["It's rude to pass someone without a greeting, {name}. This is mine."] = "擦身而過不打招呼很失禮，{name}。這是我的招呼。"
L["Same road as me, {name}? Then take this for the journey."] = "跟我同路，{name}？那帶上這個上路吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. If today goes well, remember me. If badly, I was never here."] = "拿著，{name}。今天順利就記著我。不順利，我就從沒來過。"
L["Hold still a moment, {name}. There. Best-prepared person in sight."] = "別動，{name}。好了，放眼望去你準備最周全。"
L["Everyone ready? You are now, {name}."] = "準備好了嗎？{name}，現在你好了。"
L["A little something for the party, {name}."] = "給隊伍的一點小心意，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. We go further together, and further still with this."] = "待近點，{name}。一起走得更遠，有了這個還能更遠。"
L["House rules, {name}: nobody dies, nobody sulks, everybody gets one of these."] = "家規，{name}：誰也不許死，誰也不許鬧脾氣，人人一份。"
L["There, {name}. Now if this goes badly, it won't be my fault."] = "好了，{name}。現在要是出事，可不是我的錯。"
L["All set, {name}. I'd give a speech, but we'd be here all day."] = "都好了，{name}。本想演講，但會講到天黑。"
L["Look after that, {name}. It's the only one I brought for you."] = "好好保管，{name}。我只帶了你這一份。"
L["Now we look the part, {name}. Let's go and be it."] = "架勢有了，{name}。去拿出實力吧。"
L["Fresh {buff} all round, {name}. The rest is luck and elbows."] = "{buff}全員更新，{name}。其餘就靠運氣和卡位。"
L["Anyone have a plan, {name}? No? Mine was this. Wonderful. Onward."] = "誰有計畫，{name}？沒有？我的計畫就是這個。好極了。出發。"
L["One each, {name}. Don't swap; they're fitted."] = "一人一個，{name}。別互換，都是量身訂做的。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whoever starts the fight has to tell the story afterwards."] = "拿著，{name}。誰先動手，事後誰講故事。"
L["Good friends, sharp steel, {buff}. What else is there, {name}?"] = "好夥伴、利刃、{buff}。還缺什麼，{name}？"
L["For you, {name}. Stay where I can see you. I can't help what I can't find."] = "給你的，{name}。待在我看得見的地方。找不著，我就幫不上。"
L["If this ends up a legend, {name}, I want a line in it: the one giving you this."] = "要是這成了傳說，{name}，我要一句台詞：就是把這個給你那句。"
L["Brace yourselves, {name}. This helps. And each other, if it comes to that."] = "做好準備，{name}。這個有幫助。真到那一步，就互相扶著。"
L["Chin up, {name}, and take this. Whatever's ahead has never met this lot before."] = "打起精神，{name}，拿著這個。前面不管是什麼，都還沒見識過我們這夥人。"
L["Here, {name}, to keep you in one piece. I'm only equipped for small repairs."] = "拿著，{name}，好讓你完整無缺。我只會修修補補。"
L["Well, {name}, with this on you we look ready. Let's go before we learn more."] = "好了，{name}，你身上有了這個，咱們看著像準備好了。趁還沒發現別的，走吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we get lost, we're exploring. Nobody scolds an explorer."] = "拿著，{name}。要是迷路了，那叫探索。沒人會罵探險家。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd conjure a gift in return, but it would only be water."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想變個回禮，但我只變得出水。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. I'll write it up properly later. Several pages."] = "感激不盡，{name}。我之後寫成報告，好幾頁。"
L["Thank you, {name}. They never taught gratitude at Dalaran. I'm self-taught."] = "謝謝，{name}。達拉然沒教過感恩，我是自學的。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. Everyone assumes mages need no help. We do."] = "真好心，{name}。大家都以為法師不需要幫忙。我們需要。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I nearly Counterspelled that on reflex. So glad I didn't."] = "謝謝，{name}。我差點反射性法術反制，還好沒有。"
L["Even a frost mage would thaw at that, {name}. Thank you."] = "連冰法都被你融化了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Noted in my spellbook, between Frost Nova and lunch."] = "謝謝，{name}。已記入法術書，冰霜新星和午餐間。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}, before I pass a bookshop. I've lost weeks that way."] = "先還你，{name}，趁我還沒逛書店。一逛就好幾週。"
L["Twenty years in the library, {name}, and no book said how to thank you. This."] = "在圖書館待了二十年，{name}，沒有一本書教我怎麼謝你。就用這個吧。"
L["Arcane theory says nothing comes free, {name}. Theory was wrong. Thank you."] = "秘法理論說沒有白吃的午餐，{name}。錯了。謝謝。"
L["Of course, {name}. And yes, I suppose you'll want water as well."] = "當然，{name}。我知道，你還要水，對吧。"
L["As requested, {name}. I'll find my page again later."] = "如你所求，{name}。讀到哪頁，我等等再找。"
L["At once, {name}. Carefully, too; I've blinked into two walls today."] = "馬上，{name}。會小心的，今天已閃現撞牆兩次。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Knowledge should be shared. The Kirin Tor say so, reluctantly."] = "樂意，{name}。知識該分享——祈倫托勉強這麼說。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll cast it slowly. The hand movements are the best part."] = "當然，{name}。我慢慢施法，手勢才是精華。"
L["Of course, {name}. Think of it as homework, and I've done it for you."] = "當然，{name}。就當是作業，我幫你寫好了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Antonidas taught me this. He also taught me to duck."] = "當然，{name}。安東尼達斯教的。他還教我怎麼閃。"
L["At once, {name}. Arcane, not fire. I did check."] = "馬上，{name}。是秘法不是火，查過了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. It's this or a lecture on ley lines, and you've been kind."] = "當然，{name}。不然就聽我講地脈。你人好，免了。"
L["You asked a mage, {name}. The spell is instant; the explanation is not."] = "你問的是法師，{name}。法術瞬發，解說可不是。"
L["I've cast this a thousand times, {name}. Nine hundred and ninety went well."] = "這我施放過一千次了，{name}。九百九十次都很順。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand still. Fidgeters have been known to end up woolly."] = "當然，{name}。別動。亂動的人有時會長出羊毛。"
L["Here, {name}. I had a spare thought and nowhere to put it."] = "給你，{name}。我多了一個念頭，沒地方放。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd add bread, but conjured bread tastes of nothing."] = "拿著，{name}。本想附麵包，但魔法麵包沒味道。"
L["{buff} for you, {name}. No charge, unlike the portals."] = "{buff}送你，{name}。免費，不像傳送門。"
L["Here, {name}. Most folk I point at turn into sheep. Today's your lucky day."] = "給你，{name}。被我指到的多半變羊，你今天走運。"
L["Nothing on fire, nothing frozen, {name}. I'm branching out."] = "沒燒到，也沒冰到，{name}。我在拓展業務。"
L["For you, {name}. I was practising, and you happened to be the nearest head."] = "給你，{name}。我在練習，你剛好是最近的腦袋。"
L["Here, {name}. Freshly cast, and hardly crackling at all."] = "給你，{name}。剛施放的，幾乎沒在劈啪響。"
L["Kings once hired Dalaran for this, {name}. You get it for nothing."] = "以前國王得花錢請達拉然做這個，{name}。你免費。"
L["Take this, {name}. It wears off, unlike my last experiment."] = "拿著，{name}。它會消退，不像我上次的實驗。"
L["For you, {name}: everything I learned in Dalaran, minus the essays."] = "給你，{name}：我在達拉然學的一切，扣掉報告。"
L["Here, {name}. Arcane magic is best shared, before it gets ideas of its own."] = "給你，{name}。秘法要早點分享，免得它自作主張。"
L["Evocation takes an age, {name}, so I spend my mana where it counts. Here."] = "喚醒超久，{name}，所以法力只花在刀口上。給你。"
L["Here, {name}. A mage who walks past without helping is just a very tall hat."] = "給你，{name}。見人不幫的法師，就只是頂高帽子。"
L["Now that you're clever, {name}, stand between me and the angry things."] = "你變聰明了，{name}，那就站到我跟怪物中間吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. For the record, I only blink away when it's tactical."] = "拿著，{name}。鄭重聲明：我只在戰術需要時才閃現。"
L["This first, {name}. Water's on me after; please don't ask for it mid-fight."] = "先拿著這個，{name}。水回頭我請；打著打著別找我要。"
L["Minds sharpened, {name}. I'll handle the fire, the frost and the panicking."] = "腦袋磨利了，{name}。火焰、冰霜和慌亂交給我。"
L["Here, {name}. If I say 'Frost Nova', run. If I say 'run', also run."] = "拿著，{name}。我喊「冰霜新星」，就跑。我喊「跑」，也跑。"
L["Take this, {name}. Pyroblast takes a while; interrupt it and it's personal."] = "拿著，{name}。炎爆術讀條長；誰打斷，我跟誰沒完。"
L["Yours, {name}. If I ice-block, I'm not frozen with fear. It's on purpose."] = "你的，{name}。我開寒冰屏障不是嚇僵了。是故意的。"
L["This now, {name}; portals home after. Getting there alive is on all of us."] = "現在先拿這個，{name}；回城傳送門之後再開。活著到那兒得靠大家。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything you'd rather not fight, point at. Wool by teatime."] = "拿著，{name}。不想打的就指給我。下午茶前就變成羊毛。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll drop a Blizzard on them. Watch, but from outside it."] = "拿著，{name}。我要往牠們頭上砸暴風雪。看可以，站外面看。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep them off me, and I'll keep them on fire."] = "拿著，{name}。你擋住牠們別靠近我，我就讓牠們一直著火。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I go quiet, it's Evocation, not sulking. Usually."] = "給你的，{name}。我要是不吭聲，是在喚醒，不是生悶氣。一般是。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, I've a teleport home. I'd never use it."] = "拿著，{name}。要是砸了，我有傳送回家。我絕不會用的。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. The Light keeps accounts; I settle mine early."] = "真貼心，{name}。聖光有記帳，我提早結清。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll put in a good word with the Light. It owes me several."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會向聖光美言，它欠我好幾次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. A small miracle, and I didn't even have to pray for it."] = "謝謝，{name}。一個小奇蹟，我連禱告都不用。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My faith in people is restored. It was only resting."] = "謝謝，{name}。我對人的信心回來了，它只是休息。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're in tonight's prayers. Near the top."] = "謝謝，{name}。今晚禱告有你，排很前面。"
L["Healers are rarely on this end of it, {name}. I'd forgotten how nice it is."] = "補師很少當收的那方，{name}。都忘了這麼舒服。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've saved me a prayer, and I'm always one short."] = "謝謝，{name}。幫我省了一次禱告，我老是差一次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd give a sermon on generosity, but you've just given it."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想講道談慷慨，你剛示範完了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll light a candle for you. Two. I'm feeling reckless."] = "謝謝，{name}。為你點根蠟燭。兩根，我豁出去了。"
L["Even my shadowy side is smiling, {name}. It has no face, so take my word."] = "我的暗影面都笑了，{name}。它沒臉，你信我就好。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Light keeps no hours, and neither, sadly, do I."] = "當然，{name}。聖光全年無休，可惜我也是。"
L["Straight away, {name}. Most prayers take longer; you've found a shortcut."] = "馬上，{name}。禱告通常沒這麼快，你找到捷徑了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The Light shines on those who ask. I just aim it."] = "當然，{name}。聖光照耀開口的人，我只負責瞄準。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. Faith moves mountains; I'm starting smaller."] = "樂意，{name}。信仰能移山，我先從小的開始。"
L["Of course, {name}. Confessions are extra, and I'd rather not hear them."] = "當然，{name}。告解另外收費，而且我不太想聽。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody who asks goes without. The Light's rule, and mine."] = "當然，{name}。開口的人不會落空。聖光的規矩，也是我的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. A warm glow means the Light. A cold one, tell me at once."] = "當然，{name}。暖光是聖光。冷光的話，馬上說。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll pray it lasts. I'm told I have an in."] = "當然，{name}。我會祈禱它持久，聽說我上面有人。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I heal, I smite, I do funerals. This is the cheerful bit."] = "當然，{name}。補血、懲擊、辦喪事，這個最歡樂。"
L["Bless you, {name}. No, you didn't sneeze; I'm simply thorough."] = "聖光保佑，{name}。連坐騎和背包，我很周到。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of it as a prayer that arrived early."] = "給你，{name}。就當是提早應驗的禱告。"
L["The Light asked me to pass this along, {name}. I'm paraphrasing."] = "聖光託我轉交給你，{name}。原話我稍微意譯了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It saves us both an awkward resurrection later."] = "拿著，{name}。免得待會兒還得尷尬地復活你。"
L["Freely given, {name}. Faith costs nothing. The robes, sadly, did."] = "免費送你，{name}。信仰不花錢，法袍可就貴了。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of me as a small, walking temple. No steps to climb."] = "給你，{name}。當我是會走的小神殿，免爬台階。"
L["A blessing for a stranger, {name}. The Light insists there's no such thing."] = "給路人的祝福，{name}。聖光說世上沒有路人。"
L["Take this, {name}. No collection plate follows. Look: empty hands."] = "拿著，{name}。不會傳奉獻盤。你看，兩手空空。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd preach, but you look like somebody with somewhere to be."] = "給你，{name}。本想傳道，但你看起來趕時間。"
L["Small mercies are my speciality, {name}. Here's one."] = "小小的慈悲是我的專長，{name}。給你一份。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd float over properly, but levitating in public draws a crowd."] = "給你，{name}。本想飄過來，當街漂浮會被圍觀。"
L["Your turn, {name}. Now, I beg you all: make my job boring."] = "輪到你，{name}。拜託各位：讓我閒到發慌。"
L["Everyone near me, {name}; the Light has a limited range. You're in it now."] = "都靠近我，{name}；聖光是有範圍的。你現在在裡面了。"
L["There, {name}. If anyone falls, I'll be very disappointed, then fix it."] = "好了，{name}。誰倒下我會很失望，然後修好他。"
L["Done, {name}. I'll be at the back, praying loudly."] = "好了，{name}。我在後面大聲禱告。"
L["Here, {name}. If I scream, it's a spell and everything runs. Don't join in."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是尖叫，那是法術，所有東西都會跑。別跟著叫。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I Fade, I haven't gone. I'm just very uninteresting."] = "給你的，{name}。我用漸隱術不是走了，只是變得特別不起眼。"
L["This one's on me, {name}. Shields come later, one each. Pace yourselves."] = "這個我請，{name}。護盾回頭一人一個。悠著點。"
L["Take this, {name}. Let's all come back from this the usual way: walking."] = "拿著，{name}。咱們都照老樣子回來：走著回來。"
L["That's me keeping you alive, {name}. You keep me from saying 'I told you so'."] = "這就是我保你活命，{name}。你別逼我說「我早說過」。"
L["I prayed over this group, {name}. The Light said 'good luck'. I'll take it."] = "為這隊禱告了，{name}。聖光說「祝好運」。也行。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer you berries, but I ate them all."] = "謝謝，{name}。本想請你吃莓果，但我全吃光了。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Like rain in a dry season."] = "謝了，{name}。像旱季裡的一場雨。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My cat form wants to bring you a rabbit. I've said no."] = "多謝，{name}。我變豹時想叼兔子送你，被我攔了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll plant a tree in your honour. Give it a century."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會為你種棵樹。給它一百年。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May your road stay green and your water sweet."] = "謝謝，{name}。願你的路常青，水常甜。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. I felt that right down to my roots."] = "真好心，{name}。一路暖到我的根。"
L["Nature returns everything eventually, {name}. I'm quicker. Thank you."] = "自然終究會歸還一切，{name}。我比較快。謝謝。"
L["Barkskin keeps most things out, {name}. Kindness got straight through. Thanks."] = "樹皮術擋得住刀劍，{name}，擋不住善意。謝了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. As a bear this would be a hug. Be glad I'm in this shape."] = "謝謝，{name}。變熊的話就是熊抱了，算你好運。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Give me a moment to remember which shape has hands."] = "當然，{name}。等等，我想想哪個形態有手。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still, like an oak. Oaks are wonderful at it."] = "當然，{name}。像橡樹一樣站好。橡樹超會站。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The wild shares everything. Well, not the bears."] = "樂意，{name}。大自然什麼都分享。呃，熊除外。"
L["Right away, {name}. The wild's had a good season; it can spare this."] = "馬上，{name}。荒野今年收成好，分得出這個。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nature doesn't take requests, but I do."] = "當然，{name}。大自然不接受點歌，我接受。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ask a tree and you'll wait a year. Ask a druid and it's now."] = "樂意，{name}。問樹要等一年，問德魯伊馬上有。"
L["Of course, {name}. The balance tips a little your way. Don't tell the balance."] = "當然，{name}。平衡稍微偏向你了。別告訴平衡。"
L["I'd have run over, {name}, but as a cheetah, and you'd have screamed. Here."] = "本想跑過來，{name}，但變成獵豹你會尖叫。給你。"
L["Of course, {name}. The wild is kind to all who ask. Midges excepted."] = "當然，{name}。荒野善待每個開口的人。蚊子除外。"
L["Fresh from the Emerald Dream, {name}. Sorry if I yawn."] = "剛出翡翠夢境，{name}。打呵欠請見諒。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nature provides, and I'm its errand runner today."] = "拿著，{name}。自然供應一切，今天我負責跑腿。"
L["The wild calls you friend now, {name}. Handy, since most of it has teeth."] = "荒野當你是朋友了，{name}。很實用，它大多有牙。"
L["I'd have picked you flowers, {name}, but this keeps better."] = "本想摘花給你，{name}，但這個比較耐放。"
L["Here, {name}. Cenarius would want you to have it. I'm nearly sure."] = "給你，{name}。塞納留斯會希望你收下。應該吧。"
L["Here, {name}. For cold nights, sharp claws and long roads."] = "給你，{name}。為了寒夜、利爪和長路。"
L["Take this, {name}. The wild has been watching you, and it's decided you'll do."] = "拿著，{name}。荒野觀察你很久了，決定你及格了。"
L["There, {name}. Walk lightly, and the forest will walk with you."] = "好了，{name}。腳步放輕，森林會與你同行。"
L["For you, {name}. The Moonglade sends its regards. It sends very few."] = "給你，{name}。月光林地向你問好。它很少問候誰。"
L["Nature is cruel, lovely and damp, {name}. This helps with two of those."] = "大自然殘酷、美麗又潮濕，{name}。這能擋兩樣。"
L["I tie strangers up in roots most days, {name}. This is the nicer part."] = "我平常用根鬚綁路人，{name}。這是和善的那一面。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Now, whatever happens, nobody startle the bear."] = "準備好了，{name}？拿著。不管發生什麼，誰都別嚇著熊。"
L["There, {name}. I'll be the cat, the bear or, if we must swim, the seal."] = "好了，{name}。我會當貓、當熊，要游泳就當海豹。"
L["Take this, {name}. I've one rebirth in me. Please, nobody make me choose."] = "拿著，{name}。我只有一次復生。拜託別讓我選。"
L["Close ranks, {name}, and take this. The forest is watching, and rooting for us."] = "靠攏，{name}，拿著這個。森林在看著，也在為我們扎根加油。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll heal or I'll maul. Tell me which before it's urgent."] = "拿著，{name}。我要麼治療要麼撕咬。趁還不急，告訴我選哪個。"
L["This is free, {name}. My one Innervate goes to the most desperate. No acting."] = "這個免費，{name}。我唯一的啟動給最絕望的人。別裝。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I start glowing and hooting, that's moonkin. Serious."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我開始發光還咕咕叫，那是梟獸形態。很嚴肅的。"
L["For you, {name}. If it gets crowded, I'll call a Hurricane. Hold your hats."] = "給你的，{name}。人一多我就召颶風。抓緊帽子。"
L["We move like a herd, {name}, all blessed. Mixed herd. One is sometimes a bear."] = "我們像獸群一樣走，{name}，個個受了祝福。混編獸群。有一個時不時變熊。"
L["Kindness, {name}? My favourite virtue. Just ahead of polishing."] = "善意，{name}？我最愛的美德，險勝擦亮盔甲。"
L["For that, {name}, my best blessing. Not the second best. The best."] = "給你最好的祝福，{name}。不是次好，是最好。"
L["Virtue rewarded on the spot, {name}! I do love it when that happens."] = "善有善報，當場兌現，{name}！我最愛這種時候。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My oath says to repay kindness. I'd do it anyway."] = "謝謝，{name}。誓言要我報恩，但沒有誓言我也會。"
L["I'll judge you favourably, {name}. I judge most things harshly. Thank you."] = "我會從寬審判你，{name}。別人我都嚴審。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My aura just brightened. It does that when I'm touched."] = "謝謝，{name}。光環亮了一下，我一感動就這樣。"
L["A kindness, {name}! I'll have it engraved on my shield, beside the dents."] = "真是善舉，{name}！我要刻在盾上，就在凹痕旁。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My warhorse sends thanks as well. He's more reserved."] = "多謝，{name}。我的戰馬也道謝，牠比較含蓄。"
L["I swore to protect the good, {name}. You've just gone to the top of the list."] = "我發誓守護好人，{name}。你剛登上名單第一名。"
L["By the Light, {name}, of course! I've been hoping somebody would ask."] = "以聖光之名，{name}，當然！我一直在等人開口。"
L["You have my blessing, {name}, in every sense."] = "我祝福你，{name}，各種意義上都是。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Kneel if you like. I won't insist. I'll be delighted."] = "當然，{name}。想跪就跪，不勉強。但我會很開心。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I never run short of blessings. Mana, now and then."] = "樂意，{name}。祝福我從不缺，法力偶爾缺。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim is righteous; my gauntlets are clumsy."] = "當然，{name}。別動。我瞄得正義，但鐵手套很笨。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Helping is the oath. Shining while I do it is a bonus."] = "樂意，{name}。幫忙是誓言，順便發光是額外福利。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast, chin up, and look deserving. There. You do."] = "當然，{name}。站穩抬頭，一臉值得。好，你值得。"
L["Of course, {name}. You'd be amazed how rarely anyone asks the tin can for help."] = "當然，{name}。你不會相信，很少人找鐵罐頭幫忙。"
L["Of course, {name}. A moment while I pick the blessing. I do have favourites."] = "當然，{name}。等我挑個祝福。我是有偏心的。"
L["The Light asks nothing in return, {name}. I, however, accept thanks."] = "聖光不求回報，{name}。但我接受道謝。"
L["Go with the Light, {name}. I'll be right behind you, clanking."] = "與聖光同行，{name}。我在你身後哐啷哐啷。"
L["The blessing's free, {name}. You've been spared the sermon. This time."] = "祝福免費，{name}。講道就免了，這次先放過你。"
L["There, {name}. It won't last forever, so be heroic while it does."] = "好了，{name}。它不會永久，趁它還在當個英雄。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. The Light walks with you, and it has excellent posture."] = "挺起胸膛，{name}。聖光與你同行，它站姿超標準。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give you my hammer too, but it's very attached to me."] = "拿著，{name}。本想連錘子也給你，但它很黏我。"
L["Blessings are for handing out, {name}. Hoarding them is frowned upon. By me."] = "祝福就是拿來發的，{name}。囤積會被白眼。被我。"
L["Justice for the wicked, blessings for the rest, {name}. You're the rest."] = "惡人得正義，其他人得祝福，{name}。你是其他人。"
L["Take this, {name}. My libram says to share. It says a lot; this bit I like."] = "拿著，{name}。聖契說要分享。它囉嗦，這段我愛。"
L["Chivalry isn't dead, {name}. It's in heavy armour, and it brought you this."] = "騎士精神沒死，{name}。它穿上重甲，帶來了這個。"
L["Wear it with pride, {name}. Pride's a sin, but only in large amounts."] = "帶著驕傲收下，{name}。驕傲是罪，但適量無妨。"
L["You're blessed, {name}. Keep behind my shield and we'll do fine."] = "祝福好了，{name}。待在我盾後，我們會沒事。"
L["Stand fast, {name}, blessed. We have the Light, and I have a very large hammer."] = "站穩，{name}，你已受了祝福。我們有聖光，我還有把很大的錘子。"
L["One blessing each, {name}. The Light is generous, but it insists on turns."] = "一人一個祝福，{name}。聖光很慷慨，但要排隊。"
L["Splendid, {name}, you're blessed. Don't look at me. I'm rather bright today."] = "好極了，{name}，你已受祝福。別看我。我今天亮得很。"
L["That's my blessing, {name}. Stay inside my aura too. It's warmer than it looks."] = "這是我的祝福，{name}。也待在我的光環裡。比看起來暖和。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I stun something, hit it while it's thinking things over."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是把什麼擊暈了，趁它還在發愣就揍。"
L["Blessed, {name}. The glowing ground is mine too; stand in it. It bites them."] = "祝福好了，{name}。發光的地面也是我的；站上去。只咬牠們。"
L["Take this blessing, {name}. I judge them, you sentence them. Efficient court."] = "收下這份祝福，{name}。我審判牠們，你來判刑。高效的法庭。"
L["Blessed, {name}. If I shout 'for the Light', it means charge. Or pray. Or both."] = "祝福好了，{name}。我喊「為了聖光」，就是衝鋒。或者祈禱。或者都要。"
L["Armour polished, hammer blessed, {name}, and now you too. My horse is sulking."] = "盔甲擦亮了，錘子祝福過了，{name}，現在你也是。我的馬在鬧彆扭。"
L["That's your blessing, {name}. Mine is Righteous Fury. Let them come to me."] = "這是你的祝福，{name}。我的是正義之怒。讓牠們衝我來。"
L["How kind, {name}. My imp says thank you too. He's lying, but I'm not."] = "真好心，{name}。小鬼也說謝謝。它說謊，我沒有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It's been ages since anyone gave me something uncursed."] = "謝謝，{name}。好久沒人送我沒被詛咒的東西了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll repay you with something I didn't find in a crypt."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會拿不是墓穴撿來的東西還你。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. I've asked the voidwalker to stop looming at you."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。我叫虛無行者別再杵著瞪你了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk cross the road when they see me."] = "謝謝，{name}。多數人看到我都繞道走。"
L["No blood, no bargain, no binding, {name}? What a strange way to trade. Thanks."] = "不見血、不立約、不綁魂，{name}？怪交易，謝了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should anything haunt you, send it my way."] = "謝謝，{name}。若有東西纏上你，丟給我處理。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. Everything I'm given, I return. Except souls. Here."] = "真貼心，{name}。收到的我都還，靈魂除外。給你。"
L["Of course, {name}. No soul required. This time."] = "當然，{name}。不需要靈魂。這次。"
L["You asked a warlock for help, {name}. Bold. I like you already."] = "你找術士幫忙，{name}？有膽。我已經喜歡你了。"
L["Of course, {name}. The imp offered to help, and I said no, for all our sakes."] = "當然，{name}。小鬼說要幫忙，為大家好我拒絕了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Of all my spells, this is the one I can do at parties."] = "當然，{name}。我唯一能在派對上用的法術。"
L["Gladly, {name}. A good deed on my record; the Shadow Council would be appalled."] = "樂意，{name}。記上一筆善行，暗影議會會嚇壞的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't read the book I'm holding. For your own sake."] = "當然，{name}。別看我手上的書。為你好。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Feel watched? That's only the Eye of Kilrogg. Hold still."] = "當然，{name}。被盯著？只是基爾羅格之眼。別動。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only curse people who don't ask nicely. You're quite safe."] = "當然，{name}。我只詛咒不客氣的人。你很安全。"
L["Yes, {name}, it's the one without screaming. Hold still."] = "對，{name}，是沒有慘叫的那個。別動。"
L["Of course, {name}. Going somewhere wet? I won't ask. Warlocks never ask."] = "當然，{name}。要去玩水？我不問。術士從不過問。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't ask where it came from. Really, don't."] = "給你，{name}。別問從哪來的。真的，別問。"
L["Fall in a lake someday, {name}, and you'll think of me fondly."] = "哪天掉進湖裡，{name}，你會很想念我。"
L["Breathe easy, {name}. I'd hate to lose you to anything as dull as water."] = "放心呼吸，{name}。淹死太無聊了，不配你。"
L["Here, {name}. You'll want a soulstone too, but that's a bigger conversation."] = "給你，{name}。你還會想要靈魂石，但那得另外談。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only spell of mine the priests approve of."] = "拿著，{name}。這是我唯一被牧師認可的法術。"
L["Take this, {name}. My mother still thinks I'm a mage. Let's keep it that way."] = "拿著，{name}。我媽還以為我是法師。別說出去。"
L["Here, {name}. It isn't green, it doesn't whisper, and it won't follow you home."] = "給你，{name}。它不綠、不低語，也不會跟你回家。"
L["Here, {name}. Dark magic, used for good. Do tell my old tutor; he'll hate it."] = "黑魔法行善，{name}。去跟我老師講，他會氣死。"
L["Here, {name}. I keep the darker spells for people who've earned them."] = "給你，{name}。更黑暗的法術，留給自找的人。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm not all curses and fear. Mostly, but not all."] = "給你，{name}。詛咒和恐懼不是我的全部。大半是。"
L["My grimoire has a chapter on kindness, {name}. It's short, but I've read it."] = "我的魔典有一章講善良，{name}。很短，但我讀過。"
L["Everyone ready, {name}? Souls intact? Take this; let's keep it that way."] = "都準備好了嗎，{name}？靈魂都完整？拿著；保持下去。"
L["Take this and stay close, {name}. The voidwalker takes hits; I take the credit."] = "拿著，待近點，{name}。虛無行者挨打，功勞歸我。"
L["Swim all you like, {name}. If anyone drifts off, I'll summon them back."] = "盡情游吧，{name}。誰漂走了，我再召喚回來。"
L["Do pet the felhunter, {name}. Just take your spells off first."] = "摸摸地獄獵犬吧，{name}。先把法術卸下就好。"
L["For you, {name}. If I fear something, don't chase it. It comes back angrier."] = "給你的，{name}。我恐懼了什麼，別去追。牠會更火大地回來。"
L["I trade blood for mana, {name}, and mana for this. It looks worse than it is."] = "我拿血換法力，{name}，再拿法力換這個。看著嚇人，其實還好。"
L["This now, {name}; healthstones after. For a crisis, mind, not as a snack."] = "先拿這個，{name}；治療石回頭再給。危急時用，別當零嘴。"
L["Take this, {name}, and keep clear when I cast Hellfire. I burn too. Tragic."] = "拿著，{name}，我放地獄火時離遠點。我自己也燒。悲劇。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the imp. He's on fire, and ours. Don't douse him."] = "這是我給的，{name}，不是小鬼給的。牠著著火，是自己人。別澆滅牠。"
L["Take this, {name}. If something green falls from the sky, that's mine. Cheer."] = "拿著，{name}。天上要是掉下綠色的東西，那是我的。歡呼吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Sorry, was that loud? I only have the one volume."] = "謝謝你，{name}！太大聲了？抱歉，我只有這音量。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. No spells to give back, but I do a very sincere shout."] = "多謝，{name}。沒法術可回，但我能很真誠地吼。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Now I'm twice as angry. In the good way."] = "謝了，{name}。我加倍火大了。好的那種。"
L["Thanks, {name}. You've earned a place right behind me. Safest spot there is."] = "謝了，{name}。你贏得我正後方的位置，最安全。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness makes me soft. Luckily I've plenty of armour."] = "謝謝，{name}。善意讓我心軟。還好我盔甲夠厚。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My armourer thanks you too. I paid for his house."] = "謝謝，{name}。鐵匠也謝你，他的房子是我付的。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd bandage something for you, but you look annoyingly fine."] = "謝了，{name}。想幫你包紮，可惜你好得讓人扼腕。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I switched to my grateful stance for that. It's rarely used."] = "謝謝，{name}。我切到感恩姿態了。這姿態很少用。"
L["You've given me magic, {name}. No idea where to keep it. I'll wear it. Thanks."] = "你給我魔法了，{name}。沒處放，就穿著吧。謝了。"
L["Owing folk makes me restless, {name}, and restless makes me charge things."] = "欠人情讓我坐立難安，{name}，一不安我就想衝鋒。"
L["You want a shout, {name}? I was going to shout anyway."] = "要我吼一聲，{name}？反正我本來就要吼。"
L["Of course, {name}. A fighter who asks for courage already has some."] = "當然，{name}。敢開口要勇氣的鬥士，本來就有勇氣。"
L["Right away, {name}. Square your shoulders. There, that's half of it."] = "馬上，{name}。挺起肩膀。好，這就成功一半了。"
L["Happily, {name}! Go hit something for me."] = "樂意，{name}！幫我去揍點東西。"
L["Right, {name}. Deep breath. Not you. Me."] = "好，{name}。深呼吸。不是你，是我。"
L["Happy to, {name}. First request today that didn't involve lifting something."] = "樂意，{name}。今天第一個不用扛東西的請求。"
L["Coming up, {name}. Plant your feet. This one has a kick to it."] = "來了，{name}。站穩，這個很夠勁。"
L["Of course, {name}. Most folk only ask me to stop. This is a nice change."] = "當然，{name}。大家通常只叫我閉嘴。這次真新鮮。"
L["Of course, {name}. Took me years to learn. Years of yelling at trees, mostly."] = "當然，{name}。我練了好幾年，主要是對著樹吼。"
L["Consider yourself shouted at, {name}. Affectionately."] = "你被我吼了，{name}。充滿愛的那種。"
L["No incense, no prayers, {name}. Just me, shouting encouragingly."] = "不燒香，不禱告，{name}。只有我在大吼加油。"
L["Chin up, {name}, and take this! If anything bothers you, I'll charge it."] = "打起精神，{name}，拿著！誰惹你，我就衝過去。"
L["There, {name}! Anything that doesn't feel braver now wasn't listening."] = "好了，{name}！還不覺得更勇敢的，就是沒在聽。"
L["Here, {name}, some courage. Spend it freely; I've plenty more."] = "給你，{name}，一點勇氣。儘管用，我多得是。"
L["Here, {name}. Something sharper than a whetstone: morale."] = "給你，{name}。比磨刀石更利的東西：士氣。"
L["Take this, {name}. Warriors don't carry spells, so we carry each other."] = "拿著，{name}。戰士不帶法術，所以我們互相扛。"
L["Here, {name}. You look about to walk into something big. Walk in harder."] = "給你，{name}。你看起來要闖大事了。闖猛一點。"
L["Here, {name}. No magic in it. Just a warrior believing in you, very firmly."] = "給你，{name}。沒魔法，只有一個戰士死命相信你。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's loud, it's free, and I mean it."] = "拿著，{name}。夠大聲、免費，而且我是真心的。"
L["Here, {name}. Tell whatever you fight that a warrior vouched for you."] = "給你，{name}。跟你的對手說，有個戰士替你擔保。"
L["That one was for you, {name}. The next one's for whatever's in your way."] = "這一吼是給你的，{name}。下一吼給擋你路的東西。"
L["Listen up, {name}! That's it. That was the whole speech."] = "聽好了，{name}！就這樣。演講結束。"
L["Take this, {name}. Where's the danger? Never mind, I'll find it. Face first."] = "拿著，{name}。危險在哪？算了，我去找。臉先上。"
L["Right, {name}! Take this. I go first, shout loudest; nobody touches the healer."] = "好，{name}！拿著。我打頭，我嗓門最大；誰也別碰治療。"
L["Everybody angrier? Good. Onward, {name}, and mind my backswing."] = "都更火大了？好。前進，{name}，別被我揮到。"
L["Here, {name}. I need hitting before I'm useful. Don't panic when it happens."] = "拿著，{name}。我得先挨揍才派得上用場。到時候別慌。"
L["This first, {name}. Bandages are in my pack too; I tied the knots. Very secure."] = "先拿這個，{name}。背包裡也有繃帶；結是我打的。特別牢。"
L["Right, {name}: take this. I take hits, you take credit, we split the repairs."] = "好，{name}：拿著。我挨打，你領功，修理費平攤。"
L["For you, {name}. If I go red and quiet, that's Berserker Rage. Loud is fine."] = "給你的，{name}。我要是臉紅了還不出聲，那是狂暴之怒。吵吵嚷嚷就沒事。"
L["Take this, {name}. My shield's seen worse than this. So has my face. Onward."] = "拿著，{name}。我的盾見過更糟的。我的臉也是。走。"
L["The living rarely lend me much, {name}. I'll be prompt, in case it catches on."] = "活人很少借我東西，{name}。我會儘快還，說不定能帶動風氣。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I owe you one fight at your side, on a day of your choosing."] = "謝謝，{name}。我欠你一場並肩作戰，日子由你挑。"
L["The skulls came with the armour, {name}. The gratitude is all my own."] = "骷髏是盔甲附的，{name}。感激全是我自己的。"
L["My one healing spell only mends the dead, {name}. Do stay healthy. Thank you."] = "我唯一的治療法術只醫得了死人，{name}。你千萬保重。謝謝。"
L["Your kindness is safe with me, {name}. Very little else is. Thank you."] = "你的好意交給我很安全，{name}。別的就難說了。謝謝。"
L["I've stood at the runeforge all night for less than that, {name}. Thank you."] = "為了比這還少的回報，我鑄過一整夜的符文，{name}。謝謝。"
L["The Ebon Blade answers courtesy in kind, {name}, and insults with the blade."] = "黯刃騎士團以禮還禮，{name}，以刃還辱。"
L["Tonight's watch will pass quicker for that, {name}, and I keep a great many."] = "有這個，今晚守夜會過得快些，{name}。我守的夜可多了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Ride with me a while, if your horse will stand next to mine."] = "謝謝，{name}。陪我騎一段吧，要是你的馬敢挨著我的馬。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll have the dead salute you. Badly, but with feeling."] = "謝謝，{name}。我讓亡者向你敬禮。歪歪扭扭，但誠意十足。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand fast; the horn is loud, and the cold follows it."] = "好，{name}。站穩了，號角很響，寒氣緊跟在後。"
L["Of course, {name}. Most of what I do is quick or final. This is the quick kind."] = "當然，{name}。我做事不是快，就是一了百了。這次是快的。"
L["You have my horn and my word, {name}. One is louder; the other lasts longer."] = "號角和承諾都給你，{name}。一個比較響，一個比較久。"
L["Of course, {name}. Mind the runeblade. It doesn't know you yet."] = "當然，{name}。小心符文劍，它還不認識你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I'd far rather sound a horn for a friend than a dirge."] = "樂意，{name}。比起吹輓歌，我寧可為朋友吹號角。"
L["At once, {name}. A knight who makes an ally wait isn't worth their runes."] = "馬上，{name}。讓盟友乾等的騎士，配不上身上的符文。"
L["Yes, {name}. Step into view; this helm was made for glaring, not for looking."] = "好，{name}。站到我面前來，這頭盔是拿來瞪人的，不是拿來看的。"
L["The Ebon Blade serves the living now, {name}. Even the impatient ones."] = "黯刃騎士團如今為生者效力，{name}。急性子也一樣。"
L["Of course, {name}. Pay no mind to the frost on your boots. It brushes off."] = "當然，{name}。靴子結霜別在意，拍一拍就掉了。"
L["The paladins at Light's Hope ask far more stiffly, {name}. They still get it."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的聖騎士開口可比你僵硬多了，{name}。照樣有份。"
L["Hear that, {name}? Winter, on your side for once."] = "聽到了嗎，{name}？寒冬難得站在你這邊。"
L["The horn sounds for you, {name}. It used to sound only for the Scourge."] = "號角為你而鳴，{name}。它以前只為天譴軍團吹響。"
L["Take this, {name}, and advice from a death knight: never fight fair, nor alone."] = "拿著，{name}，再聽死亡騎士一句：別講公平，也別單打獨鬥。"
L["Acherus floats over the Plaguelands, {name}. It's good to come down and help."] = "亞榭洛飄在瘟疫之地上空，{name}。偶爾下來幫個忙挺好的。"
L["The road's dark, {name}; I'm usually the darkest thing on it. Take this along."] = "路很黑，{name}；我通常是路上最黑的東西。帶上這個。"
L["You looked a little short of an army, {name}. A horn is the next best thing."] = "看你身邊少了支軍隊，{name}。先拿號角頂著。"
L["Here, {name}. My ghoul wanted to say hello. I've spared you that."] = "給，{name}。我的食屍鬼想跟你打招呼，我幫你擋了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Cold, loud and well meant, like most of my order."] = "拿著，{name}。又冷又吵，但出於好意，就像我們騎士團多數人。"
L["Whatever waits out there, {name}, I've likely killed its cousin. Take this."] = "外頭不管有什麼，{name}，我大概都殺過它表親。拿著。"
L["Take this and keep moving, {name}. Trouble tends to follow death knights about."] = "拿著，繼續走，{name}。麻煩總愛跟著死亡騎士。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I raise an army, be civil. They didn't ask to be here."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是召喚大軍，客氣點。它們也不想來。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Walk where I walk; the frost holds us up over any lake."] = "給你的，{name}。踩著我的腳印走；冰霜能托著我們走過任何湖。"
L["For you, {name}. If I look hurt, let me hit something. That's how I mend."] = "給你的，{name}。我看著受傷了，就讓我揍點什麼。我是這麼回血的。"
L["Take this, {name}. My ghoul goes in first. He won't mind. Long past minding."] = "拿著，{name}。我的食屍鬼先上。它不在乎。早就不在乎了。"
L["Here, {name}, to keep up. The dead don't tire, and I forget the living do."] = "拿著，{name}，好跟上。死人不會累，我老忘了活人會。"
L["Take this and don't fall, {name}. I can bring you back, but it's unsettling."] = "拿著，別倒下，{name}。我能把你拉回來，但那滋味瘮人。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Leave the fevers to me; they spread on their own."] = "給你的，{name}。疫病交給我；它們自己會傳開。"
L["The horn has sounded, {name}. Whatever heard it knows we're coming."] = "號角已響，{name}。聽見的都知道我們要來了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever we kill today stays dead. I'll see to it myself."] = "拿著，{name}。今天殺的，都別想再起來。我親自盯著。"
L["Take this, pick a target, {name}, and I'll pick it too. Shorter arguments."] = "拿著，挑個目標，{name}，我也挑它。省得吵。"
L["Take a gift with both hands, my master said, {name}. And return it with both."] = "師父說，收禮要雙手接，{name}。回禮也要雙手奉上。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel light enough to run up a waterfall. I may try."] = "謝謝，{name}。我身輕得能跑上瀑布。搞不好真去試試。"
L["I meditated on generosity for years, {name}. You skipped to the end. Thank you."] = "我冥想慷慨之道多年，{name}，你直接跳到結尾。謝謝。"
L["I came out into the world to find good people, {name}. That's one. Thank you."] = "我出來闖蕩，是為了尋找好人，{name}。找到一個了。謝謝。"
L["The masters at the Peak of Serenity would bow to that, {name}. So do I."] = "寂靜峰的大師們見了也會鞠躬，{name}。我也是。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. The next brigand who jumps me gets one kick fewer."] = "真好心，{name}。下個偷襲我的強盜可以少挨一腳。"
L["A kindness is like a strike, {name}: it's all in the timing. Yours was perfect."] = "善意就像出拳，{name}：關鍵在時機。你這下剛剛好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. These hands were trained to strike. Today they get to give."] = "謝謝，{name}。這雙手練來出擊，今天也能用來回禮。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Answered the monk's way: no wasted motion, no wasted words."] = "謝謝，{name}。武僧式回禮：不多一招，不多一字。"
L["Gratitude makes even a monk clumsy, {name}. Forgive the elbows. Thank you."] = "一感動，武僧也會笨手笨腳，{name}。手肘撞到你請見諒。謝謝。"
L["Of course, {name}. My master took a year to teach me this. I'll take a moment."] = "當然，{name}。師父花一年教我，我只要一下子。"
L["One of the old legacies, {name}, handed down to me and now to you."] = "古老的傳承之一，{name}，傳到我手上，現在傳給你。"
L["Nothing calms the mind like being useful, {name}. You've done me a favour."] = "沒什麼比派上用場更能靜心，{name}。是你幫了我。"
L["Of course, {name}. My hands know this one by heart. I just tell them who."] = "當然，{name}。這招我的手熟得很，我只要告訴它給誰。"
L["At once, {name}. The fist is for foes; the open palm is for friends."] = "馬上，{name}。拳頭給敵人，掌心給朋友。"
L["Of course, {name}, one moment. Mid-form; bad luck to stop on the left foot."] = "當然，{name}，稍等。我正打著套路；停在左腳上不吉利。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I was only standing still to see what it felt like."] = "樂意，{name}。我站著不動，只是想試試是什麼感覺。"
L["At once, {name}. If you blinked, you missed it. That's fine; it's on you now."] = "馬上，{name}。眨眼就錯過了。沒關係，已經在你身上了。"
L["Of course, {name}. It costs me a breath and a moment, and I've plenty of both."] = "當然，{name}。只花我一口氣、一點時間，這兩樣我多的是。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask me every day, if you like. Monks love a routine."] = "當然，{name}。想的話天天來找我。武僧最愛每日功課。"
L["I passed you twice on my morning run, {name}. The third time, I stopped. Here."] = "晨跑時我經過你兩次，{name}。第三次，我停下來了。給。"
L["Your stance says long day, {name}. Monks notice. Take this."] = "看你的架勢就知道今天很漫長，{name}。武僧看得出來。拿著。"
L["A monk gives before being asked, {name}. It saves us both the bowing."] = "武僧不等人開口就給，{name}。省得我們互相鞠躬。"
L["Take this, {name}. My master said one kind act before every meal. I'm hungry."] = "拿著，{name}。師父說每餐前要行一善。我餓了。"
L["Kindness is the hardest stance to hold, {name}. I'm practising. Here."] = "善意是最難撐住的架式，{name}。我在練。給。"
L["I practised patience by not giving you this, {name}. I lasted three heartbeats."] = "我想練耐心，忍住不給你，{name}。只撐了三次心跳。"
L["Take this, {name}, and be gentle out there. Unless a hozen starts it."] = "拿著，{name}，在外面溫和點。除非猴人先動手。"
L["A calm mind finds the road, {name}. This should keep you steady on it."] = "心靜自然找得到路，{name}。這能讓你走得穩。"
L["The Last Emperor left Pandaria a legacy, {name}. I'm leaving you a small one."] = "末代皇帝紹昊為潘達利亞留下傳承，{name}。我留給你一份小的。"
L["For you, {name}. No lesson attached. My masters would be appalled."] = "給你，{name}。不附帶任何教誨。師父們知道會嚇壞。"
L["For your feet, {name}. Stay light on them; a heavy step is an easy target."] = "給你腳下用的，{name}。腳步放輕；步子沉就是好靶子。"
L["Take this, {name}. If they surround us, I'll spin. Stand back; I'm not tidy."] = "拿著，{name}。要是被圍了，我就轉起來。退後；我轉得可不講究。"
L["Fight from your centre, {name}. If you can't find yours, borrow mine."] = "從丹田發力，{name}。找不到你的，就借我的。"
L["Take this, {name}. If one freezes mid-swing, that's me. Leave it till last."] = "拿著，{name}。要是有個揮到一半定住了，那是我幹的。留到最後。"
L["That's for you, {name}. You go high, I'll go low. Nobody guards both at once."] = "給你的，{name}。你打上，我打下。沒人能同時護住兩處。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Loose shoulders, soft knees, firm intentions."] = "準備好了，{name}？拿著。肩放鬆，膝放軟，心意要堅。"
L["Take this, {name}. Any weapon I take off them stays taken. They held it badly."] = "拿著，{name}。我繳的兵器就不還了。他們握得太差。"
L["Here, {name}. Leave the runners to me. Nothing outruns a monk with a grudge."] = "拿著，{name}。逃跑的交給我。記了仇的武僧誰也甩不掉。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I end a fight with one touch, don't ask. It took years."] = "拿著，{name}。要是我一碰就結束戰鬥，別問。練了好些年。"
L["This steadies the temper, {name}. Anger opens a door, and the Sha walk in."] = "這能穩住脾氣，{name}。怒火一開門，煞就進來了。"
L["That was well cast, {name}. I would know. Thank you."] = "施得漂亮，{name}。這我是行家。謝謝。"
L["I have studied fire, time and the Dream, {name}. You still surprised me."] = "火焰、時間和翡翠夢境我都鑽研過，{name}。你還是讓我意外。"
L["Dragons give big gifts slowly, {name}. Yours was small and quick. I prefer it."] = "龍送大禮總是慢吞吞，{name}。你的又小又快，我更喜歡。"
L["I'll dip a wing to you when I next fly over, {name}. Watch for it."] = "下次飛過你頭頂，我會壓壓翅膀向你致意，{name}。注意看。"
L["I've known dragons with worse manners, {name}, and some of them were Aspects."] = "我認識的龍裡，比你沒禮貌的多得是，{name}，有些還是守護巨龍。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I answer in kind, with magic older than your kingdoms."] = "謝謝，{name}。我也回禮，用比你們王國還古老的魔法。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm delighted. You can tell by the faint smoke."] = "謝謝，{name}。我很開心，看這縷輕煙就知道。"
L["Generous, {name}, and not a trace of showing off. I must learn that part."] = "真慷慨，{name}，還一點都不炫耀。這點我得學。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned at once. My aim is perfect; my patience is not."] = "謝謝，{name}。立刻回禮。我準頭完美，耐心就差多了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I shall cite you, should I ever write a treatise on manners."] = "謝謝，{name}。哪天我寫禮儀論著，一定引用你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Help from a dragon once took a quest. Things have improved."] = "樂意，{name}。以前求龍幫忙得先冒險一番，現在方便多了。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Or hover, if you are able. No? Standing will do."] = "別動，{name}。能浮空就浮著。不會？那站著也行。"
L["Watch closely, {name}. My casting is said to be a joy to watch. Mostly by me."] = "看仔細，{name}。據說我施法賞心悅目。主要是我自己說的。"
L["It would be my pleasure, {name}. Truly. I don't say 'truly' lightly."] = "這是我的榮幸，{name}。真的。我可不輕易說「真的」。"
L["Of course, {name}. Magic this old ought to be spent kindly, and you qualify."] = "當然，{name}。這麼古老的魔法該用在好人身上，你夠格。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask again tomorrow; I'll have improved it overnight."] = "當然，{name}。明天再來，我會連夜改良它。"
L["You need only ask, {name}. I am curious how it will look on you."] = "開口就行，{name}。我也好奇它在你身上會是什麼樣子。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Think of something calm. Not dragons."] = "沒問題，{name}。想點平靜的事。別想龍。"
L["On the Forbidden Reach we practised on rocks, {name}. You are an improvement."] = "在禁忌之境，我們拿石頭練習，{name}。你好多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You're standing exactly where I'd have put you. Well done."] = "當然，{name}。你站的正是我會安排的位置。很好。"
L["Take this, {name}. I meant to explain the spell first. Too late now."] = "拿著，{name}。本想先解釋這法術的。來不及了。"
L["For you, {name}. Unasked, unearned and entirely deserved. Draconic logic."] = "給你，{name}。不必開口，不必掙，完全應得。龍的邏輯。"
L["I spotted you from afar, {name}. Evokers have sharp eyes and little restraint."] = "老遠就看到你了，{name}。喚能師眼尖，又管不住手。"
L["Evokers study for years to cast this well, {name}. You need only stand there."] = "喚能師苦學多年才能施好這個，{name}。你只要站著。"
L["You'll be glad of this soon, {name}. Don't ask how I know. Bronze business."] = "你很快就會慶幸有它，{name}。別問我怎麼知道。青銅龍的事。"
L["I could be flying right now, {name}, and instead I'm helping you. Do take note."] = "我現在本可以在天上飛，{name}，卻在這裡幫你。記好了。"
L["Here, {name}. Old magic, new caster. We're both doing rather well."] = "給，{name}。古老的魔法，年輕的施法者。我們都表現不錯。"
L["Not my grandest spell, {name}, but the one I'd most like to be known for."] = "這不是我最壯觀的法術，{name}，卻是我最想以它聞名的。"
L["I have read about heroes, {name}. You look like the early chapters. Take this."] = "我讀過英雄的故事，{name}。你看著像開頭那幾章。拿著。"
L["Magic can't stay up in the sky, {name}. Sooner or later it lands on somebody."] = "魔法不能一直待在天上，{name}。遲早會落到某人身上。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I seize you and fly, it is a rescue, not an abduction."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是抓起你就飛，那是營救，不是綁架。"
L["That's for you, {name}. I fight from a little way back. The view is better."] = "給你的，{name}。我在稍遠處戰鬥。視野更好。"
L["Take this, {name}, and leave their spellcasters to me. Their technique offends."] = "拿著，{name}，他們的施法者交給我。那手法讓我看不下去。"
L["Hold the line, {name}, with this. I'll be the bright thing over your shoulder."] = "帶著這個守住陣線，{name}。我會是你肩頭上那道亮光。"
L["Take this, {name}. Dragons fight in three dimensions; enemies rarely look up."] = "拿著，{name}。龍是三維作戰的；敵人很少抬頭看。"
L["I've made you all a little more than you were, {name}. The rest is up to you."] = "我讓你們都比原本強了一點，{name}。剩下的靠你們。"
L["Here, {name}. If I take a long breath, do not startle me. It is still growing."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是在長長吸氣，別嚇我。還在蓄著。"
L["Fight well with this, {name}. I am taking notes on how mortals do it. Loudly."] = "帶著這個好好打，{name}。我在記凡人是怎麼打的。目前看來：很吵。"
L["Time is on our side, {name}. I have checked with it, and borrowed some for you."] = "時間站在我們這邊，{name}。我跟它確認過，還替你借了一點。"
L["Take this, {name}, and try to keep up. Not showing off; flying is just quicker."] = "拿著，{name}，盡量跟上。不是炫耀；飛就是快。"
L["Rain, fire and a rockslide this week, {name}. That was the first gentle thing."] = "這週有雨、有火、還有山崩，{name}。這是第一件溫柔的事。"
L["The fifth element is spirit, {name}, and yours is a generous one. Thank you."] = "第五元素是靈魂，{name}，而你的靈魂很慷慨。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The rain can wash everything off me today but that."] = "謝謝，{name}。今天雨能沖掉我身上的一切，唯獨這個不行。"
L["Earth is patient and fire is not, {name}. My thanks takes after fire."] = "大地有耐心，火焰沒有，{name}。我的謝意像火，等不及。"
L["Most days I speak for the elements, {name}. Today's thanks are my own."] = "平常我替元素發聲，{name}。今天的謝意是我自己的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The elements answer need, not rank. So, it seems, do you."] = "謝謝，{name}。元素只回應需要，不看地位。看來你也是。"
L["The Earthen Ring mends the world a crack at a time, {name}. You've mended one."] = "陶土議會一道一道地修補世界的裂痕，{name}。你補好了一道。"
L["Water carves canyons by never giving up, {name}. I'll repay you the same way."] = "水靠永不放棄鑿出峽谷，{name}。我也會這樣報答你。"
L["Lightning is quick, {name}, but never thoughtful. You were both. Thank you."] = "閃電很快，{name}，卻從不體貼。你兩者兼具。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The ground felt steadier under me for that."] = "謝謝，{name}。腳下的大地都踏實了些。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll ask the sky. It rarely says no to me."] = "當然，{name}。我去問問天空，它很少拒絕我。"
L["Feet on the earth, eyes on the sky, {name}. What you asked for, they give."] = "腳踏大地，眼望蒼天，{name}。你求的，它們給了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Thunder takes a moment to arrive. I don't."] = "樂意，{name}。雷聲總會慢半拍，我不會。"
L["Gladly, {name}. A shaman who won't share the storm has no business calling it."] = "樂意，{name}。不肯分享風暴的薩滿，沒資格召喚它。"
L["Of course, {name}. Lightning can be gentle. It just prefers not to be."] = "當然，{name}。閃電也能溫柔，只是它不喜歡。"
L["Of course, {name}. Let me apologise to the wind for borrowing it. There."] = "當然，{name}。我先跟風道個歉，借它一用。好了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Calling the wind is easy. Steering it is the trick."] = "樂意，{name}。喚風容易，駕馭風難。"
L["We serve the elements and they serve the world, {name}. You're in it."] = "我們侍奉元素，元素守護世界，{name}。你也在這世界裡。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind your hair; the air gets lively."] = "樂意，{name}。小心頭髮，空氣要熱鬧起來了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You'll smell of rain for an hour. Everyone I help does."] = "當然，{name}。你會帶著一小時的雨味。我幫過的人都這樣。"
L["The sky has a little fury to spare, {name}. Take some."] = "天空有點怒氣用不完，{name}。分你一些。"
L["Take this, {name}. The storm doesn't know you yet, but I've introduced you."] = "拿著，{name}。風暴還不認識你，但我幫你引見了。"
L["A storm at your back for once, {name}, instead of in your face."] = "難得一次，風暴在背後推你，{name}，不是迎面撲來。"
L["Here, {name}. I don't hand storms to just anyone. You've the shoulders for it."] = "給，{name}。風暴我不隨便給人。你肩膀扛得住。"
L["Rain for the crops, storm for the fight, {name}. You look more like a fight."] = "雨給莊稼，風暴給戰鬥，{name}。你看起來比較像要去戰鬥。"
L["Here, {name}. If you hear thunder later, it isn't weather. It's encouragement."] = "給，{name}。等下聽到雷聲，那不是天氣，是在幫你打氣。"
L["From four elements and one shaman, {name}. The shaman did the walking."] = "四大元素和一位薩滿送的，{name}。跑腿的是薩滿。"
L["Walk well with this, {name}. The earth holds up everybody, but it likes you."] = "帶著這個好好走，{name}。大地托著所有人，但它喜歡你。"
L["I'd give you fair weather, {name}, but the sky only lends me the stormy kind."] = "我很想給你好天氣，{name}，但天空只借我暴風雨。"
L["Here, {name}. Thank the next clean stream you drink from. It's listening."] = "給，{name}。下次喝到乾淨的溪水，記得道謝。它在聽。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, wait. The spirits sometimes send me back."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是倒了，等等。靈魂有時會把我送回來。"
L["Earth below, sky above, {name}, us between, and this on you. Keep that order."] = "地在下，天在上，{name}，我們在中間，你身上還有這個。就這樣別亂。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I call up an elemental, be polite. They hold grudges."] = "拿著，{name}。我要是召出元素，客氣點。它們記仇。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Let them bunch together. Lightning loves a crowd."] = "給你的，{name}。讓牠們扎堆。閃電最愛人多。"
L["This is a taste, {name}. When I call the storm into your blood, you'll know it."] = "這只是嘗個鮮，{name}。等我把風暴喚進你的血裡，你就知道了。"
L["The wind picked our side today, {name}, and asked me to give you this."] = "今天風站在我們這邊，{name}，它讓我把這個給你。"
L["The elements favour the polite, {name}, and gave you this. Thank the rain."] = "元素偏愛有禮貌的人，{name}，所以給了你這個。謝謝雨吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. We're a small storm. Small storms still knock down fences."] = "拿著，{name}。我們是場小風暴。小風暴也能吹倒籬笆。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the totems. Don't kick them. The fire one sulks."] = "這是我給的，{name}，不是圖騰給的。別踢它們。火焰圖騰會鬧脾氣。"
L["Take this, {name}. A river in the way? Don't go round. I'll have us walk on it."] = "拿著，{name}。有河擋路？別繞。我讓大家在水上走。"
L["A sharper mind for you, {name}. Mine cost me an eyebrow in Dalaran."] = "腦袋靈光點，{name}。我的在達拉然賠了一邊眉毛。"
L["A clearer head for you, {name}. What you fill it with is your own affair."] = "腦袋清爽了，{name}。要裝什麼進去，隨你。"
L["Thoughts humming, {name}? Normal. If they hum back, come and find me."] = "腦袋嗡嗡響，{name}？正常。它要是回嘴，再找我。"
L["A little arcane for your thoughts, {name}. Keep the change."] = "替你的腦袋儲值一點秘法，{name}。不用找零。"
L["Brilliance, bottled, {name}. The Kirin Tor would charge you for the bottle."] = "光輝，裝瓶，{name}。祈倫托還會收你瓶子錢。"
L["Sharper wits, {name}. Spend them on spells, locks or riddles; I won't judge."] = "腦筋更靈了，{name}。施法開鎖猜謎都行，我不管。"
L["On loan from the Violet Citadel, {name}. Late returns are fined in sheep."] = "達拉然借來的，{name}。逾期不還，罰你變羊。"
L["Clever enough to spot the trap now, {name}. Avoiding it is a separate spell."] = "聰明到看得出陷阱了，{name}。躲開是另一個法術。"
L["There, {name}. Wiser already: look, you're standing further from me."] = "好了，{name}。變聰明了：看，你站離我遠了點。"
L["The one spell of mine that's never set anything alight, {name}. Enjoy."] = "我唯一沒燒過東西的法術，{name}。請慢用。"
L["A gnome's instructions make sense now, {name}. Still don't follow them."] = "地精說明書也看得懂了，{name}。但千萬別照做。"
L["Fortitude, {name}: a priest's polite way of saying 'stand in front'."] = "加耐力，{name}：牧師請你「站前面」的客套話。"
L["Every bit of stamina is one less panicked prayer from me, {name}."] = "每多一點耐力，我就少一次慌張的禱告，{name}。"
L["Tougher already, {name}. Please don't take that as a dare."] = "已經更耐打了，{name}。拜託別當成挑戰。"
L["There are other Power Words, {name}. 'Shield', and in emergencies, 'Run'."] = "真言術還有「盾」，{name}，緊急時還有「跑」。"
L["Sturdier now, {name}. Falls, bears and bad decisions all hurt a bit less."] = "更結實了，{name}。摔跤、熊和餿主意都沒那麼痛。"
L["{buff}, {name}. Three words where 'be tougher' would do."] = "{buff}，{name}。說「耐打點」不就好了。"
L["A little more of you to go round, {name}. Spend it slowly."] = "你加量不加價了，{name}。省著點用。"
L["Harder to knock down now, {name}. The ground will miss you."] = "現在你更難被打倒了，{name}。地面會想你的。"
L["Stubbornness, really, {name}. Dwarves are born with it; the rest of us pray."] = "其實是固執，{name}。矮人天生的，其他人靠禱告。"
L["The only armour that never needs repairing, {name}. The smiths hate it."] = "唯一永不用修的護甲，{name}。鐵匠恨死它了。"
L["Consider your spirits lifted, {name}. Divinely, as it happens."] = "你的精神被提振了，{name}。還是神聖等級的。"
L["Like a good night's sleep, {name}, without all the lying down."] = "像睡了一夜好覺，{name}，只是不用躺下。"
L["A second helping of spirit, {name}. The Light always insists on seconds."] = "精神再來一份，{name}。聖光總堅持要續碗。"
L["Keep your spirit where it is, {name}. Loose ones wander off."] = "靈魂好好留在身上，{name}。鬆了會走丟。"
L["Cheer up, {name}. That's not advice this time; it's a spell."] = "打起精神，{name}。這次不是建議，是法術。"
L["Recover faster, {name}, from long fights and longer walks."] = "恢復更快，{name}：不論長仗，還是更長的路。"
L["A deep breath's worth of calm, {name}, without having to take one."] = "一次深呼吸的平靜，{name}，還不用真的吸。"
L["The Light's own second wind, {name}. Don't waste it on arguments."] = "聖光給你回了口氣，{name}。別拿去生氣。"
L["Proof against shadow, {name}. I know its tricks; I've borrowed a few."] = "防暗影，{name}。它的把戲我熟，我也借用過幾招。"
L["Should the Void call, {name}, you can now pretend you're out."] = "虛無打來的話，{name}，你可以假裝不在家。"
L["For when the dark gets personal, {name}. It usually does."] = "黑暗找你算帳時用的，{name}。它通常會找。"
L["The shadows will have to knock first now, {name}."] = "現在暗影得先敲門了，{name}。"
L["The dark still bites, {name}, but now it has to chew."] = "黑暗還是會咬，{name}，咬得動算它牙好。"
L["A lining against the dark, {name}. Like a cloak, only on the inside."] = "防黑暗的內襯，{name}。像披風，只是穿在裡面。"
L["Curses slide right off you now, {name}. The cultists will take it personally."] = "詛咒現在沾不上你，{name}。邪教徒會覺得被針對。"
L["Priests study the Shadow to guard against it, {name}. Mostly."] = "牧師鑽研暗影是為了防它，{name}。大多是啦。"
L["For crypts, cults and Scholomance, {name}. The dark gets chatty in all three."] = "墓穴、邪教、通靈學院，{name}。三處黑暗都很健談。"
L["It won't keep off gloom, {name}. For that you want company. Here I am."] = "心理陰影它防不了，{name}。那要靠人陪，我在呢。"
L["Marked by the wild, {name}. The deer will tip their antlers as you pass."] = "被荒野標記了，{name}。你經過時鹿都會點角致意。"
L["You may smell faintly of moss, {name}. That's how you know it's working."] = "你可能會有點青苔味，{name}。這代表有效。"
L["Mark of the Wild, {name}. The wolves will still bite, but they'll feel bad."] = "野性印記，{name}。狼還是會咬，但會過意不去。"
L["The wild's own seal of approval, {name}. The squirrels were consulted."] = "荒野官方認證，{name}。有徵詢過松鼠意見。"
L["A little of the wild in you now, {name}. Resist the urge to howl."] = "你身上多了點野性，{name}。忍住別嚎叫。"
L["Hide, claw and a thick coat, {name}. The wild packs light but thorough."] = "硬皮、利爪加厚毛，{name}。荒野行李輕又齊全。"
L["Cenarius signs every one of these, {name}. Well, a tree does, on his behalf."] = "每份都有塞納留斯簽名，{name}。呃，是棵樹代簽的。"
L["The forest's own armour, {name}. It doesn't clank, and it smells of rain."] = "森林牌護甲，{name}。不會哐啷響，還有雨的味道。"
L["A tougher hide in seconds, {name}. The oaks took centuries and are furious."] = "幾秒就長出硬皮，{name}。橡樹花了幾百年，氣炸了。"
L["It's a loan from the wild, {name}. Try not to bring it back chewed."] = "這是跟荒野借的，{name}。歸還時別帶咬痕。"
L["Anything that bites you now gets a mouthful, {name}."] = "現在誰咬你，{name}，就會吃滿嘴刺。"
L["Let the boar charge, {name}. It'll leave with regrets and splinters."] = "讓野豬衝吧，{name}。牠會帶著悔恨和木刺離開。"
L["Like a rose, {name}: lovely to look at, a mistake to grab."] = "像玫瑰一樣，{name}：看著美，抓了後悔。"
L["Thorns, {name}. I grew them myself, so do be polite to them."] = "荊棘，{name}。我親手種的，對它們客氣點。"
L["A hedge you can wear, {name}. Neatly trimmed; I'm not a barbarian."] = "可以穿的樹籬，{name}。修剪整齊，我可不是野蠻人。"
L["Nature never turns the other cheek, {name}. It grows spikes on it."] = "大自然從不以德報怨，{name}。它以刺還牙。"
L["Raptors learn slowly, {name}. This teaches them one bite at a time."] = "迅猛龍學得慢，{name}。這個一口一口教牠。"
L["Prickly on the outside, {name}. What's inside is your own business."] = "外表帶刺了，{name}。內心軟不軟，隨你。"
L["Mind your cloak, {name}. Wool and brambles never did get along."] = "小心你的披風，{name}。羊毛和荊棘向來不合。"
L["Blessing of Kings, {name}. No crown, no throne, no taxes owed."] = "王者祝福，{name}。無冠無座，也免繳稅。"
L["Long may you reign, {name}. For the next while, anyway."] = "吾王萬歲，{name}。呃，一陣子吧。"
L["A little more of everything, {name}. Kings never did settle for less."] = "樣樣都多一點，{name}。王者從不將就。"
L["A king's blessing, {name}. Worn by better heads than mine, and some worse."] = "王者祝福，{name}。戴過的頭有比我好，也有更糟。"
L["Every strength a little higher, {name}. Kings like to hedge their bets."] = "每項能力都高一點，{name}。王者喜歡分散風險。"
L["Crown not included, {name}. Everything else is, a little."] = "不附王冠，{name}。其他的都附一點。"
L["All of you, only more so, {name}. Wear it well."] = "你還是你，只是樣樣更出色，{name}。好好享用。"
L["A blessing fit for royalty, {name}. You'll have to do your own waving."] = "配得上王室的祝福，{name}。揮手致意得自己來。"
L["Stronger, cleverer, hardier, {name}. Kings had advisers for that; you have me."] = "更強更聰明更耐打，{name}。國王有大臣，你有我。"
L["Royal treatment, {name}, minus the courtiers and the poisoned wine."] = "王室待遇，{name}，但不附馬屁精和毒酒。"
L["Might doesn't make right, {name}, but it does help the argument."] = "拳頭大不等於有理，{name}，但講道理時很好用。"
L["A firmer swing for you, {name}. The Light loves a good follow-through."] = "揮得更有力，{name}。聖光最欣賞揮到底的人。"
L["Stronger arms, {name}. Kindly point them at something that deserves it."] = "手臂更有力了，{name}。請對準真正該打的東西。"
L["Blessing of Might, {name}. It'll surprise you. It'll surprise them far more."] = "力量祝福，{name}。你會嚇一跳，他們會嚇更大跳。"
L["Swing away, {name}. The Light will take the credit if it goes well."] = "盡情揮吧，{name}。打得好的話，功勞歸聖光。"
L["Hit harder, {name}. Them, I mean. Not me. Never the paladin."] = "用力打他們，{name}。別打我，聖騎士打不得。"
L["More weight behind every swing, {name}. The Light calls it conviction."] = "每一揮都更有份量，{name}。聖光稱之為信念。"
L["Doors, crates and ogres will all give way easier now, {name}."] = "門、木箱和食人魔，現在都更容易被撞開了，{name}。"
L["Your weapon will feel lighter, {name}. It isn't. You're just holier."] = "武器感覺變輕了，{name}。並沒有，是你變神聖了。"
L["The Light's own elbow grease, {name}. Put it somewhere useful."] = "聖光出的力氣，{name}。用在刀口上。"
L["Wisdom for you, {name}. I kept a little back for myself. Very little."] = "智慧給你，{name}。我自己留了一點。很少一點。"
L["Wisdom for your mana, {name}. The other kind still comes from bad decisions."] = "給法力的智慧，{name}。另一種還得靠做錯事換。"
L["Your mana creeps back on its own now, {name}, like a cat that's forgiven you."] = "法力會自己慢慢回來，{name}，像原諒你的貓。"
L["Fewer sips between fights, {name}. The innkeepers will be heartbroken."] = "戰鬥間少喝幾口，{name}。旅店老闆要心碎了。"
L["Drink less, cast more, {name}. The Light's own budget advice."] = "少喝水，多施法，{name}。聖光的理財建議。"
L["Blessing of Wisdom, {name}: the one blessing that pays for itself."] = "智慧祝福，{name}：唯一能自己回本的祝福。"
L["A steadier well to draw from, {name}. Draw deep."] = "一口更不易乾的井，{name}。盡情汲取。"
L["Wisdom usually comes with age, {name}. This comes with a paladin. Quicker."] = "智慧通常靠年紀，{name}。這個靠聖騎士，快多了。"
L["May you know when to fight and when to sit down, {name}."] = "願你知道何時該戰、何時該坐下，{name}。"
L["A wise blessing for a wise choice, {name}: keeping a paladin around."] = "明智的選擇配明智的祝福，{name}：身邊帶個聖騎士。"
L["A blessing of quiet, {name}. Monsters will forget whose fault it was."] = "安靜的祝福，{name}。怪物會忘記是誰惹的禍。"
L["Blessing of Salvation, {name}. You are now somebody else's problem."] = "拯救祝福，{name}。你現在是別人的問題了。"
L["Saved, {name}. Not your soul, mind. Just your hide."] = "得救了，{name}。不是靈魂，是你這身皮。"
L["Hit hard, {name}. If anything turns round, look innocent. The Light will."] = "用力打，{name}。有東西回頭就裝無辜。聖光也會。"
L["The monsters will find you forgettable now, {name}. Today, that's a compliment."] = "怪物會覺得你路人臉，{name}。今天這是稱讚。"
L["Go on, hit it, {name}. It'll blame whoever's wearing the most plate."] = "儘管打，{name}。黑鍋讓穿最厚鎧甲的背。"
L["The art of being in the fight, {name}, and out of the argument."] = "參戰有份，仇恨沒份，{name}。這是門藝術。"
L["The Light's kindest alibi, {name}. Use it often."] = "聖光最貼心的不在場證明，{name}。多多利用。"
L["The Light will find you easier now, {name}. Try not to squint."] = "聖光現在更容易找到你了，{name}。別瞇眼。"
L["Holy Light lands harder on you now, {name}. Please don't make me prove it."] = "聖光術對你更有效了，{name}。別逼我證明。"
L["You'll heal easier, {name}. The Light appreciates a willing patient."] = "你更好治了，{name}。聖光喜歡配合的病人。"
L["Blessing of Light, {name}. Saving you is simpler now. Not that you'll need it."] = "光明祝福，{name}。救你更簡單了，雖然你用不到。"
L["The Light knows the way to you now, {name}. Let's keep its visits social."] = "聖光認得去你家的路了，{name}。最好只是來串門子。"
L["A blessing that makes my job easier, {name}. Generous and lazy all at once."] = "讓我工作更輕鬆的祝福，{name}。既大方又偷懶。"
L["Holy Light fits you better now, {name}, like a well-cut tabard."] = "聖光術更合身了，{name}，像量身訂做的外袍。"
L["Mending you just got cheaper, {name}. Not that I'd ever send a bill."] = "治你更省錢了，{name}。雖然我從不寄帳單。"
L["Block a blow now, {name}, and the Light hits back for you. It's petty."] = "格擋一下，{name}，聖光就替你回敬。它很記仇。"
L["Every blow lands softer now, {name}. Complaints go to the Light."] = "每一擊都變輕了，{name}。有意見找聖光。"
L["All the shelter of a temple, {name}, and none of the roof repairs."] = "神殿般的庇護，{name}，還不用修屋頂。"
L["Claim sanctuary, {name}. It's easier when you bring your own."] = "尋求庇護吧，{name}。自備的比較方便。"
L["Every blow is a little less rude now, {name}. The Light teaches manners."] = "每一擊都客氣多了，{name}。聖光有在教禮貌。"
L["Nobody can evict you from this sanctuary, {name}. I checked the deeds."] = "沒人能把你趕出這座庇護所，{name}。我查過地契了。"
L["An ogre's club lands like a pillow now, {name}. A heavy, angry pillow."] = "食人魔的棍棒軟如枕頭，{name}。又重又火大的那種。"
L["Instructions, {name}: hit things harder. There is no page two."] = "說明書，{name}：用力打。沒有第二頁。"
L["Your sword arm is sorted, {name}. For the rest of you, see a priest."] = "持劍的手搞定了，{name}。其他部位請找牧師。"
L["Battle Shout, {name}. Not a spell, really. A strongly worded suggestion."] = "戰鬥怒吼，{name}。不算法術，算措辭強烈的建議。"
L["RAAAGH! That one was for you, {name}. Everyone else just overheard."] = "吼啊啊啊！這聲給你的，{name}。其他人只是旁聽。"
L["Priests pray, mages study, {name}. I clear my throat, and you stand taller."] = "牧師祈禱，法師讀書，{name}。我清清嗓子，你就站得更直。"
L["Words matter, {name}. Mostly the loud ones. That one was for you."] = "話語有分量，{name}。尤其是大聲的。剛才那聲是給你的。"
L["The shout lasts a few minutes, {name}. The ringing in your ears, rather longer."] = "怒吼持續幾分鐘，{name}。你的耳鳴會更久。"
L["There were words in that shout once, {name}. They slowed it down."] = "這聲吼原本有台詞，{name}。嫌太慢就刪了。"
L["A little breath from the damned, {name}. They weren't using it."] = "向亡者借了口氣，{name}。反正他們用不到。"
L["Unending Breath, {name}. The fish will have so many questions."] = "無盡呼吸，{name}。魚會有一堆問題想問。"
L["Stay down as long as you like, {name}. The air's on me."] = "想潛多久都行，{name}。空氣算我的。"
L["Swim deep, {name}. If a murloc asks, you're only visiting."] = "潛深點，{name}。魚人問起，就說只是來玩。"
L["Air from a place where air isn't strictly air, {name}. Breathe it anyway."] = "這口氣來自空氣不太像空氣的地方，{name}。照吸吧。"
L["The Vile Reef awaits, {name}. Breathe easy down there; I've seen to it."] = "惡名昭彰的礁區在等你，{name}。在下面儘管呼吸；我已經安排好了。"
L["Dropped something in a lake, {name}? Now's your chance."] = "東西掉湖裡了，{name}？自己下去撈，別等湖中女神。"
L["No gills, {name}. I read the small print; gills were extra."] = "沒附鰓，{name}。契約細則寫了，鰓另計。"
L["An order, {name}: stay standing. Your bones heard it, even if you didn't."] = "命令，{name}：站著別倒。你沒聽見，你的骨頭也聽見了。"
L["Grit is a habit, {name}. I've lent you a few years of mine."] = "堅韌是一種習慣，{name}。我把攢了幾年的借你。"
L["I command, you endure, {name}. The shortest chain of command in any army."] = "我下令，你撐住，{name}。全軍最短的指揮鏈。"
L["Officers order from the back, {name}. I shout from the front, so you hold on."] = "軍官在後面發號施令，{name}。我在前面吼，好讓你撐住。"
L["A good shout can hold a line together, {name}. A line of one is easy."] = "一聲好吼能穩住整條防線，{name}。一人防線更是小事。"
L["I learned this drilling recruits, {name}. They hated me, and they all lived."] = "這是我操練新兵時學的，{name}。他們恨我，但全都活了下來。"
L["One shout's for hitting, {name}. This one's for being hit and not minding."] = "有種吼是用來打人的，{name}。這種是讓你挨打也不在乎。"
L["Most fights go to whoever lasts longest, {name}. Today, that's you."] = "多數戰鬥，誰撐最久誰贏，{name}。今天是你。"
L["This horn once sounded for a worse master, {name}. It much prefers you."] = "這號角曾為更糟的主子吹響，{name}。它喜歡你多了。"
L["I can't runeforge your weapon, {name}, but the horn comes close."] = "我沒辦法幫你的武器鑄造符文，{name}，但號角也差不多。"
L["All Northrend's cold in a single note, {name}. Swing while it's still ringing."] = "整個北裂境的嚴寒都在這一聲裡，{name}。趁餘音未散，揮下去。"
L["I'd play something cheerful, {name}, but this horn only knows the one note."] = "我很想吹點歡樂的，{name}，可這號角只會一個音。"
L["Winter took me once, {name}. Now it comes when I call, and it comes for you."] = "寒冬曾帶走過我，{name}。如今我一喚它就來，為你而來。"
L["The Ebon Blade charges when this sounds, {name}. Today you charge with us."] = "號聲一響，黯刃騎士團就衝鋒，{name}。今天你跟我們一起衝。"
L["Cold enough to wake the dead, {name}. I would know. It'll wake you up, too."] = "冷得能把死人凍醒，{name}。我最清楚。也能讓你清醒。"
L["No warm words from me, {name}. Cold ones carry further, and carry strength."] = "我不說暖心話，{name}。冷話傳得更遠，還帶著力量。"
L["Shaohao cast out his doubt and fear, {name}. What he kept, I pass to you."] = "紹昊驅散了自己的疑惑與恐懼，{name}。他留下的，我傳給你。"
L["Shoulders down and jaw loose, {name}. Now it can settle in properly."] = "沉肩，放鬆下巴，{name}。這樣它才能好好安頓。"
L["An open palm for friends, {name}. The fist is kept for everyone else."] = "攤開的手掌給朋友，{name}。拳頭留給其他人。"
L["I swept temple steps for a year to learn this, {name}. The steps stayed dusty."] = "為了學這個，我掃了一年寺廟階梯，{name}。階梯還是灰濛濛的。"
L["Strength, grace and a clear head, {name}: the emperors' gifts. Now yours."] = "力量、優雅、清醒的頭腦，{name}：皇帝們的恩賜。如今歸你。"
L["A gift from a land that hid in the mists, {name}. Use it out in the open."] = "這份禮物來自曾隱身迷霧的國度，{name}。在光天化日下用吧。"
L["Harmony is hard to find, {name}. Hold on to this bit of it."] = "和諧難尋，{name}。這一點點，你要握緊。"
L["Nothing in it you didn't have already, {name}. I've only woken it up."] = "裡面沒有你原本沒有的東西，{name}。我只是把它喚醒。"
L["Strength is better shown than talked about, {name}. So I'll say no more."] = "力量要用展現的，不是用說的，{name}。所以我不多說了。"
L["Strike where the guard is thin, {name}. The Tiger's eyes will show you where."] = "往防守薄弱處打，{name}。白虎之眼會告訴你在哪。"
L["Xuen never strikes by halves, {name}. Now neither do you."] = "雪怒出手從不留餘力，{name}。現在你也是。"
L["You don't get the stripes, {name}. Only the nerve that goes with them."] = "虎紋不給你，{name}。只給你配得上虎紋的膽量。"
L["I trained in Kun-Lai's snow for this, {name}. Your feet stay warm, at least."] = "為了這個，我在崑萊峰的雪裡苦練過，{name}。至少你的腳是暖的。"
L["The Tiger's blessing isn't gentle, {name}, but it's on your side."] = "白虎的祝福不溫柔，{name}，但它站在你這邊。"
L["Fierce, not angry, {name}. Xuen taught me the difference. Now it's yours."] = "要兇猛，別憤怒，{name}。雪怒教我分辨，現在換你。"
L["Wait, watch, then pounce, {name}. With the tiger's gift, you'll need one try."] = "等待，觀察，然後撲上去，{name}。有了白虎之賜，一擊就夠。"
L["Dark Intent, {name}. A grim name for a kind act. Warlocks name things badly."] = "黑暗意圖，{name}。善舉配上陰森的名字。術士就是不會取名。"
L["Thank the demon who taught me this, {name}. On second thoughts, don't."] = "去謝謝教我這招的惡魔吧，{name}。想想還是算了。"
L["You'll feel no different, {name}. Your enemies will. That's rather the point."] = "你不會覺得不同，{name}。你的敵人會。重點就在這。"
L["A little fel, well filtered, {name}. You'll barely smell the sulphur."] = "一點魔化能量，濾得很乾淨，{name}。幾乎聞不到硫磺味。"
L["A spark of the Nether rides with you now, {name}. I've trained it to sit."] = "一點扭曲虛空的火花跟著你了，{name}。我訓練過它坐好。"
L["Don't feel guilty about the power, {name}. I've done the guilty part already."] = "別為這份力量內疚，{name}。內疚的部分我已經包辦了。"
L["Darkness suits you, {name}. I mean that kindly."] = "黑暗很適合你，{name}。我是好意。"
L["I'd wish you luck, {name}, but warlocks prefer to arrange it."] = "本想祝你好運，{name}，但術士比較喜歡自己安排。"
L["The sky lends you its temper, {name}. Strike once, and the storm follows it in."] = "天空把脾氣借給你，{name}。你一出手，風暴就跟著補上。"
L["The earth keeps you steady, {name}. Now the sky wants a turn."] = "大地讓你站穩，{name}。現在換天空出手了。"
L["The storm rides with you now, {name}. Do warn it before you go indoors."] = "風暴現在跟著你，{name}。進屋前記得提醒它。"
L["If your hair stands on end, {name}, that's the storm agreeing with me."] = "如果你頭髮豎起來，{name}，那是風暴在附和我。"
L["I asked the sky to stand behind you, {name}. It's very tall and easily annoyed."] = "我請天空站在你背後，{name}。它很高，而且很容易生氣。"
L["Lightning never strikes twice, they say, {name}. Mine just struck you. Fury."] = "人說閃電不會打中同一處兩次，{name}。我的剛打中你。怒意滿滿。"
L["I listen to the wind, {name}. Today it asked me to bless you. Done."] = "我聽風說話，{name}。今天它讓我祝福你。辦好了。"
L["Thunder in your arms, {name}. Let the next fool who blocks your way hear it."] = "雷霆在你臂中，{name}。讓下一個擋路的笨蛋聽聽。"
L["A few borrowed moments from the bronze, {name}. Nozdormu keeps careful count."] = "從青銅龍那借來的片刻時光，{name}。諾茲多姆都記著帳。"
L["Time won't wait for you, {name}, but for the next while it'll dawdle."] = "時間不等人，{name}，但接下來一陣子它會拖拖拉拉。"
L["Not all help arrives in time, {name}. This kind brings its own."] = "不是每種幫助都來得及時，{name}。這份自帶時間。"
L["Should you need to slip away, {name}, time will cover for you."] = "要是你需要溜走，{name}，時間會幫你掩護。"
L["Bronze magic, {name}. You'll arrive a breath before you're needed."] = "青銅龍的魔法，{name}。你總會在被需要的前一刻趕到。"
L["Time is a river, {name}. I've found you a quicker current."] = "時間是條河，{name}。我幫你找了道更快的水流。"
L["Time heals all wounds, {name}. I'd rather it helped you dodge them."] = "時間能治癒所有傷口，{name}。我寧可它幫你躲開。"
L["The bronze say I learned this tomorrow, {name}. I've stopped arguing with them."] = "青銅龍說我是明天學會這個的，{name}。我已經懶得跟他們爭了。"
L["My spare magic is yours now, {name}. Every spell I overcharge spills your way."] = "我多的魔力歸你了，{name}。每次施法溢出的都流到你那裡。"
L["Only one of you gets this, {name}. I chose. Try to look modest about it."] = "這只能給一個人，{name}。我選了你。盡量表現得謙虛點。"
L["I'd give you my patience as well, {name}, but I've barely enough for me."] = "我也想把耐心給你，{name}，可我自己都不太夠。"
L["We're linked for the hour, {name}. Don't worry, it only runs one way."] = "這一小時我們相連，{name}。放心，只是單向的。"
L["I've seen how hard you work, {name}. Let me carry a little of it."] = "我看得出你多辛苦，{name}。讓我分擔一點。"
L["My magic runs hot, {name}. By the time it reaches you, it's cooled nicely."] = "我的魔力很燙，{name}。流到你那裡時，剛好涼了。"
L["Cast freely, {name}. Your mana is partly my concern now."] = "盡情施法，{name}。你的法力現在也歸我操心。"
L["If you run dry, {name}, it means I've been idle. Do say so."] = "你要是耗盡了，{name}，表示我偷懶了。儘管說。"
L["The earth stands between you and harm now, {name}. Every blow mends you."] = "大地擋在你和傷害之間，{name}。每一擊都在治療你。"
L["Stone has your back, {name}. Each hit they land patches you up a little."] = "岩石替你撐腰，{name}。挨一下，補一點。"
L["The spirits of earth owed me a favour, {name}. I've spent it on you."] = "大地之靈欠我人情，{name}。我用在你身上了。"
L["Hold the line, {name}. The ground itself is holding you."] = "守住陣線，{name}。連大地都在撐著你。"
L["You take the hits, {name}, and the stone takes them personally."] = "你挨打，{name}，石頭幫你記仇。"
L["Charge in, {name}. What they break, the earth puts back."] = "衝吧，{name}。他們打壞的，大地補回來。"
L["You're my Beacon, {name}. Every heal I give the others shines on you too."] = "你是我的信標，{name}。我治療別人，你也沾光。"
L["The Light will find you wherever you stand, {name}. I've made sure of it."] = "不管你站哪，{name}，聖光都找得到你。我保證。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. When I mend the others, you get the echo."] = "站穩，{name}。我治療別人，你也有份。"
L["A lighthouse for the whole group, {name}. Try not to stand in the dark."] = "全隊的燈塔，{name}。別站到暗處去。"
L["Wherever I heal, {name}, a little of it reaches you."] = "我治療到哪，{name}，都分你一點。"
L["I swear it, {name}: while this oath holds, my Light finds you first."] = "我發誓，{name}：誓言在，聖光先找你。"
L["An oath sworn to you alone, {name}. Don't make me regret it."] = "只為你立的誓，{name}。別讓我後悔。"
L["My word is yours for a while, {name}. Paladins keep their word."] = "我的承諾暫時歸你，{name}。聖騎士說到做到。"
L["I've sworn to keep you standing, {name}. I take oaths seriously."] = "我發誓讓你站著，{name}。我很認真。"
L["A little of you, a little of me, {name}. Nature loves a fair trade."] = "你一點，我一點，{name}。自然愛公平交易。"
L["We're bound for the hour, {name}. Borrow my gifts; I'll borrow yours."] = "這一小時綁在一起，{name}。借你我的，借我你的。"
L["Every living thing leans on another, {name}. Today we lean on each other."] = "萬物互相倚靠，{name}。今天換我們互相倚靠。"
L["Lend me a trick, {name}, and I'll lend you one of mine."] = "借我一招，{name}，我也借你一招。"
L["The Dream calls this a partnership, {name}. I call it common sense."] = "翡翠夢境稱之夥伴，{name}。我稱之常識。"
L["Scales off my own back, {name}. Let them hit you and see what happens."] = "我背上的鱗片，{name}。讓他們打你，看會怎樣。"
L["Wear these, {name}. Anything that bites you will regret its teeth."] = "穿上，{name}。咬你的東西會後悔長牙。"
L["Dragonscale armour, freshly shed, {name}. It bites back."] = "剛蛻的龍鱗甲，{name}。會咬回去。"
L["These scales burst when struck, {name}. Do let them strike."] = "這鱗片被打會爆，{name}。儘管讓他們打。"
L["A dragon's hide for an hour, {name}. Stand in front and enjoy it."] = "龍皮借你一小時，{name}。站前面好好享受。"
L["Run at the front of the pack, {name}. The wolf spirit makes them all chase you."] = "{name}，衝在最前面，狼靈會讓牠們全追著你。"
L["Lead the hunt, {name}. Every beast in here will want your throat, not ours."] = "{name}，帶頭狩獵吧，野獸只想咬你的喉嚨。"
L["The alpha's spirit is yours now, {name}. Howl, and they'll all turn your way."] = "頭狼之靈歸你了，{name}。一聲嚎叫，牠們全朝你來。"
L["First through the door, {name}. The pack follows, and so does everything else."] = "{name}先進門，狼群跟上，別的東西也會跟上。"
L["My second Beacon, {name}. Whatever I give the others, you share in it too."] = "我的第二道信標，{name}。我給的治療你也有份。"
L["Two lights to steer by tonight, {name}, and you're one of them."] = "今晚有兩盞燈指路，{name}，你是其中一盞。"
L["The Light has room for two, {name}. Keep shining over there."] = "聖光容得下兩人，{name}。在那邊繼續發光吧。"
L["Faith marks you as well, {name}. My heals will find both of you."] = "信仰也標記了你，{name}。我的治療會找到你們倆。"
L["We're bonded for the hour, {name}. When I mend myself, you mend too."] = "我們暫時結為一體，{name}。我療傷，你也恢復。"
L["Roots in the same soil, {name}. What heals one of us helps the other."] = "根紮同一片土，{name}。治好一個，另一個也受益。"
L["A bond of the grove, {name}. Look after yourself and you look after me."] = "林間的羈絆，{name}。照顧好自己就是照顧我。"
L["Nature pairs us up for a while, {name}. Try not to make me regret it."] = "自然讓我們暫時搭檔，{name}，別讓我後悔。"
L["Now you'll see what creeps up on us, {name}. Try not to scream."] = "現在你看得見誰在偷偷靠近了，{name}。別叫出聲。"
L["A warlock's sight, {name}, lent for a while. Some shadows stare back."] = "借你一會兒術士的眼睛，{name}。有些暗影會回瞪你。"
L["Eyes open, {name}. Whatever hides near us is about to be found."] = "睜大眼睛，{name}。藏在附近的東西要現形了。"
L["Folk will think we're duelling, {name}. Thanks for the {gift}."] = "旁人以為我們在決鬥，{name}。謝謝你的{gift}。"
L["{gift} for {buff}. No auctioneer's cut, {name}."] = "{gift}換{buff}，{name}。拍賣場不抽成。"
L["Beaten to it, {name}! Your {gift} was quicker than my manners."] = "被你搶先了，{name}！你的{gift}比我的禮貌快。"
L["{gift} in, {buff} out. Finest economy in all Azeroth."] = "{gift}進，{buff}出。艾澤拉斯最棒的經濟。"
L["{gift}, for me? All I have is this, {name}, but it's heartfelt."] = "{gift}給我？我只有這個，{name}，但是真心的。"
L["Your {gift} fits perfectly, {name}. Did you measure me?"] = "你的{gift}超合身，{name}。你偷量過我尺寸？"
L["A treaty in spells, {name}: {gift} for {buff}."] = "以法術締約，{name}：{gift}換{buff}。"
L["{gift}! I feel taller already. Have some {buff}."] = "{gift}！我感覺長高了。回你{buff}。"
L["I was about to ask for {gift}, {name}. You read my mind."] = "我正想要{gift}，{name}。你會讀心嗎？"
L["Your {gift} still fizzes, {name}. Here's some fizz back."] = "你的{gift}還滋滋響，{name}。回你一點滋滋。"
L["Such a kind {gift}, {name}. I'll tell the whole inn. Twice."] = "好貼心的{gift}，{name}。我要跟全旅店講兩遍。"
L["You cast {gift} first, {name}? My mother would despair of me."] = "你先放了{gift}，{name}？我媽會對我很失望。"
L["I'll remember your {gift} fondly, {name}. Until it wears off."] = "你的{gift}我會好好記住，{name}。直到它消失。"
L["{gift} for {buff}, free. Somewhere, a goblin weeps."] = "{gift}換{buff}，免費。有個哥布林哭了。"
L["Your {gift}, my {buff}. We'll be unbearable now."] = "你的{gift}，我的{buff}。我們強到欠揍了。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. I'll earn it before it fades."] = "謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。消失前我會對得起它。"
L["For {gift} I'd hand you both moons, {name}. This'll have to do."] = "為了{gift}，兩個月亮都給你，{name}。先收這個。"
L["You brought {gift}, I brought {buff}. Now it's a party."] = "你帶{gift}，我帶{buff}。這下成派對了。"
L["{gift} means 'good luck'. {buff} means 'you too'."] = "{gift}代表「祝好運」；{buff}代表「彼此彼此」。"
L["Your {gift} came first; my {buff} tries twice as hard."] = "你的{gift}先到；我的{buff}只好加倍賣力。"
L["If anyone asks, {buff} came before {gift}. Deal?"] = "有人問起，就說{buff}比{gift}先到。一言為定？"
L["{gift} made my day; {buff} should make your hour."] = "{gift}讓我樂一整天；{buff}讓你樂一小時。"
L["Saved my {buff} for someone worthy. Then came {gift}."] = "{buff}本來留給配得上的人。結果{gift}來了。"
L["Your {gift} went to my head; my {buff} goes to yours."] = "你的{gift}讓我飄飄然，我的{buff}換你飄。"
L["{gift} on me, {buff} on you. We wear each other's work."] = "我穿你的{gift}，你穿我的{buff}。活像情侶裝。"
L["{gift} and {buff} fade. Kindness lasts. Well, longer."] = "{gift}和{buff}會消失，善意會留下。呃，留久一點。"
L["You shared {gift}; I share {buff}. Ale's next."] = "你分享{gift}，我分享{buff}。下次換麥酒。"
L["{gift} caught me empty-handed. Not any more: {buff}."] = "{gift}來時我兩手空空。現在不同了：{buff}。"
L["{gift}, best thing all day. {buff}, my bid for second."] = "{gift}，今天最棒的事。{buff}，我來爭第二。"
L["{gift} deserves a statue. I'm no sculptor, so: {buff}."] = "{gift}該立銅像表揚。我不會雕，只好回{buff}。"
L["{gift} for {buff}? Keep this up and we'll draw a queue."] = "{gift}換{buff}？再這樣下去要變排隊名店了。"
L["{gift} was kind. {buff} is kind back, and competitive."] = "{gift}很貼心。{buff}也很貼心，而且不服輸。"
L["{gift} came like good news. {buff}, by return post."] = "{gift}像捷報傳來。{buff}，限時專送回覆。"
L["{gift}, meet {buff}. Do get along, you two."] = "{gift}，這位是{buff}。你們倆好好相處。"
L["Trade you {buff} for {gift}? Ah, you've already paid."] = "用{buff}換你的{gift}？啊，你已經先付了。"
L["{gift} and {buff}. The inn will say we rehearsed."] = "{gift}加{buff}。旅店的人會說我們套好招。"
L["{gift}! I just had three clever thoughts, {name}. This was one."] = "{gift}！我剛有三個聰明念頭，{name}。這是其一。"
L["With {gift}, {name}, I finally understand my own notes. Thanks."] = "有了{gift}，{name}，終於看懂我的筆記了。謝啦。"
L["Cleverer already, {name}. Clever enough to know I owe you one. Here."] = "變聰明了，{name}。聰明到知道欠你一份。拿去。"
L["Your {gift} found me the word for this, {name}: 'thanks'."] = "你的{gift}讓我找到最貼切的詞，{name}：「謝謝」。"
L["{gift}! I understood a goblin contract, {name}. I'm appalled."] = "{gift}！我看懂哥布林合約了，{name}。細思極恐。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My thoughts are lining up politely."] = "謝謝，{name}。我的思緒都乖乖排好隊了。"
L["I'll use your {gift} for more than arguing, {name}. Probably."] = "你的{gift}我不會只拿來抬槓，{name}。大概吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next spell gets three extra syllables, just to show off."] = "謝謝你，{name}。下個法術我要多唸三個字，純炫耀。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I'll stand at the front for once. Briefly."] = "{gift}，{name}？那我難得站前面。一下下。"
L["Knees, elbows and pride, {name}: all fortified. Thank you."] = "膝蓋、手肘和自尊，{name}：全強化了。謝謝。"
L["Hit me now, {name}. Actually, don't. But thank you; I'd survive it."] = "打我試試，{name}。算了別打。但謝了，我撐得住。"
L["Nigh unbreakable now, {name}. Let's never test the 'nigh'. Thank you."] = "幾乎打不壞了，{name}。「幾乎」就別測了。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! My healer owes you a letter, {name}. I owe you this."] = "{gift}！補師該寫感謝函給你，{name}。我先回這個。"
L["Every bruise I don't get today, {name}, I owe to your {gift}."] = "今天少掉的每塊瘀青，{name}，都要感謝你的{gift}。"
L["I could lose an argument with an ogre now and live, {name}. Thank you."] = "現在跟食人魔吵輸了也死不了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel like a castle wall. A grateful one."] = "謝謝，{name}。我像座城牆了。心存感激的那種。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next boar to charge me is in for a long afternoon."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一頭衝我的野豬，有得忙一下午了。"
L["{gift}! I feel ten years younger, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我覺得年輕了十歲，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I feel twice as calm and half as grumpy, {name}. Thank you."] = "我平靜了一倍，暴躁少了一半，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Your {gift} nearly made me sing, {name}. Take this. It's kinder."] = "你的{gift}害我差點高歌，{name}。回你這個，比較不擾民。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I've forgiven three people already. Thank you."] = "{gift}，{name}？我已經原諒三個人了。謝謝。"
L["I was on fumes, {name}. Your {gift} was a hot meal and a hearth."] = "我快見底了，{name}。你的{gift}像熱飯配暖爐。"
L["I've stopped counting mana between fights, {name}. Thank you."] = "戰鬥間我不用再數法力了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["My spirit's topped up, {name}, and the rest of me is grateful too."] = "精神加滿了，{name}，其他部位也很感激。"
L["Shadow-proof, thanks to you, {name}. The whispers are furious."] = "托你的福不怕暗影了，{name}。低語們氣炸了。"
L["Nothing dark gets in now, {name}. Here's something bright going the other way."] = "黑暗進不來了，{name}。這點光亮往你那邊送。"
L["{gift}! Shadowfang Keep can keep its shadows, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！影牙城堡的影子自己留著吧，{name}。謝謝。"
L["The next shadow bolt's in for a letdown, {name}. Thank you."] = "下一發暗影箭要失望了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["On your {gift} I'll brave Duskwood tonight, {name}. Or tomorrow."] = "靠你的{gift}，我今晚就闖暮色森林，{name}。或明天。"
L["{gift}! A squirrel just nodded at me, {name}. Here's yours."] = "{gift}！有松鼠對我點頭，{name}。這份給你。"
L["Tougher hide, sharper senses, {name}. I may have to fight the urge to forage."] = "皮更厚，感官更敏銳，{name}。我得忍住別去覓食。"
L["I feel all wild and leafy, {name}. Thank you. Sorry if I shed bark."] = "我覺得又野又長葉，{name}。謝謝，掉樹皮請見諒。"
L["Thicker skin from your {gift}, {name}. Arrows and insults both."] = "你的{gift}讓我皮更厚了，{name}。箭和酸話都不怕。"
L["{gift}! A bird tried to nest on me, {name}. Thanks, I think."] = "{gift}！有鳥想在我頭上築巢，{name}。謝謝……吧。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. The woods feel like home now."] = "謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。現在森林都像家了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've an urge to stand in the rain and grow. I'll resist."] = "謝謝，{name}。好想站在雨裡長高。我會忍住。"
L["Every bramble in the Barrens will think twice now, {name}. Thank you."] = "貧瘠之地的荊棘現在都得三思了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Rain, cold and wolves: let them all try."] = "謝謝，{name}。雨、冷、狼群：儘管放馬過來。"
L["{gift}, {name}! Nobody's hugging me today. Have this instead."] = "{gift}，{name}！今天沒人敢抱我。用這個代替。"
L["Prickly now, thanks to you, {name}. More than usual, I mean."] = "多虧你，我渾身帶刺，{name}。比平常更刺。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}! Let the next kobold try for my candle."] = "你的{gift}，{name}！下個狗頭人敢來搶我蠟燭試試。"
L["{gift}! I'm a thicket with opinions now, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我成了很有意見的荊棘叢，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next thing that bites me will need a moment to reflect."] = "謝謝，{name}。下個咬我的會被反傷，順便反省。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}? I'll try not to found a dynasty."] = "你給的{gift}，{name}？我盡量不去開創王朝。"
L["A little better at everything, {name}. Is this how kings feel? No wonder."] = "樣樣都強了點，{name}。當國王是這種感覺？難怪。"
L["Your {gift}! My first decree, {name}: thank you."] = "你的{gift}！朕的第一道聖旨，{name}：謝謝。"
L["{gift} on a commoner, {name}? I'll try to look regal."] = "把{gift}給一介平民，{name}？我盡量裝得有王者風範。"
L["With your {gift} I could rule a small kingdom, {name}. Westfall."] = "靠你的{gift}，我能治理小王國了，{name}。西部荒野那種。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every bit of me is grateful, and they rarely agree."] = "謝謝，{name}。我全身上下都在感謝，它們難得意見一致。"
L["Stronger arms already, {name}. I'll try not to hug anyone. Thank you."] = "手臂更有力了，{name}。我盡量不抱人。謝謝。"
L["With {gift} I could lift a kodo, {name}. I won't, but thank you."] = "有了{gift}，科多獸都舉得起，{name}。謝了。"
L["Your {gift} has my arms very confident, {name}. Thank you."] = "你的{gift}讓我的二頭肌自信爆棚，{name}。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! Opened a jar I've fought since Stranglethorn, {name}."] = "{gift}！從荊棘谷奮戰至今的罐子，終於開了，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next swing is dedicated to you. So is the dent."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一擊獻給你，那個凹痕也是。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}, and my first wise act is this."] = "{gift}到手，{name}。第一個明智之舉：這個。"
L["Wiser already, {name}. Wise enough to know a kindness when I see one."] = "更有智慧了，{name}。足以認出什麼是好意。"
L["My mana thanks you for {gift}, {name}. It's the shy one of us."] = "我的法力謝謝你的{gift}，{name}。它是我身上最害羞的。"
L["Your {gift} refills me faster than I spend, {name}. Nearly."] = "你的{gift}回得比我花得快，{name}。差不多啦。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}: mana back, and an urge to give advice."] = "你的{gift}，{name}：法力回來了，還變得好為人師。"
L["{gift}! The monsters forgot me at once, {name}. I won't."] = "{gift}！怪物馬上忘了我，{name}。我可不會。"
L["Nothing wants to fight me now, {name}. It's lovely. Thank you."] = "現在誰都不想跟我打，{name}。真美好。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! Nothing's glared at me in minutes, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！好幾分鐘沒東西瞪我了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! A mouse at a dragon's feast, {name}: unseen, well fed."] = "{gift}！像龍宴上的老鼠，{name}：沒人發現，吃得飽飽。"
L["Thanks to {gift} I'm just a rumour in a fight, {name}."] = "多虧{gift}，我在戰場上只是個傳聞，{name}。"
L["The Light finds me easier now, {name}. I'll try to deserve it."] = "聖光更容易找到我了，{name}。我會努力配得上。"
L["Easier to heal now, {name}. Whoever patches me up thanks you too."] = "我更好治了，{name}。幫我包紮的人也謝謝你。"
L["With your {gift}, {name}, mending feels like coming home."] = "有了你的{gift}，{name}，被治療就像回家。"
L["{gift}! The Light and I are on first-name terms now, {name}."] = "{gift}！我跟聖光都稱兄道弟了，{name}。"
L["With {gift} the Light hears me first, {name}. No need to shout."] = "有了{gift}，聖光先聽到我，{name}。不用大喊。"
L["Blows land softer on me now, {name}. My bruises thank you, and so do I."] = "挨打變輕了，{name}。我的瘀青謝謝你，我也是。"
L["Every hit gentler, thanks to you, {name}. I'll make sure they notice."] = "多虧你，每擊都溫柔了，{name}。我會讓他們知道。"
L["Your {gift} softens every blow, {name}. I'm upholstered."] = "你的{gift}讓每一擊都變軟，{name}。我成了沙發。"
L["{gift}! Now the Light takes every hit personally, {name}."] = "{gift}！打我一下，聖光都當私人恩怨，{name}。"
L["With your {gift} I'm half fortress, half chapel, {name}."] = "有了你的{gift}，我半是堡壘，半是禮拜堂，{name}。"
L["You shouted at me, {name}, and I've never felt so encouraged. Here."] = "你對我吼，{name}，我從沒這麼受鼓舞過。拿去。"
L["My ears are ringing, {name}, and my arms feel twice as strong. Thank you!"] = "我耳朵在嗡嗡叫，{name}，手臂卻強了一倍。謝謝！"
L["{gift}, {name}! I felt that in my teeth. In a good way."] = "{gift}，{name}！我的牙都在震。好的那種。"
L["I'll answer your {gift} quietly, {name}. Somebody should."] = "你的{gift}，我小聲回應，{name}。總得有人安靜點。"
L["Your {gift} nearly had me charging a wall, {name}. Here, calmly."] = "你的{gift}害我差點衝鋒撞牆，{name}。來，冷靜地回你。"
L["All Azeroth heard your {gift}, {name}. Thank you for my share."] = "整個艾澤拉斯都聽到你的{gift}，{name}。謝謝分我一份。"
L["That shout put iron in my spine, {name}. Thank you."] = "那一吼讓我腰桿都硬了，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I didn't catch the words, {name}, but my arms did. Thank you!"] = "吼什麼我沒聽清，{name}，但手臂聽懂了。謝謝！"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll hit the next thing twice as hard and blame you."] = "謝謝，{name}。下個敵人我會加倍用力打，再賴給你。"
L["I can breathe underwater, {name}! I may never need to, but thank you."] = "我能在水下呼吸了，{name}！可能用不到，但謝謝。"
L["Lungs like a murloc, thanks to you, {name}. I'll try not to gurgle."] = "多虧你，肺像魚人了，{name}。我盡量不咕嚕。"
L["With {gift} I'll raid every sunken wreck, {name}. Half's yours."] = "有了{gift}，每艘沉船我都要搜刮，{name}。分你一半。"
L["I won't ask where {gift} gets its air, {name}. Just: thanks."] = "{gift}的空氣哪來的我不問，{name}。只說：謝謝。"
L["With {gift} I'll cross Lordamere Lake, {name}. Underneath."] = "有了{gift}，我要橫渡洛丹米爾湖，{name}。從湖底。"
L["If I fall, {name}, I'll be back to thank you properly."] = "要是我倒下，{name}，我會回來好好謝你。"
L["A spare life in my pocket, {name}. I'll try not to spend it. Thank you."] = "口袋裡多了一條備用的命，{name}。我盡量不用它。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Death can knock now; I've a key to the back door."] = "謝謝，{name}。死神儘管敲門，我有後門鑰匙。"
L["Dying's only a delay with your {gift}, {name}. Thank you."] = "有你的{gift}，死亡只是耽擱一下，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If the worst happens, I'll get up and say it twice."] = "謝謝，{name}。萬一出事，我爬起來再謝你一次。"
L["Let the next thing roar at me, {name}. I'm not running this time. Thank you."] = "下一個儘管衝我吼吧，{name}。這次我不跑了。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! One fright, already dealt with, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！一場驚嚇，提前搞定，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next scream I hear won't be mine."] = "謝謝，{name}。下一聲尖叫不會是我的。"
L["No running in circles for me, {name}. Not the first time, anyway. Thank you."] = "不用再繞圈亂跑了，{name}。至少第一次不會。謝謝。"
L["Brave on credit, thanks to you, {name}. I'll spend it wisely."] = "賒來的勇氣，多虧你，{name}。我會省著花。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Lakes, rivers, puddles: all floors now."] = "謝謝，{name}。湖、河、水窪，現在全是地板。"
L["{gift}! The short way across it is, {name}. Dry boots and all."] = "{gift}！那就直接走過去吧，{name}。靴子都不濕。"
L["Walking on water, {name}. Folk will start a religion. Thank you."] = "在水上行走，{name}。遲早有人要立個教派。謝謝。"
L["The murlocs will be furious, {name}. Thank you for the shortcut."] = "魚人要氣瘋了，{name}。謝謝你的捷徑。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be across before it fades. Probably."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會在它消失前走到對岸。大概吧。"
L["{gift}! Whatever hid round here, {name}, hides no more."] = "{gift}！這附近藏著的東西，{name}，再也藏不住了。"
L["I can see what's hiding now, {name}. Some of it should stay hidden. Thanks."] = "現在我看得見藏起來的東西了，{name}。有些還是藏著好。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every lurker around just lost their only trick."] = "謝謝，{name}。附近潛伏的傢伙剛剛丟了唯一的本事。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Now I can see what your imp gets up to."] = "謝謝，{name}。現在我看得見你的小鬼在幹嘛了。"
L["My eyes see more than my wits can handle, {name}. Thank you."] = "我的眼睛看到的，比我的腦袋能承受的還多，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I'll be the last one standing, {name}, just to hear you shout again."] = "我會撐到最後一個，{name}，就為了再聽你吼一次。"
L["You ordered me to live, {name}. I mean to follow it to the letter. Thanks."] = "你命令我活下去，{name}。我會一字不差地照辦。謝啦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every sinew I have just closed ranks."] = "謝謝，{name}。我全身筋骨都列隊站好了。"
L["Never been shouted into good health before, {name}. Thank you."] = "第一次被人吼到身強體壯，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Yes, Sergeant {name}! Your shout brings out the recruit in me. Thank you."] = "是，{name}中士！你一吼，我又變回新兵了。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! That voice could turn a stampede, {name}. Thanks."] = "{gift}！這嗓門能喝住奔逃的獸群，{name}。謝啦。"
L["That horn froze my breath and fired my arms, {name}. Thank you."] = "那號角凍住我的呼吸，燃起我的雙臂，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Most folk hear that horn from the wrong end of a battle, {name}. Thank you."] = "多數人聽到這號角時，都站在戰場錯的一邊，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I heard your horn and swung harder, {name}. Nobody had to tell me twice."] = "聽到你的號角，我揮得更猛了，{name}。不用說第二遍。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be humming that note for the rest of the day."] = "謝謝，{name}。那個音我會哼上一整天。"
L["Thanks to you, {name}, I'll never grumble about winter again."] = "多虧了你，{name}，我再也不抱怨冬天了。"
L["{gift}! I won't ask what the horn's made of, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我不問這號角是什麼做的，{name}。謝謝。"
L["An emperor's legacy, {name}. I'll try to leave it no worse than I found it."] = "皇帝的傳承，{name}。我會盡量不讓它在我手上變差。"
L["Like a month of training before breakfast, {name}. Thank you."] = "就像早餐前練了一個月的功，{name}。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel calm enough to brew tea in a thunderstorm."] = "謝謝，{name}。我現在靜得能在雷雨中泡茶。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I bowed without thinking. Is that part of it?"] = "謝謝，{name}。我不自覺就鞠了躬。這也是附贈的嗎？"
L["{gift}! Pandaria's finest, {name}. Don't tell the brewmasters."] = "{gift}！潘達利亞的極品，{name}。別告訴釀酒大師。"
L["Stronger, quicker and steadier at once, {name}. My teachers never managed that."] = "一次變得更強、更快、更穩，{name}。我的老師們都沒辦到。"
L["{gift}, {name}! Even my mistakes will look deliberate now."] = "{gift}，{name}！現在連我的失誤都像故意的。"
L["I feel a tiger pacing in my chest, {name}. It wants to hunt. Thank you."] = "我胸中有隻老虎在踱步，{name}。牠想狩獵。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be very polite to cats from now on."] = "謝謝，{name}。從今以後我會對貓很客氣。"
L["I could out-stare a tiger now, {name}. Not Xuen. A small one."] = "我現在能跟老虎互瞪不眨眼，{name}。不是雪怒，是小隻的。"
L["Every strike I throw now has claws in it, {name}. Thank you."] = "我現在每一擊都帶著爪子，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I'd thank Xuen as well, {name}, but he answers thanks with a sparring match."] = "我也想謝謝雪怒，{name}，但他回禮的方式是找人切磋。"
L["{gift}! I feel sharper and slightly sinister, {name}. Thanks."] = "{gift}！我變得更敏銳，還有點陰險，{name}。謝啦。"
L["Dark but generous, {name}, like a good stout. Thank you."] = "色深味厚，{name}，像杯好黑啤。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If I start cackling in a fight, you'll know why."] = "謝謝，{name}。要是我打到一半開始怪笑，你知道為什麼。"
L["Bound to a warlock for the hour, {name}. My family would faint. Thank you."] = "這一小時跟術士綁在一起，{name}。我家人會昏倒。謝謝。"
L["Like borrowing a sharp knife from a stranger in an alley, {name}. Thanks."] = "就像在暗巷跟陌生人借了把利刃，{name}。謝啦。"
L["More dangerous today and worse sleep tonight, {name}. A fair trade. Thanks."] = "今天我更危險，今晚睡更差，{name}。很公平。謝啦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Now I know why shamans always look so windswept."] = "謝謝，{name}。現在我知道薩滿為什麼總是被風吹得亂糟糟。"
L["{gift}! Swift as the wind, {name}, and as hard to argue with."] = "{gift}！快如疾風，{name}，也跟風一樣講不通。"
L["Your {gift} has me crackling, {name}. Shake hands carefully."] = "你的{gift}讓我全身劈啪作響，{name}。握手小心點。"
L["My weapon keeps hitting things twice, {name}. Thank you, and thank the storm."] = "我的武器老是打中兩次，{name}。謝謝你，也謝謝風暴。"
L["The sky's on my side now, {name}. I'll try not to stand on any hilltops."] = "天空站我這邊了，{name}。我盡量不站在山頂。"
L["I'm half thunderstorm now, {name}. Thank you, and sorry about the rain."] = "我現在有一半是雷雨了，{name}。謝謝，下雨的事抱歉。"
L["{gift}! A step ahead of everything, {name}, myself included."] = "{gift}！什麼都快一步，{name}，連我自己都追不上。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be out of trouble before trouble notices."] = "謝謝，{name}。麻煩還沒注意到我，我就脫身了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I can feel the sands shifting in my favour."] = "謝謝，{name}。我感覺時光之沙正往我這邊流。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even my running away will look dignified now."] = "謝謝，{name}。現在連我逃跑都很體面。"
L["Haven't I thanked you already, {name}? Time's gone odd. Thanks again."] = "我是不是已經謝過你了，{name}？時間怪怪的。再謝一次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Nozdormu won't miss the moments; he has all of them."] = "謝謝，{name}。諾茲多姆不會在意少這幾刻，所有時光都是他的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Your magic and mine get on surprisingly well."] = "謝謝，{name}。你的魔法和我的出奇地合得來。"
L["Of everyone here, {name}, you chose me? I'm flattered and refreshed."] = "這麼多人，{name}，你選了我？我受寵若驚，還神清氣爽。"
L["{gift}! I'll be the last one here to run dry, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我會是這裡最後一個耗盡的，{name}。謝謝。"
L["I could cast till sundown now, {name}. Please keep breathing fire."] = "我現在能施法到日落，{name}。請繼續噴火。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Everyone I help today owes you a little too."] = "謝謝，{name}。今天我幫的每個人也都欠你一點。"
L["Your leftovers beat my best, {name}. Most humbling. Thank you."] = "你剩下的都比我最好的強，{name}。真慚愧。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. With the earth at my back, I'll stand anything."] = "謝謝，{name}。有大地撐腰，我什麼都扛得住。"
L["{gift}! Let them hit me now, {name}. I'll only get better."] = "{gift}！來打我吧，{name}。我只會越打越好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll try to deserve every pebble."] = "謝謝，{name}。我會配得上每顆小石子。"
L["A Beacon, for me? I'll shine where the hits land, {name}. Thank you."] = "給我的信標？{name}，我會在挨打處發光。謝謝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every heal of yours has my address on it now."] = "謝謝，{name}。你的每個治療都寫上我家地址了。"
L["{gift}! I'll lead, {name}, and your Light can follow."] = "{gift}！我帶頭，{name}，你的聖光跟上。"
L["An oath, sworn to me? Thank you, {name}. I'll try to be worth keeping."] = "為我立的誓？謝謝，{name}。我會值得。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll stand in front; you keep your word."] = "謝謝，{name}。我站前面，你守承諾。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll take good care of your trick, and you of mine."] = "謝謝，{name}。你的招我會好好用，我的你也是。"
L["{gift}! We're a matched pair now, {name}. Let's not waste it."] = "{gift}！我們成一對了，{name}。別浪費。"
L["Your own scales, {name}? I'll wear them proudly. Thank you."] = "你自己的鱗片，{name}？我會驕傲地穿。謝謝。"
L["{gift}! Let them swing at me now, {name}. They'll regret it."] = "{gift}！讓他們來打我吧，{name}。他們會後悔。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll lead the pack and keep their eyes on me."] = "謝謝你，{name}。我來帶隊，讓牠們都盯著我。"
L["{gift}! Let them all come for me now, {name}. I am the alpha."] = "{gift}！都衝我來吧，{name}。我是頭狼。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll try to be a light worth following."] = "謝謝你，{name}。我會做一盞值得追隨的光。"
L["{gift}! Two lights on me now, {name}. I will keep mine lit."] = "{gift}！兩盞燈在我身上，{name}。我的會亮著。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Whatever I mend in myself, I'll send your way."] = "謝謝你，{name}。我自癒的部分都分你一份。"
L["{gift}! Bonded, then, {name}. I'll take good care of us both."] = "{gift}！結為一體了，{name}。我會照顧好我們倆。"
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no. Here's another one."] = "我們不能老這麼碰面了，{name}。其實，能。再給你一個。"
L["Again, {name}? Splendid. I've been practising since last time."] = "再來一次，{name}？太好了，上次後我練過了。"
L["You again, {name}? Another one for you, then. People will say we're friends."] = "又是你，{name}？那就再給你一個。別人要說咱們是朋友了。"
L["Same face, same spell, {name}. I do love a tradition."] = "同一張臉，同一個法術，{name}。我就愛傳統。"
L["Another round, {name}? I'm keeping score, and we're both winning."] = "再來一輪，{name}？我有在計分，我們都贏。"
L["Ah, {name}! My favourite repeat customer."] = "啊，{name}！我最愛的回頭客。"
L["Our paths keep crossing, {name}, and I keep having one of these for you."] = "我們的路老是交會，{name}，而我總有一個這個給你。"
L["Once more, {name}. Do stop me if you've heard this one."] = "再來一次，{name}。這句聽過就打斷我。"
L["I kept some aside, {name}, in case you came back. Good instinct, mine."] = "我留了一份，{name}，就怕你回來。我直覺真準。"
L["Back already, {name}? The day's improving. Here, same as last time."] = "這就回來了，{name}？今天越來越好了。給，跟上次一樣。"
L["Again, {name}? At this rate I'll learn your middle name. Have another."] = "又來，{name}？照這樣我都要記住你的中間名了。再來一個。"
L["Once is kindness, twice is a habit, {name}. I've never broken a habit yet."] = "一回生二回熟，{name}。三回就戒不掉了。"
L["An encore, {name}, for my most faithful audience."] = "再來一曲，{name}，獻給我最忠實的觀眾。"
L["One more of these, {name}, and we'll have to draw up a guild charter."] = "再來一次，{name}，我們就得創個公會了。"
L["I'll remember your face now, {name}, and I'm terrible with faces. Here."] = "現在我記住你的臉了，{name}，我可是最不會記臉的。拿著。"
L["Us again, {name}. The world must be short of people to bless. Here."] = "又是咱倆，{name}。世上可祝福的人大概不夠用了。拿著。"
L["Last time went so well, {name}, I've changed nothing."] = "上次很順，{name}，所以我什麼都沒改。"
L["Good to see someone I know, {name}. Rarer than you'd think. Have this."] = "見到熟人真好，{name}。比你想的要少見。拿著。"
L["Oh, it's you, {name}. Good. I hate giving these to strangers."] = "啊，是你，{name}。很好，我不愛給陌生人這個。"
L["{name}, at this point we should just share a reagent pouch."] = "{name}，都這樣了，乾脆共用材料袋吧。"
L["Same time tomorrow, {name}? I'll bring {buff}. You bring you."] = "明天老時間，{name}？我帶{buff}，你帶你自己。"
L["I've lost count of these, {name}, and I've decided that's a compliment."] = "這個我都數不清給過多少回了，{name}，我決定當它是誇獎。"
L["Keep this up, {name}, and the bards will write a dull song about our favours."] = "再這樣下去，{name}，吟遊詩人要為咱們的互幫互助寫首無聊的歌了。"
L["I could do this one in my sleep by now, {name}. I may have."] = "我睡著都能做了，{name}。說不定剛才就是。"
L["The usual, {name}? Of course the usual."] = "老樣子，{name}？當然老樣子。"
L["We should have a secret handshake by now, {name}. Until then, this."] = "咱們早該有個秘密握手了，{name}。在那之前，先用這個。"
L["By now, {name}, I think we've built a small economy between us."] = "到現在，{name}，我們都自成一個小經濟體了。"
L["Old friends by now, {name}. Old acquaintances, at least, with this habit."] = "都是老朋友了，{name}。至少是有這個習慣的老相識。"
L["Let the record show: {name} and I, undefeated at being prepared."] = "記錄在案：{name}與我，有備而來，從未落敗。"
L["My spellbook opens to your page on its own now, {name}."] = "我的法術書現在會自己翻到你那頁了，{name}。"
L["If you stopped turning up, {name}, who would I give these to? The guards?"] = "你要是不來了，{name}，這些我給誰去？給衛兵嗎？"
L["We keep this up, {name}, and one of us owes the other a drink."] = "再這樣下去，{name}，我們總有一個得請對方喝一杯。"
L["We're a local landmark now, {name}: the pair who bless each other. Here."] = "咱們都成本地地標了，{name}：互相祝福的那一對。拿著。"
L["Regular as the tides, {name}, and twice as welcome. As is this."] = "準時得像潮汐，{name}，還加倍受歡迎。這個也是。"
L["I'd trust you with my last potion, {name}. For now, take this."] = "我最後一瓶藥水都敢託付給你，{name}。眼下先拿著這個。"
L["Next time we share a fire, {name}. This time, take this."] = "下次一起烤火，{name}。這次先拿著這個。"
L["I'd miss this if it stopped, {name}. So let's not stop."] = "要是停了我會想念的，{name}。所以別停。"
L["There's nobody I'd rather keep blessing, {name}."] = "沒有誰比你更讓我願意一再祝福了，{name}。"
L["You always turn up at the right moment, {name}, and I'm always ready. Here."] = "你總在對的時候出現，{name}，我也總備著。拿著。"
L["Safe walls, warm beds, and now {buff}. You're spoiled, {name}."] = "高牆暖床，還有{buff}。{name}，你被寵壞了。"
L["The guards have it covered, {name}, but I like to be thorough."] = "衛兵都顧著呢，{name}，但我喜歡周到一點。"
L["Careful, {name}. Look this capable in town and folk will ask you favours."] = "小心，{name}。在城裡這麼能幹，會有人找你幫忙。"
L["Not a monster for miles, {name}. Still, take this. One never knows the cooking."] = "方圓幾里沒有怪物，{name}。還是拿著吧。廚子的手藝可說不準。"
L["For the crowds, {name}. In town, they're the real danger."] = "防人潮用的，{name}。城裡最危險的就是人潮。"
L["Rest easy, {name}. I'll count that my good deed and go find a pint."] = "安心休息，{name}。今日一善完成，我去喝一杯。"
L["Even in town, {name}, a dragon has been known to drop in. Better safe."] = "就算在城裡，{name}，也有龍來訪過。小心為上。"
L["Best do it in here, {name}. Out there, nobody stands still long enough."] = "最好在這弄，{name}。到外面，沒人肯站著不動。"
L["Mind the pickpockets, {name}. This is the one thing on you they can't lift."] = "小心扒手，{name}。你身上只有這個他們偷不走。"
L["City rules, {name}: no blades drawn, no spells thrown. This one's allowed."] = "城裡規矩，{name}：不准拔刀，不准施法。這個例外。"
L["Nothing to fight here but stray cats, {name}. Take this anyway."] = "這裡除了野貓沒什麼好打，{name}。還是拿著吧。"
L["For the walk to the bank, {name}. It's always further than it looks."] = "去銀行的路上用，{name}。那段路總比看起來遠。"
L["Enjoy a warm hearth while you can, {name}, and take this for the road."] = "能享受暖爐就多享受，{name}，路上帶著這個。"
L["The watch has the walls, {name}. I'll see to you."] = "城牆有守衛看著，{name}。你歸我照應。"
L["For the stairs, {name}. Whoever built this place never met a short way up."] = "爬樓梯用的，{name}。蓋這裡的人沒聽過捷徑。"
L["Everything else in town has a price, {name}. This slipped past the merchants."] = "城裡什麼都要錢，{name}。這個是商人漏掉的。"
L["Buy nothing from anyone who calls you 'friend', {name}. Except me. It's free."] = "誰管你叫「朋友」，就別買他的東西，{name}。我除外。這個免費。"
L["Out here everything wants to eat you, {name}. Now it'll need a bigger fork."] = "這裡什麼都想吃你，{name}。現在得換把大叉子了。"
L["No guards for miles, {name}, and the boars know it. Take this."] = "方圓幾里沒衛兵，{name}，野豬都知道。拿著。"
L["Nobody out here but us and the wildlife, {name}. With this, we're tougher."] = "這兒就我們和野獸，{name}。有了這個，我們更扛揍。"
L["If a bear asks, {name}, you were like this when I found you."] = "熊要是問，{name}，就說我撿到你時就這樣。"
L["The wolves have been eyeing you, {name}. This should give them pause."] = "狼一直在盯著你，{name}。這下牠們得三思了。"
L["Wild country, {name}. Best not to meet it armed with good intentions alone."] = "荒郊野外，{name}。光靠一片好心可應付不來。"
L["Map, canteen, {buff}. Now you can get lost properly, {name}."] = "地圖、水壺、{buff}。{name}，可以好好迷路了。"
L["Camp's a long way off, {name}. Consider this a roof you can carry."] = "營地還很遠，{name}。這就當隨身帶的屋頂。"
L["Out past the last farm, {name}, you're on your own. Nearly."] = "過了最後一座農場，{name}，就只能靠自己了。差不多。"
L["Nearest inn's a day's walk, {name}; the nearest teeth, closer. Take this."] = "最近的旅店要走一天，{name}；最近的獠牙更近。拿著。"
L["Two hills and a swamp to the next town, {name}. Here; the swamp has opinions."] = "到下個鎮要翻兩座山過一片沼澤，{name}。拿著；沼澤有自己的想法。"
L["Take this; camp carefully, {name}. Every nice clearing has an owner with claws."] = "拿著；紮營小心點，{name}。每片好空地都有個帶爪子的主人。"
L["Fresh air, open sky, {name}, and this. Enjoy it while nothing's chasing you."] = "新鮮空氣，開闊天空，{name}，還有這個。趁沒東西追你，好好享受。"
L["Something's following you, {name}. Probably a boar. This is in case it isn't."] = "有東西跟著你，{name}。大概是野豬。這是以防萬一。"
L["Take this and stay on the road, {name}. The road has guards. Some of the time."] = "拿著，別離開大路，{name}。大路上有衛兵。有時候有。"
L["Rain's coming, {name}, and so are the wolves. One of those I can help with."] = "雨和狼都快來了，{name}。狼歸我管，雨歸天管。"
L["A villain in here rehearses a speech, {name}. Take this, then let's interrupt."] = "這裡頭有個反派在排練台詞，{name}。拿著，然後咱們去打斷他。"
L["Whatever waits at the end of this place, {name}, this will make it regret it."] = "不管這地方盡頭等著什麼，{name}，這個都會讓它後悔。"
L["Nobody leaves here alive, they say, {name}. Take this; let's prove them wrong."] = "都說沒人能活著離開這裡，{name}。拿著；咱們證明他們錯了。"
L["Our host had years to prepare, {name}. We have {buff}."] = "主人準備了好幾年，{name}。我們有{buff}。"
L["Nobody builds a dungeon with a back door, {name}. Take this instead."] = "沒人蓋地城會留後門，{name}。拿這個代替。"
L["Dark halls, old traps, worse tempers. At least you're ready, {name}."] = "暗廳、舊陷阱、壞脾氣，{name}。好在你準備好了。"
L["Better I hand you this now, {name}, than a eulogy later."] = "現在給你這個，{name}，總比日後念悼詞好。"
L["There's treasure in here, {name}, and something large sat on it. This first."] = "這裡有寶藏，{name}，還有個大傢伙坐在上面。先拿著這個。"
L["If a door slams shut behind us, {name}, that's tradition. Take this first."] = "門在身後砰地關上是老規矩，{name}。先拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}, and mind the patrols. They walk the same loop and resent it."] = "拿著，{name}，當心巡邏的。牠們總走同一圈，憋著一肚子氣。"
L["Whoever built this place spent it all on skulls, {name}. Here's a little light."] = "造這地方的人把錢全花在骷髏上了，{name}。給你一點光。"
L["The last lot through here were never seen again, {name}. They lacked this."] = "上一隊進來後就失蹤了，{name}。他們少了這個。"
L["Take this, {name}; check the ceiling. In places like this, something drops in."] = "拿著，{name}；看看天花板。這種地方總會有東西掉下來。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we meet a talking skull, let me do the talking."] = "拿著，{name}。要是遇到會說話的骷髏，讓我來說。"
L["Here, {name}. If the walls start whispering, don't answer. It encourages them."] = "拿著，{name}。牆要是開始低語，別回話。會助長它們。"
L["Touch nothing that glows, pull nothing that clicks, {name}. Wear this."] = "發光的別摸，會喀一聲的別拉，{name}。拿著。"
L["Take this and stick together in here, {name}. Echoes carry, and so do grudges."] = "拿著，在裡面別走散，{name}。回聲傳得遠，仇怨也是。"
L["Flags, towers, graveyards, {name}. Whatever we're fighting over, take this."] = "搶旗、奪塔、占墓地，{name}。管他搶什麼，拿著。"
L["Win or lose, {name}, nobody will say you went in unprepared."] = "不論輸贏，{name}，沒人能說你沒準備。"
L["The graveyard's just over there, {name}. Take this; let's both not visit it."] = "墓地就在那邊，{name}。拿著；咱倆都別去。"
L["Honour's on the line, {name}. So is the flag. Here's something for both."] = "榮譽攸關，{name}。旗子也是。給你點兩樣都用得上的。"
L["Take this and stay with the group, {name}. Lone heroes make short songs."] = "拿著，跟緊隊伍，{name}。獨行英雄的歌都很短。"
L["Our banner looks better with you under it, {name}, and blessed. Stand tall."] = "有你在旗下，我們的旗更好看，{name}，你還受了祝福。站直了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep your head down and your colours up."] = "拿著，{name}。腦袋壓低，旗幟舉高。"
L["Hold the line with this, {name}. The songs are about the ones who stood."] = "帶著這個守住陣線，{name}。歌謠唱的都是堅守的人。"
L["Take this and come back in one piece, {name}. That's all I ask."] = "拿著，完完整整地回來，{name}。我只求這個。"
L["Drums are for courage, {name}. This is for everything else."] = "戰鼓是給勇氣的，{name}。其他的交給這個。"
L["Some fight for glory, {name}. I fight for whoever's beside me, and bless them."] = "有人為榮耀而戰，{name}。我為身邊的人而戰，還為他們祝福。"
L["Take this, {name}. Fight for the banner, come back for the singing. It's awful."] = "拿著，{name}。為旗而戰，回來聽歌。唱得很難聽。"
L["Early bird, {name}? Here's something better than a worm."] = "早起的鳥兒，{name}？給你比蟲更好的東西。"
L["Good morning, {name}. Consider this your first cup of something strong."] = "早安，{name}。這就當你今天第一杯提神的。"
L["Early start, {name}. The day hasn't gone wrong yet, and this should keep it so."] = "起得早，{name}。今天還沒出岔子，這個能讓它繼續順利。"
L["Not even lunch yet, {name}, and you're already better prepared than I am."] = "還沒到午餐，{name}，你就比我準備得還周全了。"
L["Morning, {name}. The monsters are still yawning. Take this before they stop."] = "早，{name}。怪物們還在打哈欠。趁牠們沒醒透，拿著這個。"
L["A fresh day and a fresh {buff}, {name}. Let's not waste either."] = "新的一天，新的{buff}，{name}。兩個都別浪費。"
L["Up with the sun, {name}? Show-off. Here; the sun doesn't get one."] = "跟太陽比早起，{name}？愛現。給你，太陽沒份。"
L["Rise and shine, {name}. This is the shine; breakfast can wait."] = "起床發光吧，{name}。這就是光；早飯可以等等。"
L["Everything's golden and nobody's shouted yet, {name}. Add this to it."] = "一片金燦燦，還沒人吼過，{name}。再添上這個。"
L["Too early for heroics, {name}? Nonsense. Here; heroics go best before lunch."] = "太早了不適合逞英雄，{name}？胡說。拿著；英雄事蹟午飯前最好辦。"
L["The birds are singing, {name}. They haven't seen what's out there. Take this."] = "鳥在唱歌，{name}。牠們還沒見識外頭有什麼。拿著。"
L["First good deed of the day, {name}. It's all downhill from here."] = "今天第一件好事，{name}。接下來就走下坡了。"
L["Still yawning, {name}? This works faster than tea."] = "還在打呵欠，{name}？這比茶還提神。"
L["Early, {name}. The dawn patrol thinks we're mad, handing out blessings now."] = "好早，{name}。黎明巡邏隊覺得我們瘋了，這麼早就發祝福。"
L["Out this late, {name}? The night is hungrier than the day. Take this."] = "這麼晚還在外面，{name}？夜晚比白天更餓。拿著。"
L["Past bedtime, {name}. The sensible folk are asleep, so you get this."] = "過了睡覺的點了，{name}。明理的人都睡了，所以這個歸你。"
L["Can't sleep either, {name}? Then let me be useful. Here."] = "你也睡不著，{name}？那讓我派點用場。拿著。"
L["Mind the dark, {name}, and take this. Not everything out there is as friendly."] = "當心黑暗，{name}，拿著這個。外頭可不全這麼友善。"
L["It's late, {name}. This should keep you going till the sun remembers us."] = "很晚了，{name}。這能撐到太陽想起我們。"
L["Only the owls and us awake, {name}, and the owls get no {buff}."] = "只有貓頭鷹和我們醒著，{name}，貓頭鷹沒{buff}。"
L["The inns have locked up, {name}. This is the only thing still being served."] = "旅店都打烊了，{name}。只剩我這攤還有營業。"
L["It's the hour for ghost stories, {name}. Take this, in case one is true."] = "鬼故事時間，{name}。拿著，萬一是真的呢。"
L["Candles low, stars high, {name}. A good hour for small kindnesses."] = "燭火將盡，星光正亮，{name}。適合做點小好事。"
L["Quiet hour, {name}. Every creak sounds like an ambush. This helps with that."] = "安靜的時辰，{name}。每聲吱呀都像伏兵。這個能幫上忙。"
L["This late, {name}, even the guards talk to themselves. I'd rather bless you."] = "這麼晚了，{name}，連衛兵都在自言自語。我寧可給你祝福。"
L["This is the hour things climb out of graves, {name}. Take this; walk briskly."] = "這時間墳裡會爬出東西，{name}。拿著，走快點。"
L["Tomorrow you'll wonder why you stayed up, {name}. This is one good reason."] = "明天你會納悶幹嘛熬夜，{name}。這算一個好理由。"
L["Takes one to know one, {name}. Takes one to do it properly, too."] = "同行才懂同行，{name}。也只有同行做得到位。"
L["From one of our trade to another, {name}. No need to check my work."] = "同行對同行，{name}。不用檢查我的手藝。"
L["Professional courtesy, {name}. We don't charge each other."] = "同業禮遇，{name}。自己人不收錢。"
L["Two of a kind, {name}. We could write the manual. This is chapter one."] = "同道中人，{name}。咱倆能寫本手冊了。這就是第一章。"
L["Don't look so surprised, {name}. Same trainer, I expect. Same blessing too."] = "別這麼驚訝，{name}。大概是同一個訓練師教的。祝福也一樣。"
L["I'd critique your technique, {name}, but mine looks the same. Here."] = "我想挑你手法的毛病，{name}，可我的一模一樣。拿著。"
L["Don't tell the others, {name}: ours is the finest calling. Proof: this."] = "別告訴別人，{name}：咱們這行最好。證據就是這個。"
L["Look at us, {name}. Two experts, making this look easy. It isn't, is it?"] = "看看咱倆，{name}。兩個行家把這事做得像很簡單。其實不簡單吧？"
L["Between colleagues, {name}: I don't know how half of it works. This half, I do."] = "同行之間說，{name}：一半我都不知道怎麼回事。這一半我知道。"
L["We walked the same road to get here, {name}. Take this for the next stretch."] = "我們走的是同一條路，{name}。拿著這個走下一段。"
L["If anyone asks, {name}, we trained each other. Starting with this."] = "要是有人問，{name}，就說咱倆互相教的。從這個開始。"
L["Calling to calling, {name}. We should compare notes. Here's mine."] = "同行對同行，{name}。咱們該交流交流心得。這是我的。"
L["Colleague, {name}. We look after our own."] = "同行，{name}。自己人照顧自己人。"
L["Good to see the old craft in steady hands, {name}. Steadier with this."] = "看到老手藝在穩當的手裡真好，{name}。有了這個更穩。"
L["I'd shout some encouragement, {name}, but you do that far better. Here instead."] = "我想給你喊幾聲鼓勁，{name}，可你喊得比我好多了。給你這個吧。"
L["Charge in as usual, {name}. I'll simply feel better about it now."] = "照常衝吧，{name}。我現在只是比較放心。"
L["For the one who goes in first, {name}. Somebody has to, and it's never me."] = "給第一個衝的人，{name}。總得有人衝，不會是我。"
L["You take the hits so the rest of us don't, {name}. It's the least I can do."] = "你替我們挨打，{name}。這是我至少能做的。"
L["Take this, {name}, and charge. I'll be right behind you."] = "拿著，{name}，衝吧。我緊跟在後面。"
L["For the one who fixes every problem by hitting it, {name}. It usually works."] = "君子動口，戰士動手，{name}。通常戰士比較有效。"
L["I'd shake your hand, {name}, but both are holding something sharp. Take this."] = "想跟你握個手，{name}，可你兩隻手都拿著利器。拿著這個吧。"
L["A little help for a lot of armour, {name}. I hope it fits under there."] = "一身板甲，{name}，希望這個還塞得進去。"
L["You'll charge something enormous soon, {name}. I'm just helping it lose."] = "你待會要衝鋒某個大傢伙，{name}。我只是幫它輸。"
L["Save your Light for later, {name}. This one's from me."] = "你的聖光先留著，{name}。這個是我給的。"
L["You bless everyone else all day, {name}. Here's one going the other way."] = "你整天祝福別人，{name}。這次換我祝福你。"
L["The Light already favours you, {name}. Here's a little more of it."] = "聖光已經眷顧你，{name}。再給你添一點。"
L["Even the Light's own champion needs a hand now and then, {name}."] = "就算是聖光的勇士，{name}，偶爾也需要幫一把。"
L["I'd ask for a blessing back, {name}, but then we'd be here all day."] = "本想跟你要個祝福，{name}，但這樣會互加到天黑。"
L["For the one who carries a hammer and a conscience, {name}. Heavy load."] = "錘子加良心，{name}，你背得可真重。"
L["Don't thank the Light for this one, {name}. This was me."] = "這個別謝聖光，{name}。是我給的。"
L["No need to kneel, {name}. I know it's a habit. Take this standing."] = "不用跪，{name}。我知道這是習慣。站著拿吧。"
L["One for you, {name}, and a pat on the head for your companion."] = "一份給你，{name}，再摸摸你寵物的頭。"
L["You watch everyone's back from range, {name}. I've got yours."] = "你在遠處顧大家的背，{name}。你的背我來顧。"
L["Hunter's Mark for them, {buff} for you, {name}. Much nicer."] = "獵人印記給他們，{buff}給你，{name}。好多了。"
L["Take this and aim true, {name}. If it charges anyway, run to the rest of us."] = "拿著，瞄準了，{name}。牠要是照樣衝過來，就往我們這邊跑。"
L["Keen eye, steady hand, {name}. Here's something for the long hunt."] = "眼尖手穩，{name}。給你點東西，留著長途狩獵用。"
L["Nothing for the pet this time, {name}. It's already had three of my sandwiches."] = "寵物這次沒份，{name}。牠吃掉我三個三明治了。"
L["I'd have brought arrows, {name}, but I never know which kind you like."] = "本想帶箭給你，{name}，但我永遠搞不懂你愛哪種。"
L["You can track anything, {name}, but you never saw this one coming."] = "你什麼都追蹤得到，{name}，就是沒料到這個。"
L["Quick hands, quiet feet, {name}. Here's luck to go with them."] = "手快、腳輕，{name}。再配上一點運氣。"
L["Quick, {name}, before you vanish again."] = "快，{name}，趁你還沒消失。"
L["Poison on the blades, {buff} on you. Very thorough, {name}."] = "刀上有毒，身上有{buff}。真周全，{name}。"
L["I'd slip it in your pocket, {name}, but you'd notice. You always notice."] = "想偷塞你口袋，{name}，但你會發現。你總會。"
L["For the one who opens every locked box, {name}. This one comes unlocked."] = "給開過每個上鎖盒子的人，{name}。這個不用撬。"
L["Nobody sees you coming, {name}. Now it's even worse news when they do."] = "沒人看見你靠近，{name}。看見的話，對方更慘。"
L["Take this, {name}. Very discreet. It even walks quietly."] = "拿著，{name}。很低調，走路都躡手躡腳。"
L["I'd have wrapped it, {name}, but you'd only pick the knot."] = "本想包裝一下，{name}，反正你會把結撬開。"
L["Keep this one, {name}. You don't even have to steal it."] = "這個送你收著，{name}。連偷都不用。"
L["For once, {name}, somebody's looking after the priest."] = "難得一次，{name}，換人照顧牧師了。"
L["Save your prayers for the rest of us, {name}. This one's already answered."] = "禱告留給我們其他人吧，{name}。這個已經應驗了。"
L["Light or Shadow, {name}, I don't ask which. This suits both."] = "聖光或暗影，{name}，我不問。這兩邊都適用。"
L["Sit down after this fight, {name}. That's an order. Take this, from a patient."] = "這仗打完就坐下歇著，{name}。這是命令。拿著，病人送的。"
L["You keep us all standing, {name}. Here's a little of it coming back."] = "你讓大家都站得住，{name}。這點算回饋給你。"
L["You've knelt beside all of us, {name}. Stand tall a minute, and take this."] = "你在我們每個人身邊跪過，{name}。站直一會兒，拿著這個。"
L["Something that needed no prayer, {name}. You've said plenty of those today."] = "這個不用禱告，{name}。你今天禱告夠多了。"
L["No voice in your head comes with this one, {name}. Refreshing, isn't it?"] = "這個不附腦中的聲音，{name}。很清爽吧？"
L["The Ebon Blade asks no favours, {name}. I'm giving one anyway."] = "黯刃騎士團不求人情，{name}。我還是要給。"
L["A little warmth, {name}. I know you don't feel the cold. It's the thought."] = "一點溫暖，{name}。我知道你不怕冷，是心意。"
L["You came back from the dead, {name}. The least I can do is help you stay back."] = "你從死亡中歸來，{name}。我至少能幫你別再回去。"
L["Runes, plague and frost, {name}. Take this too; it completes the set."] = "符文、瘟疫、冰霜，{name}。加這個就湊成套裝了。"
L["A skeletal horse and a sword that talks back, {name}. Here's something normal."] = "骷髏馬、會頂嘴的劍，{name}。來點正常的。"
L["No need to drag me over on a chain, {name}. I was coming anyway. With this."] = "不用拿鏈子拽我過去，{name}。我本來就要過來。帶著這個。"
L["Welcome back to the land of the living, {name}. Its general direction. Here."] = "歡迎回到活人的世界，{name}。大致方向吧。拿著。"
L["The elements look after you, {name}, but they don't make house calls."] = "元素照顧你，{name}，但它們不出診。"
L["Tell the spirits I said hello, {name}, and showed them this."] = "替我向靈魂們問好，{name}，再給他們看看這個。"
L["Plant a totem in my honour, {name}, for this. A small one. I'm modest."] = "為這個替我插根圖騰吧，{name}。小的就行。我很謙虛。"
L["Earth, fire, water, air and me, {name}. Admittedly the least of the five."] = "土、火、水、風，還有我，{name}。我承認我最弱。"
L["Totems up already, {name}? Then this goes with them."] = "圖騰都插好了，{name}？那這個也配上。"
L["The wind would have brought you this, {name}, but it's flighty. I'm reliable."] = "風本想送來，{name}，但它太飄忽了。我比較可靠。"
L["You speak for the land, {name}. I hope this makes it speak kindly of me."] = "你替大地發聲，{name}。希望有了這個，它會說我好話。"
L["The spirits said you'd earned this, {name}. I didn't ask; they volunteered."] = "眾靈說你值得這個，{name}。我沒問，它們自己說的。"
L["A gift for a mage, {name}. Hard to find one you can't conjure."] = "送法師的禮物，{name}。很難找到你變不出來的。"
L["You solve most problems with sheep, {name}. This covers the rest."] = "你多半靠變羊解決問題，{name}。這個管剩下的。"
L["You could teleport out of any trouble, {name}. This is for the trouble first."] = "你能傳送脫身，{name}。這是給脫身前那段麻煩的。"
L["For the clever one, {name}. Please don't thank me by making me a sheep."] = "給聰明人，{name}。道謝時拜託別把我變成羊。"
L["Blink wherever you like, {name}. This comes too."] = "想閃去哪都行，{name}。這個會跟著你。"
L["Stand a little back from the fire you're about to start, {name}. Here."] = "等下放火記得站遠點，{name}。先拿著。"
L["You keep us all fed and watered, {name}. Your turn to be looked after."] = "你包辦大家的吃喝，{name}。換你被照顧了。"
L["Portal fees are steep, {name}. Call this a down payment on my next one."] = "開門費好貴，{name}。這當我下次的訂金。"
L["Entirely demon-free, {name}. I checked."] = "完全無惡魔成分，{name}。我檢查過了。"
L["Your imp may be jealous, {name}. Tell it there's plenty to go round."] = "你的小鬼可能會吃醋，{name}。跟它說人人有份。"
L["No contract, no fine print, {name}. Just a gift."] = "沒有契約，沒有小字，{name}。單純的禮物。"
L["For the one who hands out healthstones, {name}. Nobody ever thanks you."] = "給發治療石的人，{name}。從來沒人謝過你。"
L["Here, {name}. Summon the rest of us later and we'll call it even."] = "給你，{name}。晚點把大家召喚過來就算扯平。"
L["Your voidwalker can stop hovering, {name}. I mean well."] = "叫你的虛無行者別再飄了，{name}。我是好意。"
L["Your felhunter eats magic, {name}. Keep it off this one; it's for you."] = "惡魔獵犬吃魔法，{name}。這份是你的，別餵它。"
L["For the one who reads what nobody else dares, {name}."] = "獻給敢讀別人不敢讀之書的人，{name}。"
L["Carrying a bag of souls all day, {name}? Your shoulders must need this."] = "整天扛一袋靈魂，{name}？肩膀一定很痠，拿著。"
L["Roll wherever you like, {name}. This rolls with you."] = "翻滾去哪都行，{name}。這個陪你一起翻。"
L["Brew first or fight first, {name}? Either way, take this."] = "先釀酒還是先開打，{name}？先拿著這個。"
L["Inner peace for you, {name}, and outer peace too, as long as this lasts."] = "內心平靜給你，{name}，效果期間外在也平靜。"
L["Chi flows better with a little help, {name}. Or so a monk once told me."] = "真氣有人幫才順，{name}。一個武僧跟我說的。"
L["Kick, flip, roll, {name}. I'll just stand here and do this bit."] = "踢、翻、滾，{name}。我就站在這裡負責這部分。"
L["Teach me to flip without spilling my drink, {name}, and we're even."] = "教我翻跟斗不灑酒，{name}，我們就扯平。"
L["Tea, meditation and this, {name}. The three pillars of a good day."] = "茶、冥想和這個，{name}。好日子的三寶。"
L["Tell the bear this is for them too, {name}."] = "跟你的熊說這也有牠一份，{name}。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've never once managed to catch you as a cheetah."] = "別動，{name}。你變獵豹時我從沒追上過。"
L["Nature looks after you already, {name}. Today she sent me to help."] = "大自然本來就照顧你，{name}。今天她派我來幫忙。"
L["Whatever shape you're in next, {name}, this goes with you."] = "下次變成什麼形態，{name}，這都跟著你。"
L["For the forest's friend, {name}. Give my regards to the trees."] = "給森林的朋友，{name}。替我向樹問好。"
L["Cenarion work is never done, {name}. Here's a little help."] = "塞納里奧的工作永遠做不完，{name}。幫你一點。"
L["I'd give it to the cat, {name}, but the cat would pretend not to care."] = "本想給那隻貓，{name}，但貓會裝作不在乎。"
L["Take this, {name}. Say hello to your moonkin form; it always looks so startled."] = "拿著，{name}。替我向你的梟獸形態問好；牠總是一副受驚的樣子。"
L["You were not prepared, {name}. Now you are."] = "你還沒準備好，{name}。現在好了。"
L["Years in a Warden's cell, {name}. You've earned a small kindness."] = "在守望者牢房關了那麼多年，{name}。你值得一點善意。"
L["You gave up so much to fight the Legion, {name}. Here's a little back."] = "你為對抗燃燒軍團犧牲那麼多，{name}。還你一點。"
L["For the one who leaps first, {name}. Do land somewhere friendly."] = "給第一個跳的人，{name}。落地挑個友善的地方。"
L["Fel and fury, {name}, and now a little kindness. It'll balance out."] = "魔化能量加怒火，{name}，再加點善意，剛好平衡。"
L["I'd ask if you saw this coming, {name}, but you see everything."] = "本想給你驚喜，{name}，但你蒙著眼都看得見。"
L["You can see souls, {name}. Mine's the one being generous."] = "你看得見靈魂，{name}。正在大方的那個就是我。"
L["Illidan never let anyone help him, {name}. You're wiser than your teacher."] = "伊利丹從不讓人幫，{name}。你這是青出於藍。"
L["A demon inside and a Legion outside, {name}. Here's one thing on your side."] = "內有惡魔，外有軍團，{name}。至少這個挺你。"
L["For you, {name}. Please don't breathe on it."] = "給你，{name}。拜託別對它吐息。"
L["A little help for a dragon, {name}. I'll be telling my grandchildren."] = "幫了龍一把，{name}。我要講給孫子聽。"
L["The Aspects sent you out into the world, {name}. I'm making it friendlier."] = "守護巨龍派你來闖蕩，{name}。我讓世界友善點。"
L["Take to the skies after this, {name}. I'll wave from down here."] = "拿了就飛上天吧，{name}。我在地上揮手。"
L["A dragon on our side, {name}. I've never felt safer being generous."] = "有龍站我們這邊，{name}。我從沒這麼安心地大方。"
L["A gift for a dragon, {name}. Normally folk bring gold and hope to leave again."] = "送禮給龍，{name}。一般人都帶黃金來求活命。"
L["For the one who could fly me to the next town, {name}. Not asking. Hinting."] = "給能載我飛的人，{name}。不是拜託，是暗示。"
L["I've met a few dragons, {name}. You're the first I didn't run from. Here."] = "我見過幾條龍，{name}。你是第一個我沒逃開的。拿著。"
L["For the world's youngest ancient, {name}."] = "給全世界最年輕的老前輩，{name}。"
L["{buff} for a mage, {name}. Like lending a library a book."] = "給法師{buff}，{name}。像借書給圖書館。"
L["Mage to mage, {name}: I won't ask you for water if you won't. Take this."] = "法師對法師，{name}：你不找我要水，我也不找你要。拿著這個。"
L["Two mages, {name}. We can portal anywhere and still be late. Take this."] = "兩個法師，{name}。哪兒都能開傳送門，還是會遲到。拿著。"
L["A mage for a mage, {name}. Our old masters would approve."] = "法師送法師，{name}。我們的老導師會點頭的。"
L["A mage enchanting a mage, {name}. We'll both pretend we needed it."] = "法師幫法師是班門弄斧，{name}。一起假裝需要吧。"
L["We'd never admit which spells we still read off the page, {name}. Not this one."] = "哪些法術還得照著書念，咱倆誰都不會承認，{name}。這個不用。"
L["One mage is a scholar, {name}. Two is an argument. Here's my opening point."] = "一個法師是學者，{name}，兩個是辯論。我先申論。"
L["We both know this spell by heart, {name}. Humour me."] = "這法術我們都倒背如流，{name}。就依我一次。"
L["More mana for you, {name}. Try not to spend it all on one fireball."] = "多給你點法力，{name}。別全砸在一顆火球上。"
L["Priest to priest, {name}: who blesses the blessers? Today, me."] = "牧師對牧師，{name}：誰祝福祝福者？今天我。"
L["Between us, {name}, we'll pretend the warriors listen. Take this."] = "咱倆之間，{name}，就假裝戰士們會聽吧。拿著。"
L["A priest looking after a priest, {name}. It feels almost forbidden."] = "牧師照顧牧師，{name}。感覺幾乎是禁忌。"
L["Two priests, {name}. Twice the praying, half the panic. Here's my share."] = "兩個牧師，{name}。祈禱加倍，慌亂減半。這是我那份。"
L["If it all goes wrong, {name}, we two are the last ones standing. Take this."] = "要是全砸了，{name}，最後站著的就是咱倆。拿著。"
L["Rest your prayers a while, {name}. Mine can keep watch."] = "你的禱告先歇會兒，{name}。我的來守著。"
L["I'd preach to you, {name}, but you've heard it. You've probably given it. Here."] = "我想給你佈道，{name}，可你早聽過了。八成你還講過。拿著。"
L["Same vows and same sore knees, {name}. Here's something for yours."] = "誓言相同，膝蓋一樣痠，{name}。給你的膝蓋補補。"
L["If I fall, {name}, you know the words. If you fall, so do I. Here, so neither."] = "我倒了，{name}，你會念那段話。你倒了，我也會。拿著，誰都別倒。"
L["Two druids, {name}. The Cenarion Circle would call this a quorum. Take this."] = "兩個德魯伊，{name}。塞納里奧議會會說這夠法定人數了。拿著。"
L["Druid to druid, {name}: bear or cat, you'll have this, and leaves in your hair."] = "德魯伊對德魯伊，{name}：熊也好貓也罷，你都有這個，頭髮裡還有葉子。"
L["From one shapeshifter to another, {name}: this one fits every shape."] = "變形者對變形者，{name}：這個每種形態都合身。"
L["No handshake, {name}. Two druids, neither the right shape. Take this instead."] = "免了握手，{name}。兩個德魯伊，誰的形態都不對。拿這個吧。"
L["Between us, {name}, we've a shape for every problem, and this for the rest."] = "咱倆加起來，{name}，每個問題都有對應的形態，剩下的交給這個。"
L["Fellow druid, {name}? The trees told me you were coming, so I had this ready."] = "德魯伊同行，{name}？樹告訴我你要來，所以我把這個準備好了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If you see me as a cat later, pretend you don't know me."] = "拿著，{name}。待會兒要是看見我是隻貓，就裝不認識。"
L["Paladin to paladin, {name}: heavy hammer, light heart, and this blessing."] = "聖騎士對聖騎士，{name}：錘子要沉，心要輕，還有這份祝福。"
L["A blessing for a paladin, {name}. Now we're both insufferably radiant."] = "給聖騎士的祝福，{name}。我們都亮到讓人受不了。"
L["Two paladins, {name}. Somewhere, a priest is relieved. Take this."] = "兩個聖騎士，{name}。某處的牧師鬆了口氣。拿著。"
L["One of us should be humble about this, {name}. Neither of us will be."] = "我們之中該有人謙虛點，{name}。但兩個都不會。"
L["Same oath, different polish, {name}. Yours is shinier. Take this to match."] = "同樣的誓言，不同的光澤，{name}。你的更亮。拿著這個配一配。"
L["Between us, {name}, we could light a cathedral. This lights you, for a start."] = "咱倆能照亮一座大教堂，{name}。先用這個把你照亮。"
L["Two suits of plate, {name}. Nobody hears us sneak up. Take this anyway."] = "兩套鎧甲，{name}。誰也聽不見我們偷偷摸過去。還是拿著吧。"
L["Your libram and mine agree on this one, {name}. Rare, that."] = "你我的聖契這次看法一致，{name}。難得。"
L["Warlock to warlock, {name}: take this, and keep your imp away from mine."] = "術士對術士，{name}：拿著，讓你的小鬼離我的遠點。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}? Then you'll know this one's harmless."] = "同為術士，{name}？那你知道這個無害。"
L["Two warlocks, {name}. Let's not compare soul shards in public. Take this."] = "兩個術士，{name}。別當眾比靈魂碎片。拿著。"
L["Between us, {name}, the demons do all the work. This bit I do myself."] = "私下說，{name}，活都是惡魔幹的。這個我親自來。"
L["Another warlock, {name}. Let's be polite; I've seen what you summon. Here."] = "又一個術士，{name}。客氣點；我見過你召喚的東西。拿著。"
L["A spell from one warlock to another, {name}. Check it for curses. I would."] = "術士送的，{name}。先驗驗有沒有詛咒，換我也會。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}. The only one who won't ask where this came from."] = "同為術士，{name}，只有你不會嫌它來路不明。"
L["Two warlocks, one kind deed, {name}. The Burning Legion must be livid."] = "兩個術士，一件善事，{name}。燃燒軍團一定氣炸了。"
L["I'd summon you a drink, {name}, but you know how summoning goes. Have this."] = "想給你召喚杯酒，{name}，可你知道召喚是什麼下場。拿這個吧。"
L["Two warriors, {name}. Somewhere, a healer just sighed. Take this."] = "兩個戰士，{name}。某處的治療剛嘆了口氣。拿著。"
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: first into the fight buys the drinks. I'm buying."] = "戰士對戰士，{name}：先衝的請喝酒。我請。"
L["Shout for shout, {name}. We'll deafen the whole place together."] = "吼對吼，{name}。我們一起把全場震聾。"
L["No plan, {name}? Perfect. Take this; we'll get along."] = "沒計畫，{name}？完美。拿著；咱倆合得來。"
L["Warriors, {name}: the only folk who think shouting is a spell. We're right."] = "只有戰士覺得吼叫算法術，{name}。我們沒錯。"
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: take this. Shield up, temper hot."] = "戰士對戰士，{name}：拿著。盾舉高，火氣旺。"
L["You know this one, {name}. You've probably shouted it at me already."] = "這招你熟，{name}。你大概已經對我吼過了。"
L["Our trainer would be proud, {name}. He'd shout it, but he'd be proud."] = "訓練師會很欣慰，{name}。會吼著說，但很欣慰。"
L["Fellow warrior? Then you know the blacksmith's name too, {name}. Here."] = "也是戰士？那你也知道鐵匠叫什麼吧，{name}。拿著。"
L["We both served the Scourge, {name}. I won't ask what you did. Just take this."] = "我們都為天譴效過力，{name}。我不問你幹過什麼。拿著就是。"
L["Two death knights, {name}. We've died twice between us. Take this; stop there."] = "兩個死亡騎士，{name}。咱倆加起來死過兩回。拿著；到此為止。"
L["Between us, {name}, we can drop the echoing voice. Just take this."] = "咱倆之間，{name}，不用那種回音腔了。拿著就行。"
L["Mograine would approve of this, {name}. Grimly; he approves of all grimly."] = "莫格萊尼會贊許這個的，{name}。冷著臉贊許；他贊許什麼都冷著臉。"
L["Two horns and one winter, {name}. Mine sounds today; yours can have tomorrow."] = "兩支號角，一個凜冬，{name}。今天吹我的，明天換你。"
L["The living keep their distance from us, {name}. I won't. Here."] = "活人都跟我們保持距離，{name}。我不會。拿著。"
L["We both broke free at Light's Hope, {name}. Every gift since is our own choice."] = "我們都在聖光之願掙脫了束縛，{name}。從那以後每份禮物都是我們自己的選擇。"
L["Do you still dream, {name}? I only ask our own kind. Take this either way."] = "你還做夢嗎，{name}？我只問同類。不管怎樣，拿著。"
L["Walk with me after dark, {name}. With eyes like ours, and this, no lantern."] = "天黑後跟我走走，{name}。憑咱們這雙眼，再加上這個，不用燈籠。"
L["Fellow monk, {name}? Take this; we'll spar later and both pretend we held back."] = "武僧同行，{name}？拿著；回頭切磋，咱倆都裝作留了手。"
L["Two monks and one teapot, {name}. Whoever pours is the humbler, so I'll pour."] = "兩個武僧一把茶壺，{name}。倒茶的人比較謙虛，所以我來倒。"
L["Compare masters, {name}? Mine was the hardest. Everyone's was. Here."] = "比比師父，{name}？我的最嚴。誰的都最嚴。拿著。"
L["Take this, {name}. Meditate with me later. If one of us snores, the other did."] = "拿著，{name}。回頭一起打坐。誰打呼嚕就是另一個。"
L["Monk to monk, {name}: I won't tell you to breathe. I'll just give you this."] = "武僧對武僧，{name}：我不叫你呼吸。我就給你這個。"
L["Two monks, {name}. Xuen sees a contest, Yu'lon a lesson. I see a friend. Here."] = "兩個武僧，{name}。雪怒看到較量，玉瓏看到功課。我看到朋友。拿著。"
L["Why is every monastery on a mountaintop, {name}? Take this for the climb."] = "為什麼每座寺院都在山頂上，{name}？拿著，爬山用。"
L["Take this, {name}; do the forms with me at dawn. Two monks in step is music."] = "拿著，{name}；黎明時跟我一起打套路。兩個武僧步調一致，就是音樂。"
L["Strangers ask you for wisdom, {name}? I give them this. And say eat something."] = "陌生人也找你討智慧嗎，{name}？我給他們這個。再叫他們吃點東西。"
L["Some followed Sarkareth into the dark, {name}. We chose the sky, and this."] = "有人追隨薩卡雷斯墜入黑暗，{name}。我們選了天空，還有這個。"
L["Shall we speak Draconic, {name}? The mortals will think this is a quarrel."] = "咱們說龍語吧，{name}？凡人會以為這是在吵架。"
L["Not even the Aspects knew what to make of us, {name}. I do. Here."] = "連守護巨龍都不知道拿我們怎麼辦，{name}。我知道。拿著。"
L["Do you hold a spell a moment too long, {name}, to feel it gather? I just did."] = "你也會多憋一會兒法術嗎，{name}，好感受它蓄起來？我剛這麼幹了。"
L["Our people are still choosing their customs, {name}. I'd like this one kept."] = "我們的族人還在挑選自己的習俗，{name}。我希望這一條能留下來。"
L["Valdrakken was built for grown dragons, {name}. Take this; we'll feel taller."] = "瓦德拉肯是為成年巨龍建的，{name}。拿著；咱們會覺得自己高一點。"
L["Our magic hums when two of us stand close, {name}. Listen. That's this one."] = "咱們兩個靠近時魔力會嗡嗡作響，{name}。聽。就是這個。"
L["Scalecommanders drilled us both, {name}. Shouts still straighten my back. Here."] = "鱗長們操練過我們倆，{name}。一聽吼聲我還會挺直腰。拿著。"
L["Whichever side you took, {name}, we were kin before there were sides. Here."] = "不管你選了哪邊，{name}，在分邊之前我們就是同族。拿著。"
L["Heard the earth grumble just now, {name}? It was giving you this. Good."] = "剛才聽見大地嘟囔了嗎，{name}？它在給你這個。好。"
L["Race you to the next town as wolves, {name}? Take this first. No lightning."] = "化狼賽跑到下一個鎮，{name}？先拿著這個。不許用閃電。"
L["My ancestors and yours have met by now, {name}. They'd want you to have this."] = "你我的先祖想必早見過面了，{name}。他們會希望你拿著這個。"
L["Two shamans, one sky, {name}. I asked first, so this storm is mine to give."] = "兩個薩滿，一片天空，{name}。我先開口的，這場風暴由我來給。"
L["Folk stare when we talk to rocks, {name}. Let them. The rocks gave you this."] = "我們跟石頭說話時別人老盯著看，{name}。隨他們。石頭給了你這個。"
L["Between two shamans, {name}, a storm is just a conversation. Here's my half."] = "兩個薩滿之間，{name}，風暴只是一場對話。這是我那一半。"
L["The elements could go quiet any day, {name}. Today they answered: this."] = "元素隨時可能沉默，{name}。今天它們回應了：就是這個。"
L["Ever tried to stop listening, {name}? I did. Everything got louder. Here."] = "你試過不去聽嗎，{name}？我試過。一切都更吵了。拿著。"
L["People want storms stopped or started, {name}. I ask the sky; it gave you this."] = "人們想讓風暴停或起，{name}。我去問天空；它給了你這個。"
L["No mana to fill, {name}. It'll just stand about being clever, like me."] = "沒法力可補，{name}。它只會站著裝聰明，跟我一樣。"
L["My spell on a warrior, {name}. Call it a small experiment."] = "我的法術用在戰士身上，{name}。就當小實驗。"
L["I only know the one spell for friends, {name}. Rage or mana, you're getting it."] = "朋友我只會這招，{name}。管你怒氣還法力，收下。"
L["Your rage doesn't need this, {name}, but I'd feel rude walking past you."] = "你的怒氣用不到這個，{name}，但路過不給很失禮。"
L["No mana, I know, {name}. A sharp mind never hurt a sharp blade."] = "我知道你沒法力，{name}。腦袋靈光，對利刃也沒壞處。"
L["It's meant for mana, {name}. You'll find a use. Rogues always find a use."] = "這是補法力的，{name}。但盜賊總能物盡其用。"
L["Not your kind of magic, {name}. Call it a very clever lockpick."] = "不是你那種魔法，{name}。就當是很聰明的撬鎖工具。"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now!"] = "好咧，{name}，你開口就成！別亂動！"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet."] = "來，{name}，這點小玩意讓你站穩腳！"
L["My thanks, {name}. Allow me to return the kindness."] = "多謝，{name}。容我還你這份人情。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast a moment."] = "當然，{name}。站穩片刻。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. Take this with you."] = "前路漫漫，{name}，帶上這個吧。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Your kindness is returned."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。回敬你的好意。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly beneath the stars."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。星光下輕步慢行。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}, and so shall I."] = "聖光會回報善意，{name}，我也會。"
L["Of course, {name}. May the Naaru guide your steps."] = "當然，{name}。願那魯指引你的腳步。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace."] = "聖光與你同在，{name}。平安去吧。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness."] = "感激不盡，{name}。吉爾尼斯從不忘恩。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！帶它上戰場！"
L["The Earth Mother sees your kindness, {name}. I return it."] = "大地之母看見你的善心，{name}。我回敬你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace."] = "當然，{name}。站直了，心平氣和。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}."] = "願大地之母與你同行，{name}。"
L["Ya be too kind, {name}! Dis one be from me."] = "你太客氣啦，{name}！這份算我的。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still now."] = "當然囉，{name}。站好別動。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}."] = "羅亞看顧著你，{name}。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Anar'alah belore."] = "如此禮數，實屬難得，{name}。Anar'alah belore。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。願太陽指引你。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "慷慨已記下，{name}。蘇拉瑪爾不忘友人。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness."] = "謝謝你，{name}！商隊向來知恩圖報。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}."] = "出門在外，總得帶點盤纏，{name}。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done."] = "當然，{name}。耐心點，這就好了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies."] = "拿著，{name}。龍也需要盟友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own."] = "謝謝你，{name}。聯盟照顧自己人。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other."] = "當然，{name}。盟友就該互助。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there."] = "為了聯盟，{name}！在外頭挺住！"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. Your kindness is repaid."] = "力量與榮譽，{name}。好意奉還。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde."] = "交給我，{name}。為了部落。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength."] = "為了部落，{name}！力量與你同在！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts are found everywhere."] = "謝謝你，{name}。好心人處處都有。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly."] = "樂意，{name}，不論你舉哪面旗。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}."] = "朋友不分陣營，{name}。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. Take some {buff} with you."] = "路上小心，{name}。帶點{buff}走吧。"
L["Off ye go, {name}, steady as the mountain."] = "去吧，{name}，穩如磐石！"
L["Stand behind me, {name}. Aye, I know. Crouch a bit."] = "躲我後面，{name}。對，我知道。蹲低點。"
L["Right, {name}: I take the front, ye take the loot, and we argue after."] = "好，{name}：我打頭陣，你撿寶，打完再吵！"
L["If I start singin', {name}, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "我要是開唱，{name}，不是打得很順，就是很慘。"
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}."] = "風平浪靜，一帆風順，{name}。"
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}."] = "阿拉索的子孫同氣連枝，{name}。"
L["Keep close, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things."] = "跟緊點，{name}。人類打贏靠的一向是人多。"
L["Stay in formation, {name}. We haven't got one, but stay in it anyway."] = "保持陣形，{name}。我們沒有陣形，但照樣要保持。"
L["I'll draw up a plan, {name}, and then we can all ignore it together."] = "我來擬個計畫，{name}，然後大家一起無視它。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly; the trees are light sleepers."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。腳步輕點，樹睡得很淺。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。伊露恩守護她的子民。"
L["Quick one, {name}? By kaldorei reckoning we'll be done before we start."] = "速戰速決？{name}，以卡多雷的時間感，眨眼就完。"
L["I'll be the one you can't see, {name}. That's not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "你看不見我的話，{name}，那不是失誤，是戰術。"
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I'm just the one who waves at her."] = "伊露恩看顧著全隊，{name}。我只負責向她揮手。"
L["The moon's up, {name}. For a kaldorei, this is the middle of the morning."] = "月亮出來了，{name}。對卡多雷來說，這才上午。"
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these for millennia. I'm adapting."] = "早安，{name}。我族錯過早晨幾千年了，還在適應。"
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}."] = "在暗處走路要小心，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "跟緊，{name}。有人作伴，低語會安靜很多。"
L["If the shadows start giving orders, {name}, ignore them. I usually do."] = "暗影若開始發號施令，{name}，別理。我都不理。"
L["Keep an eye on my shadow, {name}. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "幫我盯著我的影子，{name}。一打起來它就亂跑。"
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor."] = "夜晚很適合虛無精靈，{name}。跟裝潢很搭。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Always nice to talk to somebody at eye level."] = "為了諾姆瑞根，{name}！能平視說話真好。"
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with you here, we win. I rounded up."] = "算過了，{name}：有你在，穩贏。四捨五入後。"
L["If I shout 'duck', {name}, don't look for a duck. That went badly last time."] = "喊「快閃」是叫你躲，{name}。上次有人跳起舞。"
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed a new engine."] = "早，{name}！我三點就起來了，烤麵包機得換引擎。"
L["Stay near, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "靠近點，{name}。丟過一個世界了，這隊我抓牢。"
L["Twenty-five thousand years on the run, {name}. Walking with friends is nicer."] = "逃了兩萬五千年，{name}。跟朋友一起走好多了。"
L["The naaru would call this a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "那魯會稱之為同伴之誼，{name}。我稱之為好運。"
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}. Something is always hunting."] = "保持警覺，{name}。總有東西在狩獵。"
L["The curse binds us, {name}, but Gilneas binds us tighter."] = "詛咒綁住我們，{name}，吉爾尼斯綁得更緊。"
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, and nobody mentions the fleas."] = "狼群規矩，{name}：不准亂跑，不准提跳蚤。"
L["A pack again, {name}. I hadn't known how much I'd missed one."] = "又成群了，{name}。沒想到我這麼想念這感覺。"
L["I'll catch the scent of trouble first, {name}. It's the one perk of the curse."] = "麻煩我會先聞到，{name}。詛咒唯一的好處。"
L["Night again, {name}. I'm at my best and my worst. This is the best part."] = "夜裡的我最好也最壞，{name}。這是好的那面。"
L["Morning, {name}. I'd have been up sooner, but the rug by the fire was so warm."] = "早，{name}。本想早點起，但爐火邊的地毯太暖了。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Go and earn your glory."] = "血與雷霆，{name}！去贏得你的榮耀！"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！氏族之血在你體內奔騰！"
L["The plan, {name}: we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "{name}，計畫：揍它。問題？沒有？好計畫。"
L["A true warband, {name}. Loud, angry, and all on the same side for once."] = "真正的戰團，{name}。又吵又兇，難得全站同一邊。"
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers. And in axes."] = "跟緊戰團，{name}。人多力量大，斧頭多也是。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Undercity's housing list is already very long."] = "保住小命，{name}。幽暗城的房子要排很久。"
L["If I fall down, {name}, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "我若倒下，{name}，等一下。老習慣。"
L["I'll take the front, {name}. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "我打頭陣，{name}。最糟又能怎樣？再死一次？"
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have company for once."] = "死人作息很糟，{name}。難得有人作伴。"
L["Morning already, {name}? I've been up all night. And all of last decade."] = "已經早上了，{name}？我整晚沒睡，過去十年也是。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}. She's everywhere, so you can't get lost."] = "與大地之母同行，{name}。她無處不在，迷不了路。"
L["May An'she light your path, {name}."] = "願安榭照亮你的路，{name}。"
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}."] = "大地之母看顧著我們倆，{name}。"
L["Get behind me, {name}. There's room back there for the whole party."] = "躲我後面，{name}。後面塞得下全隊。"
L["The herd moves together, {name}. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned to."] = "牛群同進退，{name}。小心我的蹄，大家都學乖了。"
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we. Slower, in my case."] = "安榭升起，{name}，我們也起身。我慢一點。"
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll tell her to keep an eye on you."] = "月亮守夜，{name}。我請她多看你一眼。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya gotta be careful."] = "跟緊，{name}。食人妖會再生，你們其他人小心點。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. That's the plan, mon."] = "一起進去，{name}，一起出來。計畫就這樣，老兄。"
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance."] = "Shorel'aran，{name}。優雅地戰鬥。"
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}."] = "太陽之井為你我閃耀，{name}。"
L["Do keep pace, {name}. We have a reputation for arriving beautifully."] = "請跟上，{name}。我們以優雅登場聞名。"
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. If we must fight, we'll look splendid."] = "站光線好的地方，{name}。要打，也要打得好看。"
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one."] = "有隊伍了，{name}。我可是盛裝出席。"
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate."] = "太陽升起了，{name}，我也起了。我們有默契。"
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}."] = "蘇拉瑪爾的子民再度同輝，{name}。"
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this needed six permits and a masquerade."] = "遠征！{name}，在蘇拉瑪爾要六份許可加假面舞會。"
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now we must make do with one another. Gladly."] = "以前靠穹頂，{name}，現在靠彼此。我很樂意。"
L["Night at last, {name}. Add a few thousand lanterns and it's nearly Suramar."] = "入夜了，{name}。再掛幾千盞燈，就像蘇拉瑪爾了。"
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it still startles me."] = "天亮了，{name}。關了一萬年，陽光還是嚇我一跳。"
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. The paperwork's a nightmare."] = "我合約期間不准死人，{name}。手續超麻煩。"
L["We split the take even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "收穫平分，{name}。帳我來算。相信我。"
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}."] = "同是流浪人！商隊總在不遠處，{name}。"
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stay together, share the water, nobody sells the alpaca."] = "商隊規矩，{name}：別走散、水要分、不准賣羊駝。"
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. Caravan law."] = "裡頭亮晶晶的，{name}，我先看到的。商隊慣例。"
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids."] = "狐狸人夜裡趕路，{name}。沙子涼，蠍子睏。"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Now go with a light heart."] = "萬事講求平衡，{name}。放寬心去吧。"
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}!"] = "改天得空，一起喝壺酒，{name}！"
L["A fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order. Never the reverse."] = "先打，再吃，{name}。這才是正確順序，反了不行。"
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm, and ready."] = "靠攏點，{name}，像蒸籠裡的包子，熱騰騰待命。"
L["We move as one, {name}. Slowly, perhaps, but as one."] = "同進同退，{name}。慢是慢，但一致。"
L["Past my first nap, {name}, and before my second. Quickly, while I'm awake."] = "第一覺睡過了，第二覺還沒，{name}。趁醒著快點。"
L["The Forbidden Reach feels far behind us now, {name}."] = "禁忌之境彷彿已遠在身後，{name}。"
L["Tell me when to breathe fire, {name}. And, please, when not to."] = "何時該噴火跟我說，{name}。也拜託說何時別噴。"
L["I woke in a cave full of strangers, {name}. This is far better company."] = "醒來時滿洞陌生人，{name}。這群夥伴好多了。"
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We have improved on him."] = "奈薩里奧要我們獨自作戰，{name}。我們青出於藍。"
L["Hagar sent me to see the goddess's work, {name}. You're some of her best."] = "哈嘉爾派我來看看女神的造物，{name}。你可算是她的得意之作。"
L["Two haranir out in the world, {name}. No wonder the elders are up in arms."] = "兩個哈拉尼爾在外頭闖蕩，{name}。難怪長老們炸開了鍋。"
L["We once mastered every beast on our mountain, {name}. These won't take long."] = "我們曾馴服過山上所有野獸，{name}。這些花不了多久。"
L["Word from Harandar, {name}: the haranir are ready to join the fight."] = "哈朗達傳來消息，{name}：哈拉尼爾準備好加入戰鬥了。"
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}."] = "能見到同胞真好，{name}。"
L["Stormwind has a statue for every hero, {name}. I'm putting in a word for yours."] = "暴風城英雄都有雕像，{name}。我幫你報名了。"
L["Onward, {name}. The Alliance is with you."] = "前進吧，{name}。聯盟與你同在。"
L["Together we stand, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "團結一心，{name}。為了聯盟！"
L["Right, {name}: shields up, heads down, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "聽好，{name}：舉盾、低頭，計畫沒動誰都別衝。"
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Or at least the nearest."] = "聯盟史上最精銳的部隊，{name}。至少是最近的。"
L["Go with honour, {name}. Victory awaits."] = "榮譽隨行，{name}。勝利在前方。"
L["Go and do something worth a song, {name}. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "幹件值得高歌的事，{name}。部落就愛大聲。"
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde always made room for those the world turned away."] = "抬頭挺胸，{name}。部落總會收留被世界拒絕的人。"
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. For the Horde!"] = "有彼此就有力量，{name}。為了部落！"
L["Forward, {name}. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never, officially."] = "前進，{name}。部落從不撤退，官方說法。"
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud."] = "聚在一起是戰團，{name}。分開了只是很吵。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or, like me, from none in particular."] = "朋友不分陣營，{name}。或者像我，根本沒陣營。"
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes."] = "並肩同行，{name}，無論如何。"
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us. That's plenty."] = "這隊沒掛旗，{name}，只有我們。這就夠了。"
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we pick fights, together."] = "有天我們得選陣營，{name}。今天先一起找架打。"
L["Your stance says you've had a long day, {name}. Monks notice these things."] = "看你的站姿，{name}，今天很累吧。武僧看得出來。"
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no, we don't."] = "我們不能再這樣見面了，{name}。不對，當然可以。"
L["Somewhere in here a villain is rehearsing a speech, {name}. Let's interrupt."] = "某處有反派在排練台詞，{name}。去打斷他。"
L["Bwonsamdi gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "邦桑迪會超失望的，{name}。謝啦，老兄。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still; da mojo don't like a movin' target."] = "當然囉，{name}。站好，巫毒不愛打移動靶。"
L["No worries, {name}. Da loa got ya covered."] = "別擔心，{name}。羅亞罩著你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. ...Except dis voodoo. Dis one fine."] = "遠離巫毒，{name}。……這個除外，這個沒事。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}. Dey real nosy like dat."] = "羅亞看顧著你，{name}。祂們可愛管閒事了。"
L["Stay sharp out dere, {name}. Take dis wit' ya."] = "在外頭機靈點，{name}。這個帶著走。"
L["Take dis, {name}. Walk like ya own da jungle. I do."] = "{name}，走路要像叢林是你家的。我就這樣走。"
L["Hey, {name}! Always good to see family, mon."] = "嘿，{name}！見到自家人真好，老兄。"
L["Dis crew got style, {name}. Now it got mojo too."] = "這隊很有型，{name}。現在還有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. Dat be da whole plan, mon."] = "一起進，{name}，一起出。計畫就這樣，老兄。"
L["Night be da best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody see where it come from."] = "晚上最適合巫毒，{name}。沒人看得到從哪來的。"
L["We split the loot even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "戰利品平分，{name}。我來算。相信我。"
L["Magni turned to diamond fer the cause, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "麥格尼為了大業變成鑽石，{name}，這是平價版。"
L["Returning a favour:"] = "還人情："
L["Answering a request:"] = "回應請求："
L["In your group:"] = "隊伍中："
L["Offering unasked:"] = "主動提供："
L["Returning a favour of %s:"] = "還人情（%s）："
L["Meeting somebody a third time:"] = "第三次遇到同一個人："
L["(nothing -- speech off, or no usable lines)"] = "（無：說話已關閉，或沒有可用的台詞）"
L["In character"] = "入戲"
L["an in-character line"] = "一句入戲台詞"
L["Could I have {buff} when you have a moment, {name}? Thank you."] = "{name}，方便的時候能幫我加個{buff}嗎？謝謝。"
L["{name}, may I ask you for {buff}, please?"] = "{name}，可以麻煩你幫我加個{buff}嗎？"
L["Hello {name}, would you mind casting {buff} on me? Thanks!"] = "你好，{name}，能幫我加個{buff}嗎？多謝！"
L["My own words"] = "我自己的話"
L["{name}, might I trouble you for {buff}? You have my thanks."] = "{name}，可否賜我{buff}？多謝。"
L["A moment of your craft, {name}? {buff} would serve me well."] = "{name}，借你妙手一用，{buff}對我大有助益。"
L["{name}, if you can spare it, {buff} would be most welcome."] = "{name}，若有餘力，{buff}再好不過。"
L["Well met, {name}. Could you grant me {buff} before I go?"] = "幸會，{name}。臨行前可否賜我{buff}？"
L["I would be in your debt for {buff}, {name}."] = "若得{buff}，{name}，我必銘記此情。"
L["{name}, the road ahead is long. Would you lend me {buff}?"] = "{name}，前路漫長，可否借我{buff}？"
L["Automatic"] = "自動"
L["ask for %s"] = "請求%s"
L["Could give you a buff you are missing. A press asks them for it, politely."] = "對方可以給你缺少的增益。按一下就會禮貌地向對方請求。"
L["|cffffcc66Does nothing:|r %s."] = "|cffffcc66無作用：|r%s。"
L["nobody can be asked just now"] = "目前沒有可以請求的人"
L["Says: |cffffffff%s|r"] = "說：|cffffffff%s|r"
L["Whispers |cffffffff%s|r: |cffffffff%s|r"] = "悄悄話給|cffffffff%s|r：|cffffffff%s|r"
L["Casts nothing and leaves your target alone."] = "不施放任何法術，也不改變你的目標。"
L["asking for buffs: off -- %s is not ticked."] = "請求增益：關閉——未勾選%s。"
L["asking for buffs: held back -- nobody is asked in a fight."] = "請求增益：暫不請求——戰鬥中不向任何人請求。"
L["asking for buffs: held back -- nobody is asked in a battleground or an arena."] = "請求增益：暫不請求——戰場和競技場中不向任何人請求。"
L["asking for buffs: held back in a city or an inn -- tick %s to ask there too."] = "請求增益：在主城或旅店中暫不請求——勾選%s後在那裡也會請求。"
L["Ask in cities and inns too"] = "在主城和旅店也請求"
L["asking for buffs: held back -- you asked somebody %s ago, and one ask in two minutes is the most."] = "請求增益：暫不請求——你在%s前向別人請求過，兩分鐘內最多請求一次。"
L["asking for buffs: |cffffffff%s|r can be asked for %s."] = "請求增益：可以向|cffffffff%s|r請求%s。"
L["asking for buffs: on -- nobody in your group or beside you could give you a buff you are missing right now."] = "請求增益：開啟——此刻你的隊伍裡和身邊沒有人能給你缺少的增益。"
L["asked |cffffffff%s|r %s ago -- not again for the same buff for ten minutes."] = "已向|cffffffff%s|r請求（%s前）——十分鐘內不再請求同一個增益。"
L["whoever buffed you"] = "為你加增益的人"
L["Thank %s"] = "感謝%s"
L["that thank-you has lapsed."] = "這次道謝已過期。"
L["not thanked: %s."] = "未道謝：%s。"
L["they are out of sight now"] = "對方已不在視線內"
L["not thanking |cffffffff%s|r this time."] = "這次不向|cffffffff%s|r道謝。"
L["clear your target to thank them"] = "清除目標後才能道謝"
L["for %s -- they buffed you"] = "為了%s——對方為你加了增益"
L["Buffed you a moment ago. A press thanks them as you have set it up; a right-click lets it go."] = "剛才為你加了增益。按一下會依你的設定道謝；右鍵點擊則放棄。"
L["Emote: one of your thank emotes, with nobody targeted"] = "表情動作：你的道謝表情動作之一，不選目標"
L["Emote: |cffffffff%s|r with nobody targeted"] = "表情動作：|cffffffff%s|r，不選目標"
L["Emote: one of your thank emotes, at |cffffffff%s|r"] = "表情動作：你的道謝表情動作之一，對|cffffffff%s|r"
L["Emote: |cffffffff%s|r at |cffffffff%s|r"] = "表情動作：|cffffffff%s|r，對|cffffffff%s|r"
L["Whispers |cffffffff%s|r a thank-you"] = "密語向|cffffffff%s|r道謝"
L["Right-click: let it go, nothing is sent."] = "右鍵：放棄，不送出任何內容。"
L["ask me before thanking: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "道謝前先問我：|cff00ff00開啟|r"
L["waiting for your press to thank: |cffffffff%s|r, %ds left"] = "等你按下以道謝：|cffffffff%s|r，還剩%d秒"
L["Favour ledger"] = "人情帳本"
