L["%s: none in your bags, so group buffs are not offered."] = "%s：背包裡沒有，所以不會提供群體增益。"
L["Group buffs when %d of your party or raid need it (%s: %d in bags)."] = "你的隊伍或團隊中有%d人需要時使用群體增益（%s：背包裡有%d個）。"
L["Group buffs when %d of a party need it (%s: %d in bags)."] = "同一隊伍有%d人需要時使用群體增益（%s：背包裡有%d個）。"
L["Group buffs when %d of your party or raid need it."] = "你的隊伍或團隊中有%d人需要時使用群體增益。"
L["Group buffs when %d of a party need it."] = "同一隊伍有%d人需要時使用群體增益。"
L["Ready checks and the just-revived go first."] = "就位確認時隊友優先，剛復活的人也優先。"
L["At a ready check, your group goes first."] = "就位確認時，你的隊伍優先。"
L["The just-revived go first."] = "剛復活的人優先。"
L["The thanks wait for a press of the prompt."] = "道謝會等你按下提示框。"
L["Whispers a thank-you to people you can't buff back."] = "向你無法回贈增益的人密語道謝。"
L["Also /thanks people who buff you."] = "也會對為你加增益的人使用 /thank。"
L["Only /thank."] = "只用 /thank。"
L["Silent."] = "不說話。"
L["a whisper"] = "密語"
L["Says %s in %s when you buff someone back."] = "加回增益時說%s（%s）。"
L["Says %s in %s when you buff someone."] = "加增益時說%s（%s）。"
L["Says one of your own lines in %s when you buff someone back."] = "加回增益時說一句你自己的台詞（%s）。"
L["Says one of your own lines in %s when you buff someone."] = "加增益時說一句你自己的台詞（%s）。"
L["What's new in %s"] = "%s 版本更新內容"
L["1. Quick setup"] = "1. 快速設定"
L["Who do you want to buff?"] = "你想為誰加增益？"
L["Should your character talk?"] = "你的角色要說話嗎？"
L["Use these"] = "使用這些"
L["Not now"] = "暫不"
L["Leaves every setting as it is. You can make the same choices later on %s and %s."] = "所有設定維持不變。之後你可以在「%s」和「%s」中做同樣的選擇。"
L["Manners is on"] = "啟用 Manners"
L["It can also remind you to use what is in your bags on yourself: %s."] = "它也可以提醒你對自己使用背包裡的物品：%s。"
L["Your class has no buffs it can cast on another player."] = "你的職業沒有可以對其他玩家施放的增益。"
L["Manners can still answer a buff with a /thank: %s. And it is worth keeping installed on an alt that has buffs."] = "Manners 仍可用 /thank 回應別人給你的增益：%s。有增益的分身也用得上它，值得保留安裝。"
L["/thank people who buff me"] = "對為我加增益的人使用 /thank"
L["Manners could not work out what you can cast."] = "Manners 無法判斷你能施放哪些法術。"
L["Either your class has nothing for other players, or the spell probe came back empty -- %s says which."] = "可能是你的職業沒有能給其他玩家的法術，也可能是法術偵測沒有結果——%s 可以告訴你是哪一種。"
L["Your class has nothing to cast on other players, so this is what the prompt can do with them: ask for theirs, one short polite line at a press. How it is said, and where, is on %s."] = "你的職業沒有可以對其他玩家施放的法術，所以提示框能為你做的是：向他們請求增益，每按一次說一句簡短的客氣話。怎麼說、在哪裡說，請見%s。"
L["Manners shows a small button, the prompt, with the next person to buff. Click it, or press your key, and it casts on them; the game does not let addons cast by themselves."] = "Manners 會顯示一個小按鈕（也就是提示框），上面是下一個要加增益的人。點擊它或按下你的按鍵，就會對對方施放；遊戲不允許插件自行施法。"
L["These settings are shared by your other characters (profile: %s)."] = "你的其他角色也共用這些設定（設定檔：%s）。"
L["Go back to this character's own settings"] = "換回此角色的獨立設定"
L["Give this character its own settings"] = "此角色使用獨立設定"
L["Switches back to the profile named after this character; nothing is copied or overwritten."] = "換回以這個角色命名的設定檔；不會複製或覆蓋任何內容。"
L["Copies these settings into a profile named after this character; changes made after that stay on this character."] = "把這些設定複製到以這個角色命名的設定檔；之後的修改只影響這個角色。"
L["Seeing passers-by"] = "看到路人"
L["1. Who to buff"] = "1. 增益對象"
L["Offer my buff to"] = "提供對象"
L["A starting point; fine-tune it on Who to buff."] = "先選一個起點，再到「增益對象」分頁細調。"
L["Turn on friendly nameplates so Manners can see passers-by: without them it sees almost nobody outside your group."] = "開啟友方名條，Manners 才能看到路人：沒有它們，隊伍之外的人幾乎一個也看不到。"
L["The game's own setting, under Nameplates in its options, where you can turn it off again."] = "這是遊戲本身的設定，位於遊戲選項的「名條」下，你可以在那裡再次關閉。"
L["2. Put it on a key"] = "2. 設定按鍵"
L["The prompt's key"] = "提示框的按鍵"
L["Saved with your game key bindings, so it works on every profile."] = "與遊戲的按鍵設定一起儲存，所以每個設定檔都適用。"
L["Open key bindings"] = "開啟按鍵設定"
L["Opens Options > Keybindings > Manners, the game's own key bindings."] = "開啟「選項 > 按鍵設定 > Manners」，也就是遊戲本身的按鍵設定。"
L["Put Manners on an action bar"] = "把 Manners 放到快捷列上"
L["In a fight it casts at the one person the fight began with: only the prompt and its key move on to the others."] = "戰鬥中它只對開戰時的那一個人施放：只有提示框和它的按鍵會輪到其他人。"
L["In a fight it casts at the one person the fight began with, as the prompt does."] = "戰鬥中它只對開戰時的那一個人施放，和提示框一樣。"
L["Makes the Manners macro and puts it on your cursor: drop it on any action bar slot. The slot then shows the spell a press would cast."] = "建立 Manners 巨集並放到游標上：把它放到任何快捷列格子裡。該格子會顯示按下後會施放的法術。"
L["Drop it on any action bar slot."] = "把它放到任何快捷列格子裡。"
L["Ready: %s buffs whoever the prompt shows."] = "就緒：按 %s 就會為提示框上的人加增益。"
L["Your Manners macro is made: open the macro window (/macro) and drag it onto an action bar."] = "你的 Manners 巨集已建立：開啟巨集視窗（/macro），把它拖曳到快捷列上。"
L["Optional: pick a key or put Manners on a bar, or just click the prompt."] = "選擇性設定：選一個按鍵，或把 Manners 放到快捷列上，或直接點擊提示框。"
L["No key yet."] = "尚未設定按鍵。"
L["Click the box below and press the key you want: one press then buffs whoever the prompt shows."] = "點一下下面的方框並按下想用的按鍵：之後按一下就會為提示框上的人加增益。"
L["Remind me in chat while Manners has no key"] = "Manners 沒有按鍵時在聊天中提醒我"
L["One line a little after you log in, never in a fight, on three logins at most. It stops by itself once a key is set or Manners is on an action bar."] = "登入後不久顯示一行，戰鬥中不顯示，最多在三次登入時顯示。設定按鍵或把 Manners 放到快捷列上之後會自動停止。"
L["3. See it"] = "3. 看看提示框"
L["Stop preview"] = "停止預覽"
L["Show me the prompt"] = "顯示提示框"
L["Shows a sample prompt so you can see it and put it where you want."] = "顯示一個範例提示框，讓你看看並放到想要的位置。"
L["4. Say thanks (optional)"] = "4. 道謝（可選）"
L["When I buff someone"] = "我加增益時"
L["When someone buffs me"] = "有人給我加增益時"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once the fight ends."] = "|cffffd100暫停%s。|r戰鬥中提示框會維持戰鬥開始時的樣子，戰鬥結束後才依暫停處理。"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged, casting nothing, until you lock it."] = "|cffffd100暫停%s。|r提示框目前已解鎖，所以在你鎖定之前，會留在畫面上供你拖曳，但不會施放任何東西。"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r No prompt until then, though who buffs you is still noticed."] = "|cffffd100暫停%s。|r在此之前不會顯示提示框，但仍會記下誰為你加了增益。"
L["Hide the prompt for a while without turning Manners off."] = "暫時隱藏提示框，不必關閉 Manners。"
L["Snooze %s"] = "暫停%s"
L["Who buffed you, whether you returned it, and who you buffed first."] = "誰為你加了增益、你是否還了人情，以及你主動為誰加了增益。"
L["Turn optional modules on or off here. Their changes take effect after Reload UI."] = "可在此開啟或關閉選用模組。變更會在介面重載後生效。"
L["All optional modules start on in 1.12.5. Choose what you want to keep: Combat adds fight buttons, My Buffs reminds you of your own buffs and consumables, Services answers requests, Pets cares for pets, and Achievements adds optional ledger goals. Changes take effect after Reload UI."] = "1.12.5 中所有選用模組預設開啟。請選擇要保留的模組：戰鬥新增戰鬥按鈕，我的增益提醒自身增益與消耗品，服務回應請求，寵物照顧寵物，成就新增選用帳簿目標。變更會在介面重載後生效。"
L["Keep these modules"] = "保留這些模組"
L["Manners: Combat"] = "Manners：戰鬥"
L["One combat prompt for interrupts, defensives and other actions, and the cure, Will of the Forsaken and Mend Pet buttons."] = "用於斷法、防禦等行動的戰鬥提示，以及驅散、不死意志和治療寵物按鈕。"
L["Manners: Achievements"] = "Manners：成就"
L["Quiet achievements for good manners, with medals, points and ranks, on a page of their own."] = "為良好禮儀提供的低調成就，獎章、點數和頭銜都在單獨的頁面中。"
L["Manners: Pets"] = "Manners：寵物"
L["Hunter pet care and moments, and moments with a companion pet for every class."] = "獵人寵物的照料與片刻，以及所有職業與小寵物的片刻。"
L["Manners: My Buffs"] = "Manners：自身增益"
L["Own buffs, consumables and companion-pet reminders."] = "自身增益、消耗品和夥伴寵物提醒。"
L["Manners: Services"] = "Manners：服務"
L["Mage, priest, shaman and warlock services on explicit request."] = "僅在收到明確請求時提供法師、牧師、薩滿和術士的服務。"
L["Reload now"] = "立即重載"
L["Load or unload the optional modules after they are changed above."] = "在上方變更後載入或卸載選用模組。"
L["Minimap and chat window"] = "小地圖與聊天視窗"
L["Show minimap button"] = "顯示小地圖按鈕"
L["Manners stays in the addon compartment under the minimap either way."] = "無論如何，Manners 都會保留在小地圖下方的插件選單中。"
L["Without it, open these settings with %s or Options > AddOns."] = "沒有它時，可用 %s 或「選項 > 插件」開啟這些設定。"
L["A line when somebody buffs you, when a favour is counted as repaid, and when a click fails, is skipped, or leaves somebody owed."] = "有人為你加增益、人情算作已還，以及點擊失敗、被略過或點擊後仍欠著人情時，都會顯示一行訊息。"
L["Only you see these; they show whether a buff was missed or someone could not be reached."] = "只有你看得到這些訊息；從中可看出是否漏了增益，或是有人不在範圍內。"
L["Not even the few lines Manners keeps when the switch above is off: the game refusing somebody, a skip in a fight, something it could not write. What you type after /manners is still answered."] = "連上面的開關關閉後 Manners 仍會保留的那幾行也不說：遊戲拒絕某人、戰鬥中的略過、無法寫入的內容。你在 /manners 之後輸入的指令仍會得到回應。"
L["Send Manners messages to"] = "Manners訊息傳送到"
L["The chat window Manners' own lines go to: the default one, or one of your chat tabs. If that tab is closed or renamed, they go to the default window."] = "Manners自己的訊息顯示在哪個聊天視窗：預設視窗，或你的某個聊天分頁。該分頁被關閉或改名時，訊息會顯示在預設視窗。"
L["Default chat window"] = "預設聊天視窗"
L["Simple view"] = "簡易檢視"
L["Shows only the essentials. Nothing is switched off by hiding it, and search still finds every setting."] = "只顯示最基本的設定。隱藏並不會關閉任何設定，搜尋仍能找到每一項設定。"
L["More options are in the full view: untick Simple view under the search box."] = "更多選項在完整檢視中：取消勾選搜尋框下方的簡易檢視。"
L["Show the welcome again"] = "再次顯示歡迎訊息"
L["Says again in your chat window what Manners does and the one thing it needs from you."] = "在聊天視窗再次說明 Manners 的功能，以及它需要你做的那一件事。"
L["Automatic (whatever they are missing)"] = "自動（缺什麼給什麼）"
L["%s |cff808080(not learned)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（未學會）|r"
L["%s from my imp on the tank"] = "我的小鬼給坦克施放%s"
L["%s |cff808080(mana users only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（僅限法力職業）|r"
L["%s |cff808080(your group only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（僅限隊伍）|r"
L["This character has nothing it can cast on another player."] = "這個角色沒有可以對其他玩家施放的法術。"
L["You have not learned any of these yet, so nobody will be offered anything."] = "你還沒學會其中任何一個法術，所以不會為任何人提供增益。"
L["Automatic never offers %s -- nobody standing in a city wants it -- so nobody will be offered anything."] = "「自動」從不提供%s（站在主城裡的人不會需要它），所以不會為任何人提供增益。"
L["Pick it in Buff to offer if you want it given out anyway."] = "如果還是想提供它，請在「要提供的增益」中選擇它。"
L["Every spell you have learned is switched off, so nothing is offered until you switch one back on or learn one of the others."] = "你已學會的法術全都關閉了，所以在你重新開啟其中一個或學會其他法術之前，不會提供任何增益。"
L["Every spell below is switched off, so the prompt will never appear."] = "下方所有法術都已關閉，所以提示框永遠不會出現。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. |cffffd100Always offer|r does not check what they carry, so it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。|cffffd100一律提供|r不會檢查對方身上帶著什麼，所以可能取代你原有的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Where the game hides which blessing somebody carries, it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。遊戲不顯示對方帶著哪個祝福時，可能會取代你原有的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Anybody already carrying one of yours is left alone."] = "你的祝福會互相取代，所以「自動」只會給%s之中第一個適合對方的。已帶有你某個祝福的人不會被打擾。"
L["Automatic may offer, in this order: %s. Each person gets the first one they are missing."] = "「自動」可能依此順序提供：%s。每個人會得到第一個缺少的增益。"
L["When the game hides what someone has, it tries the next one each time."] = "遊戲隱藏對方身上的增益時，每次會改試下一個。"
L["Only |cffffffff%s|r is offered, to everybody, whatever else they are missing. The per-spell switches come back with Automatic."] = "只會為所有人提供|cffffffff%s|r，不論對方還缺少什麼。切回「自動」後，各法術的開關就會恢復作用。"
L["You picked %s in Buff to offer, but have not learned it, so nothing is offered."] = "你在「要提供的增益」中選了%s，但尚未學會，所以不會提供任何增益。"
L["Learn it or set Buff to offer back to Automatic."] = "請學會它，或把「要提供的增益」改回「自動」。"
L["Untick to never offer this buff."] = "取消勾選即永不提供這個增益。"
L["Off until you tick it. Tick to offer this buff."] = "勾選前保持關閉。勾選即提供這個增益。"
L["Off until you tick it. On: while your imp is out and knows it, the tank of your party is offered it; a press has your imp cast it on them. The tank is whoever the game gives the tank role. Somebody in your party who asks you for it by name gets it too."] = "勾選之前保持關閉。開啟後：只要你的小鬼在場並且會這個技能，就會提示給你小隊裡的坦克；按一下，你的小鬼就會對其施放。坦克是指遊戲分配了坦克職責的人。小隊中按名稱向你要求的人也會得到。"
L["Offer %s to everybody near me"] = "向我身邊的所有人提供%s"
L["On: it is offered to your group and to passers-by, as it was before 1.11.19. Off: it is kept for returning a favour and for somebody who asks you for it by name in chat."] = "開啟：像 1.11.19 之前一樣，向你的隊伍和路人提供。關閉：只用於回報人情，以及在聊天中點名請求的人。"
L["Offer %s to passers-by too"] = "也向路人提供%s"
L["Off: it is offered to the members of your party or raid only. On: passers-by missing it are offered it as well, and so is a passer-by who asks you for it in chat. Passers-by must be ticked above for it to reach them unasked."] = "關閉：只向你的隊伍或團隊成員提供。開啟：也向缺少它的路人提供，在聊天中向你索要的路人同樣如此。要讓它不經請求就提供給路人，上方的路人必須已勾選。"
L["Offer %s to"] = "%s 提供給"
L["Who is offered it."] = "提示給誰。"
L["Tanks only: in your group, only its tanks; nobody outside it. In a group you are reminded of yours only while you tank."] = "僅限坦克：隊伍裡只提示其中的坦克，隊伍之外不提示任何人。在隊伍中，只有你擔任坦克時才會提醒你自己的。"
L["Tanks, and anyone outside my group: your group's tanks, and passers-by and people who buffed you as usual."] = "坦克，以及隊伍之外的任何人：提示隊伍裡的坦克，路人和為你加過增益的人照常提示。"
L["Tanks and me: the tanks, and you whatever your role (Myself must be on)."] = "坦克和我：提示坦克，你自己無論什麼職責都會提示（必須開啟「我自己」）。"
L["Only me: nobody else; you are still reminded when yours is down (Myself must be on)."] = "僅自己：不提示其他人；你自己的增益消失時仍會提醒你（必須開啟「我自己」）。"
L["Somebody who asks you for it in chat always gets it."] = "在聊天裡向你求助的人總會得到提示。"
L["Everyone"] = "所有人"
L["Tanks only"] = "僅限坦克"
L["Tanks and me"] = "坦克和我"
L["Tanks, and anyone outside my group"] = "坦克，以及隊伍之外的任何人"
L["Only me"] = "僅自己"
L["Not on me in a dungeon or raid"] = "在地城與團隊副本中不用於我自己"
L["On: in a dungeon or a raid you are not reminded of your own, whatever Offer to says and whatever your role; the rest of your group is offered it as Offer to says. Out in the world, and in a battleground or an arena, you are reminded as before."] = "開啟：在地城或團隊副本中，無論「提供給」如何設定、無論你的職責為何，都不會提醒你對自己施放；隊伍裡的其他人仍依「提供給」的設定提供。在野外、戰場與競技場中，照常提醒你。"
L["Also offer %s to my target"] = "%s 也提供給我的目標"
L["On: the friendly player you have targeted is offered it whatever Offer to says; everybody else is offered it as Offer to says."] = "開啟：你選中的友方玩家不論「提供給」怎麼設都會被提示；其他人仍按「提供給」的設定。"
L["Offer your resurrection for somebody of your party or raid who is dead and within reach, ahead of everything else. Never in a fight, never for somebody who has released their spirit, and not while another resurrection is already on its way to them."] = "為你隊伍或團隊中已死亡且在範圍內的人提示你的復活法術，排在其他一切之前。戰鬥中絕不提示，已釋放靈魂的人絕不提示，已有其他復活正在施放時也不提示。"
L["Dead passers-by too"] = "也包括死亡的路人"
L["Also offer it for a dead player outside your group whom you could help: your target, your focus or whoever is under your cursor."] = "也為隊伍之外、你可以幫助的死亡玩家提示：你的目標、專注目標或滑鼠指向的玩家。"
L["Asking for buffs"] = "請求增益"
L["When somebody in your group, or right beside you, could cast a buff you would want and do not have, the prompt can offer to ask them. A press says one short polite line to them and casts nothing. It comes last of everything on the prompt; never in a fight, a battleground or an arena; one ask a person for each buff in ten minutes, and one ask in all in two minutes. Nobody on your never-offer list or your ignore list is asked."] = "當你的隊伍裡或身邊有人能施放你想要卻沒有的增益時，提示框可以提供向對方請求的選項。按一下會對對方說一句簡短的客氣話，不施放任何法術。它排在提示框上所有內容之後；戰鬥中、戰場和競技場中絕不請求；同一個人的同一個增益十分鐘內只請求一次，總共兩分鐘內只請求一次。不會向永不提供名單或忽略名單中的人請求。"
L["Ask in"] = "請求方式"
L["A whisper reaches only the person you ask. /say is heard by everybody near you."] = "悄悄話只有被請求的人看得到。/say 會被你身邊的所有人聽到。"
L["A whisper to them"] = "悄悄話給對方"
L["/say, aloud"] = "/say，公開說"
L["What the ask says"] = "請求時說什麼"
L["{name} is their name and {buff} the spell. With the In character set chosen on %s, a line in character is said instead."] = "{name}是對方的名字，{buff}是法術。在%s中選擇了入戲套組時，會改說一句入戲的台詞。"
L["What the ask says, in your own words, even with the In character set on. {name} is their name and {buff} the spell; leave {name} out and no name is said. One line. Left empty, the first line above is said."] = "請求說的話，用你自己的措辭，即使開啟了「入戲」也一樣。{name} 是對方的名字，{buff} 是法術；不寫 {name} 就不會說出名字。一行。留空時，說上面的第一句。"
L["Blessing to ask a paladin for"] = "向聖騎士請求的祝福"
L["Automatic keeps the blessing chosen for your class and role. Pick one blessing to ask for that one instead. With Automatic, Manners may ask another reachable paladin for a different missing blessing after the first request."] = "「自動」會保留依你的職業與角色選擇的祝福。也可以選擇一種祝福，只請求該種。在「自動」模式下，首次請求後，Manners 可能會請範圍內的另一名聖騎士施放另一種缺少的祝福。"
L["Off: nobody is asked while you are in a city or an inn."] = "關閉：你在城市或旅店中時，不會向任何人發出請求。"
L["A blessing for each class"] = "每個職業一種祝福"
L["Pick a class, then the blessing its players are offered first. Somebody who already wears it from another paladin, or who cannot be given it, gets what the order above would have chosen; anybody wearing one of yours is left alone."] = "先選一個職業，再選優先提供給該職業玩家的祝福。已經從其他聖騎士那裡獲得該祝福或無法獲得它的人，會得到上方順序原本會選的祝福；已有你的祝福的人不會被打擾。"
L["No class has a blessing of its own yet."] = "還沒有職業設定自己的祝福。"
L["Chosen: %s."] = "已選：%s。"
L["Offer nothing in dungeons and raids"] = "地城和團隊副本中不提供任何增益"
L["Offer nothing in dungeons, raids and battlegrounds"] = "地城、團隊副本和戰場中不提供任何增益"
L["Manners offers each person the first of these they can use, and leaves alone anybody who already wears one of yours."] = "Manners會提供每個人其中第一個可用的增益，已帶有你某個增益的人不會被打擾。"
L["Manners offers each person the first of these they are missing."] = "Manners會提供每個人其中第一個缺少的增益。"
L["Your own order is in use."] = "正在使用你自己的順序。"
L["Following Automatic's order, with %s first."] = "依「自動」的順序，%s優先。"
L["Following Automatic's order."] = "依「自動」的順序。"
L["Only give mana buffs to players with mana"] = "只對有法力的玩家提供法力增益"
L["Only give %s to players with mana"] = "只對有法力的玩家提供%s"
L["%s: the game does not say how many you carry."] = "%s：遊戲沒有提供你攜帶的數量。"
L["%s: %d in your bags"] = "%s：背包裡有%d個"
L["%s: none needed -- the game lets you cast without it."] = "%s：不需要——遊戲允許你不帶它也能施放。"
L["You have not learned a group version of your buffs yet."] = "你還沒學會任何增益的群體版本。"
L["What to cast"] = "施放內容"
L["Buff to offer"] = "要提供的增益"
L["You offer %s."] = "你提供%s。"
L["%s first"] = "%s優先"
L["Offer %s to everybody before any other blessing. Somebody who already carries it from another paladin, or who cannot be given it, gets the blessing Automatic would have chosen instead; anybody carrying one of yours is left alone."] = "先向所有人提供%s，再考慮其他祝福。已從其他聖騎士獲得該祝福、或無法獲得該祝福的人，會改為獲得「自動」本會選擇的祝福；已帶有你某個祝福的人不會被打擾。"
L["Skip players another paladin has blessed"] = "略過已被其他聖騎士祝福的玩家"
L["On: somebody who already carries any blessing from another paladin is not offered one of yours, even one they lack. Somebody who asks you for a blessing by name is still offered it."] = "開啟：身上已有其他聖騎士任何祝福的人，不會再被提示你的祝福，即使是他們缺少的那種。點名向你要祝福的人仍會被提示。"
L["Don't offer %s to mages, warlocks and priests"] = "不向法師、術士和牧師提供%s"
L["On: they are never offered it, however the blessing would be chosen, since it does nothing for them. Their other blessings are still offered and refreshed. Somebody who asks you for it by name is still given it."] = "開啟：無論祝福如何選擇，都不會向他們提供，因為它對他們毫無用處。他們的其他祝福仍會提供和刷新。點名向你索取的人仍會得到。"
L["Only remind tanks and melee with Battle Shout"] = "僅為坦克和近戰角色提醒戰鬥怒吼"
L["Off: Battle Shout reminders work as before. On: an unasked reminder is kept for a tank or a recipient reliably known to fight in melee. Pure melee classes are known from their class; hybrid specs are used only where the client can read them, and an unknown hybrid is not guessed. A favour owed, a buff asked for in chat and your existing never-offer list still work as usual. One shout still reaches its whole party or raid."] = "關閉：戰鬥怒吼提醒與以前相同。開啟：未經請求的提醒只留給坦克或能可靠確認正在近戰作戰的目標。純近戰職業由職業確認；混合專精僅在用戶端能讀取時使用，未知的混合專精不會靠猜測判定。應償還的人情、在聊天中請求的增益與現有的永不提供名單仍照原方式運作。一次怒吼仍涵蓋整個小隊或團隊。"
L["Only remind me of Battle Shout in combat in dungeons and raids"] = "僅在地城和團隊副本戰鬥中提醒戰鬥怒吼"
L["Off: Battle Shout follows the usual reminder timing. On: unasked Battle Shout reminders wait until you are in combat inside a dungeon or raid. A favour owed and somebody who asks for a buff in chat are still offered at the usual times."] = "關閉：戰鬥怒吼依平時時間提醒。開啟：未經請求的戰鬥怒吼提醒會等到你在地城或團隊副本內戰鬥時再出現。應償還的人情和在聊天中請求增益的人仍會依平時時間提供。"
L["Offer Kings last to someone with a Fish Bowl's Boosted Stats"] = "對帶有魚缸加強屬性的人，最後才提供王者祝福"
L["Sitting by a Fish Bowl gives Boosted Stats, 8% to all stats, and Blessing of Kings replaces it. On: somebody wearing it is offered your other blessings first, and Kings only when nothing else of yours is missing for them."] = "坐在魚缸旁會獲得加強屬性（全屬性提高8%），而王者祝福會取代它。開啟後：帶著它的人會先被提供你的其他祝福，只有在你的其他祝福都不缺時才提供王者祝福。"
L["Never offer them Kings while it lasts"] = "加強屬性持續期間，絕不對其提供王者祝福"
L["On: somebody wearing a Fish Bowl's Boosted Stats is not offered Blessing of Kings at all while it lasts, even with nothing else of yours missing. Somebody who asks you for Kings by name is still given it."] = "開啟後：帶著魚缸加強屬性的人，在它持續期間完全不會被提供王者祝福，即使你的其他祝福都不缺。指名向你要王者祝福的人仍然會得到它。"
L["Leave a campsite's Boosted Stamina, Intellect or Spirit alone"] = "不去動營地的加強耐力、智力或精神"
L["Resting at a campsite gives Boosted Stamina, Intellect or Spirit. Manners already leaves it alone when it gives as much as yours would. On: nobody wearing it, you included, is offered the buff it would replace, even a stronger one."] = "在營地休息會獲得加強耐力、智力或精神。當它和你的效果一樣強時，Manners 本來就不會覆蓋它。開啟：任何帶著它的人（包括你）都不會被提供會取代它的增益，即使你的更強。"
L["%s is not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不會為沒有法力的玩家（例如戰士和盜賊）提供%s。"
L["%s are not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不會為沒有法力的玩家（例如戰士和盜賊）提供%s。"
L["Buff order"] = "增益順序"
L["Move up"] = "上移"
L["Move down"] = "下移"
L["Back to Automatic"] = "改回自動"
L["Blessing for that class"] = "該職業的祝福"
L["Automatic leaves this class to the order above."] = "「自動」會讓該職業依上方順序處理。"
L["Clear every class's blessing"] = "清除所有職業的祝福"
L["Nothing is ticked here, so the prompt will never appear."] = "這裡什麼都沒勾選，所以提示框永遠不會出現。"
L["People who buff me"] = "為我加增益的人"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your own party (in a raid, your subgroup), so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去。你的增益只作用於你自己的隊伍（在團隊中則是你所在的小隊），所以不在其中的人要等加入後才會出現。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your group, so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去。你的增益只作用於你的隊伍，所以不在隊伍中的人要等加入後才會出現。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you, in your group or not."] = "有人為你加增益時，提示你加回去，不論對方是否在你的隊伍中。"
L["My party and raid"] = "我的隊伍與團隊"
L["My group's pets too"] = "也包括我隊伍的寵物"
L["Also offer your buffs to the pets of the people in your party or raid: a hunter's beast, a warlock's demon. A pet is targeted by its name, so one with a name of its own is reached most surely."] = "也為你隊伍或團隊中玩家的寵物提示增益：獵人的野獸、術士的惡魔。寵物是依名字選取的，因此有自己獨特名字的寵物最能準確選中。"
L["When somebody else of your class in your party or raid uses Manners too, the group is split between you, so you are not both sent to buff the same person. A favour owed, a request, your target and your focus are never held back, and anybody still missing the buff after 45 seconds is offered anyway."] = "當你的隊伍或團隊中還有同職業的玩家也在使用 Manners 時，隊伍會在你們之間分配，避免兩人都被提示去為同一個人加增益。欠下的人情、對方的請求、你的目標和專注目標不受此限制；45 秒後仍缺少增益的人，照樣會提供給你。"
L["Passers-by: players near me who are not in my group"] = "路人：我附近、不在我隊伍中的玩家"
L["Seen through nameplates, your target, focus and mouseover."] = "透過名條、目標、專注目標和滑鼠指向發現。"
L["What you can offer goes only to members of your group, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能提供的增益只會給隊伍成員，所以不會提供給路人。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and reaches only your party, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能提供的增益都是對自己施放、只作用於你的隊伍，所以沒有能給路人的。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and reaches your party and raid around you, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能提供的增益都是對自己施放、作用於你周圍的隊伍和團隊，所以沒有能給路人的。"
L["Passers-by within"] = "路人距離"
L["Only passers-by are measured, and only roughly: the game gives no exact distance."] = "只有路人會測量距離，而且只是大約：遊戲不提供精確距離。"
L["Out in the world, passers-by are left alone; your group and people who buff you are offered anywhere."] = "在野外不會提供給路人；隊友和為你加增益的人在哪裡都會提供。"
L["On: nothing is offered to anybody while you are in a city or an inn: not passers-by, not your group, not a favour you owe. Somebody you target or focus is still offered. Your own buffs have a switch of their own: %s."] = "開啟：你在城市或旅店中時，不向任何人提示：路人、你的隊伍、你欠的人情都不例外。你選為目標或焦點的人仍會被提示。你自己的增益有單獨的開關：%s。"
L["Where"] = "適用地點"
L["A city is a capital, such as Stormwind or Orgrimmar; an inn is anywhere else you rest. When the game will not say which map you are on, both count."] = "城市指主城，例如暴風城或奧格瑞瑪；旅店指其他你可以休息的地方。當遊戲不告訴你身處哪張地圖時，兩者都算。"
L["Cities and inns"] = "主城和旅店"
L["Cities only"] = "僅主城"
L["Inns only"] = "僅旅店"
L["On: inside a dungeon or a raid, nothing is offered to anybody: not your group, not a favour you owe. Somebody you target or focus is still offered, and your own buffs are not held back. A battleground or an arena goes by its own switch, %s, which ticking this one unticks."] = "開啟：在地城或團隊副本中，不向任何人提供任何東西：你的隊伍、你欠下的人情都一樣。你選為目標或專注目標的人仍會被提示，你自己的增益也不受影響。戰場和競技場由它們自己的選項%s決定；勾選本選項時會取消勾選那個選項。"
L["Hold back short buffs in cities and inns"] = "在城市和旅店中不提供持續時間短的增益"
L["On: while you are in a city or an inn, buffs that last only a few minutes (Thorns, say) are not offered, since they run out before you reach anywhere they matter; longer ones, such as Mark of the Wild, still are. Somebody who asks for a buff by name, and somebody you target or focus, is still offered it."] = "開啟：你在城市或旅店中時，只持續幾分鐘的增益（例如荊棘術）不會被提供，因為它們在派上用場前就消失了；更長的增益（如野性印記）仍會提供。按名字請求增益的人，以及你選為目標或焦點的人，仍會被提供。"
L["A buff counts as short up to"] = "增益算作短的上限"
L["In minutes."] = "單位：分鐘。"
L["Buffs that last up to this long are held back in a city or an inn."] = "持續時間不超過此時長的增益會在城市和旅店中被保留不提供。"
L["On: the switches above hold back everybody, even somebody you target or focus. Off: somebody you target or focus is still offered."] = "開啟：上面的開關會攔下所有人，連你選為目標或焦點的人也不例外。關閉：你選為目標或焦點的人仍會被提示。"
L["In a battleground or an arena with %s off, %s holds back somebody you target or focus too."] = "在戰場或競技場中，%s關閉時，%s也會把你的目標或專注目標排除在外。"
L["For a minute, offer your buff to someone who asks for it (\"fort pls\"); off by default because chat is guesswork."] = "有人向你要增益時（「fort pls」），一分鐘內會為對方提供；讀聊天只能靠猜，所以預設關閉。"
L["My group and raid"] = "我的隊伍與團隊"
L["Use group buffs"] = "使用群體增益"
L["When this many need it"] = "需要的人數"
L["Raid groups I buff"] = "我加增益的團隊小隊"
L["In a raid, only these groups are offered your buff; people who buff you or ask are offered anyway."] = "在團隊中只為這些小隊提供增益；為你加增益或向你要增益的人照樣會提供。"
L["What you offer is cast on yourself and reaches only your own group of a raid, so the other groups' ticks change nothing."] = "你提供的增益對自己施放，在團隊中只作用於你自己的小隊，所以其他小隊的勾選沒有作用。"
L["What you offer is cast on yourself and reaches every group of the raid around you: these ticks only choose whose missing buff brings the prompt up."] = "你提供的增益對自己施放，作用於你周圍團隊的每個小隊：這些勾選只決定誰缺少增益時跳出提示框。"
L["Who comes first"] = "優先順序"
L["My target first"] = "我的目標優先"
L["Your target goes ahead of everyone when the game can see they lack the buff."] = "遊戲能看出你的目標缺少增益時，對方會排在所有人前面。"
L["Greyed out while |cffffd100Always offer|r is chosen on %s: nothing is read then."] = "在「%s」分頁選擇|cffffd100一律提供|r時會變灰：那時不會讀取任何資訊。"
L["Friends and guildmates first"] = "好友與公會成員優先"
L["Only changes the order; nobody is added or left out."] = "只改變順序，不會增加或排除任何人。"
L["My group first at a ready check"] = "就位確認時我的隊伍優先"
L["From a ready check until the pull, group members missing your buff go first."] = "從就位確認到開怪，缺少你增益的隊友優先。"
L["Group members just revived first"] = "剛復活的隊友優先"
L["For two minutes after someone is brought back, they go first if they lack your buff."] = "有人被復活後2分鐘內，若缺少你的增益就會優先。"
L["Skip players below level"] = "略過低於此等級的玩家"
L["Someone known only by name is offered anyway."] = "只知道名字、看不到等級的人照樣會提供。"
L["1: nobody is skipped for their level."] = "1：不會因等級而略過任何人。"
L["Skip players out of range"] = "略過超出範圍的玩家"
L["If the game cannot tell the range they are still offered."] = "遊戲無法判斷距離時，對方仍會出現在提示框上。"
L["Skip players flagged for PvP"] = "略過處於 PvP 狀態的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody flagged for PvP flags you too. Ignored while you are flagged yourself, as in a battleground, but not while your own flag is running out."] = "為處於 PvP 狀態的人加增益，你也會進入 PvP 狀態。你自己處於 PvP 狀態時（例如在戰場中）此選項不會生效，但你自己的 PvP 狀態即將結束時仍會生效。"
L["Skip players in a fight"] = "略過戰鬥中的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody in a fight pulls you into it, and what they are fighting may turn on you. They are offered again once the fight is over. Your target and focus are still offered."] = "對戰鬥中的人施放增益會把你也捲入戰鬥，他正在對付的敵人可能轉而攻擊你。戰鬥結束後會再次為其提供。你的目標和專注目標仍會提供。"
L["Skip players of my class, who can buff themselves"] = "略過我的同職業玩家，他們可以自己施放增益"
L["Somebody of your class can give themselves your buff, so they are left out -- unless they are too low a level for the rank you cast, and then they still get yours. People who buffed you, asked or you targeted are always offered."] = "同職業的玩家能自己施放你的增益，所以會被略過——除非對方等級太低，用不了你施放的法術等級，這時仍會提供給對方。為你加過增益、向你要增益或被你選為目標的人一律會提供。"
L["Skip these guilds"] = "略過這些公會"
L["One guild per line, or several with commas between. Blank lines and repeats are dropped when you press Accept."] = "每行一個公會，或用逗號隔開寫多個。按「接受」後，空行和重複的名字會被去掉。"
L["People in these guilds are not offered anything, in your group or as passers-by. Type a guild's name as it shows under a player, with or without the < >. Somebody who buffed you or asked, and your target and focus, are still offered. |cffffd100Show their guild under the name|r (%s) shows whose guild it is."] = "這些公會的成員不會被提供任何增益，無論在你的隊伍裡還是作為路人。請照玩家名字下方顯示的樣子輸入公會名，有沒有 < > 都可以。給過你增益或向你索取的人，以及你的目標和專注目標，仍會被提供。|cffffd100在名字下顯示公會|r（%s）可以看到對方的公會。"
L["Players OlympusMute mutes, by name or by a word in their guild's name, are not offered anything: in your group, as passers-by or when they ask, and are never asked for a buff. Somebody who buffed you is still offered the favour back, and your target and focus are still offered. Its lists are read as they stand and never changed; while its muting is switched off, nobody is skipped."] = "OlympusMute 依名字或公會名稱中的字詞封鎖的玩家，不會被提供任何東西：隊伍中、路人或他們開口請求時都一樣，也不會向他們要求增益。幫你上過增益的人仍會得到回禮，你的目標和專注目標也仍會被提供。它的名單只讀取、絕不修改；它的封鎖功能關閉時，不會略過任何人。"
L["Classes I buff as passers-by"] = "作為路人時我加增益的職業"
L["Passers-by of a class you untick are not offered your buff. Your group, people who buff you or ask, and your target and focus are offered anyway."] = "取消勾選的職業的路人不會被提供你的增益。你的隊伍、為你加增益或向你請求的人，以及你的目標和專注目標仍會被提供。"
L["Nobody is on the list. Shift-right-click the prompt to add the person it shows, or type a name below."] = "名單上沒有人。Shift+右鍵點擊提示框可加入目前顯示的人，或在下方輸入名字。"
L["One person is on the list. They are never offered anything as a passer-by or as a member of your group."] = "名單上有1人。不論對方是路人還是隊友，都永遠不會為對方提供任何增益。"
L["%d people are on the list. They are never offered anything as passers-by or as members of your group."] = "名單上有%d人。不論他們是路人還是隊友，都永遠不會為他們提供任何增益。"
L["Somebody on it who buffs you is still offered the favour back. Shift-right-click them on the prompt to let that favour go."] = "名單上的人若為你加了增益，仍會提示你還人情。在提示框上 Shift+右鍵點擊對方，就能讓那份人情作罷。"
L["Add a name"] = "加入名字"
L["Type it as the prompt shows it and press Enter."] = "照提示框上顯示的寫法輸入，再按 Enter。"
L["Paste a list of names"] = "貼上名字列表"
L["One name per line, or several with commas between, as the prompt shows them. Press Accept to put them all on the list. Blank lines and names already on it are passed over."] = "每行一個名字，或用逗號隔開寫多個，寫法與提示框顯示的一致。按「接受」把它們全部加入名單。空行和已在名單上的名字會被略過。"
L["Pick a name"] = "選擇名字"
L["Remove from list"] = "從名單移除"
L["Clear the list"] = "清空名單"
L["Take everybody off the never-offer list?"] = "要把所有人移出永不提供名單嗎？"
L["Offer held-back buffs again"] = "重新提供暫停的增益"
L["A buff the game refused on somebody (A more powerful spell is already active, too low a level, or refused twice running with nothing changed) is not offered to them for ten minutes. This offers every such buff again now."] = "遊戲拒絕對某人施放的增益（已經有一個更強大的法術在發揮作用、等級太低，或在沒有任何變化的情況下連續兩次被拒絕）會在十分鐘內不再提供給對方。此按鈕立即重新提供所有此類增益。"
L["Other people already buffed"] = "已有增益的其他玩家"
L["Already buffed"] = "已有增益"
L["When they already have my buff"] = "對方已有我的增益時"
L["Your own buffs are offered when none is up; with Offer a top-up when it runs low, also when one is running out (never an aura or an aspect)."] = "你自己的增益都沒有生效時會提供；選擇「快到期時提供補加」時，有增益快到期也會提供（光環和守護除外）。"
L["Someone who buffed you is offered a buff back unless they already have it with time to spare; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "為你加過增益的人會提示你加回去，除非對方已有該增益且剩餘時間充裕；「診斷」分頁會顯示 Manners 能看到別人身上的哪些增益。"
L["Someone who buffed you is always offered a buff back; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "為你加過增益的人一律會提示你加回去；「診斷」分頁會顯示 Manners 能看到別人身上的哪些增益。"
L["Skip them (default)"] = "略過（預設）"
L["Offer a top-up when it runs low"] = "快到期時提供補加"
L["Always offer (costs a lot of mana)"] = "一律提供（耗費大量法力）"
L["Top up at most this early"] = "最多提前這麼久補加"
L["Manners tops a buff up shortly before it ends: about a tenth of its length, so a minute before for a ten-minute buff and five minutes for an hour. This is the most it will ever take."] = "Manners 會在增益快結束時補上：大約是持續時間的十分之一，所以十分鐘的增益提前一分鐘，一小時的提前五分鐘。這是它最多會提前的時間。"
L["Someone whose time left cannot be read is not offered a top-up, unless they buffed you."] = "讀不到剩餘時間的人不會提供補加，除非對方為你加過增益。"
L["Earlier in a raid or dungeon"] = "團隊或地城中提前更多"
L["A fight and the drinking after it take minutes, so in a raid or a dungeon a top-up is offered this many times as early. Your own buffs are offered half as early again, and people outside your group only in the last half minute."] = "一場戰鬥和戰後的喝水要花上幾分鐘，所以在團隊或地城中，補加會提前這麼多倍提供。你自己的增益會再提前一半提供，隊伍之外的人只在最後半分鐘提供。"
L["Topping up early"] = "提前補充"
L["Top up my own buffs before they run out"] = "在我自己的增益結束前補加"
L["Your own buffs, and the ones you put on yourself, are offered again shortly before they end, whatever When they already have my buff says for other people."] = "你自己的增益，以及你加在自己身上的增益，會在結束前不久再次提供，不論「對方已有我的增益時」對其他人怎麼設定。"
L["Remind me this long before mine run out"] = "在我的增益結束前這麼久提醒我"
L["At 0, Manners works it out from how long the buff lasts: a little over a tenth of it, twice that in a dungeon or raid. Set a time to be reminded exactly that long before your own buffs end, in a dungeon or raid too (0.5 is half a minute). Never more than half the buff's length."] = "設為 0 時，Manners 依增益的持續時間來算：略多於十分之一，在地城或團隊中是兩倍。設一個時間，就會在你自己的增益結束前正好提前這麼久提醒你，地城或團隊中也一樣（0.5 是半分鐘）。最多不超過增益時長的一半。"
L["0: worked out from how long each buff lasts."] = "0：依每個增益的持續時間自動計算。"
L["Everyone you offer to is offered again and again, even with a fresh buff."] = "你提供增益的每個人都會一再出現，即使增益剛加上也一樣。"
L["%s does nothing in this mode."] = "%s在這個模式下沒有作用。"
L["Don't offer when the game hides their buffs"] = "遊戲隱藏其增益時不提供"
L["In a fight, and sometimes just after, the game hides other players' buffs: Manners cannot tell then whether they already have yours, and offers it marked \"unverified\". Tick this to never offer it then. Someone who buffed you or asked for a buff is still offered."] = "戰鬥中（有時在戰鬥剛結束時），遊戲會隱藏其他玩家的增益：這時 Manners 無法判斷對方是否已有你的增益，會標示為「未確認」後提供。勾選後，這種情況一律不提供。為你加過增益或向你要求增益的人仍會獲得提供。"
L["In battlegrounds and arenas"] = "戰場和競技場中"
L["On: in a battleground or an arena your team is offered your buffs: freely while the gates are still shut, group casts first, and after that only while you are out of combat and only somebody within reach. Off: nobody else is offered anything there but somebody you target or focus. This switch decides there, whatever %s says. Your own buffs are not held back either way: what you fight with comes first after a death, food and the like after."] = "開啟：在戰場或競技場中向你的隊友提供你的增益：大門尚未開啟時不受限制，群體版優先；之後只在你脫離戰鬥時提供，且只限施法範圍內的人。關閉：在那裡不向其他任何人提供任何增益，你選為目標或專注目標的人除外。在那裡由本選項決定，無論%s如何設定。你自己的增益無論如何都不受影響：死亡之後，先提示戰鬥用的增益，食物之類排在後面。"
L["Off: nothing is said when you buff somebody in a battleground or an arena, whatever %s is set to. On: your line is said there as it is anywhere else."] = "關閉：在戰場或競技場中為別人加增益時什麼都不說，無論%s如何設定。開啟：在那裡和在其他地方一樣說出你的台詞。"
L["On: the /thank and the whispered thank-you, where you have them switched on, also go to somebody of your own team who buffs you in a battleground or an arena, never in a fight. Off: nobody is thanked there."] = "開啟：如果你開啟了 /thank 和密語道謝，它們也會傳送給在戰場或競技場中為你加增益的己方隊友，戰鬥中不會傳送。關閉：在那裡不向任何人道謝。"
L["On: in a battleground or an arena the reminders that %s holds back come up as they do in a dungeon. Off: they wait there, as they do out in the world. With that switch off this one changes nothing: they come up everywhere."] = "開啟：在戰場或競技場中，被%s暫緩的提示會像在地城中一樣出現。關閉：它們在那裡暫不提示，和在野外一樣。如果那個選項已關閉，本選項不會改變任何事：它們在任何地方都會出現。"
L["Consumables only in dungeons and raids"] = "消耗品僅限地城與團隊副本"
L["Hold back"] = "暫緩提供"
L["Casting would dismount you; it is always hidden while dead, on a flight path or in a vehicle."] = "施法會讓你下坐騎；死亡、在飛行路線上或搭乘載具時一律隱藏。"
L["In percent of your mana."] = "單位：法力的百分比。"
L["Below this, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低於此值時，只會提供你自己的增益，以及為你加過增益或向你要增益的人。"
L["Below this, only people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低於此值時，只會提供給為你加過增益或向你要增益的人。"
L["Below this, only your own buff is offered."] = "低於此值時，只會提供你自己的增益。"
L["Below this, nothing is offered."] = "低於此值時，不會提供任何增益。"
L["While saving mana, still offer"] = "節省法力時仍然提供"
L["Who is still offered while you are under the floor. Someone who buffed you and is held back stays owed, and is offered once your mana is back."] = "法力低於門檻時仍提供給誰。為你加過增益卻被暫緩的人仍記為待還，法力恢復後再提供。"
L["People who buffed me or asked"] = "為我加過增益或向我要增益的人"
L["Only my own buff"] = "只有我自己的增益"
L["Nothing"] = "無"
L["Off: buffs are offered at any mana."] = "關閉：不論法力多少都會提供增益。"
L["Below %d%% only favours, requests and your own buff are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時只提供人情、請求和你自己的增益；回到%d%%時恢復提供其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only favours and requests are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時只提供人情與請求；回到%d%%時恢復提供其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only your own buff is offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時只提供你自己的增益；回到%d%%時恢復提供其他人。"
L["Below %d%% nothing is offered; it all comes back at %d%%."] = "法力低於%d%%時不提供任何增益；回到%d%%時全部恢復。"
L["Azeroth (general)"] = "艾澤拉斯（通用）"
L["loaded the %s lines."] = "已載入「%s」台詞組。"
L["In combat: changes here apply once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：這裡的變更會在戰鬥結束後套用。"
L["Thanks and speech"] = "道謝與說話"
L["Everyone near you sees it; never in combat or inside a dungeon or a raid, in a battleground or an arena only for your own team, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "你附近的人都看得到；戰鬥中不會使用，地城和團隊副本內也不會使用，戰場和競技場中只對己方隊伍使用，同一個人每5分鐘最多一次。"
L["Emote to use"] = "使用的表情"
L["Or one of these, at random"] = "或隨機使用其中之一"
L["Each thank-you uses the emote above or one of the ones ticked here, picked at random, so it is not the same every time."] = "每次致謝使用上面的表情或此處勾選的表情之一，隨機選擇，這樣就不會每次都一樣。"
L["Wait a moment before thanking"] = "道謝前稍等片刻"
L["The /thank and the whispered thank-you go out a second or three after the buff lands, so they seem less automatic. If they have gone out of sight by then, or a fight has started, nothing is sent."] = "/thank 和密語道謝會在增益落下後一到三秒再發出，顯得不那麼自動。如果到那時對方已離開視野，或戰鬥已經開始，就什麼都不發送。"
L["Ask me before thanking"] = "道謝前先問我"
L["Nothing goes out by itself: when somebody buffs you, the prompt offers to thank them, and your thank emote and whispered thank-you go only when you press it (a click, or the prompt's key). Left alone, the offer goes away after twenty seconds, and a fight drops it. A favour you owe or a buff your group needs comes first."] = "不會自動送出任何內容：有人為你加增益時，提示框會提議道謝，你的道謝表情動作和密語道謝只在你按下提示框時（點擊或提示框的按鍵）才會送出。不理會的話，二十秒後提議消失，進入戰鬥也會取消。你欠的人情或隊伍需要的增益優先。"
L["Don't thank anybody while I'm in a party or a raid"] = "我在隊伍或團隊中時，不向任何人道謝"
L["While you are in a party or a raid, no /thank and no whispered thank-you go out, to group members or anybody else. In a battleground or an arena, Thank people there decides instead."] = "你在隊伍或團隊中時，不會送出 /thank，也不會送出悄悄話道謝，無論對隊友還是其他任何人。在戰場和競技場中，改由「在那裡也道謝」決定。"
L["Whisper a thank-you to people I can't buff back"] = "向我無法回贈增益的人密語道謝"
L["A line from the In character set, fitting your race and class, whispered to somebody who buffs you when nothing of yours goes back to them. Never in combat, a dungeon or a raid, in a battleground or an arena only to your own team, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "從「入戲」台詞中挑一句符合你種族和職業的話，在有人為你加增益而你沒有可回贈時密語給對方。戰鬥中、地城和團隊副本中不會傳送，戰場和競技場中只傳給己方隊伍，每人每五分鐘最多一次。"
L["With friendly nameplates off the game often will not say who buffed you. Then your thank emote goes out with nobody targeted, and on clients that name them in the combat log the whispered thank-you goes by name. Never while you have somebody targeted, never for somebody who may be in your group, and once per buff every five minutes."] = "友方名條關閉時，遊戲常常不會告訴你是誰為你加了增益。這時你的道謝表情動作會在沒有選取任何人的情況下發出；在戰鬥紀錄中會顯示其名字的用戶端上，密語道謝會依名字送出。你選取某人時絕不發送，對可能在你隊伍中的人絕不發送，每個增益每五分鐘最多一次。"
L["Say a line when I buff someone"] = "加增益時說句話"
L["Where to say it"] = "說話頻道"
L["Whisper them sends it only to the person you buff."] = "「密語對方」只會傳給你加增益的那個人。"
L["Say"] = "說"
L["Whisper them"] = "密語對方"
L["Emote"] = "表情動作"
L["Party"] = "隊伍"
L["Raid"] = "團隊"
L["Yell"] = "大喊"
L["Only when I buff someone back"] = "只在加回增益時"
L["Off, you also speak when you buff someone first."] = "關閉時，你主動為人加增益也會說話。"
L["While you are in a party, no line goes out when you buff, to anybody. The buff is still offered and cast."] = "你在隊伍中時，加增益不會對任何人說話。增益照常提供和施放。"
L["While you are in a raid, no line goes out when you buff, to anybody. The buff is still offered and cast."] = "你在團隊中時，加增益不會對任何人說話。增益照常提供和施放。"
L["First name only"] = "只叫名字"
L["{name} says only the first word of a name: Petra Stonewell is called Petra. A one-word name is said whole, and a whisper still goes to the whole name."] = "{name} 只說名字的第一個詞：Petra Stonewell 會被叫作 Petra。只有一個詞的名字照原樣說出，密語仍然發給完整的名字。"
L["Turn on friendly nameplates so Manners can tell when strangers are in range to hear you."] = "開啟友方名條，Manners 才能判斷路人是否近到聽得見你說話。"
L["Tick Say a line to choose what you say."] = "勾選「加增益時說句話」即可選擇要說的話。"
L["Lines"] = "台詞"
L["Line set"] = "台詞組"
L["Replaces the lines below."] = "會取代下方的台詞。"
L["Replace everything in the box below with the %s lines?"] = "要用「%s」台詞組取代下方方框中的所有內容嗎？"
L["One line is picked at random. Placeholders: {name} their name, {buff} the spell."] = "每次隨機挑一句。變數：{name} 對方名字、{buff} 法術。"
L["A line too long for a macro is skipped; Try a few shows what would go out."] = "超過巨集長度的台詞會被略過；「隨機試幾句」可看到實際會送出的內容。"
L["In character picks one of its %d lines when you click, to fit your race, faction, class and the moment. The box below shows only a few examples; editing it turns In character off."] = "「入戲」會在你點擊時從%d句台詞中挑選一句，配合你的種族、陣營、職業和當下情況。下方只列出幾句範例；修改它就會關閉「入戲」。"
L["Never say my last line again"] = "再也不說我上一句台詞"
L["Your last line was one of your own: change it in My own lines, mixed in."] = "你最後說的是自己的台詞：請在「我自己的台詞，混入其中」裡修改。"
L["No In character line has been said yet this session."] = "本次登入還沒有說過入戲台詞。"
L["Leaves this line out of In character for good: %s"] = "將這句台詞永久排除出入戲：%s"
L["left out: %s"] = "已排除：%s"
L["Lines left out"] = "已排除的台詞"
L["One per line."] = "每行一句。"
L["In character never says these lines. Delete a row to hear its line again."] = "入戲永遠不會說這些台詞。刪除一行即可再次聽到那句台詞。"
L["Your lines"] = "你的台詞"
L["Editing these turns In character off and uses only your lines. Continue?"] = "修改這些台詞會關閉「入戲」，只使用你自己的台詞。要繼續嗎？"
L["My own lines, mixed in with In character"] = "我自己的台詞，混入入戲"
L["With In character as the set, some presses say one of these instead of an In character line: How often my own lines are said, below, says how many. {name} is their name and {buff} is the spell. Leave it empty to hear In character alone."] = "選用入戲台詞時，部分按鍵會說這裡的一句，而不是入戲台詞：由下方的「我的台詞出現頻率」決定多少。{name} 是對方的名字，{buff} 是法術。留空則只說入戲台詞。"
L["How often my own lines are said"] = "我的台詞出現頻率"
L["How many presses say one of your own lines instead of an In character one. With Every press, In character speaks only when none of your lines fits the macro."] = "多少次按鍵會說你自己的台詞而不是入戲台詞。選「每次按鍵」時，只有在你的台詞都放不進巨集時才說入戲台詞。"
L["About one press in three"] = "大約每三次一次"
L["About half the presses"] = "大約一半"
L["About two presses in three"] = "大約每三次兩次"
L["Every press"] = "每次按鍵"
L["Go back to In character"] = "改回入戲"
L["Try a few lines"] = "隨機試幾句"
L["Prints sample lines in your chat; only you see them."] = "在聊天框印出幾句範例，只有你看得到。"
L["Somebody"] = "某人"
L["A line goes out only with a buff that can land: in range, ready to cast, and with the mana for it. When Manners cannot tell, the buff goes out without it. Line of sight cannot be checked."] = "只有增益能加上時才會送出台詞：在範圍內、可以施放、法力足夠。Manners 無法判斷時，只加增益、不送台詞。視線範圍無法檢查。"
L["Hold Shift for %s, Ctrl for %s."] = "按住 Shift 施放%s，按住 Ctrl 施放%s。"
L["Hold Shift for %s."] = "按住Shift使用%s。"
L["Hold Ctrl for %s."] = "按住 Ctrl 施放%s。"
L["In combat: changes here show once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：這裡的變更會在戰鬥結束後顯示。"
L["Lock position"] = "鎖定位置"
L["Unlock to drag the prompt; it will not cast until you lock it again."] = "解鎖後可拖曳提示框；重新鎖定前不會施法。"
L["unlocked, but the addon is |cffff8080off|r so there is no prompt to drag -- switch it on first."] = "已解鎖，但插件|cffff8080已關閉|r，沒有提示框可以拖曳——請先開啟插件。"
L["Move it in Edit Mode"] = "在編輯模式中移動"
L["While the game's Edit Mode is open the prompt is unlocked, so you can drag it there with everything else. It casts nothing meanwhile and locks again when Edit Mode closes."] = "遊戲的編輯模式開啟期間，提示框處於解鎖狀態，可以和其他介面元素一起在那裡拖曳。期間它不會施放任何法術，關閉編輯模式後會重新鎖定。"
L["Where it sits"] = "放置位置"
L["Pick Above the action bars to put it back where it started."] = "選擇「快捷列上方」可放回原本的位置。"
L["Dragging the prompt afterwards sets this to Where I dragged it."] = "之後拖曳提示框，這裡會變成「我拖曳到的位置」。"
L["Above the action bars (default)"] = "快捷列上方（預設）"
L["Where I dragged it"] = "我拖曳到的位置"
L["Size"] = "大小"
L["Scale"] = "縮放"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Width"] = "寬度"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["Style"] = "樣式"
L["Use my class's look on each character"] = "每個角色使用我職業的外觀"
L["Each character on this profile wears the look made for its class: a druid the Druid look, a paladin the Paladin look. Where a class has several, as a mage does, it wears the one you last clicked on that class, else the first. Any other look you click becomes this profile's own, which every character wears with this off."] = "此設定檔中的每個角色都使用為其職業設計的外觀：德魯伊使用德魯伊外觀，聖騎士使用聖騎士外觀。若某職業有多個外觀（如法師），則使用你最後在該職業上點擊的那個，否則使用第一個。你點擊的其他任何外觀會成為此設定檔自己的外觀，關閉此項後所有角色都使用它。"
L["Panel style"] = "面板樣式"
L["Pick a theme for the prompt from the list. It switches at once."] = "從清單中為提示框選擇一種樣式。立即生效。"
L["%s: its settings"] = "%s：它的設定"
L["Earlier art"] = "舊版美術"
L["Draws every look with the art it had before it was repainted. Off, a repainted look wears its new painted frame."] = "以重繪之前的美術繪製每種外觀。關閉後，重繪過的外觀使用新的手繪邊框。"
L["Show my key on the prompt"] = "在提示框上顯示我的按鍵"
L["Whether the key you press for the prompt is shown on it. As the look has it: on the class and themed looks, not on the calmer ones. Nothing is shown while no key is bound."] = "是否在提示框上顯示你按下它所用的按鍵。依外觀而定：職業外觀和主題外觀顯示，較素雅的外觀不顯示。未綁定按鍵時什麼也不顯示。"
L["As the look has it (shown)"] = "依外觀而定（顯示）"
L["As the look has it (hidden)"] = "依外觀而定（隱藏）"
L["Always"] = "總是"
L["Never"] = "從不"
L["Panel colour"] = "面板顏色"
L["Colour by why they are offered"] = "依提供原因上色"
L["Pale yellow for your own target, orange for a favour owed, deep pink for somebody who asked, sky blue for your group, violet for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "淺黃色是你自己的目標，橘色是欠的人情，深粉紅色是向你要增益的人，天藍色是隊友，紫色是路人——這也是提供增益的先後順序。"
L["Pale blue for your own target, amber for a favour owed, pink for somebody who asked, deeper blue for your group, grey for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "淺藍色是你自己的目標，琥珀色是欠的人情，粉紅色是向你要增益的人，較深的藍色是隊友，灰色是路人——這也是提供增益的先後順序。"
L["A colour that shows why this person is on the prompt."] = "用顏色表示這個人為什麼出現在提示框上。"
L["Colour set"] = "配色"
L["The colour-blind set keeps the reasons apart for red-green colour blindness, in colours that differ in lightness too."] = "「色盲友善」配色讓紅綠色盲的人也能分辨各種原因，這些顏色的亮度也各不相同。"
L["Standard"] = "標準"
L["Colour-blind friendly"] = "色盲友善"
L["Colour to use otherwise"] = "其餘情況的顏色"
L["Used when Colour by why they are offered is off."] = "「依提供原因上色」關閉時使用。"
L["Put the colour on"] = "顏色顯示在"
L["Where the reason's colour is drawn."] = "原因顏色繪製的位置。"
L["Ring around the icon"] = "圖示外圈"
L["Stripe on the left edge"] = "左側色條"
L["Both"] = "兩者都要"
L["None"] = "無"
L["There is nothing left to colour: %s puts it on the icon, which is switched off."] = "已沒有可上色的地方：「%s」把顏色放在圖示上，而圖示已關閉。"
L["Getting my attention"] = "提醒方式"
L["Flash when someone buffs me"] = "有人為我加增益時閃爍"
L["Needs the spell icon, the colour marker or Full animations."] = "需要顯示法術圖示、色標，或將「動畫」設為「完整」。"
L["Pulse until I buff them back"] = "持續脈動到我加回去為止"
L["Flash once"] = "閃一次"
L["Calm only fades in and out: no sweeps of light, rings, waves, cracks or shaking."] = "「平靜」只有淡入淡出：沒有光線掃過、光環、光波、裂紋或晃動。"
L["In a fight, each press buffs the next person in line"] = "戰鬥中每按一次，為佇列中的下一個人加增益"
L["A fight locks the prompt, so Manners hands it everybody who still needed a buff as the fight began, and each press of the prompt or its key casts at the next of them in turn. Off, every press in a fight casts at the one person the prompt was on. The Manners macro on an action bar keeps to that one person either way."] = "戰鬥會鎖定提示框，因此 Manners 會把戰鬥開始時仍需要增益的所有人交給它，每次按下提示框或它的按鍵都會依序對下一個人施放。關閉後，戰鬥中的每次按下都只對提示框當時所在的那一個人施放。快捷列上的 Manners 巨集在兩種情況下都只對那一個人施放。"
L["Show a Will of the Forsaken button when I am feared, charmed or asleep"] = "我被恐懼、魅惑或沉睡時顯示不死意志按鈕"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows while you are feared, charmed or asleep, and whenever you lose control of your character in a fight where the game will not say what took it: lit when the spell is ready, dim while it cools down. Show the fight buttons can keep it there, dim, all fight. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁邊一個獨立的按鈕，有自己的按鍵。當你被恐懼、魅惑或沉睡時顯示；在戰鬥中失去對角色的控制、而遊戲又沒有說明原因時也會顯示：法術就緒時亮起，冷卻期間保持黯淡。「顯示戰鬥按鈕」可以讓它在整場戰鬥中黯淡地留在那裡。戰鬥中所做的更改從下一場戰鬥起生效。"
L["Key for Will of the Forsaken"] = "不死意志的按鍵"
L["%s was bound to %s; it now casts %s."] = "%s 原本綁定「%s」；現在改為施放%s。"
L["Show a Mend Pet button in a fight when my pet is badly hurt"] = "寵物重傷時在戰鬥中顯示治療寵物按鈕"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows while your pet is under half health, in reach, and Mend Pet is ready. Where the game hides your pet's health in a fight, it shows only with Show the fight buttons set to All fight; its key works either way. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁邊一個獨立的按鈕，有自己的按鍵。當寵物生命值低於一半、在施法範圍內且治療寵物可用時顯示。在遊戲於戰鬥中隱藏寵物生命值的地方，只有「顯示戰鬥按鈕」設為「整場戰鬥」時才會顯示；按鍵兩種情況下都有效。戰鬥中所做的更改從下一場戰鬥起生效。"
L["Key for Mend Pet"] = "治療寵物的按鍵"
L["Show the fight buttons"] = "顯示戰鬥按鈕"
L["For the Will of the Forsaken and Mend Pet buttons. Only when needed: a button appears when you need it and fades after; its key casts it, and a click too when no key is set. All fight: it sits dim beside the prompt for the whole fight, lights up when needed and takes a click. Where the game hides your pet's health in a fight, only All fight shows the Mend Pet button."] = "用於不死意志和治療寵物的按鈕。僅在需要時：需要時按鈕出現，之後淡出；由按鍵施放，沒有設定按鍵時點擊也可以。整場戰鬥：它在整場戰鬥中黯淡地停在提示框旁，需要時亮起，也可以點擊。在遊戲於戰鬥中隱藏寵物生命值的地方，只有「整場戰鬥」會顯示治療寵物按鈕。"
L["Only when needed"] = "僅在需要時"
L["All fight, dim until needed"] = "整場戰鬥，需要前保持黯淡"
L["Show my cure on a button in a fight, only while somebody needs it"] = "戰鬥中用按鈕顯示我的驅散，僅在有人需要時"
L["A button of its own, right of the prompt, that appears only while you, your target or somebody in your group carries a poison, disease, curse or harmful magic your class can remove, and says who. Its key is Key for my cure in a fight, below, also in the game's Key Bindings under Manners. A press cures whoever is under your mouse, else your target, else you. Where the game hides debuffs in a fight, it still appears when the game says you can remove one, without naming the kind. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框右邊一個獨立的按鈕，只在你、你的目標或隊伍中有人帶著你的職業能移除的毒藥、疾病、詛咒或有害魔法時顯示，並告訴你是誰。它的按鍵是下方的「戰鬥中驅散的按鍵」，也在遊戲的按鍵設定中的 Manners 下。按下會驅散滑鼠下的玩家，否則驅散你的目標，再否則驅散你自己。在遊戲於戰鬥中隱藏減益效果的地方，只要遊戲表示你能移除其中一個，它仍會顯示，但不說明是哪一類。戰鬥中所做的更改從下一場戰鬥起生效。"
L["A button of its own, right of the prompt, that appears only while you, your target or somebody in your group carries a poison, disease, curse or harmful magic your class can remove, and says who. Its key is Key for my cure in a fight, below, also in the game's Key Bindings under Manners. A press cures your target when it is a friend, else you. Where the game hides debuffs in a fight, it still appears when the game says you can remove one, without naming the kind. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框右邊一個獨立的按鈕，只在你、你的目標或隊伍中有人帶著你的職業能移除的毒藥、疾病、詛咒或有害魔法時顯示，並告訴你是誰。它的按鍵是下方的「戰鬥中驅散的按鍵」，也在遊戲的按鍵設定中的 Manners 下。按下會驅散你的目標（若是友方），否則驅散你自己。在遊戲於戰鬥中隱藏減益效果的地方，只要遊戲表示你能移除其中一個，它仍會顯示，但不說明是哪一類。戰鬥中所做的更改從下一場戰鬥起生效。"
L["A button for each cure"] = "每個驅散法術一個按鈕"
L["For a class with two cures, such as a druid's Remove Curse and Cure Poison: each cure gets a button and a key of its own, and appears only for the debuff it removes. Off: one button, and Shift casts the second cure."] = "適用於有兩個驅散法術的職業，例如德魯伊的解除詛咒和消毒術：每個法術有自己的按鈕和按鍵，只在出現它能移除的減益效果時顯示。關閉：只有一個按鈕，按住Shift施放第二個法術。"
L["Key for my cure in a fight"] = "戰鬥中驅散的按鍵"
L["Key for my second cure in a fight"] = "戰鬥中第二個驅散的按鍵"
L["Plain press"] = "直接按下"
L["Which cure the cure button and its key cast with no key held. Only cures your class knows are listed. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "未按修飾鍵時按鈕和快捷鍵施放的解除法術。只列出職業已學會的解除法術。戰鬥中的變更從下一次生效。"
L["With Shift"] = "按住 Shift"
L["Which cure the cure button and its key cast while you hold Shift. With A button for each cure on, this cure also gets the second button. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "按住 Shift 時按鈕和快捷鍵施放的解除法術。啟用「每種解除法術一個按鈕」時，此法術也使用第二個按鈕。戰鬥中的變更從下一次生效。"
L["With Ctrl"] = "按住 Ctrl"
L["Which cure the cure button and its key cast while you hold Ctrl. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "按住 Ctrl 時按鈕和快捷鍵施放的解除法術。戰鬥中的變更從下一次生效。"
L["Fade this window while I change the look"] = "變更外觀時淡化此視窗"
L["On: after a change on Look, and while you drag a slider or pick a colour, this window fades for a moment so you can see the prompt behind it. Off: it stays as it is."] = "開啟：在外觀頁變更設定後，以及拖曳滑桿或選擇顏色時，此視窗會短暫淡化，讓你看到後面的提示框。關閉：視窗保持不變。"
L["When a new person appears on the prompt."] = "有新的人出現在提示框上時。"
L["Sound"] = "音效"
L["%s |cff808080(not loaded)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（未載入）|r"
L["Only for people who buff me"] = "只限為我加增益的人"
L["Off, every new person makes a sound, passers-by included."] = "關閉時，每個新出現的人都會發出音效，包括路人。"
L["%s is silent. Pick a sound above."] = "%s 沒有聲音。請在上方選擇一個音效。"
L["Tooltip"] = "提示資訊"
L["Tooltip on the prompt"] = "提示框的提示資訊"
L["What the prompt and the names in its list show when the cursor is on them. Short is the name, why they are offered and a hint; hold Shift for everything. The note about dragging that shows while the prompt is unlocked stays whatever you pick, since it explains the drag."] = "游標移到提示框及其清單中的名字上時顯示的內容。「簡短」只顯示名字、提示的原因和一行說明；按住 Shift 可看到全部。提示框解鎖時顯示的拖曳說明不受此選項影響，因為它是用來解釋拖曳的。"
L["Short (hold Shift for more)"] = "簡短（按住 Shift 看更多）"
L["Only while holding Shift"] = "僅在按住 Shift 時"
L["Off"] = "關閉"
L["Tooltip position"] = "提示資訊位置"
L["Beside the prompt puts it above or below, on the side with more room on your screen, clear of the prompt and its list. Where the game shows tooltips uses your usual tooltip corner."] = "「提示框旁邊」會把它放在提示框的上方或下方，選螢幕上空間較大的一側，不會蓋住提示框及其清單。「遊戲預設位置」使用你平常的提示資訊位置。"
L["Beside the prompt"] = "提示框旁邊"
L["Where the game shows tooltips"] = "遊戲預設位置"
L["Text"] = "文字"
L["Font"] = "字型"
L["Font size"] = "字型大小"
L["Text colour"] = "文字顏色"
L["White turns dark by itself on a light panel; any other colour is used as you pick it, except for names while this is on:"] = "白色在淺色面板上會自動變深；其他顏色依你選的使用，但開啟下面這項時，名字除外："
L["Colour names by class"] = "依職業為名字上色"
L["Shadow and outline on the text"] = "文字陰影與描邊"
L["The shadow under the words, and the outline Minimal draws with no panel behind it, on Glass, Framed and Minimal. Off, the text is drawn flat."] = "玻璃、邊框與極簡樣式中文字下方的陰影，以及極簡在無背景時繪製的描邊。關閉後文字為平面繪製。"
L["Show a second line"] = "顯示第二行"
L["Needs a prompt at least %d pixels tall."] = "提示框高度至少要%d像素。"
L["Show their guild under the name"] = "在名字下顯示公會"
L["Adds <Guild> after the reason on the second line, and in the tooltip, for somebody who is in a guild. Needs the second line."] = "對方在公會中時，在第二行原因之後和滑鼠提示中加上 <公會>。需要顯示第二行。"
L["Icon and waiting list"] = "圖示與等待名單"
L["Show spell icon"] = "顯示法術圖示"
L["Size of the consumables button"] = "消耗品按鈕大小"
L["The button your consumables come up on, with Put consumables on a button of their own on. Unlock the prompt to drag it."] = "開啟「把消耗品放到獨立的按鈕上」後，消耗品出現的那個按鈕。解鎖提示框即可拖曳它。"
L["Icon size"] = "圖示大小"
L["The icon stays inside the prompt: make the prompt taller or wider for a bigger one."] = "圖示留在提示框內：想要更大的圖示，請把提示框調高或調寬。"
L["This look sizes the icon from the prompt's height: %d at %d high. Make the prompt taller for a bigger icon."] = "此外觀依提示框高度決定圖示大小：%d（高度%d）。把提示框調高可讓圖示更大。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d wide."] = "圖示維持在%d，以配合寬度%d的提示框。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d high."] = "圖示維持在%d，以配合高度%d的提示框。"
L["Round the icon off"] = "將圖示裁成圓形"
L["Masks the icon into a circle. Reads more like a portrait than a spell, so it is off by default."] = "以遮罩把圖示裁成圓形。看起來比較像頭像而不像法術，所以預設為關閉。"
L["Frame round the icon"] = "圖示邊框"
L["The metal bezel round the spell icon, on Glass, Framed and Minimal. Off, the icon stands on its own."] = "玻璃、邊框與極簡樣式中法術圖示周圍的金屬邊框。關閉後只顯示圖示本身。"
L["Gryphons at the ends"] = "兩端的獅鷲"
L["A gilt gryphon at each end of the Glass look, as on the game's old action bar. Off, the bar ends at its rails."] = "玻璃外觀兩端各有一隻鍍金獅鷲，如同遊戲舊版快捷列。關閉後，快捷列止於滑軌。"
L["Show the global cooldown on the icon"] = "在圖示上顯示公共冷卻"
L["Sweeps the spell icon while the global cooldown runs, like your action bars, so you can see when the next press will go through."] = "公共冷卻時間內，法術圖示上會顯示冷卻動畫，就像快捷列一樣，讓你知道下一次按下何時會生效。"
L["Show how many are waiting"] = "顯示等待人數"
L["List the next few below"] = "在下方列出接下來的幾位"
L["How many to list"] = "列出人數"
L["Click a name in the list to buff them"] = "點擊列表中的名字，為對方加增益"
L["Turns each name in the list into a button: a left click buffs that person as if they were on the prompt. Right-click skips them for now, shift-right-click puts them on your never-offer list. Names cannot be clicked in a fight."] = "把列表中的每個名字變成按鈕：左鍵點擊會為對方加增益，就像對方在提示框裡一樣。右鍵點擊暫時略過對方，Shift+右鍵點擊將對方加入永不提供名單。戰鬥中無法點擊名字。"
L["Advanced"] = "進階"
L["The defaults suit most players; change these only if something bothers you."] = "預設值適合大多數玩家；只有遇到困擾時才需要調整。"
L["In combat: targeting changes apply once the fight ends."] = "戰鬥中：目標相關的變更會在戰鬥結束後套用。"
L["Reset this page"] = "重置本頁"
L["Put every setting on this page back to its default? Where the prompt sits, the lines you wrote and the never-offer list are kept."] = "要把這個頁面的所有設定恢復為預設值嗎？提示框的位置、你寫的台詞和永不提供名單都會保持不變。"
L["Only class buffs count as favours"] = "只有職業增益算作人情"
L["Only class buffs such as Fortitude count as a favour to return."] = "只有真言術：韌這類職業增益才算要還的人情。"
L["The same goes for /thank people who buff me."] = "「對為我加增益的人使用 /thank」也是如此。"
L["Off, somebody who buffs you and already has everything you could give them, with time to spare, is offered nothing, whoever cast it: a thank-you is enough, and the favour is let go. A buff they are missing, or one about to run out, is still offered back."] = "關閉時：為你加增益的人如果已經擁有你能給的所有增益，且剩餘時間充裕，無論是誰施放的，都不會再提示——道聲謝就夠了，這份人情隨即作罷。對方缺少的增益，或即將到期的增益，仍會提示加回去。"
L["On, the buff they already have is offered again to return the favour."] = "開啟時：會再次提示對方已有的增益，用來還人情。"
L["In seconds."] = "單位：秒。"
L["How long someone who buffed you stays on offer."] = "為你加過增益的人在提示框上保留的時間。"
L["Let them go sooner if they have probably left"] = "對方很可能已離開時更早放棄"
L["Manners can rarely tell whether somebody who buffed you is still in range, so they are let go after the time below."] = "Manners 很難判斷為你加過增益的人是否仍在範圍內，所以過了下面設定的時間就會放過他們。"
L["Let them go after"] = "放棄前等待"
L["Counted from their buff, not from when they walked off."] = "從對方加增益時開始計算，而不是從對方走開時。"
L["Turning it off forgets what is already kept."] = "關閉時會忘掉已保留的人情。"
L["Timing"] = "計時"
L["Wait before trying the same spell on someone again"] = "再次對同一個人嘗試同一法術前等待"
L["In case the cast failed. How long a right-click skips someone is set on %s."] = "以防施法失敗。右鍵略過某人多久，在「%s」裡設定。"
L["A right-click skips someone for"] = "右鍵略過某人的時間"
L["In seconds: how long right-clicking the prompt, or Skip for now in its menu, leaves that person, or your own buff, alone."] = "單位為秒：右鍵點擊提示框或在選單中選擇「暫時略過」後，多久內不再向那個人（或你自己的增益）推薦。"
L["A right-click skips my own buffs for"] = "右鍵略過我自己增益的時間"
L["In minutes: how long right-clicking one of your own buffs, on the prompt or the consumables button, or Skip for now in the menu, leaves it alone. Skipping a food skips every food in your bags, since any of them gives Well Fed. At 0 it follows A right-click skips someone for."] = "單位為分鐘：右鍵點擊你自己的某個增益（在提示框或消耗品按鈕上），或在選單中選擇「暫時略過」後，多久內不再提示它。略過某種食物時，背包裡的所有食物都會一併略過，因為任何一種都能帶來「進食充分」。設為 0 時，沿用「右鍵略過某人的時間」。"
L["After a right-click on my own buff, offer 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes"] = "右鍵點擊我自己的增益後，提供15、30、45或60分鐘選項"
L["Four small buttons come up under the prompt for a few seconds after you right-click one of your own buffs: press one to leave that buff alone that long instead, while fishing or crafting for example. Off until you turn it on."] = "右鍵點擊你自己的某個增益後，提示下方會出現四個小按鈕，持續幾秒：按其中一個即可在這段時間內不再提醒該增益，例如釣魚或製作時。預設關閉，需要你開啟。"
L["Look for people every"] = "尋找玩家的間隔"
L["Lower reacts faster and uses a little more CPU."] = "數值越低反應越快，但會多用一點 CPU。"
L["Targeting"] = "選取目標"
L["Hand my target back afterwards"] = "施放後切回原目標"
L["The prompt has to target someone to buff them; this puts your old target back."] = "提示框必須先選取對方為目標才能加增益；這個選項會在之後切回原目標。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and heard by your party, so the prompt never takes your target and has none to hand back."] = "你能提供的增益都是對自己施放、作用於你的隊伍，所以提示框從不改變你的目標，也就沒有目標需要切回。"
L["Exact position"] = "精確位置"
L["Left / right"] = "左右位置"
L["Up / down"] = "上下位置"
L["Prompt wording"] = "提示框文字"
L["Placeholders: {name} their name, {reason} why, {count} how many others are waiting, {class} their class, {buff} the spell, {time} time left on their buff (top-ups only)."] = "變數：{name} 對方名字、{reason} 原因、{count} 其他等待人數、{class} 對方職業、{buff} 法術、{time} 對方增益的剩餘時間（僅限補加）。"
L["The second line always shows the reason."] = "第二行一律顯示原因。"
L["First line"] = "第一行"
L["For my target"] = "對我的目標"
L["Shown when your target is first in line."] = "你的目標排在第一位時顯示。"
L["For someone who buffed me"] = "對給我加過增益的人"
L["For someone who asked in chat"] = "對在聊天中請求的人"
L["Shown for someone who asked in chat."] = "對在聊天中向你要增益的人顯示。"
L["For my own buff"] = "對我自己的增益"
L["Shown when the prompt offers you your own buff."] = "提示框提供你自己的增益時顯示。"
L["For my group"] = "對我的隊伍"
L["For a passer-by"] = "對路人"
L["For a top-up"] = "對補加"
L["{time} is how long theirs has left."] = "{time} 是對方增益的剩餘時間。"
L["When the game hides their buffs"] = "遊戲隱藏其增益時"
L["Shown when the game hides whether they already have it."] = "遊戲隱藏了對方是否已有增益時顯示。"
L["Manners full check-up. Copy all of it (click in the box, Ctrl+A, Ctrl+C) and paste it into a comment on CurseForge or an issue at github.com/fpsacha/Manners/issues, with a few words on what went wrong."] = "Manners 全面檢查。請全部複製（點擊方框，Ctrl+A，Ctrl+C），貼到 CurseForge 的留言或 github.com/fpsacha/Manners/issues 的問題中，並簡單說明出了什麼問題。"
L["the duel range"] = "決鬥距離"
L["spell and item ranges"] = "法術和物品距離"
L["Messages in chat"] = "聊天訊息"
L["Log every click (noisy)"] = "記錄每次點擊（訊息很多）"
L["Prints what the prompt held and what the game did, to work out why a cast failed."] = "印出提示框當時的內容和遊戲的處理結果，用來找出施法失敗的原因。"
L["Nothing is holding the prompt back right now."] = "目前沒有什麼在阻止提示框。"
