L["(%d in all this session, %d kept -- |cffffd100%s|r)"] = "（本次登入共%d個錯誤，保留%d個——|cffffd100%s|r）"
L["(%d in all this session -- |cffffd100%s|r)"] = "（本次登入共%d個錯誤——|cffffd100%s|r）"
L["Show every error"] = "顯示所有錯誤"
L["Lists every error this session in your chat window, the oldest first."] = "在聊天視窗列出本次遊戲中的所有錯誤，最早的在前。"
L["Nothing has gone wrong this session."] = "本次登入沒有發生任何錯誤。"
L["Reporting a bug"] = "回報錯誤"
L["Manners is made by %s, who plays on the RP-PvP server of WoW Forever."] = "Manners 由 %s 製作，其在 WoW Forever 的 RP-PvP 伺服器上遊玩。"
L["Opens a window that walks you through it: what went wrong, a link that opens the issue on GitHub filled in, and the report to paste."] = "開啟一個逐步引導的視窗：哪裡出了問題、一個在 GitHub 上開啟已填好的問題單的連結，以及可貼上的報告。"
L["Asked for a report? Press %s and paste everything in the box."] = "有人向你要報告？按「%s」，然後貼上框中的全部內容。"
L["Hide the report"] = "隱藏報告"
L["Show a short summary"] = "顯示簡短摘要"
L["Opens a box with the build, what this client allows, the settings that matter and anything that has broken, ready to copy."] = "開啟一個文字框，內含版本號、客戶端允許的功能、重要的設定，以及所有發生過的錯誤，可以直接複製。"
L["Runs every check Manners has and gathers the results, what this client allows, your settings and anything that broke into one box, ready to copy and send with a bug report. Nothing is said to anybody, and nothing is changed."] = "執行 Manners 的所有檢查，把結果、此用戶端允許的內容、你的設定以及出錯的內容彙整到一個方框中，方便複製並隨錯誤回報送出。不會對任何人說話，也不會更改任何東西。"
L["the options window would not open, so the check-up follows here."] = "無法開啟選項視窗，因此檢查結果顯示在這裡。"
L["Key for Mark this moment"] = "「標記此刻」的按鍵"
L["Press it the moment something goes wrong, even in a fight: the report then shows what Manners saw at that instant. Saved with your game key bindings, so it works on every profile."] = "一出問題就按下它，戰鬥中也可以：報告之後會顯示 Manners 在那一刻看到的內容。隨遊戲按鍵綁定一起儲存，所以對每個設定檔都有效。"
L["%s was bound to %s; it now marks this moment."] = "%s 原本綁定到 %s；現在它用來標記此刻。"
L["Test how Manners looks in this game"] = "測試 Manners 在此遊戲中的外觀"
L["Puts every look on the real prompt, tries the action bar slot and the tooltip, and puts everything back: the report opens in the box below. Nothing is cast or said."] = "把每種外觀依序套用到真實的提示框上，測試快捷列欄位和滑鼠提示，然後全部還原：報告會顯示在下方的框中。不會施放任何東西，也不會發言。"
L["Every character uses the Default profile unless you pick another here; make one per character for different settings."] = "除非在這裡另選，否則每個角色都使用「預設」設定檔；想要不同設定，就為每個角色各建一個。"
L["Share as text"] = "以文字分享"
L["Copy your settings as text to share, or paste text someone gave you. Pasting keeps your own on/off, lock, position, minimap button and chat options, and never turns on Say a line."] = "把你的設定複製成文字分享，或貼上別人給你的文字。貼上時會保留你自己的開關、鎖定、位置、小地圖按鈕和聊天選項，也絕不會開啟「加增益時說句話」。"
