L["Off, Manners leaves your pet to you: no care, no moments, no hints and no Mend Pet button in a fight. Each switch below keeps its own setting for when this is on again."] = "關閉後，Manners 把寵物交還給你：沒有照料、沒有片刻、沒有提示，戰鬥中也沒有治療寵物按鈕。下面每個開關都會保留自己的設定，等這裡重新開啟時再用。"
L["Call my pet when none is out"] = "沒有寵物時召喚寵物"
L["Offers Call Pet when no pet is with you. Not in a fight, not while mounted, not in a city unless your own buffs are offered there, and not after you dismissed it yourself."] = "身邊沒有寵物時提供召喚寵物。不會在戰鬥中、騎乘時、城市裡（除非你的自身增益在城市裡也會提供）提供，你自己解散寵物後也不會提供。"
L["Revive my pet when it is dead"] = "寵物死亡時復活寵物"
L["Offers Revive Pet when your pet has died."] = "寵物死亡時提供復活寵物。"
L["Feed my pet when it is not happy"] = "寵物不快樂時餵養寵物"
L["Offers Feed Pet with a food it eats from your bags while it is not happy, and nothing once it is. Food that makes you Well Fed is kept for you."] = "寵物不快樂時，用背包裡牠吃的食物提供餵養寵物；快樂後就不再提供。能讓你進食充分的食物會留給你自己。"
L["Mend my pet when it is hurt after a fight"] = "戰鬥後寵物受傷時治療寵物"
L["Offers Mend Pet when your pet is badly hurt and the fight is over."] = "寵物重傷且戰鬥結束後提供治療寵物。"
L["Tell me at a vendor when my pet is low on food"] = "在商人處提醒我寵物的食物不足"
