L["Remind me about Growl in groups and alone"] = "在隊伍中和獨自時提醒我低吼"
L["A line in chat when Growl is on autocast in a dungeon or raid with a tank in your group (once a zone), or off while you are alone in the open world (once a session). Manners never changes it for you. Off by default: the game does not always say who the tank is."] = "在地城或團隊副本裡，隊伍中有坦克而低吼處於自動施放時（每個區域一次），或在開放世界獨自一人而低吼關閉時（每次登入一次），在聊天視窗說一行。Manners 從不替你更改。預設關閉：遊戲並不總能說明誰是坦克。"
L["Tell me when my pet has training points to spend"] = "寵物有訓練點數可用時告訴我"
