L["How often moments come"] = "片刻出現的頻率"
L["The least time between two moments with your pet: an hour, twenty minutes or ten. Before one on a quiet road: half an hour, a quarter of an hour or ten minutes."] = "與寵物兩次片刻之間的最短間隔：一小時、二十分鐘或十分鐘。在安靜的路上出現片刻之前：半小時、一刻鐘或十分鐘。"
L["Rarely"] = "很少"
L["Sometimes"] = "有時"
L["Often"] = "經常"
