L["After the gesture, how your companion answers: it nuzzles closer, chirps, spins with joy."] = "動作之後，你的小寵物如何回應：蹭過來、啾啾叫、開心地轉圈。"
L["Say a line to my companion"] = "對我的小寵物說一句話"
L["With In character on and lines going in /say, something sweet said to your companion with each moment."] = "開啟入戲且台詞以/say發出時，每個片刻都對小寵物說句貼心話。"
L["Moments with my companion"] = "與小寵物的片刻"
L["Now and then offers a moment with the companion pet that follows you: hello when it comes out, a pat on the road, a game when you stand still, a cuddle at the inn, a treat for a quest, a celebration when you level up. A press does an emote for it, and says something sweet when In character is on and lines go in /say; it targets it by its name and gives your target back. Never in a fight; letting it pass costs nothing."] = "不時提供一個與跟隨你的小寵物相處的片刻：牠出來時問好，路上摸摸牠，你站著不動時一起玩，在旅店抱抱，交任務時給點心，升級時一起慶祝。按下會對牠做一個表情動作，開啟入戲且台詞以/say發出時還會說句貼心話；它會按名字選取小寵物，再把你原本的目標還給你。戰鬥中從不出現；錯過也沒有任何損失。"
L["My companion"] = "我的小寵物"
L["Now and then, a moment with the companion pet that follows you."] = "不時與跟隨你的小寵物相處的片刻。"
