L["%s (Manners now reminds you of it itself)"] = "%s（Manners 現在已自行提醒你）"
L["Spells of your own (%d of %d):"] = "我自己的法術（%d / %d）："
L["No spells of your own yet. Add one on Who to buff, under Add a spell of my own, or with /manners spell add <name or id>."] = "還沒有我自己的法術。請在增益對象的加入我自己的法術之下加入，或使用 /manners spell add <名稱或ID>。"
L["Type /manners spell add <name or id>, or /manners spell remove <name or id>."] = "請輸入 /manners spell add <名稱或ID>，或 /manners spell remove <名稱或ID>。"
L["Manners: consumables"] = "Manners：消耗品"
L["Left-click to use it, right-click to skip it for now."] = "左鍵使用，右鍵暫時跳過。"
L["Drag to move it. Lock the prompt to use it."] = "拖曳以移動。鎖定提示框後即可使用。"
L["Automatic (only while I'm the tank)"] = "自動（只在我擔任坦克時）"
L["Automatic (%s, the one you had up last)"] = "自動（%s，你上次用的）"
L["Automatic (%s, in a dungeon or raid)"] = "自動（%s，在地城或團隊副本中）"
L["Automatic (%s, outside dungeons and raids)"] = "自動（%s，在地城和團隊副本以外）"
L["Automatic (%s, the best you can use now)"] = "自動（%s，你現在能用的最好的）"
L["Automatic (%s, until you have put one up)"] = "自動（%s，在你用過任一個之前）"
L["Reminds you to drink a flask when none is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有精煉藥劑、且背包裡有精煉藥劑時提醒你飲用，優先用你能用的最好的。預設關閉，開啟後才生效。"
L["Reminds you to drink a guardian elixir when no guardian elixir or flask is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. A flask fills both elixir slots. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有守護藥劑或精煉藥劑、且背包裡有守護藥劑時提醒你飲用，優先用你能用的最好的。精煉藥劑會佔滿兩個藥劑欄位。預設關閉，開啟後才生效。"
L["Reminds you to drink a battle elixir when no battle elixir or flask is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. A flask fills both elixir slots. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有作戰藥劑或精煉藥劑、且背包裡有作戰藥劑時提醒你飲用，優先用你能用的最好的。精煉藥劑會佔滿兩個藥劑欄位。預設關閉，開啟後才生效。"
L["A scroll counts as a battle or a guardian elixir, as its own tooltip says."] = "卷軸依其本身的滑鼠提示算作作戰藥劑或守護藥劑。"
L["Reminds you to drink an elixir when none is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有藥劑、且背包裡有藥劑時提醒你飲用，優先用你能用的最好的。預設關閉，開啟後才生效。"
L["Reminds you to use one on yourself when none of it is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有該效果、且背包裡有時，提醒你對自己使用，優先用你能用的最好的。預設關閉，開啟後才生效。"
L["Not while a class buff of the same stat is on you."] = "身上已有同屬性的職業增益時不提示。"
L["Automatic reminds you while your group role is tank, or, when you are alone, while your talents are a tank's; Always reminds you whenever it is not up."] = "「自動」在你的隊伍職責為坦克時提醒你，獨自一人時則在你的天賦屬於坦克時提醒你；「總是」則只要沒有生效就會提醒你。"
L["Reminds you when no ward is on you. Automatic takes the one you had up last, else the first you know. Outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners offers no ward, so in a fight you recast it yourself. Off until you turn it on."] = "當你身上沒有任何結界時提醒你。自動會選擇你上次使用的，否則選擇你學會的第一個。僅在戰鬥外：從開戰到戰鬥結束，Manners 不會提供任何結界，所以戰鬥中需要你自己重新施放。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your %s and one of these in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the kind you had on that hand last, at the best rank your level allows, else the first you can use; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "你的%s武器上沒有任何附魔、且背包裡有適用的物品時提醒你。「自動」會選這隻手上次用的那一種，用你的等級能用的最高等級，否則選你現在能用的第一個；按名字選一個即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your %s and one of these in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the best you can use now: by your level, weapon and Fishing, an oil by your group role or talents, a warlock's stone by your talents; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "你的%s武器上沒有任何附魔、且背包裡有適用的物品時提醒你。「自動」會選你現在能用的最好的：按你的等級、武器和釣魚技能，油按你的隊伍職責或天賦，術士的石頭按你的天賦；按名字選一個即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon or shield in your off hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know."] = "你的副手武器或盾牌上沒有任何附魔時提醒你。「自動」會選擇你已學會的第一個。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon in your main hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know."] = "你的主手武器上沒有任何附魔時提醒你。「自動」會選擇你已學會的第一個。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon in your main hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know, Windfury ahead of the rest."] = "主手武器上沒有任何附魔時提醒你。「自動」選擇你已學會的第一個，風怒優先。"
L["Reminds you to make a stone when none is in your bags or on the weapon in your main hand and a Soul Shard is in your bags. Once it is made, Firestone or Spellstone offers to put it on. Automatic makes the kind your talents favour, else the kind you used last. Off until you turn it on."] = "背包裡和主手武器上都沒有石頭、而背包裡有靈魂碎片時，提醒你製造一塊。製造好後，「火焰石或法術石」會提醒你把它用到武器上。「自動」製造你的天賦偏向的那種，否則製造你上次用的那種。在你開啟前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your main hand and a scroll in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the best you can use now: one of the school your talents favour, then your level and weapon; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "主手武器上沒有任何附魔、且背包裡有適用的卷軸時提醒你。「自動」會選你現在能用的最好的：先選你的天賦偏向的系別，再按你的等級和武器；按名字選一個即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when no familiar is with you and a scroll for one is in your bags. Automatic takes the best your level allows."] = "身邊沒有魔寵、且背包裡有魔寵卷軸時提醒你。「自動」會選你的等級能用的最好的。"
L["Reminds you when none of these is up. Automatic takes the one you had up last; pick one to always be reminded of that one."] = "這些都沒有生效時提醒你。「自動」會選你上次用的那個；選定一個則一律提醒那一個。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up. With Demonic Pact, %s has a switch of its own below and is reminded of too."] = "沒有生效時提醒你。有惡魔契印時，%s在下方有自己的開關，也會提醒。"
L["Until you have had one up: %s in a dungeon or raid, %s elsewhere."] = "在你用過任一個之前：地城或團隊副本中用%s，其他地方用%s。"
L["Don't remind me"] = "不要提醒我"
L["Reminds you to eat when Well Fed is not on you and food that gives it is in your bags. Off until you turn it on. A food you keep for something else, a fishing food say, can be ticked under %s."] = "身上沒有「進食充分」、背包裡有能提供它的食物時，提醒你進食。在你開啟之前保持關閉。留作他用的食物（例如釣魚食物）可以在「%s」中勾選。"
L["Never remind me about"] = "永不提醒的法術"
L["Keeps a companion pet out: Manners brings one out of your pet journal itself, with no press. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground, an arena or a pet battle, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "讓一隻小寵物始終在外：Manners 會自己從你的寵物日誌中召喚一隻，無需按鍵。戰鬥中、地城、團隊副本、戰場、競技場或寵物對戰中從不召喚，騎乘、潛行或飛行時也不會；你解散的寵物在你自己召喚之前不會回來。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Keeps a companion pet out. Manners brings one out of your pet journal itself, with no press; a pet you use from your bags each time comes up on the prompt. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground or an arena, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "讓一隻小寵物始終在外。Manners 會自己從你的寵物日誌中召喚一隻，無需按鍵；每次都要從背包中使用的寵物會出現在提示上。戰鬥中、地城、團隊副本、戰場或競技場中從不召喚，騎乘、潛行或飛行時也不會；你解散的寵物在你自己召喚之前不會回來。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you to bring out your companion pet when none is out and one is in your bags. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground or an arena, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "當沒有寵物在外且背包中有一隻時，提醒你召喚小寵物。戰鬥中、地城、團隊副本、戰場或競技場中從不提醒，騎乘、潛行或飛行時也不會；你解散的寵物在你自己召喚之前不會回來。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you to lay down your Cozy Sleeping Bag when Well-Rested is not on you and the bag is in your bags. Not at the level cap, where there is no experience to gain. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有「充分休息」、背包裡有「舒適的睡袋」時，提醒你打開睡袋。達到等級上限時不提醒，那時已沒有經驗可以獲得。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you when it is not on you, outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners does not offer it, so in a fight you recast it yourself. Off until you turn it on."] = "當它不在你身上時提醒你，僅在戰鬥外：從開戰到戰鬥結束，Manners 不會提供它，所以戰鬥中需要你自己重新施放。在你開啟之前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you to make a healthstone when none is in your bags and a Soul Shard is. Outside a fight only. Uncheck it if you would rather not be reminded."] = "背包裡沒有治療石、而背包裡有靈魂碎片時，提醒你製造一塊。僅在戰鬥之外。如果不想被提醒，取消勾選即可。"
L["Reminds you to make a healthstone when none is in your bags. Outside a fight only. Uncheck it if you would rather not be reminded."] = "背包裡沒有治療石時，提醒你製造一塊。僅在戰鬥之外。如果不想被提醒，取消勾選即可。"
L["Reminds you when it is not on you, whoever cast it. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上沒有時提醒你，無論是誰施放的。開啟前保持關閉。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up, once you have had it up yourself."] = "你自己開啟過一次之後，它未開啟時提醒你。"
L["Reminds you while you are swimming and it is not on you, whoever cast it. Never on dry land."] = "游泳時身上沒有就提醒你，無論是誰施放的。在陸地上從不提醒。"
L["Reminds you when you are not in it, and never while you are in another form."] = "你不在該形態時提醒你，處於其他形態時從不提醒。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up and a demon is out. With Demonic Pact it stands beside Demonic Sacrifice, which is reminded of first: the sacrifice takes the demon Soul Link needs."] = "沒有生效且有惡魔在場時提醒你。有惡魔契印時，它與惡魔犧牲並存，惡魔犧牲先提醒：犧牲會獻出靈魂鏈結所需的惡魔。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up."] = "沒有生效時提醒你。"
L["Ticked spells are left out of Automatic and never offered, even one you picked above. The others of their kind still are."] = "勾選的法術不會被「自動」選中，也不會被提醒，即使是你在上方指定的法術。同類的其他法術仍會提醒。"
L["Elixirs to keep up"] = "要同時維持的藥劑"
L["Tick the elixirs you want on you at once: Manners reminds you of each ticked one that is in your bags and not on you, one at a time. With none ticked, any one elixir on you will do, the best you can use first."] = "勾選你想同時維持的藥劑：Manners會逐一提醒你每個已勾選、在背包裡但不在你身上的藥劑。都不勾選時，身上有任一種藥劑即可，優先用你能用的最好的。"
L["Mana Shield, Fire Ward and Frost Ward are reminded outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners offers none of them, so in a fight you recast them yourself. Each lasts a minute or less."] = "魔法盾、防護火焰結界和防護冰霜結界僅在戰鬥外提醒：從開戰到戰鬥結束，Manners 不會提供它們，所以戰鬥中需要你自己重新施放。每個最多持續一分鐘。"
L["A buff of yours Manners does not know: type its name as your spellbook shows it, or its spell id, and press Enter. It must be one this character knows, not passive and not cast on an enemy. Manners then reminds you of it as it does your other buffs, outside a fight, and in cities and inns only with Also in cities and inns. Up to ten, kept for this character."] = "一個 Manners 不認識的自己的增益：輸入它在法術書中顯示的名稱或法術 ID，然後按 Enter。它必須是這個角色已學會、非被動、且不是對敵人施放的法術。之後 Manners 會像對待你的其他增益一樣提醒你，戰鬥之外才提醒，在城市和旅店中則只有開啟「在主城和旅店也提供」時才提醒。最多十個，儲存在這個角色上。"
L["Add a spell"] = "加入法術"
L["Its name as your spellbook shows it, or its spell id. Press Enter to add it."] = "它在法術書中顯示的名稱，或它的法術 ID。按 Enter 加入。"
L["Remove %s"] = "移除%s"
L["Stop reminding you of it and take it off the list. You can add it again."] = "不再提醒你，並將它從清單中移除。你可以再次加入。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you when one is not up: the ones below. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "有自己的增益沒有生效時，提供給你：也就是下方這些。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you too, when one is not up: the ones below, and the buff you give others. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "有自己的增益沒有生效時，也提供給你：包括下方這些，以及你給別人的增益。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Offer your own buff to you too, when you are missing it or, with top-ups on, it is running low. It is cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "你缺少自己的增益時，也提供給你；開啟補加時，快到期也會提供。會直接對你施放，然後切回原目標，也不說話。"
L["Off: your own buffs are not offered while you are in a city or an inn."] = "關閉：你在城市或旅店中時，不提示你自己的增益。"
L["On: the reminder for an oil or a stone for your weapon, for food, and for a flask, an elixir or a scroll comes up only in a dungeon or a raid, not out in the world. Poisons and fishing lures are not held back."] = "開啟：武器用的油或磨刀石、食物，以及精煉藥劑、藥劑或卷軸的提醒只在地城或團隊副本中出現，野外不會。毒藥和釣魚魚餌不受影響。"
L["Food still offered outside dungeons and raids"] = "在地城和團隊副本之外也提示食物"
L["On: food for Well Fed still comes up out in the world, while weapon stones and oils, flasks, elixirs and scrolls keep waiting for a dungeon or a raid. Only matters while Consumables only in dungeons and raids is on."] = "開啟：進食充分所需的食物仍會在野外提示，而武器磨刀石和油、精煉藥劑、藥劑和捲軸繼續等到地城或團隊副本再提示。僅在「消耗品僅限地城與團隊副本」開啟時有效。"
L["My food, stones and oils after everybody else"] = "我的食物、磨刀石和油放在所有人之後"
L["On: your own food, weapon stones and oils, flasks, elixirs and scrolls wait until nobody else needs a buff from you. In a busy place you buff other people first and keep your own for later."] = "開啟：你自己的食物、武器磨刀石和油、精煉藥劑、藥劑和捲軸會等到沒有其他人需要你的增益時再提示。在熱鬧的地方先為別人施放增益，把自己的留到以後。"
L["Hold my food, stones and oils while I move"] = "移動時暫緩使用我的食物、磨刀石和油"
L["On: food, a weapon stone or oil, and anything else of your own that takes a cast leave the prompt while you move, and come back a moment after you stand still. Off: they stay on the prompt while you move, but the game may refuse a press on the run or cut it short, and food may be used up for nothing."] = "開啟：食物、武器磨刀石或油，以及其他需要施法時間的自用物品，會在你移動時從提示中消失，並在你站定片刻後回來。關閉：它們在你移動時仍留在提示上，但遊戲可能拒絕行進中的點擊或將其打斷，食物也可能白白用掉。"
L["Which pet"] = "召喚哪隻寵物"
L["The pet Manners brings out of your pet journal: the one you had out last, a random favourite, any pet, or one of your pets by name. With none out last, a favourite; with no favourites, any pet."] = "Manners 從你的寵物日誌中召喚的寵物：你上次召喚的那隻、隨機一隻最愛寵物、任意寵物，或依名字選定的一隻寵物。沒有上次召喚的，則為最愛寵物；沒有最愛寵物，則為任意寵物。"
L["The one I had out last"] = "我上次召喚的那隻"
L["A random favourite"] = "隨機最愛寵物"
L["Any pet"] = "任意寵物"
L["Which food"] = "選用哪種食物"
L["Which food Manners reminds you to eat when you have several in your bags. The best one you can eat is what it did before. The weakest first uses up your cheaper food. Or pick one of the foods in your bags by name. A food you tick under Never remind me about is never picked."] = "背包裡有多種食物時，Manners 提醒你吃哪一種。能吃的最好的食物與之前一樣。先吃最弱的會先用掉便宜的食物。也可以按名字從背包裡的食物中選一種。在「永不提醒」中勾選的食物永遠不會被選用。"
L["The best one I can eat"] = "我能吃的最好的"
L["The weakest first"] = "最弱的優先"
L["Put consumables on a button of their own"] = "把消耗品放到獨立的按鈕上"
L["Food, flasks, elixirs, scrolls and your weapon's oils, stones and poisons come up on a button of their own instead of on the prompt, with the item's name under it. Show and move the consumables button, just below, puts it where you want it; its key is set below too, and a right-click skips that item for now. It is never shown in a fight."] = "食物、精煉藥劑、藥劑、卷軸以及武器的油、磨刀石和毒藥會顯示在獨立的按鈕上，而不是提示按鈕上，按鈕下方顯示物品名稱。用下方的「顯示並移動消耗品按鈕」把它放到你想要的位置；按鍵也在下方設定，右鍵點擊可暫時略過該物品。戰鬥中從不顯示。"
L["Show and move the consumables button"] = "顯示並移動消耗品按鈕"
L["Shows the consumables button with its name over it. Drag it where you want it, then press Done or this button again."] = "顯示消耗品按鈕，並在上方顯示其名稱。把它拖到你想要的位置，然後按完成或再次按此按鈕。"
L["Key for the consumables button"] = "消耗品按鈕的按鍵"
L["%s was bound to %s; it now uses the consumables button."] = "%s 原先綁定到 %s；現在它用於消耗品按鈕。"
L["Remind me of my shout when I'm alone"] = "獨自一人時提醒我戰鬥怒吼"
L["Off: a shout is only offered to your group. On: with nobody in your group, Battle Shout is offered to you too when it is missing or running low. In a group the group's own offer covers you."] = "關閉：怒吼只會提供給你的隊伍。開啟：隊伍中沒有其他人時，戰鬥怒吼缺少或即將結束也會提供給你。在隊伍中時，隊伍的提示已經涵蓋你。"
L["Dampen Magic only when I'm alone"] = "僅在我獨自一人時使用魔法抑制"
L["On: Dampen Magic is not offered while you are in a party or raid, where it would cut the healing you get."] = "開啟：在隊伍或團隊中時不提示魔法抑制，因為它會減少你受到的治療。"
L["Amplify Magic only when I'm alone"] = "僅在我獨自一人時使用魔法增效"
L["On: Amplify Magic is not offered while you are in a party or raid."] = "開啟：在隊伍或團隊中時不提示魔法增效。"
L["Weapon imbues before the shield"] = "武器附魔優先於護盾"
L["On: your weapon imbues come up ahead of your shield, so a shield you cannot cast for want of mana does not keep your imbue waiting behind it."] = "開啟：武器附魔排在護盾之前，這樣法力不足無法施放護盾時，不會耽誤你的附魔。"
L["Remind me before Well-Rested runs out"] = "在「充分休息」結束前提醒我"
L["On: the sleeping bag comes up again when Well-Rested has five minutes left, so you can lie down in it and renew it before it runs out. Off: only once it has gone."] = "開啟：「充分休息」還剩五分鐘時再次提醒睡袋，讓你在它結束前躺下續上。關閉：只在它消失後提醒。"
L["Off: no scroll is ever offered to you, and the switches for scrolls leave this list. Turned back on, each scroll is as you left it."] = "關閉：永遠不會向你提供任何卷軸，卷軸的開關也會從這個列表中消失。重新開啟後，每個卷軸都保持你之前的設定。"
L["Reminders for your own buffs, weapon oils, food, flasks and scrolls."] = "自身增益、武器油、食物、藥劑和卷軸的提醒。"
L["When my own buffs come up"] = "我自己的增益何時出現"
