L["courtesy: |cffffffff%s|r, your target, is offered %s -- %s"] = "善意：向|cffffffff%s|r（你的目標）提供%s——%s"
L["Requests I accept"] = "我接受的請求"
L["Choose the people whose request this service may answer: your current target, party or raid chat, and direct whispers. Clear all three to leave the service on but silent."] = "選擇此服務可以回應哪些人的請求：目前目標、隊伍或團隊聊天，以及直接密語。三項全部取消後，服務會保持啟用但不回應。"
L["Party or raid chat"] = "隊伍或團隊聊天"
L["Whispers"] = "密語"
L["If they ask in a fight"] = "對方在戰鬥中請求時"
L["A service is never cast in combat. Hold keeps an allowed request for the moment the fight ends; Ignore drops it immediately."] = "服務絕不會在戰鬥中施放。保留會將允許的請求留到戰鬥結束；忽略會立即丟棄。"
L["Hold until the fight ends"] = "保留到戰鬥結束"
L["Ignore the request"] = "忽略請求"
L["Where it may be offered"] = "可提供地點"
L["Anywhere obeys the usual quiet-time rules. Outside instances never offers this service in a dungeon, raid or battleground."] = "任意地點遵循一般的安靜時段規則。副本外則絕不在地城、團隊副本或戰場中提供此服務。"
L["Anywhere"] = "任意地點"
L["Outside instances"] = "副本外"
L["Words that count"] = "辨識詞"
L["The spell or item's own name is always read. Short aliases also accept the familiar request words, such as water, hs or summon, without reading ordinary conversation as a request."] = "一律辨識法術或物品的正式名稱。簡短別名也可接受 water, hs or summon 等常見請求詞，但不會把一般對話當成請求。"
L["Explicit names only"] = "僅正式名稱"
L["Explicit names and short aliases"] = "正式名稱和簡短別名"
L["Load or unload the optional Services addon. Turning it off stops its requests, frames and queue work immediately; Reload UI completes the addon change."] = "載入或卸載選用 Services 模組。關閉後會立即停止其請求、介面和佇列工作；重新載入介面即可完成模組變更。"
L["Mage refreshments and portals, warlock summons and stones, Priest Levitate, Shaman Water Walking, and Fire Shield where the client supports them."] = "法師的飲水、食物和傳送門，術士的召喚與石頭，牧師的漂浮術，薩滿的水上行走，以及用戶端支援時的火焰之盾。"
L["Apply an optional-module load or unload change."] = "套用選用模組的載入或卸載變更。"
L["Water and food, when they ask"] = "有人要時提供水和食物"
L["Somebody who asks for water or food is offered it. New profiles can choose water and food separately on Manners: Services."] = "有人請求水或食物時會提供。新設定檔可在 Manners: Services 中分別選擇水和食物。"
L["Conjured water, when they ask"] = "有人請求時製造水"
L["A person allowed below who asks for water is offered the best conjured rank that suits their level. With none in your bags, the first press conjures it and the next opens a trade."] = "下方允許的玩家請求水時，會提供最適合其等級的最高級製造水。背包裡沒有時，第一次按下會製造，下一次按下會開啟交易。"
L["Conjured food, when they ask"] = "有人請求時製造食物"
L["A person allowed below who asks for food is offered the best conjured rank that suits their level. With none in your bags, the first press conjures it and the next opens a trade."] = "下方允許的玩家請求食物時，會提供最適合其等級的最高級製造食物。背包裡沒有時，第一次按下會製造，下一次按下會開啟交易。"
L["Portals, when my group asks"] = "隊友要時提供傳送門"
L["A member of your party or raid who explicitly asks for a learned destination is offered that portal. The press targets nobody, and Manners casts only the destination named in chat."] = "隊伍或團隊成員明確請求已學會的目的地時，會提供對應傳送門。按下不會選取任何人，Manners 只施放聊天中指名的目的地傳送門。"
L["Portal destinations"] = "傳送門目的地"
L["Only ticked destinations can be matched from chat. A destination must also be learned and in range of its own rules before it is offered."] = "只有勾選的目的地可從聊天中配對。目的地還必須已學會並符合其自身規則，才會提供。"
L["Healthstones and Soulwell"] = "治療石與靈魂之井"
L["A member of your group who asks for a healthstone is offered a Soulwell. On older clients, a stone that suits them is created or traded instead."] = "隊伍成員請求治療石時，會提供靈魂之井。較舊的用戶端則改為製造或交易適合對方的治療石。"
L["A person allowed below who asks for a healthstone is offered one. With none in your bags, the first press creates it and the next opens a trade."] = "下方允許的玩家請求治療石時會獲得提供。背包裡沒有時，第一次按下會製造，下一次按下會開啟交易。"
L["Group summons, when they ask"] = "有人請求時提供團隊召喚"
L["A member of your party or raid who explicitly asks for a summon is offered Ritual of Summoning. The press targets them and leaves them targeted for the summons portal."] = "隊伍或團隊成員明確請求召喚時，會提供召喚儀式。按下會選取對方，並為召喚傳送門保留目標。"
L["Soulstone preparation"] = "靈魂石準備"
L["On a clear request, Manners creates the best learned Soulstone when needed, then targets the requester and uses it. A target already carrying a Soulstone is never offered another."] = "收到明確請求後，Manners 會在需要時製造已學會的最高級靈魂石，接著選取請求者並使用。目標已有靈魂石時，絕不再提供另一顆。"
L["Slow Fall on request"] = "收到請求時施放緩落術"
L["An explicit, in-range Slow Fall request is answered for an alive, friendly visible player, with the learned spell, required reagent and cooldown checked first."] = "對存活、友善且可見、處於範圍內的玩家，收到明確的緩落術請求後，會先檢查已學會的法術、所需材料和冷卻時間，再作出回應。"
L["Levitate on request"] = "收到請求時施放漂浮術"
L["An explicit, in-range Levitate request is answered for an alive, friendly visible player, with the learned spell, required reagent and cooldown checked first."] = "對存活、友善且可見、處於範圍內的玩家，收到明確的漂浮術請求後，會先檢查已學會的法術、所需材料和冷卻時間，再作出回應。"
L["Water Walking on request"] = "收到請求時施放水上行走"
L["An explicit, in-range Water Walking request is answered for an alive, friendly visible player, with the learned spell, required reagent and cooldown checked first."] = "對存活、友善且可見、處於範圍內的玩家，收到明確的水上行走請求後，會先檢查已學會的法術、所需材料和冷卻時間，再作出回應。"
L["Offer water and food to my target"] = "向我的目標提供水和食物"
L["Out of a fight, a friendly player you target is offered water and food that suits their level, or food alone for a class without mana. Nothing is offered if their level, viability or trade range cannot be read."] = "非戰鬥狀態下，選取的友善玩家會獲得適合其等級的水和食物；不使用法力的職業只提供食物。如果無法讀取其等級、可用性或交易距離，則不提供任何物品。"
L["How much to trade"] = "交易多少"
L["One stack of each requested refreshment, or as many stacks as the trade window and your bags hold that suit them."] = "每種請求的補給放入一組，或放入交易視窗與背包所能容納的所有適用組數。"
L["Fill the trade window"] = "放滿交易視窗"
L["One stack"] = "一組"
L["Fire Shield from my imp on the tank"] = "讓小鬼對坦克施放火焰之盾"
L["The imp's Fire Shield is an optional party-tank service on the clients that prove it. It is offered only with the imp's spell learned, never in combat, and never on yourself."] = "小鬼的火焰之盾是在支援它的用戶端中為隊伍坦克提供的選用服務。只有小鬼已學會該法術時才提供，戰鬥中絕不提供，也絕不對自己施放。"
L["Optional class services for clear requests, with no action taken until you press the prompt."] = "為明確請求提供選用職業服務；按下提示按鈕前不會執行任何操作。"
